<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">LUL</book>
  <para style="toc3">Lul</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ennanga</para>
  <para style="toc1">ENNANGA</para>
  <para style="h">Lulanga lwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">ENNANGA</para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Ed citabu cibâmwo Nnanga 150. Ennanga kwo kuderha enyimbo zayimbagwa omu cînanda erhi omu nzenze erhi omu mulimba gw’engoma. Kurhenga mîra, abantu bw’omu Israheli bagwerhe ennanga za ngasi lubero nk’agandi ma- shanja g’ebushoshôkero bw’izuba, nk’enyimbo za Mûsa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 15">Lub 15</ref></char>), Olwimbo lwa Debora (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 5">Bac 5</ref></char>); emisengero ya Daudi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 1:17">2 Sam 1, 17</ref></char>) na ntyo na ntyo. Ecitabu c’Ennanga cibâmwo ennanga z’idini zajiragwa n’abantu ba ngasi lubero.</para>
  <para style="ip">Daudi wajiraga ennanga, ci kwône ezindi zajiragwa enyuma ly’okurhenga e Babeli. Ennanga zasâlîragwa n’okuyimbwa omu ka-Nyamuzinda kurhenga mîra bwenene. Obwinja bw’Ennanga: ennanga gali masala g’Amalaganyo ga mîra. Nyamuzinda yêne wabafûhiraga ebinwa alonzagya mpu bamushambâzemwo. Yezu yêne na nnina Mariya n’entumwa basàliraga ennanga. Ekleziya eyimba ennanga nk’oku esalîra agandi masâla matagatifu. Abayandikaga ennanga bakolêsize ebinwa n’ebijiro by’amango gabo. Buzir’okuhindula oluderho ciru n’olu- guma, ebyo binwa by’okukuza Nnâmahanga, by’okumushenga, by’okumuharâmya, byanahash’ikolesibwa n’abantu boshi erhi bankayimanga embere za Yezu, Mucunguzi wirhu. Ebi abayandikaga Ennanga bamanyîsagya mulizo byoshi byabire: Omuciza mîra ayishaga, ayîmire n’amashanja nago goshi gahamagirwe okumukuza, okumuhà irenge emyaka yoshi.</para>
  <para style="iot">EBIRIMWO</para>
  <para style="ip">Ennanga zijira mbero isharhu nene:</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Enyimbo z’okukuza Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Enyimbo z’okushenga</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Enyimbo z’enyigîrizo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Enjira ibirhi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1"/>Iragi lyâge omuntu orhacîfundikira haguma n’encuku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:1">orhagenda n’emihera, orhanaboneka omu ndêko y’abashombanyi.<verse eid="PSA 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2"/>Arhasîmisibwa n’agarhali marhegeko ga Nyamuzinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:2">anagerêreza ago marhegeko bwacà-bwayira.<verse eid="PSA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3"/>Kwo agandâza nka murhi gumezire aha cikunguzo c’olwîshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:3">guyêrakwo emburho amango gâgwo, gunayôrha guyinjihire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:3">Na ngasi hyoshi ajira kubêra himubêra.<verse eid="PSA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4"/>Emihera erhakabona okwo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:4">kàli kw’eri nka hyâsi hya canda hiyehwîrwe n’empûsi!<verse eid="PSA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5"/>Ntà kwâbo: aha kagombe eyo mihera erhakahambûla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:5">ciru erhakalabarha omu ihano ly’abashinganyanya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sadiq ye mushinganyanya ci arhali rash’</char></note>.<verse eid="PSA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6"/>Bulya Nyamuzinda ayishi enjira y’abimâna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:6">ci enjira y’endyâlya kuhabula ehabula.<verse eid="PSA 1:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Masiha ye Mwâmi w’e Siyoni n’ow’igulu lyoshi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1"/>Kwo kurhi oku amashanja gakunire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:1">ganadwîrhe gahiga emihigo y’obusha?<verse eid="PSA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2"/>Abâmi b’igulu bamâhuluza engoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:2">nabo abaluzi bamâja ihano</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:2">mpu bagomere Nnâmahanga n’omwîshogwa wâge.<verse eid="PSA 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3"/>«Mpu: emigozi yâbo rhuyitwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:3">rhunakabulire omuzigo gwâbo kuli nîrhu!»<verse eid="PSA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4"/>Omu bwâmi bwâge Nnâmahanga adwîrhe asinz’emalunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:4">Nyakasane adwîrhe abashekera.<verse eid="PSA 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5"/>Amâkunira amâbashuza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:5">omu bukunizi bwâge amâbayobohya.<verse eid="PSA 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6"/>Erhi: «Niene nayimikaga Omwâmi wâni oku Siyoni»,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:6">«Oku ntondo yâni ntagatîfu».<verse eid="PSA 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7"/>Lekagi nâni mmubwîre akanwa ka Nnâmahanga; àmbwîzire, erhi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:7">«Oli mugala wâni, nie nkubusire ene».<verse eid="PSA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8"/>Ompûne eci wankalonza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:8">nâni nâkuhà ebihugo byoshi bibè hyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9"/>«Wabamalîra n’engôrho yâwe»,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:9">«onabavungunyule nka mubumbi wabera enyungu.»<verse eid="PSA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10"/>Lêro, mw’oyo bâmi, muyumve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:10">ninyu batwî b’emmanja b’igulu mumanye!<verse eid="PSA 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11"/>Mukolere Nyamuzinda munamurhînye,<verse eid="PSA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12"/>mucîkwêbe aha magulu gâge n’obwôba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">buly’erhi ankakunira mwanahungumuka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">oburhè bwâge kwo buyâka caligumiza nka ngulumira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">Iragi lyâbo abamuyegemera!<verse eid="PSA 2:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’esêzi gw’omuntu oli omu marhabi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi. Amango al’iyasire omugala Absalomi.<verse eid="PSA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2"/>Nyakasane, baluzire nka nzige</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:2">abantezire bali banji-banji.<verse eid="PSA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3"/>Bali mwandu, abadwîrhe banshumika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:3">mpu: «Ntâkwo Nnâmahanga ankacimuciza!»<verse eid="PSA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4"/>Ci we mpenzi yâni, Nyamwagirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:4">we irenge lyâni we n’ihungiro lyâni.<verse eid="PSA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5"/>Nkayâkûza Nyakasane anayumve</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:5">anayumve izù lyâni oku ntondo yâge ntagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6"/>Ngwîshîre, mpunzire, nsinsimusire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:6">erhi Nnâmahanga ye nnancîkubagîre.<verse eid="PSA 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7"/>Ntumvîrhi ngwêrhwe n’obwôba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:7">bw’ezîra ngabo zingosire.<verse eid="PSA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8"/>Zûka, zûka, Nnâmahanga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:8">ontenze omu marhabi, mâshi Nyakasane!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:8">Enzigo zâni ozikolere buligo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:8">eyo mihera erhacisigalanaga ciru n’elîno lyo linyi ekanwa.<verse eid="PSA 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 3:9"/>Nêci, Nyamuzinda ye ciza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:9">Waliha, we bwangà bw’olubaga lwâwe!<verse eid="PSA 3:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Musengero gw’ebijingo</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Oku luzihwa lusâlikwa n’emisî: Lulanga lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2"/>Nkakulakira, oyumvîrhize izù lyâni, Yâgirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:2">Nnâmahanga, mucîranuzi wâni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:2">Kàli nàlimbengîre, wanciza:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:2">ndîkûza we kasinga, onayumvîrhize omusengero gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3"/>Mwe bantu, mangaci mwaleka obudandalisi bwinyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:3">mangaci mwaleka okurhonya empûsi n’okulonza obunywesi?<verse eid="PSA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4"/>Ci mumanye bwinjà oku Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:4">àjirîre omurhonyi wâge ecirhangâzo, nkamulakira, Nyakasane anayumve izù lyâni.<verse eid="PSA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5"/>Muyôbohe n’irhondo murhacijiraga ecâha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:5">n’amango mukola muli aha ncingo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:5">mucîje emurhima, muhulike!<verse eid="PSA 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6"/>Murherekêre enterekêro z’okuli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:6">mucîkwêbe omu maboko ga Nnâmahanga!<verse eid="PSA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7"/>Banji bacîduduma, mpu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:7">«Ndi wankacirhuha akalembe wâni?»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:7">Yâgirwa Nyakasane, orhumolekere n’obumoleke bw’obusù bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8"/>Waliha Nnâmahanga, omurhima gwâni oguyunjuze masîma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:8">galushire ag’amango engano n’irivayi lyâbo biyêzire.<verse eid="PSA 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 4:9"/>Ncikolera aha ncingo n’omurhûla, na nkola ndi îrò:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:9">bulya we onyimangire wênene, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 4:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’esêzi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Oku rhurhêra. Lulanga lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2"/>Oyumvîrhize izù lyâni, Yâgirwa Nyakasane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:2">omusengero gwâni oguyumve.<verse eid="PSA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3"/>We ndwîrhe nâganîza, Mwâmi wâni na Nyamuzinda wâni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:3">we nsengîre Yâgirwa Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4"/>Erhi gubà mucêracêra,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:4">erhi mîra izù lyâni lyahikaga emund’oli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:4">sêzi-sêzi erhi nkola ndwîrhe nakusêngera nandwîrhe nalangûza.<verse eid="PSA 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5"/>Bulya orhali Nyamuzinda wa kusîma mabî,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:5">Yâgirwa; enkola-maligo orhankaziga yakujaho<verse eid="PSA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6"/>Nanga, emihera erhankakuyimangaho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:6">abajira ebigalugalu, orhababâkwo<verse eid="PSA 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7"/>Abaderha obunywesi, kuheza obaheza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:7">omuntu osîma omukò n’olyaliha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:7">Nyamuzinda arhamubonakwo<verse eid="PSA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8"/>Ci niehe, bwonjo bw’obuzigire bwâwe bunene burhumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:8">najà omu mwâwe; nacîkweba oku idaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:8">nkuharâmye omu bwâmi bwâwe butagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9"/>Nyakasane, onange omu bushinganyanya bwâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:9">bulyâla abanzi bampisire eka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:9">enjira yampisa emwâwe, oyiyumanyanye.<verse eid="PSA 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10"/>Bulyâla omu kanwa kâbo murhabà oburhali bunywesi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:10">omurhima gwâbo guyunjwîre bubî;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:10">omurhima gwâbo eri nshinda nyigule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:10">n’olulimi lwâbo kali kêre ka môji abirhi.<verse eid="PSA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11"/>Obamalîre, Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:11">ojire batulikanyè n’emihigo yâbo mibî;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:11">obakage, batumbaguze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:11">abo banyankola-maligo, bulya bàkugomîre!<verse eid="PSA 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12"/>Ci abacikwîkubagira, barhulûle banasîme;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:12">bacîkwitakire emyâka n’emyâka bulya bayimangîrwe nâwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:12">bacîshinge muli we abasîma izîno lyâwe!<verse eid="PSA 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 5:13"/>Bulya we Nyamuzinda, we hà omushinganyanya obwangâ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:13">we mucinga n’obuzigire bwâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:13">nka kula empenzi ecinga entwâli.<verse eid="PSA 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Amingingo omu marhangulo</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Oku nzihwa zishwêkwa n’emisî. Oku izù lya kali munâni. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, orhampanaga omu burhè bwâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:2">orhanankalihiraga omu bukunizi bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3"/>Mâshi Nyakasane, ombêre obwonjo ntà misî ncigwêrhe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 6:3"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:3">nfumya, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:3">bulya enjingo z’orhuvuha rhwâni zikola zihozire.<verse eid="PSA 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4"/>Omurhima gwankangusire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:4">nâwe, we Nnâmahanga kuhika mangaci?<verse eid="PSA 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5"/>Galuka, mâshi Yâgirwa Nyakasane onyôkole;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:5">oncize buzigire bwâwe burhumire.<verse eid="PSA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6"/>Bulya ntâye ofîre wankacikuyibuka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:6">ndi wankakukuza kurheng’e kuzimu?<verse eid="PSA 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7"/>Ndi bufà erhi maganya garhuma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:7">erhi binajinga, nanyongoberere omu lwôgo lwâni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:7">oku narhoga emirenge, ncîkwêbe omu ncingo yâni.<verse eid="PSA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8"/>Amasù gakola ganduma erhi mirenge erhuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:8">abashombanyi bâni boshi bagahûsa.<verse eid="PSA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9"/>Ntengiho mweshi banyankola-maligo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:9">bulya Nyamuzinda ayumvîrhîze emirenge yâni.<verse eid="PSA 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10"/>Nnâmahanga ayumvîrhîze izù lyâni;</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 6:10"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:10">Nyakasane ayumvîrhîze omusengero gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 6:11"/>Abashombanyi bâni boshi bafè n’obôba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:11">enshonyi zibayîrhe bagaluke cinyumanyumà.<verse eid="PSA 6:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’omushinganyanya odwîrhe alibuzibwa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1"/>Endûlù ya Daudi, àyiyimbiraga Nyakasane erhi Kushi w’omu bûko bwa Benyamini orhumire.<verse eid="PSA 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2"/>Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda wâni, we lwâkiro lwâni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:2">ndîkûza oku badwîrhe bandibuza boshi, nciza nâni.<verse eid="PSA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3"/>Lyo balek’inshembagula nka kula entale eshembagula omuhanya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:3">emusharhule na ntâye wahalîza mpu amulîkûza.<verse eid="PSA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, ka najizire okwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:4">k’obubî buli omu maboko gâni?<verse eid="PSA 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5"/>Ka najirîre orhampalalîri kubî,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:5">ka nashokwîre omushombanyi wâni buzira igwârhiro?<verse eid="PSA 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6"/>Akabà najizire ntyo, omwanzi anyandukekwo anangwanyanye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:6">andabarhe n’obûla bwâni anabushandâze omu budaka!<verse eid="PSA 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, zûka omu bukunizi bwâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:7">oburhè bw’abashombanyi bâni oburhange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:7">ondwîre, Nyakasane, bulya wêne warhegekaga mpu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:7">olubanja lukâja aha kagombe.<verse eid="PSA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8"/>Omurhwe gw’amashanja gukuzunguluke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:8">nâwe obarhegeke emalunga!<verse eid="PSA 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9"/>Nyakasane, we mutwî w’emmanja w’amashanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:9">oncîranulire, Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:9">nyêre nka kulya obushinganyanya n’obwimâna bwâni bunali.<verse eid="PSA 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10"/>Obubî bw’emihera buhwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:10">na ngasi oli mushinganyanya, omuzibuhye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:10">we yishi ebiri omu murhima n’omu nsiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:10">Nyamuzinda mwimâna!<verse eid="PSA 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11"/>Nnâmahanga ye mpenzi yâni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:11">ye ciza abantu b’emirhima eshingânîne.<verse eid="PSA 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12"/>Nyamuzinda ye mutwî w’emmanja mwimâna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:12">oburhè bwâge ntà lusiku burhûlûla.<verse eid="PSA 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13"/>Abarhalonza okumugalukira, anabarhyagize engôrho yâge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:13">asêze olugè lw’omuherho gwâge agufôle.<verse eid="PSA 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14"/>Omuhera gwône gucirheganyiza emyampi y’olufù,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:14">gwône gurhuma yagulumira.<verse eid="PSA 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15"/>Gw’ogwo gudwîrhe gwahiga emihigo y’obubî</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:15">gudwîrhe gwârhimanya obulyâlya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:15">ci ibala gwacîlerhera!<verse eid="PSA 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16"/>Gudwîrhe gwarheganya omwîna n’okuguhumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:16">ci gwône gwarhogera mw’ogwo mwîna gwajiraga.<verse eid="PSA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17"/>Obubî bwâge bwâmunanira emalanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:17">obulenzi bwâge bwâmusêra oku irhwe nka ngarha.<verse eid="PSA 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 7:18"/>Niehe nâvuga Nnâmahanga omunkwa oku bushinganyanya bwâge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:18">nâyimba izîno lya Nyamuzinda w’Enyanya!<verse eid="PSA 7:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Irenge lya Lulema n’obukulu bw’omuntu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Oku izîno lya Gati. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, Nnâhamwîrhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:2">izîno lyâwe lyàjîre irenge omu igulu lyoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:2">obukulu bwâwe buyunjwîre amalunga!<verse eid="PSA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3"/>Akanwa k’abâna b’ebirhaba n’abaciyonka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:3">karhubwiriza irenge lyâwe kanahulisa abashombanyi bâwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:3">lyo abanzi n’abagoma bahirigirha.<verse eid="PSA 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4"/>Nkalola amalunga eminwe yâwe yàmanikaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:4">n’omwêzi n’enyenyêzi walemaga:<verse eid="PSA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5"/>Omuntu aligi cici mpu wamuyibuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:5">mwene-Adamu aligi ndi mpu wamushîbirira?<verse eid="PSA 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6"/>N’obwo wamujizire munyi hisungunu hyône kuli ba malahika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:6">wamuyambika ishungwè ly’irenge n’obukuze.<verse eid="PSA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7"/>Wamujira mwâmi w’ebiremwa by’amaboko gâwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:7">byoshi wabihizire aha magulu gâge.<verse eid="PSA 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8"/>Ebibuzi n’enkafu, byoshi byoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:8">ciru n’ensimba z’omu irungu;<verse eid="PSA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9"/>Enyunyi z’emalunga n’enfî z’omu nyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:9">n’eby’omu mîshi byoshi<verse eid="PSA 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 8:10"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda Nnâhamwîrhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:10">izîno lyâwe lyàjîre irenge omu igulu lyoshi.<verse eid="PSA 8:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" altnumber="9a" sid="PSA 9"/>
  <para style="s1">(cihabr. 9): Nyamuzinda Mucîranuzi Mushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Nzihwa y’omu karhêra erhi lulanga. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:2">nakukuza n’omurhima gwâni gwoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:2">namanyîsa ebirhangâzo byâwe byoshi.<verse eid="PSA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3"/>We busîme na mwishingo gwâni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:3">nakuza izîno lyâwe, Nyakasane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:3">Nyamuzinda, Nn’emalunga.<verse eid="PSA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4"/>Bulya abashombanyi bâni bayâsire, bashubira nyuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:4">bajâjâbire banahungumuka embere zâwe.<verse eid="PSA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5"/>Nêci, wampîre ecâzo n’olubanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:5">watamala oku ntebe y’obwâmi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:5">we mutwî w’emmanja mushinganyanya.<verse eid="PSA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6"/>Walembya entumva, walimbula n’ebigamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:6">izîno lyâbo walizâza lwoshi oku nsiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7"/>Abashombanyi bahirigirha lwoshi lwoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:7">engabo zâbo wazishâba, n’aha bâli harhasigalaga cimanyîso.<verse eid="PSA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8"/>Nyamuzinda yêhe ho ayôrha abà ensiku n’amango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:8">ajeberîze entebe yâge y’obwâmi mpu atwe emmanja.<verse eid="PSA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9"/>Ye twîra igulu olubanja n’obushinganyanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:9">anacîranulire amashanja n’oburhondekezi.<verse eid="PSA 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10"/>Mâshi Nyamuzinda abà lwâkiro lw’abadwîrhe barhindibuzibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:10">lwâkiro omu mango g’obulagîrire.<verse eid="PSA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11"/>We bacîkubagira abayîshi izîno lyâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:11">bulya orhalikirira abakulonza, Yâgirwa Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12"/>Muzihire Nyamubâho ôbà omu Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:12">mubalire amashanja ebirhangâzo àjizire.<verse eid="PSA 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13"/>Bulya ye cîhôlera omukò, abalibusire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:13">omulenge gw’abagalugalu arhaguyibagira.<verse eid="PSA 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, ombabalire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:14">olole oku abashombanyi badwîrhe bantindibuza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:14">onshugule omu mihango y’olufù;<verse eid="PSA 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15"/>Nderhe irenge lyâwe lyoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:15">omu mihango y’omunyere w’e Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:15">ncîshingire obucire bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16"/>Amashanja g’abapagani garhogîre omu nyenga bàhumbaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:16">omurhego bàrhegaga okugulu kwâbo kwagwârhwamwo.<verse eid="PSA 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17"/>Nyamuzinda acîmanyîsize, atwa olubanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:17">agwâsa omunya-byâha omu mirimo y’enfune zâge.<verse eid="PSA 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18"/>Emihera eshubire ekuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:18">aga mashanja goshi g’entumva gayibagire Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19"/>Bulya omukenyi arhayibagirwa lwoshi lwoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:19">obulangâlire bw’abanyi ntà mango bwankahirigirha.<verse eid="PSA 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20"/>Zûka Nyamuzinda, omuntu ankahima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:20">amashanja g’abapagani gatwîrwe olubanja omu busù bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 9:21"/>Mâshi Nyakasane, obashûrhe ebihamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:21">abapagani bamanye oku bali bantu nk’abandi.<verse eid="PSA 9:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" altnumber="9b" sid="PSA 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda Mushinganyanya ho ali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1"/>Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, cirhumire wabêra kulî,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:1">cirhumire ocîfulika amango g’amalibuko?<verse eid="PSA 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2"/>Oku omuhera gwacîbona, omukenyi arhindibuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:2">agwârhwe omu bulyâlya bw’entimanya z’owâbo.<verse eid="PSA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3"/>Omuhera gunacishingire enyifinjo z’omurhima gwâgwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:3">omuhubu kulogorha alogorha, anagayaguze Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="PSA 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4"/>Omu bucîbone bwâge omuhera kwo guderha, mpu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:4">«Ntà buhane; Nyamuzinda arhahabà!» Zo nkengêro zoshi ezo.<verse eid="PSA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5"/>Ngasi mango amâjira gâge kubêra gamubêra;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:5">emmanja enyanya zimugera, arhankazirhimanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:5">abashombanyi bâge boshi kumeshera abamesherakwo.<verse eid="PSA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6"/>Anaderhe omu murhima gwâge, erhi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:6">«Nie ntadundwa; amâburha gàja oku gandi ntanabona malibuko.»<verse eid="PSA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7"/>Akanwa kâge kayunjwîre malogorha n’obunywesi n’obulyâlya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:7">olulimi lwâge lurharhêngamwo oburhali buhanya n’obubî.<verse eid="PSA 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8"/>Y’oyo oshurhamire omu masheke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:8">acîfulisire mpu ayîrhe omwêru-kwêru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:8">amasù gâge gadwîrhe gahigira omuhanya.<verse eid="PSA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9"/>Kwo acîfulika nka ntale omu bulumba bwâyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:9">alingûze mpu alonze omuhanya ayehûkana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:9">amuyehûkane, amukululire omu murhego gwâge.<verse eid="PSA 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10"/>Anajè abundabunda, anashurhame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:10">omuhanya amugwe omu nfune.<verse eid="PSA 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11"/>Aderhe omu murhima gwâge, erhi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:11">«Nyamuzinda ayibagire! Ahengwîre obusù bwâge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:11">arhanacidwirhi abona!»<verse eid="PSA 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12"/>Yimuka, Nyamuzinda, Nnâmahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:12">olengeze okuboko kwâwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:12">omanye wankayibagira abali omu bulagîrire.<verse eid="PSA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13"/>Cankarhuma omuhera gwagayaguza Nnâmahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:13">cankarhuma guderha omu murhima gwâgwo mpu arhabona?<verse eid="PSA 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14"/>Wêne obwîne, walolêrîze amalibuko n’emirenge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:14">mpu ohiyankirire omu nfune zâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:14">omukenyi we acîkubagira, we lwâkiro lw’enfûzi.<verse eid="PSA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15"/>Shangula okuboko kw’omubî n’omuhera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:15">obubî bwâge obuhane, burhacifâga bwabonesire.<verse eid="PSA 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16"/>Nyamuzinda ye Mwâmi w’ensiku n’amango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:16">amashanja g’abapagani gàhirigirha omu igulu lyâge.<verse eid="PSA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, oyumvîrhize omwîfinjo gw’abîrhôhye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:17">ozibuhye emirhima yâbo onayirhege okurhwiri.<verse eid="PSA 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18"/>Mpu lyo otwîra enfûzi n’odwîrhe arhindibuzibwa olubanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:18">lyo n’omuntu warhengaga omu bidaka alekikâlibuza abandi n’ebihamba.<verse eid="PSA 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" altnumber="10" sid="PSA 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Omulangâliro gw’omushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1"/>Oku mukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:1">Nyamuzinda ye lwâkiro lwâni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:1">Kurhi wakacimbwîra, mpu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:1">«Yàkira oku ntondo nka kanyunyi?»<verse eid="PSA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2"/>Ba nyankola-maligo abo bagosire emiherho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:2">badwîrhe bafôl’emyampi oku ngè</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:2">mpu balashire abantu b’emirhima nkana omu mwizimya.<verse eid="PSA 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3"/>Erhi eciriba cankahongoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:3">cici omushinganyanya ankacibash’ijira?<verse eid="PSA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4"/>Nnâmahanga omu ka-Nyamuzinda kâge katagatîfu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:4">Nyakasane oku ntebe yâge y’obwâmi omu malunga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:4">amasù gâge gadwîrhe galolêreza igulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:4">engohe zâge zidwîrhe zasinza abâna b’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5"/>Nyamuzinda abona entimanya z’omwinjà n’omubî;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:5">omurhima gwâge gushologorhwa na nyankola-maligo.<verse eid="PSA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6"/>Mûshi emihera ayirhogeze amakala g’engulumira n’ecibiriti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:6">n’empûsi y’omuliro ebè co cigabi c’omu kabehe kâbo.<verse eid="PSA 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7"/>Bulya Nyamuzinda abâ mushinganyanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:7">akunda n’obushinganyanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:7">abantu b’emirhima mimâna bo bâbone obusù bwâge.<verse eid="PSA 11:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" altnumber="11" sid="PSA 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda ancize oku mihigo y’abantu babî</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1"/>Oku mukulu w’abimbiza. Nzihwa y’omu lulanga lwa misî munâni. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2"/>Orhucize, Nyakasane, bulya abashinganyanya badwîrhe bahwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:2">abemêzi badwîrhe bahirigirha omu bâna b’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3"/>Abantu badwîrhe barhebana bône na nnene:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:3">nderho nnunu, mirhima ibirhi.<verse eid="PSA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4"/>Mâshi Nyamuzinda aherêrekeze ngasi kanwa kaderha obunywesi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:4">ngasi lulimi lulyâlyanya.<verse eid="PSA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5"/>Ngasi baderha, mpu: «Olulimi lwîrhu yo misî yîrhu»,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:5">«kanwa rhujira, ye ndigi wankarhukulikira?»<verse eid="PSA 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6"/>Naye Nnâmahanga, erhi: «Amalibuko g’abazamba»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:6">«n’emirenge y’abakenyi erhumire»,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:6">«nkolaga nayimanga; abalonza obucire nabahêrezabwo.»<verse eid="PSA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7"/>Ebinwa bya Nyakasane biri by’okuli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:7">kwo biri nka cûma ca marhale citule omu luganda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:7">nka masholo mashuke kali nda.<verse eid="PSA 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, we rhuciza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:8">we warhulanga kuli er’iburha ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 12:9"/>Abanya-byâha bazungulusire hoshi hoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:9">n’obubî bwarhalusire olugero omu bâna b’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 12:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" altnumber="12" sid="PSA 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuhika mangaci, Yâgirwa Nyakasane?</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2"/>Kuhika mangaci wayôrha onyibagira, Nyakasane?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:2">Kuhika mangaci wanfulika obusù bwâwe?<verse eid="PSA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3"/>Kuhika mangaci nayôrha ntimanya amalibuko omu murhima gwâni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:3">Kuhika mangaci omushombanyi wâni ayôrha ampima?<verse eid="PSA 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4"/>Lolà, onshuze, Nyakasane Nyamuzinda, Nnâhamwîrhu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:4">Ommolekere amasù, ndek’ijir’îrò omu lufù.<verse eid="PSA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5"/>Omushombanyi alek’iderha, erhi: «Namuhimire!»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:5">Abanzi bâni balek’icîshinga babona njajâba.<verse eid="PSA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6"/>Niehe bwonjo bwâwe ncîkubagira:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:6">omurhima gwâni gucîshingire obucire bwâwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:6">nyimbire Nyakasane oku minjà anjirire.<verse eid="PSA 13:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" altnumber="13" sid="PSA 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Isirhe ly’omuntu orhîshi Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:1">Omusirhe anakâderha omu murhima gwâge, erhi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:1">«Nyamuzinda arhahabà!»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:1">Bàcisherêzize, bàjira ebirhankaderhwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:1">ntà muntu okola aminjà ocibabâmwo.<verse eid="PSA 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2"/>Kurhenga emalunga Nyakasane adwîrhe asinza bene-Adamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:2">mpu alole erhi bankacibonekanamwo ogwêrhe obukengêre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:2">ocidwîrhe alonza Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="PSA 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3"/>Boshi boshi bahabusire, oku banali boshi bàsherîre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:3">ntà muntu okola aminjà ocibabâmwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:3">ntâye ciru n’ow’obufumu.<verse eid="PSA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4"/>Ka barhakayumva,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:4">abôla banyankola-maligo bakàmirangusa ishanja lyâni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:4">nka kulya omuntu amirangusa omugati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:4">barhanashenga izîno lya Nyakasane?<verse eid="PSA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5"/>Co cânarhume bajuguma n’obwôba buzira igwârhiro ly’ecôbà</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:5">kulya kubà Nyamuzinda ayôrha abâ n’iburha ly’omushinganyanya.<verse eid="PSA 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6"/>Kàli mwêhe mpu mwashekera ihano ly’omunyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:6">n’obwo Nyamuzinda ye lwâkiro lwâge!<verse eid="PSA 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7"/>Owabona obucire bw’Israheli buhubuka e Siyoni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:7">Mango Nyakasane àgalula olubaga lwâge ekà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:7">Yakôbo acîshinga, Israheli asîme!<verse eid="PSA 14:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" altnumber="14" sid="PSA 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Omwîra wa Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:1">Yâgirwa Nyakasane, ndi wankabêra omu bwâmi bwâwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:1">Ndi wankatwa ecirâlo oku ntondo yâwe ntagatîfu?<verse eid="PSA 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2"/>Ow’olugendo lwimâna n’ojir’ebishingânîne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:2">n’oderha eby’okuli nk’oku binali omu murhima gwâge;<verse eid="PSA 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3"/>Orhagamba ndi omu lulimi lwâge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:3">Orhajirira wâbo kubî, arhanajacira mulungu wâge.<verse eid="PSA 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4"/>Anagayaguze omuherêra,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:4">akenge abarhînya Nyamuzinda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:4">Ebi acîgashiraga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:4">arhankacibigashûla, ciru ankahona;<verse eid="PSA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5"/>Arhahogeza bunguke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:5">arhanalya mpyûlo mpu aheze omwêru-kwêru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:5">Oyôrha ntyo, ntà mango ankahuligana.<verse eid="PSA 15:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" altnumber="15" sid="PSA 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyakasane ye Mwîmo gwâni</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1"/>Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:1">Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, onnange,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:1">bulya we lwâkiro lwâni.<verse eid="PSA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2"/>Nabwîzire Nnâmahanga, nti: «We Nyakasane»,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:2">«Nnâhamwîrhu, buzira we ntà kwinjà».<verse eid="PSA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3"/>Abimâna bali omu cihugo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:3">bo Nnâmahanga arhonya.<verse eid="PSA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4"/>Abandi bashiga abazimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:4">kuyûshûla bacîyûshûlira obuhanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:4">Barhakabona nahuma omu mwamba gw’embâgwa zâbo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:4">barhakàyumva mpu amazîno gâbo gampisire ekanwa.<verse eid="PSA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5"/>Waliha Nyamuzinda, we cigabi câni c’omwîmo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:5">we na kabehe kâni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:5">we gwêrhe obuzîne bwâni omu maboko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6"/>Olugero bàntambagizagyamwo lwangerîre oku nsîmire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:6">ecigabi câni c’omwîmo ciri cinjà.<verse eid="PSA 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7"/>Ayâgirwe Nyakasane ôkampà ihano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:7">ciru n’obudufu nanyumve ihano lyampubuka omu ndubi y’omurhima.<verse eid="PSA 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8"/>Amasù gâni gayôrha gasinza Nyakasane ngasi mango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:8">kulya kubà andi ebulyo, ntankahuligana.<verse eid="PSA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9"/>Co cirhumire omûka gwâni gusîma n’omûka gwâni gucishinga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:9">ciru n’omubiri gwâni guluhûsire omu murhûla.<verse eid="PSA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10"/>Bulya orhankalikirira omûka gwâni omu kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:10">orhankanaziga omwîra wâwe abolera omu nshinda.<verse eid="PSA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11"/>Wanyêreka enjira y’akalamo,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 16:11"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:11">obwimâna bw’amasîma omu kubona obusù bwâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:11">ekulyo kwâwe, mwîshingo gw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 16:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" altnumber="16" sid="PSA 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Omulenge gw’omwêru-kwêru odwîrhe walibuzibwa buzira kumanya ecirhumire</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1"/>Musengero. Gwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:1">Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, oyumvîrhize omwêru-kwêru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:1">oyumve endûlù yâni; orhege okurhwiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:1">oyumvîrhize omusengero gwâni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:1">gwahubuka omu kanwa karhalyalyanya.<verse eid="PSA 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2"/>Olubanja lwâni lutwirwe embere zâwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:2">amasù gâwe gabwîne oku ndi mwêru-kwêru.<verse eid="PSA 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3"/>Wanalola omu ntimanya z’omurhima gwâni onantangule budufu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:3">wanantangula: orhankambonamwo bubî.<verse eid="PSA 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4"/>Akanwa kâni karhakola maligo nka kula abantu bajira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:4">oluderho lw’ekanwa kâni nalulanzire.<verse eid="PSA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5"/>Olugendo lwâni lurharhenga omu njira z’amarhegeko gâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:5">ntà mango amagulu gâni gajajâba.<verse eid="PSA 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6"/>Nkulakire, kulya kubà onyumva,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:6">Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga; ontege okurhwiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:6">oyumve eci naderha.<verse eid="PSA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7"/>Oyerekane obwonjo bwâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:7">we ciza abalongeza olwâkiro omukulyo kwâwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:7">obalîkûze oku babisha bâbo.<verse eid="PSA 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8"/>Onnange nka mbonyi y’isù,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:8">onfulike omu kwaha kwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9"/>Onfulike emihera ekantindibuza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:9">ondîkûze oku bashombanyi bâni bangosire bakâlonza okunyîrha.<verse eid="PSA 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10"/>Amashushi gàbafunisire emirhima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:10">akanwa kâbo nderho za bucîbone kaderha.<verse eid="PSA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11"/>Badwîrhe banyunja banakola bangosire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:11">banniolire amasù mpu bannambike oku idaho<verse eid="PSA 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12"/>Owababona anamanya mpu ntale elingûzize ensimba yalya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:12">mpu câna ca ntale cishurhamire omu bulambo bwâco.<verse eid="PSA 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13"/>Baduka Nyakasane, omujeyo, omushûrhe oku idaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:13">n’engôrho yâwe olîkûze obuzîne bwâni omu maboko g’Omuhera.<verse eid="PSA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14"/>Okuboko kwâwe kundîkûze kuli eyo mifù, Yâgirwa Nyakasane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:14">bulya eyo mifù ecigabi câbo c’obuzîne coshi eco en’igulu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 17:14"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:14">Enda zâbo oziyunjuze n’ebi wababikiraga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:14">abâna bâbo bayigurhe, basigîre abinjikulu bâbo ebisigaliza.<verse eid="PSA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15"/>Niehe omu bushinganyanya, nayishibona obusù bwâwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:15">aha kuzûka, nyishiyigurha nkusinzakwo.<verse eid="PSA 17:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" altnumber="17" sid="PSA 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Omunkwa gwa mwâmi Daudi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa Daudi, mwambali wa Nyamuzinda, àyimbiraga Nyakasane ebinwa by’olu lwimbo amango Nnâmahanga àmulîkuzagya omu maboko g’abanzi bâge n’aga Saulu.<verse eid="PSA 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2"/>Anaciderha, erhi: Nkusîma Nyamuzinda, we misî yâni;<verse eid="PSA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3"/>Nyakasane, we lwâla nsimikirakwo, we lugerêro lwâni, we mufungizi wâni. Nyamuzinda Nnâhamwîrhu, we lwâla nyâkiramwo; we mpenzi yâni, w’ihembe ly’obucire bwâni, we lugerêro lwâni.<verse eid="PSA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4"/>Nalakîre Nyamuzinda, olya okayagirwa! andîkûza oku bashombanyi bâni.<verse eid="PSA 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5"/>Emigozi y’olufù yanziriringa, enyîshi z’omu kuzimu zanyôbohya.<verse eid="PSA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6"/>Emigozi y’omu kuzimu yanzunguluka, emirhego y’olufù yangorha.<verse eid="PSA 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7"/>Omu malibuko gâni nalakira Nyakasane, nàyambaza Nyamuzinda Nnâhamwîrhu; àyumva izù lyâni omu bwâmi bwâge n’omulenge gwâni gwahika omu marhwiri gâge.<verse eid="PSA 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8"/>Igulu lyanacidirhimana lyàgeramwo omusisi, ensimikiro y’entondo yàdundagana, yàdirhimana kulya kubà anakunîre.<verse eid="PSA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9"/>Omugî gwatumbûka omu mazûlu gâge, engulumira y’omuliro omu kanwa kâge, amakala g’amasèsè gàmurhengamwo.<verse eid="PSA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10"/>Anaciyûnamya amalunga, àyandagala, ecitù ciru ciru aha magulu gâge.<verse eid="PSA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11"/>Ashonerakwo kerubi, àbalala, ajà alembêra oku byûbi by’empûsi.<verse eid="PSA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12"/>Anacijira omwizimya gwàshuba cishûli câge, ecirâlo câge gwo mwizimya gw’amîshi n’ebitù bîru bîru.<verse eid="PSA 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13"/>Obulangashane bwamoleka embere zâge, n’ebitù byàhirigirha, byàrhenga-mwo olubula n’amakala g’amasèsè.<verse eid="PSA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14"/>Obwo Nyamuzinda anacilaza emalunga, n’izù ly’Ow’enyanya lyàyumvikana<verse eid="PSA 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15"/>Anacilasha emyampi yâge, àbashandabanya, àlîka emilazô yâge, àbalibisa.<verse eid="PSA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16"/>Okuhandi enshôko z’amîshi zàbonekana, n’ebiriba igulu lisimikirakwo byàfûnuka, erhi mirongwè yâwe erhuma, Yâgirwa Nyakasane, erhi mûka gw’obukunizi gw’omu izûlu lyâwe gurhuma.<verse eid="PSA 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17"/>Anacilambûla okuboko kwâge kurhenga enyanya, angwârha, ankûla aha amîshi gazungulira.<verse eid="PSA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18"/>Anciza omu maboko g’omushombanyi mudârhi, andîkûza oku banzi bâni bandusha misî.<verse eid="PSA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19"/>Bantêra olusiku lw’obuhanya, ci Nyakasane ashuba lwegemero lwâni.<verse eid="PSA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20"/>Anfumya, àmpêka ahagalihire; ànciza, bulya kurhonya antonya.<verse eid="PSA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21"/>Nyakasane anjirire nk’oku obushinganyanya bwâni bukwânîne, ampembera obucêse bw’amaboko gâni.<verse eid="PSA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22"/>Bulyâla nashimbire enjira za Nyakasane, ntanahemukaga nti ngomere Nnâhamwîrhu Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="PSA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23"/>Amarhegeko gâge goshi gayôrha gamba ebusù, n’obulonza bwâge ntaleka kwabujira.<verse eid="PSA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24"/>Mbà mwimâna embere zâge, nnancîlanga oku kubî.<verse eid="PSA 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25"/>Naye Nyakasane anjirire nk’oku obushinganyanya bwâni bunakwânîne. angerera oku bucêse bw’amaboko gâni omu masù gâge.<verse eid="PSA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26"/>N’omuntu mwinjà ôbà mwinjà, n’omwimâna ôbà mwimâna.<verse eid="PSA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27"/>Ôbà mwêru-kwêru n’omwêru-kwêru, ci endyâlya kuyengehula oyiyengehula.<verse eid="PSA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28"/>Nêci we ciza olubaga lw’abîrhôhye, onahonye amasù g’abacîbona.<verse eid="PSA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29"/>We kamole kâni, Yâgirwa Nyakasane, Nnâhamwîrhu Nyamuzinda ye molekera omwizimya gw’amasù gâni.<verse eid="PSA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30"/>Bulya n’oburhabâle bwâwe nangere omu lugamba lw’abanzi! na nka rhuli rhwêne Nnâhamwîrhu Nyamuzinda nambalale olugurhu.<verse eid="PSA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31"/>Enjira ya Nyamuzinda ebà nyimâna, n’akanwa ka Nyakasane karhabâmwo kubirhi; abà mpenzi ya ngasi omuyâkiraho.<verse eid="PSA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32"/>Ndigi oli Nyamuzinda aha nyuma za Nyakasane, Ndi oli lwâla aha nyuma za Nnâhamwîrhu Nyamuzinda?<verse eid="PSA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33"/>Ye Nyamuzinda onzibuhya, ye yumanyanya enjira yâni.<verse eid="PSA 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34"/>Ye lembuhya amagulu gâni nk’ag’enshagarhi, ananyimanze omu malunga.<verse eid="PSA 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35"/>Ye yigîriza enfune zâni okulwa, n’amaboko gâni okufôla omuherho gw’amarhale.<verse eid="PSA 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36"/>Wàmpîre empenzi yâwe eciza, wanangwârha n’okuboko kwâwe kulyo; wankuza n’okubukombêzi bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37"/>Olugendo lwâni walugalihiza enjira, n’amagulu gâni garhajajâba.<verse eid="PSA 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38"/>Nashimbulula abashombanyi bâni, mbagwanyanye ntâgaluke ntajibahungumula.<verse eid="PSA 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39"/>Nabashûrha bayabîrwe kuyimanga, bâhirima aha magulu gâni<verse eid="PSA 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40"/>Wanzibuhize omu ntambala, engabo zàli zintezire wazifunyira omu masù gâni.<verse eid="PSA 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41"/>Abashombanyi bâni wabayandûkakwo, bàmpindulira omugongo; abanzi bâni nabaherêrekeza<verse eid="PSA 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42"/>Banacihamagala, ci barhabonaga owankabaciza; bàyâkûza Nyakasane, àrhabashuzagya!<verse eid="PSA 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43"/>Nabatuntuma nka katulo kayehulwa n’empûsi, nabakandagira nka bajondo b’omu njira.<verse eid="PSA 18:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44"/>Wancizize obugoma bw’olubaga, wananyîmika mwâmi w’amashanja, abantu ntàli nyishigi bànshiga.<verse eid="PSA 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45"/>Abâna b’abantu b’ihanga bàndimîriza, bakayumva akanwa kâni ho na halya banakajira.<verse eid="PSA 18:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46"/>Abâna b’abantu b’ihanga bahirimire, barhenga omu birâlo bâli bayàkiremwo erhi badwîrhe bajuguma.<verse eid="PSA 18:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47"/>Ayâgirwe Nyakasane, luyagirwe Olwâla lwâni, aj’irenge Nyamuzinda, Muciza wâni.<verse eid="PSA 18:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48"/>Nyamuzinda ompôlera, ye lambika amashanja g’abantu aha magulu gâni.<verse eid="PSA 18:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49"/>We ndîkûza oku babisha bâni, onarhume nahima engabo zintêzire; onandîkûze oku muntu w’ebikanyâli.<verse eid="PSA 18:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50"/>Nêci, nâni nakâderha irenge lyâwe omu mashanja, Nyakasane, nâkayimba izîno lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 18:51"/>We rhuma mwâmi wâwe ahima okusômerîne, onarhonya omushîgwa amavurha wâwe, ye Daudi n’iburha lyâge omu myâka n’emyâka.<verse eid="PSA 18:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" altnumber="18" sid="PSA 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamubâho Izûba ly’obushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi<verse eid="PSA 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2"/>Amalunga gaganîra irenge lya Nyamuzinda, n’enkuba ederha emikolo y’eminwe yâge.<verse eid="PSA 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3"/>Olusiku lushambâlira olundi lusiku, n’obudufu bubwîra obundi budufu.<verse eid="PSA 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4"/>Lirhali iderha birhanali binwa, izù lyabyo lyankabula bwayumvibwa:<verse eid="PSA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5"/>Izù lyabyo lilumîre igulu lyoshi, n’enderho zâbo zihisire ngasi aha igulu lihekera. Eyo nyanya yo àyubakira izûba icumbi,<verse eid="PSA 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6"/>Nalyo, nka muhya-mulume warhenga omu k’obuhya, lisîma okushimba enjira yalyo nka ntwâli.<verse eid="PSA 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7"/>Lishoshôkera oku mpekà y’emalunga, lihike bulibirha oku yindi mpekà, na ntâco cankacîfulika idûrhu lyâlyo.<verse eid="PSA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8"/>Amarhegeko ga Nyamuzinda gabà mimâna, gazibuhya omurhima; akanwa ka Nyamuzinda kabà k’okuli, kabwîriza ecidâga obugula.<verse eid="PSA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9"/>Amarhegeko ga Nyamuzinda gashingânîne, gasîmîsa omurhima akanwa ka Nyamuzinda kulangashana kalangashana, kabà kamole k’amasù.<verse eid="PSA 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10"/>Okurhînya Nyakasane bubà bucêse, kuyôrha ensiku n’amango; emmanja za Nyakasane zibà z’okuli zoshi zoshi zishingânîne.<verse eid="PSA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11"/>Zanacîfinjwa kulusha amasholo kulusha amasholo gacìre bwenêne; galushire obûci obununu, ciru n’enshongôle y’obûci.<verse eid="PSA 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12"/>Naye mwambali wâwe go gamuyigîriza, kali kamalo kanene okugashimba.<verse eid="PSA 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13"/>Ndi wankamanya amabî gâge? Ombabalire ngasi bubî bucînfulisiremwo.<verse eid="PSA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14"/>Obucîbone nabwo obulangekwo mwambali wâwe, bulek’impîma! Ntyo mbè muntu mwimâna, na mwêru-kwêru oku câha cinene.<verse eid="PSA 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 19:15"/>Mâshi enderho z’ekanwa kâni zikusîmîse, n’entimanya z’omu murhima gwâni embere zâwe, Nyakasane Nyamuzinda, ntebo yâni na Muciza wâni.<verse eid="PSA 19:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" altnumber="19" sid="PSA 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda aciza mwâmi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2"/>Mâshi Nyakasane akuyumvirhize omu lusiku lw’amalibuko, izîno lya Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo likulange!<verse eid="PSA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3"/>Akurhumire oburhabâle kurhenga ebwâmi bwâge butagatîfu anakulange kurhenga e Siyoni.<verse eid="PSA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4"/>Ayibuke entûlo zâwe zoshi, anasîme enterekêro yâwe.<verse eid="PSA 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5"/>Akushobòze eci omurhima gwâwe gucìfinja, anakurhabâle obone ehi olonza hyoshi.<verse eid="PSA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6"/>Mâshi rhucîshingire okuhimana kwâwe, rhunashûrhire izîno lya Nnâhamwîrhu Nyamuzinda engoma. Nyakasane ayumvîrhîze ensengero zâwe zoshi!<verse eid="PSA 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7"/>Lêro nkola mmanyire oku Nyakasane aciza omushîgwa-mavurha wâge; kurhenga ebwâmi bwâge butagatîfu bw’omu malunga amuyumvîrhiza, omu kurhwalihya okuboko kwâge mpu kuhimane.<verse eid="PSA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8"/>Baguma ngâlè zâbo bacîkubagira, abandi endogomi zâbo; rhwêhe izîno lya Nyakasane Nnâhamwîrhu Nyamuzinda lyo rhucîkubagira!<verse eid="PSA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9"/>Bôhe bahimirwe banahirima, nîrhu rhuli bwimanga rhunazibuhire!<verse eid="PSA 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 20:10"/>Nyakasane, fungira mwâmi; orhuyumvîrhize olusiku rhwakubirikira.<verse eid="PSA 20:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" altnumber="20" sid="PSA 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuvuga omunkwa oku minjà Nyakasane àjirîre mwâmi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2"/>Yâgirwa Nyakasane, mwâmi adwîrhe acîshingira emisî yâwe, oburhabâle bwâwe bumuyunjuzize mwishingo.<verse eid="PSA 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3"/>Wàmushobôzize eci omurhima gwâge gucîfinja, orhanabulaga bwayumvîrhiza omusengero gw’akanwa kâge.<verse eid="PSA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4"/>Wanacimuhà obwangà burhajirwa na wundi, wamuyambika ishungwè ly’amasholo oku irhwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5"/>Akushenga obuzîne, wamuhabwo, wayûshûla ensiku z’akalamo kâge kuhika ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6"/>Oku burhabâle bwâwe irenge lyâge liri linji, wamuhîre obukuze n’obulangashane.<verse eid="PSA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7"/>Nêci, wamuhîre obwangà bw’ensiku n’amango, wamusîmîsa n’obusîme bw’omu masù gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8"/>Bulya mwâmi acîkwîkubagîre Nyakasane, arhankahuligana kulya kubà arhabirwe n’enshôkano y’Ow’Enyanya.<verse eid="PSA 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9"/>Okuboko kwâwe kwâhika oku bashombanyi boshi, okulyo kwâwe kwâgwârha abanzi bâwe boshi.<verse eid="PSA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10"/>Wàbajira nka cibêye cayâka olusiku waciyêrekana, Nyakasane abaherêrekeza omu bukunizi bwâge; n’omuliro gwabamirangusa.<verse eid="PSA 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11"/>Iburha lyâbo waliherêrekeza en’igulu, n’ishanja lyâbo wâlikaga omu bâna b’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12"/>Ciru bankaja migabo y’okukujira kubî, ciru bankajira amenge, barhankakuhasha.<verse eid="PSA 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13"/>Nêci, wabalibisa, wabafôlera omuherho gwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 21:14"/>Baduka, Nyakasane, omu buhashe bwâwe: rhuyimbe rhunakuze oburhwâli bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" altnumber="21" sid="PSA 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Amalibuko n’obulangâlire bw’omushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Oku «burhwâli bw’omucêracêra.» Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, Nyamuzinda wâni, kurhi wandekêrîre? Oli kuli n’omusengero n’omulenge gw’izù lyâni.<verse eid="PSA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda wâni, namâlaka omulenge mûshi, orhananyumvîrhîzi, nnandwîrhe nalira budufu, orhanatwa ihuzihuzi.<verse eid="PSA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4"/>Ocîbêrîre omu ndâro yâwe, mwo Israheli akuhêra irenge.<verse eid="PSA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5"/>We bashakulûza balangâlîre; bàkulangâlira, nâwe wàbaciza.<verse eid="PSA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6"/>Erhi bàkuyâkûza, bàcira, erhi bacîkwikubagira, barhacitulutûmbaga.<verse eid="PSA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7"/>Niehe ndi muvunyu, ntali muntu: ndi mugalugalu omu bîrhu, ndi ikundwe omu lubaga.<verse eid="PSA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8"/>Ngasi wambona erhi anangayaguza, abande ennani, adunde irhwe.<verse eid="PSA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9"/>Mpu: Nyakasane amucizagye, obwo ye akacîkubagira; amulwîrage, bulya kuzigira amuzigira.<verse eid="PSA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10"/>Arhali wundi wankûlaga omu nda ya nyâmà, ci wêne, wandera n’omurhûla erhi ndi oku ibêre<verse eid="PSA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11"/>Kurhenga aha kuburhwa mbà wâwe nieshi, wêne Nyamuzinda wâni kurhenga omu nda ya nyâmà.<verse eid="PSA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12"/>Mâshi, orhanje kuli, obu narhindibuka, yegera hôfi, bulya ntagwêrhi murhabâzi.<verse eid="PSA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13"/>Ndi butumirhwa n’empanzi mwandu mwandu, ensimba z’e Bashâni zamànzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14"/>Zidwîrhe zanyânira emalanga, nka ntale yatula yanabinja mpu ndîbwe.<verse eid="PSA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15"/>Namâbulajika nka mîshi, namâjonjolekana orhuvuha. Omurhima gwâni gwamâjonga nka nsinde, gwamâhirigirha omu nda.<verse eid="PSA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16"/>Namâyumûka omumiro nk’isèsè, n’olulimi lwamânanîra ebiraka.<verse eid="PSA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17"/>Orhubwa rhunzungulusire mwandu mwandu, omulongo gw’enkola-maligo guntêzire. <verse eid="PSA 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18"/>Bantuzire amaboko n’amagulu, banaganja orhuvuha rhwâni rhwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19"/>Badwîrhage bampengûza, banammôlera amasù: emyambalo yâni bayigabanyire, n’ecirondo câni baciyeshire cigole<verse eid="PSA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20"/>Mâshi, Yâgirwa, orhacilegerere, okanye, ontabâle<verse eid="PSA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, obuzîne bwâni oburhenze oku ngôrho, omanye nankalumwa n’akabwa.<verse eid="PSA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22"/>Onkûle omu kanwa k’entale, n’obunyi bwâni oburhange oku mahembe g’embogo.<verse eid="PSA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23"/>Nâlumîza irenge ly’izîno lyâwe ekarhî ka bene wîrhu, nnankukuze omu ndêko y’olubaga.<verse eid="PSA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24"/>Mwe murhînya Nyakasane, kuzagyi ye, we iburha lya Yakôbo wêshi, omuhè irenge. Iburha ly’Israheli lyoshi limoyôbôhe.<verse eid="PSA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25"/>Kulya kubà arhankengulaga, arhanagayaguzagya omusengero gw’omunyi arhananfulikaga obusù bwâge, ci erhi nkaz’imuyâkûza, ànyumvîrhiza.<verse eid="PSA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26"/>We nâkaziha irenge omu ndêko nkulu, nâjirire eciragâne embere z’abakurhînya.<verse eid="PSA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27"/>Abakenyi nabo bâlya banayîgurhe, n’abalongereza Nyakasane, kukuza bâmukuza, emirhima yâbo elame ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28"/>Igulu lyoshi lyàkengera Nyakasane, linabè ye lishiga, n’emilala y’amashanja goshi yâfukama embere zâge, emuharâmye.<verse eid="PSA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29"/>Bulya Nyakasane ye Nn’obwâmi, yêne ye Nyamwagirwa w’amashanja;<verse eid="PSA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30"/>Yêne yêne baharâmya abayûbaka igulu n’abadwîrhe bajà omu idaho, bamuyûnamire.<verse eid="PSA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31"/>Iburha lyâni ye lyâkolera; Amashanja gânacibwîrwe obwonjo bwa Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 22:32"/>N’iburha lyâyisha libwîrwe obushinganyanya bwâge, mpu: «Lolagi emikolo ya Nyakasane».<verse eid="PSA 22:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" altnumber="22" sid="PSA 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Lungere mwinjà</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi. Nyakasane ye lungere onyâbula, ntâco ndagîrîrekwo.<verse eid="PSA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2"/>Anampugire omu bulambo bw’akahasi kinjà; anampise aha nshôko y’amîshi naluhûkira.<verse eid="PSA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3"/>Ho n’omurhima gwâni gwabombêrera; Ye ndwîrhe omu njira nnungêdu; erhi izîno lyâge lirhuma.<verse eid="PSA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4"/>Ciru nankahonera omu kabanda k’omwizimya ntà mabî nyôbohire, bulya rhwembi rhunali. Akarhi kâwe n’obuhiri bwâwe bindi hôfi; byo bidwîrhe byantûliriza.<verse eid="PSA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5"/>Wanteganyiza ecîbo c’ebiryo, erhi n’abashombanyi bâni badwîrhe basinza. Irhwe lyâni wamâlibumba mavurha, n’akabehe kâni kayunjwîre cinyôbwa.<verse eid="PSA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6"/>Iragi n’okubêrwa binkulikîre, ngasi lusiku lw’obuzîne bwâni. Omu mwa Nyakasane ncîbêrîre, ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 23:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" altnumber="23" sid="PSA 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Obugashânize bw’okujà omu cirhînyiro</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 24:1">Igulu n’ebibâmwo byoshi bibà bya Nyakasane, Ye Nnâmahanga goshi n’ebiremwa byâgo byoshi.<verse eid="PSA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2"/>Ye walijeberezagya oku ndêko y’enyanja, àliyûbaka analizibuhya oku maliba g’enyîshi.<verse eid="PSA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3"/>Ndi wankarheremera oku ntondo ya Nyamuzinda, erhi ndi wankabêra omu bwâmi bwâge butagatîfu?<verse eid="PSA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4"/>Omuntu w’amaboko mêru-kwêru n’ow’omurhima gucîre, olya orhahîra omurhima gwâge oku by’obunywesi, orhanalahira binyoma.<verse eid="PSA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5"/>Oyo ye wâgishwe na Nnâmahanga, anacîranulirwe bwinjà na Nyakasane Muyôkozi wâge.<verse eid="PSA 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6"/>Eryo lyo iburha ly’abamulonza, iburha ly’abalonza okubona obusù bwa Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo.<verse eid="PSA 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7"/>Mwe nyumvi, yimuki, yimuki, mwe nyumvi z’ensiku n’amango: hundusi Mwâmi w’irenge.<verse eid="PSA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8"/>«Ye ndi oyo Mwâmi w’irenge?» «Ye Nnâmahanga ciri-misî, ntwâli, ye Nyakasane ohima entambala.»<verse eid="PSA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9"/>Mwe nyumvi, yimuki, yimuki, mwe nyumvi z’ensiku n’amango, hundusi mwâmi w’irenge.<verse eid="PSA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10"/>«Ye ndi oyo mwâmi w’irenge?» «Nyamuzinda w’Emirhwe: yêne ye mwâmi w’irenge.»<verse eid="PSA 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" altnumber="24" sid="PSA 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero omu malibuko</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1"/>Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:1">Emund’oli yo nyêrekîze omurhima gwâni, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2"/>Wêne ncîkubagîre: orhambonesagya nshonyi, abashombanyi bâni bakanacishinga.<verse eid="PSA 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3"/>Bulyâla omu bantu bacîkwikubagira ntâye enshonyi zibumba, bo zàbumba balya bavuna n’olucâli akanwa bàdesire.<verse eid="PSA 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4"/>Yâgirwa onanangule aha emirimbwa yâwe egera, onanyigîrize oku enjira zâwe zigenda.<verse eid="PSA 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5"/>Ongeze omu njira y’okuli kwâwe onanyigîrize, bulya wêne we Nyamuzinda we na mufungizi wâni.<verse eid="PSA 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6"/>Yâgirwa, kengêra obwonjo oyôrha ôbà; kengêra olukogo lwâwe lwa kurhenga mîra.<verse eid="PSA 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7"/>Yâgirwa, orhagerêrezagya ebyâha najiraga erhi ndi murhò, onkengêre erhi nie Yâgirwa, obwonjo bwâwe n’obwinjà bwâwe burhumire.<verse eid="PSA 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8"/>Nyakasane abà mwinjà abà na mwimâna co cinarhuma ahabûla abanya-byâha.<verse eid="PSA 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9"/>Abantu bîrhôhye omu njira y’obushinganyanya abageza, abacirhohya bo amanyîsa enjira yâge.<verse eid="PSA 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10"/>Enjira za Nyakasane zoshi bubà burhonyi n’oburhabêsha, oku bantu bashimba omulagi gwâge n’amarhegeko gâge.<verse eid="PSA 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11"/>Yâgirwa Nyakasane, izîno lyâwe lyoki lyarhuma wakûla ecâha câni, caluzire kuligo. <verse eid="PSA 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12"/>Ndi olyâla orhînya Nyakasane? Yêne àmubwîriza njira ehi acîshoga.<verse eid="PSA 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13"/>Akolaga ayôrha ali mugale, n’iburha lyâge lihâbwe ecihugo.<verse eid="PSA 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14"/>Nyakasane abamurhînya abajîsa mahwe, bo anayêreka ebi àli abalaganyize.<verse eid="PSA 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15"/>Nyakasane yêne nyôrha ndolakwo, bulya yêne ye kûla amagulu gâni omu kasirha.<verse eid="PSA 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16"/>Ndolakwo obwonjo bwâni bukugwârhe, Lolà oku ndi kahumba nnampanyagîre.<verse eid="PSA 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17"/>Nkûla ogu mutula emurhima, onantenzemwo ebi bihamba.<verse eid="PSA 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18"/>Lolà oku mpanyagîre, lolà oku mbabîre, nkûlira n’ebyâha byâni byoshi.<verse eid="PSA 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19"/>Langîra abashombanyi bâni: mpu baluga wâni! Alà n’enshombo bandwîrhekwo!<verse eid="PSA 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20"/>Olange iroho lyâni onandîkûze, enshonyi zakanambumba namânakuyâkiraho.<verse eid="PSA 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21"/>Okubà mwêru-kwêru n’okurhalyalyanya byo byananga, bulya we ncîkubagîre.<verse eid="PSA 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22"/>Nnâmahanga mâshi, okûle Israheli omu mbaka alimwo zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 25:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" altnumber="25" sid="PSA 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’omushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1"/>We wantwîra olubanja Yâgirwa, bulya ntalyâlyanya ntanadandabagana, bulya Nyakasane ye nyôrha mpizirekwo omurhima.<verse eid="PSA 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2"/>Ontangule, Yâgirwa, onyenje obone, onjè emurhima, onanje omu nsiko, olole.<verse eid="PSA 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3"/>Obwinjà bwâwe burhantenga omu masù, nâni niene ntarhenga omu njira y’okunali kwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4"/>Ntatamala ahâli ababî, ntanaja omu ndêko y’endyâlya.<verse eid="PSA 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5"/>Ntakwîrirwa endêko y’enkola-maligo, ntatamala ahâli encuku.<verse eid="PSA 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6"/>Obwêru-kwêru go mîshi ncîkalaba, ntanahwa ntakeya aha luhêro lwâwe, Nyamwagirwa.<verse eid="PSA 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7"/>Kuderha nti inmanyîse irenge lyâwe n’obwâlagale nnamanyîse abandi ebisômerîne byâwe byoshi.<verse eid="PSA 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8"/>Yâgirwa ntahimwa kurhonya eciriba c’enyumpa yâwe, n’ahantu irenge lyâwe lihanda.<verse eid="PSA 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9"/>Iroho lyâni orhaliganjiraga haguma n’ery’abanya-byâha, n’obuzîne bwâni orhabuhiraga haguma n’abahuma omukò.<verse eid="PSA 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10"/>Amaboko g’abôla oku gayunjwîre kubî, n’okulyo kwâbo kudwîrhe entûlo.<verse eid="PSA 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11"/>Niehe mwo ngera omu njira y’obwêru-kwêru, ondîkûze onambabalire.<verse eid="PSA 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12"/>Okugulu kwâni njira ya cidekêra kuyimanziremwo, nâkazikuliza Nyakasane aha abantu bali.<verse eid="PSA 26:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" altnumber="26" sid="PSA 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Oku muntu oli hôfi ha Nnâmahanga ntà côbà</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1"/>Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:1">Nyakasane ye kamole ye na kucira kwâni: ndi naciyôboha? Nyakasane ye lwâkiro lwâni: ndi wampiramwo ecikango?<verse eid="PSA 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2"/>Erhi enkola-maligo zaciyisha mpu zimmire mugumagumà, abo babisha banabè bo bahenanguka bajè oku idaho.<verse eid="PSA 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3"/>Ciru bakantulakwo entambala, ngwêrhe aha ncîkubagîre.<verse eid="PSA 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4"/>Kantu kaguma konene nsengîre Nnawîrhu, kanali k’aka: nti mbêre nâni omu bwâmi bwa Nyakasane ensiku zoshi z’obuzîne bwâni, lyo ncîshingira oburhonyi bwa Nyakasane, ndole n’oku ndâro yâge.<verse eid="PSA 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5"/>Bulyâla omu mwâge anfulika olusiku najakwo olubanja, yo ànfulika enyuma z’ecirhebo c’omu mwâge, anannengereze oku ibuye.<verse eid="PSA 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6"/>Nkolaga ndengerîre oku nyanya z’ababisha bandi eburhambi. Niono nkola nârherekêra omu mwâge enterekêro y’omwîshingo, nayimbira Nyakasane nnamuzihire.<verse eid="PSA 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7"/>Nyakasane yumva oku nayâkûza, mbêra nâni obwonjo, oyumve oku nakubwîra.<verse eid="PSA 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8"/>Wêne omurhima gwâni gulikwo, amasù gâni wêne galonza, nti obusù bwâwe nâni mbulolekwo, Muciza.<verse eid="PSA 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9"/>Orhabunfulikaga orhanayôzagya mwambali wâwe omu burhè bwâwe, wêne we burhabâle bwâni orhandikiriraga orhacidêkereraga, Nnâmahanga, Muciza wâni.<verse eid="PSA 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10"/>Ciru larha na nyâmà bakandekêrera, Nnâmahanga yêhe arhakandeka.<verse eid="PSA 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11"/>Ondangûle enjira zâwe, Yâgirwa, onampire omu njira edêkerîre, bulyâla abanshombire ho bali.<verse eid="PSA 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12"/>Orhankwêbaga omu nfune z’abashombanyi bâni, bulyâla abahamirizi b’obunywesi bakola bayimanzire, nie banayimangire barhanammirira marhî.<verse eid="PSA 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13"/>Ncîkêbirwe nti nâbà nciri omu igulu ly’abazîne, nambone oku Nyakasane kuhâna abâna.<verse eid="PSA 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14"/>Osengere Nyakasane onazibuhe, ohire omurhima omu nda, onacîkubagire Ye!<verse eid="PSA 27:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" altnumber="27" sid="PSA 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Amingingo n’okuvuga omunkwa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1"/>Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:1">Yâgirwa w’ono nayâkûza; omanye wafuka amarhwîri, mâshi Kabuye kâni; bulyâla erhi wakabula bwanyumva, nânashusha abacôcobera omu mwîna.<verse eid="PSA 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2"/>Yumvîrhiza guno musengero gwâni, yumva kuno nakubirikira; lolà oku ndengerize amaboko ebwa ngombe yâwe ntagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3"/>Omanye wampêka omu nsânya haguma n’abanya-byâha, haguma n’enkola-maligo; balyâla babwîra abâbo mpu murhûla, n’obwo bagwêrhe obubî omu murhima.<verse eid="PSA 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4"/>Obatwîre nk’oku ebijiro byâbo bikwânîne, n’oku obubî bw’ebyâha byâbo budesire, obashobôze ebiringânîne emikolo y’enfune zâbo, ebijiro byâbo bibashubirekwo.<verse eid="PSA 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5"/>Obûla barhashîbirira emikolo ya Nyakasane, barhanashîbirira obushanja bw’enfune zâge, Nyakasane arhang’ibashandabanya buzira kucibashubiza haguma.<verse eid="PSA 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6"/>Nyakasane ayâgirwe obu ayumvîrhîze izù ly’omusengero gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7"/>Nyakasane ye buzibu bwâni ye na mpenzi yâni! Yêne omurhima gwâni gwàli gucîkubagire ananyumva.<verse eid="PSA 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8"/>Nyakasane ye buzibu bw’olubaga lwâge, ye na lwâkiro lw’okuciza omushîge wâge.<verse eid="PSA 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9"/>Ocizagye olubaga lwâwe onagishe omwîmo gwâwe, bayâbulè onakaz’iyôrha obashokolera ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 28:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" altnumber="28" sid="PSA 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo kuli Nyamuzinda Nnankubâ</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:1">Mukazirhûla Nyakasane, bene Lungwè we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:1">Mukazirhûla Nyakasane irenge n’obukulu.<verse eid="PSA 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2"/>Mukazirhûla Nyakasane irenge likwânîne izîno lyâwe, mukaziharâmya Nyakasane n’omwambalo gukwânîne.<verse eid="PSA 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3"/>Izù lya Nyamuzinda lirhalusire ery’amîshi, Nyamuzinda Nnâmahanga akûngwîre: amîshi manji-manji gacîhambage.<verse eid="PSA 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4"/>Izù lya Nyakasane obuhashe lijira wâni! Izù lya Nyakasane lirhaluga wâni!<verse eid="PSA 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5"/>Izù lya Nyakasane linahongole enduluma, Nyakasane anahongole enduluma z’e Libano.<verse eid="PSA 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6"/>Anarhume ecihugo ca Libano cahama nka mutwîrà arhume na Siriyoni ahama nka kanina ka mbogo.<verse eid="PSA 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7"/>Izù lya Nyakasane linamanule engulumira y’omuliro.<verse eid="PSA 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8"/>Izù lya Nyakasane linadirhimanye irungu, Nyakasane anageze irungu lya Kadesi mw’omusisi.<verse eid="PSA 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9"/>Izù lya Nyakasane linakube emirhi lisige emizirhu bûmu-bûmu: n’omu ngombe yâge boshi kwo baderha, mpu: Aj’irenge!<verse eid="PSA 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10"/>Nyakasane atamîre agandâza kurhaluka ecihonzi, Nyakasane ye wanayôrha ayîmire ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11"/>Nyakasane ye wâyîsh’ihà olubaga lwâge emisî, Nyakasane ye wâyîsh’igisha ishanja lyâge omu kulihà. omurhûla.<verse eid="PSA 29:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" altnumber="29" sid="PSA 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Omunkwa gw’omuntu ofulumusire akâga k’okufà</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1"/>Lulanga. Lwimbo lw’omugisho gw’aka-Nyamuzinda. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2"/>Nkola naderha aminjà gâwe, Nyamwagirwa: wandîkûzize Muhanyi, orhanazigaga abashombanyi bâni bacîzigiriza nie ntumire.<verse eid="PSA 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda wâni, nshuba nakuyâkûza wananfumya.<verse eid="PSA 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4"/>Omu kuzimu wakûzire omûka gwâni Nyamwagirwa: mwo wankûzire muli balya bayandagalira omu mwîna.<verse eid="PSA 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5"/>Mwe barhonyi ba Nyakasane; nêci mumuzihire là! munavuge izîno lyâge litagatîfu omunkwa.<verse eid="PSA 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6"/>Kulya kubà oburhè bwâge hisanzi hityunguni bushinga, oburhonyi bwâge bwôhe oku omuntu ahabà erhi ho bunabà.<verse eid="PSA 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7"/>Omu muhimbo gwâni nâyisha, nti: «Ntakafà nâdunzirwe».<verse eid="PSA 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8"/>Nyamwagirwa erhi okola wantonya, wampà irenge wampà n’obuhashe; erhi ocibà nka wanfulika obusù bwâwe, najuguma nageramw’omusisi.<verse eid="PSA 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9"/>Yâgirwa w’ono nkola nayâkûza, bwonjo bwa Nnawîrhu Nnâmahanga buno nkola nasengera:<verse eid="PSA 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10"/>Bunguke buci wankakûla omu mukò gwâni, nîsi erhi omu kujà emwîna kwâni? K’oluvù lwo lwakukuza, nîsi erhi lumanyîse oburhabêsha bwâwe?<verse eid="PSA 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11"/>Yâgirwa onyumve onambabalire, obè mufungizi wâni, Muciza w’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12"/>Omulenge nàlimwo waguhindwîre gwashuba masâmo; busunzu nali nyambîrhe wamushwêkûla wanyambika enshagadu.<verse eid="PSA 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 30:13"/>Omurhima gwâni gukolaga gwakuzihira gurhacihuse Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga nâkaz’ikukuza omu myâka n’emyâka.<verse eid="PSA 30:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" altnumber="30" sid="PSA 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero omu marhangulo</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2"/>W’ono nyâkireho Nyamwagirwa: nti enshonyi zakanayîsh’immumba omu myâka n’emyâka. ondîkûzagye wêne omu bushinganyanya bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3"/>Oyuname ontege okurhwiri onakanye ondîkûze. Ombêre ibuye nyâkireho, onshubire côgo cizibu lyo ndobôka.<verse eid="PSA 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4"/>Bulya wêne w’ibuye lyâni we na côgo nyakîremwo, n’izîno lyâwe lyo lyarhuma wangwârhira oku kuboko onandangûle enjira.<verse eid="PSA 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5"/>Lyo lyanarhuma wantenza omu kasirha bantezire, bulya wêne we lwâkiro lwâni.<verse eid="PSA 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6"/>Omu nfune zâwe mbîsire omûka gwâni, nêci wandîkûza, Nyakasane Nyamuzinda orharhebana.<verse eid="PSA 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7"/>Orhakwîrirwa abagashâniza enshusho z’obusha niehe Nyakasane ncîkubagîre.<verse eid="PSA 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8"/>Nkolaga nasâma ncîtakîre obwonjo bwâwe, bulya walolêrîze obuligo bwâni.<verse eid="PSA 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9"/>Orhanampizire omu nfune z’omubisha, ci amagulu gâni wagayimanza ahadekerîre.<verse eid="PSA 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10"/>Ombêre obwonjo Yâgirwa, kulagîrira kuno isù lyâni lyaganukîrwe erhi mutula gurhuma, omurhima gurhaciri gwâni, n’omubìri kwo na kwo.<verse eid="PSA 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11"/>Okulama kwâni kukola ntâkwo erhi mungo gurhuma, emyâka yâni nayo yahwêrîre omu mirenge. Emisî nagwêrhe omu burhè yahwêrîre, n’orhuvuha rhundimwo byacîbêrîre bivungunyukiza.<verse eid="PSA 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12"/>Abanzi bâni ntà cijâci barhampizirimwo, abàlungwe bâni banshekîre barhama, abanyishi boshi kufuduka badwîrhe bafuduka, n’abadwîrhe bambona embuga kuyâka badwîrhe banyâka.<verse eid="PSA 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13"/>Narhenzire abantu emurhima, nayibagîrwe ak’owafîre, nâbà nka nyungu mbêre.<verse eid="PSA 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14"/>Nayumvîrhe abantu bali mahwe kàli ntaho ebihamba birhali! bajà haguma banjira omu ihano, badôsanya kurhi bankulamw’omûka.<verse eid="PSA 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15"/>Yâgirwa niehe we ncîkubagîre, nêci nsêzize: we Nyamuzinda wâni.<verse eid="PSA 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16"/>Iragi lyâni aha nfune zâwe liri: nkûla muno nfune z’ababisha, nkûla mwa bano bandibuza.<verse eid="PSA 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17"/>Yerekeza mwambali wâwe obusù burhulwîre, ndîkûza na lulya lukogo lwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18"/>Yâgirwa mâshi orhazigaga enshonyi zambumba namânakuyakûza, zibumbe ababî bahabe oku bàdesire, bajanwe ekuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19"/>Mâshi orhunwa rhuderha obunywesi rhudume, rhuhumbârhale rhulya rhunwa rhunywerhera entagengwa buzira nshonyi.<verse eid="PSA 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20"/>Yâgirwa obwinjà bwâwe buluga mushâna! Burhaluga obwinjà obîkira abakukenga wâni! Burhaluga obwinjà oshobôza abakuyâkiraho n’abandi basinza wâni!<verse eid="PSA 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21"/>Abôla orhabarhaza oku bulanzi bwâwe, kulanga obalanga oku mihigo mibî y’abantu. Kufulika okaz’ibafulika omu burhwâli bwâwe, mpu ly’obacinga oku nnongwè z’ab’akalimi.<verse eid="PSA 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22"/>Nyakasane mushâna ayâgirwe, owayankaga olukogo lwâge lusômerîne alunyêreka omu cishagala ciyûbakire.<verse eid="PSA 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23"/>Omu ntemu yâni niehe naderha, nti: «Bankûzire omu masù gâwe». Ci wêhe wayumva izù ly’omusengero gwâni ene nkaz’ikuyâkûza.<verse eid="PSA 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24"/>Musîme Nyakasane mwe barhonyi bâge! Kulanga alanga abemêzi Abakola n’obucîbone bôhe kukolera abakolera.<verse eid="PSA 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 31:25"/>Mwe mucicîkubagira Nyakasane mweshi, muzibuhe munashubize omurhima omu nda.<verse eid="PSA 31:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" altnumber="31" sid="PSA 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuciyâza kunarhenze omu byâha</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1"/>Lwa Daudi. Lwimbo lwa Nyigîrizo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:1">Ali muny’iragi omuntu obabalirwe obubî bwâge, omuntu ecâha cirhenzîbwe.<verse eid="PSA 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2"/>Ali muny’iragi omuntu Nyakasane arhatumuzizi obubî, omuntu orhagwêrhi bulyâlya omu murhima.<verse eid="PSA 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3"/>Amango nali mpulisire erhi orhuvuha rhwâni banarhubujegera, erhi n’omulenge gurhankala oku isù.<verse eid="PSA 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4"/>Bulyâla okuboko kwâwe kwàli kuzidohire oku irhwe lyâni mûshi na budufu, emisî yâni yakaz’iyonda nka kuno bayiyanikira oku izûba ly’ecanda.<verse eid="PSA 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5"/>Lyo nkajâga nacîshobeka emund’oli buzira kufulika obubî bwâni; naderha, nti: «Obubî bwâni ncîshobesirebwo Nyakasane», nâwe wakûla obubî bw’ecâha câni.<verse eid="PSA 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6"/>Okwôla kwarhuma ngasi mushibirizi ayishikaz’ikushenga amango alagîrîre. Amango amîshi manji-manji gashabira, garhâhike ah’ali.<verse eid="PSA 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7"/>We lwâkiro lwâni, we wânankûle omu bulagîrire, onampire omu karhî k’enshagadu y’obucire.<verse eid="PSA 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8"/>Nkolaga nakuyigîriza nkulangûle enjira wakaz’igeramwo, nkolaga nakubwîriza nankuje ebulâbi.<verse eid="PSA 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9"/>Murhakazâg’ibà ak’endogomi nîsi erhi ecihêsi, byo birhajira bukengêre, byo birhayumva olurhali lugîsho n’olukoba; nka ntalwo ogwêrhe birhankakuyegêra.<verse eid="PSA 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10"/>Omubî amababale gâge gabà mwandu, ocîkubagira Nyakasane yêhe, obwonjo bumuzungulusire.<verse eid="PSA 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11"/>Mwe bashinganyanya musîme munacîzigirize muli Nyakasane; muzuruke mwe b’omurhima gushongwîre.<verse eid="PSA 32:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" altnumber="32" sid="PSA 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo lw’obukulu n’obuhashe bwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1"/>Mushaguluke muli Nyakasane, mwe bashinganyanya: ab’omurhima gushingânîne bakwânîne bamukuze.<verse eid="PSA 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2"/>Muhindire Nyakasane, mumuzihire enzenze, mumuzihire olulanga lwa bikanyi ikumi.<verse eid="PSA 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3"/>Mumuyimbire olwimbo lurhasâg’iyimbirwa wundi, muyimbe bwinjà muhirekwo n’emishekera.<verse eid="PSA 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4"/>Kulya kubà ngasi kanwa Nnâmahanga aderha erhi kanakubûsire, na ngasi mukolo ajira erhi gunali gwa nkwîra.<verse eid="PSA 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5"/>Arhahimwa kurhonya ebishingânîne n’ebiringânîne, igulu lyoshi liyunjwîre ngalo za Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6"/>Amalunga luderho lwâge lwagajiraga, n’engabo z’emalunga mûka g’ekanwa kâge gwazijiraga.<verse eid="PSA 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7"/>Amîshi g’omu nyanja yêne wagagushaga haguma nka kulya bagarhulira omu kabindi, n’amîshi gahulula yêne agarhulira aha gabêra.<verse eid="PSA 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8"/>Mushâna igulu lyoshi liyobôhe Nyakasane, abayûbaka okw’igulu boshi bamurhînye.<verse eid="PSA 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9"/>Bulyâla yêhe àdesire kwône byanabà, arhegeka byanabâho.<verse eid="PSA 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10"/>Nyakasane ye twîra ab’emahanga omu myanzi, ye bulabuza emirâli y’ab’ekulî. <verse eid="PSA 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11"/>Emihigo ya Nyakasane ecibêra kadundu-ntashugulwa, enkengêro z’omurhima gwâge zirhahuligana, oku biguma byahira ebindi byahirûka.<verse eid="PSA 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12"/>Ishanja lishizire Nyamuzinda liri ly’iragi, lwo lulya lubaga yêne acîshogaga mpu lubè lwâge lwa mwîmo.<verse eid="PSA 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13"/>Nyakasane anabè ali empingu erhi analika isù, anakaz’ibona ngasi boshi babusirwe n’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14"/>Anabè ali omu ndâro yâge erhi anali ebulâbi: anakaz’ilâba ngasi yêshi oyûbaka okw’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15"/>Yêne ye wabumbaga emirhima y’abantu yoshi, yêne ye nakaz’ilola ebi abantu bajira byoshi.<verse eid="PSA 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16"/>Mwâmi arhahimira kuluza ngabo, Omulwî arharhabâlukira kuluza misî.<verse eid="PSA 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17"/>Endogomi erhahimwa kurhebana omu malwa, arhali okuluza emisî kwâyo kwo kugalukira omuntu.<verse eid="PSA 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18"/>Lâba oku amasù ga Nyakasane garharhenga oku bantu bamuyôboha, garharhenga oku bantu bacîkubagira oburhabâle bwâge.<verse eid="PSA 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19"/>Kulinga mpu akûle amaroho gâbo omu lufù, anabayikuze amango bashalisire.<verse eid="PSA 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20"/>Omûka gwîrhu Nyakasane yêne gwâlolakwo: Yêne ye ntabâza orhurhabâla, yêne ye mpenzi yîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21"/>Omurhima gwîrhu gubâge gwacîtakîraye, izîno lyâge litagatîfu lyo rhuhizirekwo omurhima.<verse eid="PSA 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22"/>Nyakasane olukogo lwâwe lurhujâgekwo, nk’oku rhucîkwikubagîre.<verse eid="PSA 33:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" altnumber="33" sid="PSA 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Obukuze bw’obushinganyanya bwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1"/>Lwa Daudi. Amango àcisingiraga isirhe embere za Abimeleki, ayêmêra amulibirhakwo anacîgendera.<verse eid="PSA 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2"/>Nkola nakaz’ikuza Nyakasane ngasi mango, irenge lyâge lirhakantenga ekanwa.<verse eid="PSA 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3"/>Omurhima gwâni guje irenge muli Nyakasane, abanyi bayumve nabo basîme.<verse eid="PSA 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4"/>Mungwâse rhukuze Nyakasane, rhunagwâsanye izîno lyâge rhulihire enyanya.<verse eid="PSA 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5"/>Najîre aho nalongereza Nyakasane naye anyumvîrhiza, anankûla ebihamba byoshi emurhima.<verse eid="PSA 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6"/>Murhang’imulolakwo ninyu mushagaluke, n’enshonyi zimurhenge omu masù.<verse eid="PSA 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7"/>Lâba oku ow’obuligo ashuba ayâkûza, na Nyakasane ayumva amurhenza omu buligo.<verse eid="PSA 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8"/>Malahika wa Nyakasane anagwîsire ecirâlo aha burhambi bw’abayôboha Nyakasane, kulikûza anabalikûza.<verse eid="PSA 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9"/>Labuli mwabona oku Nyakasane abà mwinjà, iragi lyâge omuntu omuyâkiraho <verse eid="PSA 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10"/>Mukazirhînya Nyakasane, mwe Batagatîfu bâge, bulyâl’abamukenga barhabulirwa na bici.<verse eid="PSA 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11"/>Abàli bagale bashubire ba buligo banakena, abashîbirira Nyakasane bôhe barhabulirwa na bici.<verse eid="PSA 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12"/>Bâmina, yishi muyumve, yishi mmuyigîrize okukenga Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13"/>Ndi olyâla orhonya akalamo? Ndi olyâla walonza ensiku lyo ahika oku binjà?<verse eid="PSA 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14"/>Ocîke olulimi lwâwe oku bubî, ocinge akanwa kâwe oku nderho z’obulyâlya. <verse eid="PSA 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15"/>Oyâke amabî ojire aminjà, olonze omurhûla onagukulikire.<verse eid="PSA 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16"/>Isù lya Nyakasane lirharhenga oku bashinganyanya, n’amarhwîri gâge gayôrha gali marhege galinga omulenge gwâbo.<verse eid="PSA 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17"/>Obusù bwa Nyakasane burhabà oku nkola-maligo, azizàze hano igulu ntâye ocizikengêrage.<verse eid="PSA 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18"/>Abashinganyanya bôhe bajà aho bayâkûza Nyakasane, naye abayumvirhiza anabakûla omu buhanya balimwo.<verse eid="PSA 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19"/>Nyakasane arhabà kuli n’emirhima eri burhè, emirhima ecîyunjuzize yo acungula.<verse eid="PSA 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20"/>Amahanya galuga oku muntu mushinganyanya, ci kwône Nyakasane anakaz’imulîkûza kuli go goshi.<verse eid="PSA 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21"/>Orhuvuha rhwâge rhwoshi kulanga arhulanga harhâvunikè ciru n’akaguma.<verse eid="PSA 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22"/>Omubî bubî bwâge bumuyîrha, n’oshomba omushinganyanya kuhanwa anahanwa.<verse eid="PSA 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 34:23"/>Nyakasane yêne olîkûza abamushiga, na ntà buhane oku muntu oyâkira hali ye.<verse eid="PSA 34:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" altnumber="34" sid="PSA 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’omuntu olibuzibwe</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1"/>Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:1">Yâgirwa lwîsa bano badwîrhe bandwîsa, rhabâlira bano banshimbire.<verse eid="PSA 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2"/>Yanka empenzi yâwe n’omushâbiro gwâwe, okanye ontabâle.<verse eid="PSA 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3"/>Ohume itumu abanshimbulwire bageremwo omusisi, obwîre omûka gwâni, erhi: «Nie kucira kwâwe».<verse eid="PSA 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4"/>Balya bashimbire omûka gwâni barhang’itumbaguza, enshonyi zibabumbe; Balyâla barhammirira marhî barhang’ishukira, enshonyi zibagwarhe.<verse eid="PSA 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5"/>Hano malahika wa Nyakasane akola abadwîrhe luminomino, bashube nka byâsi empûsi yayisha yayêhûla.<verse eid="PSA 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6"/>Hano malahika wa Nyakasane akola abadwîrhe luminomino, enjira yâbo ejemw’omwizimya n’obunterezi.<verse eid="PSA 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7"/>Bulyâla emirhego bantezire eri ya bumâma, n’omûka gwâni babîre baguhumbira enshinda oku bumâma.<verse eid="PSA 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8"/>Bamorhogerwa n’olufù barhanalîliri wâni! Mâshi bagwe omu murhego bàrhegaga bône banagwe omu mwîna bampumbîre mâshi!<verse eid="PSA 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9"/>Omurhima gwâni gwohe gwakaz’icishinga muli Nyakasane, gwakaz’icîtakîrira oburhabâle bwâge.<verse eid="PSA 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10"/>N’ebivuha byâni byoshi bikaz’iderha, mpu: «Yâgirwa ndi wakakuja omw’irhwe, we shugula engonyi omu nfune za ciri-misî, we shugula omunyi n’omukenyi omu nfune z’owal’imunyaga!»<verse eid="PSA 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11"/>Nabona bàyinamuka abahamirizi badârhi, bakaz’indôkereza ntanamanyiri.<verse eid="PSA 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12"/>Okunabajirira aminjà bôhe bangalulira amabî; gwo mutula gukângwarhaga.<verse eid="PSA 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13"/>Erhi bàbâga balwâla niehe nanyambale sunzu, ncîshalisagye nk’aha bwacêra obwo, nsâlirage emurhima obwo ntaluse.<verse eid="PSA 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14"/>Nkaz’igenda ndi burhè aka oli omu mishîbo y’omwîra wâge erhi ya mwene wâbo; nnangende nyûnamirîze aka oli omu mishîbo y’omuzîre wamuburhaga.<verse eid="PSA 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15"/>Bôhe erhi nabâga nka nadunga, banasîme, balâlikanage obwo, banjire omu ihano, banyâbuke banshûrhe. Bambambagule burhahusa,<verse eid="PSA 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16"/>bakaz’ingeramwo bananshekera, n’okujegeza amîno nie ntumire.<verse eid="PSA 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17"/>Yâgirwa mâshi, mbwîra nâni kasanzi kanganaci wacîshinga oli ebulâbi? Kanya olîkûze omûka gwâni kuli ezi ngoromora, ogushugule omu nyûnu z’ezi mpangaza.<verse eid="PSA 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18"/>Hano nkola nakuvuga omunkwa omu ndêko y’abantu najà, omu karhî k’olubaga najà hano nkola nakukuza.<verse eid="PSA 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19"/>Orhazigaga endyâlya zinshomba zamwemwerhwa, orhazigaga balya banshombera obumâma bakemana n’amasù.<verse eid="PSA 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20"/>Kàli ciru barhaderha binwa biyêrekîre omurhûla, bakabona omuntu ocîrhûlûlîre hano igulu banamusingire amenge.<verse eid="PSA 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21"/>Banakaz’incuma n’akanwa banaderha, mpu: «Hâco rhwacîbwînîre n’amasù gîrhu rhwêne!»<verse eid="PSA 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22"/>Obwînage obwo Waliha, omanye wankacihulika, omanyâge wankacinja kuli. <verse eid="PSA 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23"/>Tulûka orhahunge, otulûke ondwîre, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, Yâgirwa Muciza wâni, tulûkira luno lubanja lwâni.<verse eid="PSA 35:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24"/>Oluntwîre Yâgirwa, kulya onayôrha oshinganyanya, Nnâmahanga wâni mâshi orhazigaga bankwâma!<verse eid="PSA 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25"/>Orhazigaga bacîshingira emurhima baderha, mpu: «Ho rhwacilakiraga aho!» orhazigaga bacîshinga, mpu: «Rhwamukabize!»<verse eid="PSA 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26"/>Balya bacîshinga bakayumva mpanyagîre, batumbaguze mâshi, enshonyi zibabumbe, balya boshi bannimbira bacinyîgererakwo, babumbwe n’ezamêmè.<verse eid="PSA 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27"/>Balya bandwîrakwo bôhe bacîshinge banashagaluke, bayôrhe baderha, mpu: «Nyakasane aganze orhabâla omwambali mpu naye acîre».<verse eid="PSA 35:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28"/>Nalwo olulimi lwâni lukolaga lwakaz’imanyîsa obushinganyanya bwâwe, luyimbe n’irenge lyâwe bwaca-bwayira.<verse eid="PSA 35:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" altnumber="35" sid="PSA 36"/>
  <para style="s1">Obwengehusi bw’omunya-byâha n’olukogo lwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa mwambali wa Nyamuzinda. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2"/>Obubî kuderha buderhera omu murhima gw’omuntu mubî; obwôba bwa Nyamuzinda burhamubà oku masù.<verse eid="PSA 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3"/>Bulyâla omurhima gwâge kulimîrhiza gumulimirhiza, mpu arhamanyaga obubî bwâge bwankanamushologorha.<verse eid="PSA 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4"/>Ebinwa birhenga ekanwa kaga ciru byône bya bwengûza, bibà bya bulyâlya, Okurhimanya n’okukola kwinjà arhacikuyishi.<verse eid="PSA 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5"/>Ajîre oku ncingo, bibî arhanya, ajire omu njira, enjira mbî yo ntonyi, obubî bwâge arhabuleka.<verse eid="PSA 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6"/>Yâgirwa wêhe olukogo lwâwe luhisire oku nkuba, oburhabêsha bwâwe buhumire oku bitù.<verse eid="PSA 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7"/>Obushinganyanya bwâwe kwo buli ak’entondo za Lungwè, okumany’itwa emmanja kwâwe kwo kuli nka muhengere gwa nyanja. We ciza abantu we ciza n’ebintu Nyamwagirwa.<verse eid="PSA 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8"/>Nnâmahanga mushâna oburhonyi bwâwe bwône! Barhâgaywa abâna b’abantu bakaz’iyâkira omu byûbi byâwe;<verse eid="PSA 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9"/>banakaz’ishêga oku mwandu gw’ebinja bibà omu mwâwe, bakola basûza obahêke aha nshalalo y’obununîrizi bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10"/>Bulya nêci enshôko y’akalamo aha burhambi bwâwe ebà, n’akamole kâwe ko rhubonamwo obulangashane.<verse eid="PSA 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11"/>Abakugashâniza obabêze omu burhonyi bwâwe, n’abajira omurhima gushingânîne obabêze omu bushinganyanya bwa we.<verse eid="PSA 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12"/>Okugulu kw’omuntu mugayanyi irhondo kurhampikagakwo, n’okuboko kw’omunya-byâha irhondo kurhampumagakwo.<verse eid="PSA 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 36:13"/>Lâba oku enkola-maligo oku idaho zikola ziri, zalundusire zirhanacilobôke.<verse eid="PSA 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" altnumber="36" sid="PSA 37"/>
  <para style="s1">Empingira mungo erhayêza</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1"/>Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:1">Orhahîraga okalubira banyankola-maligo, orhahîraga okayâgalwa n’abajira amabî.<verse eid="PSA 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2"/>Bulya kula ebyâsi bihorhama kwo nabo bahorhama kula akâsi kayuma kwo nabo bânabè.<verse eid="PSA 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3"/>Wêhe okaz’icîkubagira Nyakasane onakaz’ijira aminjà, lyo odêkerera hano igulu onayumve omurhûla<verse eid="PSA 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4"/>Obè wacîzigiriza muli Nyakasane, wabona oku akushobôza engalo omurhima gwâwe gusengîre.<verse eid="PSA 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5"/>Olangîse Nyakasane enjira zâwe, onacîkubagireye, wâbona ebi akola.<verse eid="PSA 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6"/>Wâbona oku alengeza obushinganyanya bwâwe nka kamole, n’okuyâza oyâzize akulengeze nka lya kalengerêre.<verse eid="PSA 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7"/>Orhûlûle muli Nyakasane onacîkubagireye kwône orhahîraga okalubira omuntu oli omu njira yâge yâge buzira kubà kurhi, omuntu ovunyengerera ebirhali byo.<verse eid="PSA 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8"/>Lekà okukunira, ocîke oburhè bukugwêrhe; orharûkûzagya: bulya buzinda byankanabîha.<verse eid="PSA 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9"/>Bulyâla enkola-maligo kuhera zâhere abacîkubagira Nnâmahanga bôhe bo bayish’irya igulu.<verse eid="PSA 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10"/>Omubî hano kasanzi erhi arhacihali, n’erhi wakalola aha anali, orhâmubone.<verse eid="PSA 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11"/>Abatûdu bo balya igulu balirya banayumve omurhûla munji-munji.<verse eid="PSA 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12"/>Omubî arhalongeza omwinjà kalamo, arhanamumirira marhî<verse eid="PSA 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13"/>Nyakasane kwo kugwîra amasheka, bulyâla amanyire oku olusiku lw’oyo luyishire. <verse eid="PSA 37:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14"/>Banyankola-maligo aha babîhira banakaz’iyômola engôrho, bafôle n’omuherho, mpu lyo bahira omukenyi muhanya okw’idaho, bananige abantu bashimbire enjira nyinjà.<verse eid="PSA 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15"/>Bône: engôrho yâbo yo yanabarhungûla emirhima, n’amatumu gâbo oku madwî gabavunikira.<verse eid="PSA 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16"/>Ebinyi omushinganyanya afumbasire, byo bikulu oku binji binji by’encuku;<verse eid="PSA 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17"/>bulyâla amaboko g’encuku kuvunwa gâvunwe, abashinganyanya bôhe Nyakasane bayegemîre.<verse eid="PSA 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18"/>Nnâmahanga kushîbirira ashîbirira omûka gw’abantu nkana, omwîmo gwâbo kalamo k’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19"/>Omu buhanya barhâyumve nshonyi, n’omu cizombo barhâbule bushalûka.<verse eid="PSA 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20"/>Endyâlya zôhe kuhera zâhere abashombanyi ba Nnâmahanga nabo kwo bâhungumuke ak’enshungulûlù y’ebulambo, kwo bâhirigirhe nka kula omugî guhirigirha.<verse eid="PSA 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21"/>Encuku ehoza ci erhagalula, omushinganyanya yêhe arhahimwa lukogo arhanahimwa kuhâna.<verse eid="PSA 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22"/>Bulya yêhe abà ahâ obwangà, bo balya igulu, n’abà ahehêrera kukubunguka bakubunguka.<verse eid="PSA 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23"/>Nyakasane ye zibuhya ilabarha ly’omuntu, ye rhonya n’igenda lyâge. <verse eid="PSA 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24"/>Na ciru akahirima arhabêra oku idaho bulya Nyakasane amugwêrhe okuboko.<verse eid="PSA 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25"/>Nali murhò, nie oyu nkola mushosi, ntasâg’ibona balekêrîre entagengwa, ntasâg’ibona iburha lyâbo lyafâ cizômbo.<verse eid="PSA 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26"/>Ngasi mango lukogo ebà na kuhoza ehoza, n’iburha lyâbo kugishwa lyâgishwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27"/>Oleke okubî ojire okwinja, ly’oyôrha ohali ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28"/>Bulyâla Nyakasane ye ayôrha arhonya obushinganyanya, arhakanalekêrera abacêse bâge.<verse eid="PSA 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29"/>Abashinganyanya bo balya igulu, bo banalibêrakwo ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 37:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30"/>Akanwa k’omushinganyanya kurhimanya karhimanya, n’olulimi lwâge lurhaderha ebirhashinganini.<verse eid="PSA 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31"/>Irhegeko lya Nyakasane lirhamurhenga emurhima, n’igenda lyâge lirhadandabagana.<verse eid="PSA 37:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32"/>Encuku yôhe ebulâbi ekaz’ijà omushinganyanya na kuyîrha ekaz’ilonza mpu emuyîrhe.<verse eid="PSA 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33"/>Cikwône Nyakasane arhâmulekêrere omu nfune zâyo, arhamutumuze olusiku lw’okutwa emmanja.<verse eid="PSA 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34"/>Okaz’icîkubagira Nyakasane onakaz’ishimba enjira zâge, akuyôlolola olye igulu, osheke obona oku enkola-maligo zahungumuka.<verse eid="PSA 37:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35"/>Nkola mbwîne endyâlya eminyire, yagandâza nka nduluma ya mpehema.<verse eid="PSA 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36"/>Erhi nshub’igera erhi erhacihali, nti nnonza, lêrhaga!<verse eid="PSA 37:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37"/>Orhang’ilola omuntu mwinjà, olâbe entagengwa, mulume nkana osiga enfula.<verse eid="PSA 37:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38"/>Enkola-maligo bushugunu zâgende endyâlya nshuzo zânafe.<verse eid="PSA 37:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39"/>Abashinganyanya Nyakasane balolerakwo obucire bwâbo, yêne ye lwâkiro lwâbo omu mango g’embaka.<verse eid="PSA 37:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40"/>Nyakasane kurhabâla akaz’irhabâla abashinganyanya, kulikûza akaz’ibalîkûza oku babisha n’okubacinga kulibo, bulya bamuyâkireho.<verse eid="PSA 37:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" altnumber="37" sid="PSA 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’omunya-byâha oli burhè</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi. Lwa kukengêza.<verse eid="PSA 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2"/>Yâgirwa, orhantumuzagya omu burhè bwâwe, orhankalihiraga omu mutula gwâwe,<verse eid="PSA 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3"/>Bulyâla emyampi yâwe yacinyîgwisiremwo n’okuboko kwâwe kwamponîrekwo.<verse eid="PSA 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4"/>Ntà bwinjà amagala gâni gacirikwo nanakugayisize, ntà kuzibuha orhuvuha rhwâni rhwacizibuha nanagomire.<verse eid="PSA 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5"/>Obubî bwâni nêci bundenzire bulî, kwo bunzidohîre nka mushoko muzirho.<verse eid="PSA 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6"/>Ebibande byâni bidwîrhe byahulula byanahûsa, erhi kuhwinjagala kwâni kurhuma.<verse eid="PSA 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7"/>Nagombire, nayûnama nayûnamiriza; nalegerera ndi omu mishîbo.<verse eid="PSA 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8"/>Ensiko zâni kwo zikola ziri nka buhya bwa muliro, na ntaho amagala garhandya.<verse eid="PSA 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9"/>Najîrage nayûnama, omutula guli bunyîrha; nandwîrhe nalaka erhi kukungula kw’omurhima gwâni kurhuma.<verse eid="PSA 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10"/>Yâgirwa, ebi nalakiraga omu masù gâwe biri, n’omulenge gwâni ogubwîne.<verse eid="PSA 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11"/>Omurhima gurhaciri gwâni, emisî yâni yansizire omu marhabi, ciru n’obubone bw’amasù gâni bwantibire.<verse eid="PSA 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12"/>Abirhu n’abîra bâni badwîrhe bayâka akafinjo kâni; abâlungwe bâni nabo barhadwirhi bandirâna.<verse eid="PSA 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13"/>Balya balingûza omûka gwâni bantezire emirhego, balya barhannongeza kalamo badwîrhe bampigira, banadwîrhe balegerera basinga amenge.<verse eid="PSA 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14"/>Niehe kwo nacîbêrire nka wa bihuli, ntadwîrhi nayumva, kwo nnandi nka kaduma ko karhashagala.<verse eid="PSA 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15"/>Kwo nashubire nka muntu orhumva, ye rhanajira kushuza ankashuza.<verse eid="PSA 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16"/>Yâgirwa, nêci, wêne ncîkubagîre; wêne wanyumva, Yâgirwa, Nyamuzinda wâni.<verse eid="PSA 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17"/>Kwo ndesire, nti: «Barhamwemwerhagwa nie ntuma; barhacitakìraga babona okugulu kwâni kwarherera»<verse eid="PSA 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18"/>Bulya ndi buhirima, n’oburhè burhantenga emurhima.<verse eid="PSA 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19"/>Obubî bwâni niehe ncîyâzize kulibwo; n’ecâha câni co cinjizire mutula.<verse eid="PSA 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20"/>Ci balya banshombera obusha bali badârhi, n’abarhambonakwo guli mwandu.<verse eid="PSA 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21"/>Balyâla bangalulira amabî oku minjà mbajirira, banyabwîre kulya kubà niehe njira nyinjà nshimbire.<verse eid="PSA 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22"/>Nyamwagirwa, orhandekêreraga; orhanjâga kulî, Nyamuzinda wâni.<verse eid="PSA 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 38:23"/>Okanye, ontabâle, Yâgirwa, we kucira kwâni.<verse eid="PSA 38:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" altnumber="38" sid="PSA 39"/>
  <para style="s1">Omulenge n’omusengero gw’omulwâla oli bufà</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lw’e Yedutuni. Lulanga Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2"/>Kwo nadesire nti: «Ka nsêze enjira zâni, olulimi lwâni lwakanahabuka; nti narhang’ishuba oku kanwa kâni, obu encuku endi omu malanga.»<verse eid="PSA 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3"/>Nahulika, namerha, ci lêrhaga! Amababale gàbâ kudarhabala gadarhabala.<verse eid="PSA 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4"/>Omurhima gundi omu nda gwabà kudûrhubala gudurhubala; okurhanya kwarhuma gwazûkamwo omuliro kwo kudumûka olulimi Lwâni lwadumûsire.<verse eid="PSA 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5"/>Nti: «Yâgirwa mbwîra ngahi mpekire, nti mbwîra ensiku zâni ziri nyinganaci. nâni mmanye oku ndi ntâye.»<verse eid="PSA 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6"/>Ensiku zâni wazijizire za makoro abirhi, n’okulama kwâni kuli nka ntâkwo omu masù gâwe, ngasi muntu kwo anali nka mûka kwône.<verse eid="PSA 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7"/>Ngasi muntu kugera agera nka cizunguzungu, kwo ahirigirha nka mûka, anarhema analundike ci arhishi ndi wâbihabwe!<verse eid="PSA 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8"/>Bindi bici nacilonza, Yâgirwa? Omurhima gwâni wêne gucikubagìre.<verse eid="PSA 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9"/>Ondîkûzagye oku ngasi bubî bwâni, orhanazigaga nâgwa omu masheka g’idâga <verse eid="PSA 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10"/>Kuhulika nali mpulisire, ntabumbwîre kanwa, bulya wêne wanjiraga.<verse eid="PSA 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11"/>Onkûlagekwo eyi mibambu yâwe,: empîmbo z’okuboko kwâwe zambozize.<verse eid="PSA 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12"/>Okuhana ohan’omuntu kunarhume ayinjiha; kunalundugurhe ebi omuntu arhonya kula ennundo ekolera omurhi.<verse eid="PSA 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13"/>Yâgirwa, oyumve omusengero gwâni oyumvîrhize omulenge gwâni, orhabâga nka wa bihuli nandwîrhe nabanda olujamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:13">Bulyâla ndi cigolo aha oli, ndi mubalama aka bashakulûza boshi.<verse eid="PSA 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 39:14"/>Orhang’ibà wankûlakwo amasù, mbè nka nayîsa, mbul’icîgendera ntengeho!<verse eid="PSA 39:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" altnumber="39" sid="PSA 40"/>
  <para style="s1">Munkwa oku mwandu gw’aminjà Nyamuzinda ajirira abamulangâlira</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa Daudi. Lulanga.<verse eid="PSA 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2"/>Mushâna nali nnangâlîre, nnalinnangalîre Nyakasane, naye olya okasinga ayunama, ayumvîrhiza omulenge gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3"/>Ankûla omu kuzimu, anshâyûla, ayimanza amagulu gâni oku ibuye, azibuhya ilabarha lyâni.<verse eid="PSA 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4"/>Anampira olwimbo luhyâhya ekanwa: lwimbo lwa kuyimbira Nyamuzinda wîrhu. Banji bâbona bayôbôhe, banacîkubagire Nyakasane nabo.<verse eid="PSA 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5"/>Ali w’iragi omuntu ocîkubagira Nyakasane, omuntu orhayêrekera emunda abagashâniza ebiremwa bali, n’emunda abanywesi bali.<verse eid="PSA 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6"/>Ebi wajizire, Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu, guli mwandu: ebisômerîne n’ebi olonza okurhujirira nagwo mwandu, mushâna orhajîbwa omu irhwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:6">Erhi nankalonza okubiderha n’okubirhondêreza, buli bujangija, nanga birhankaganjwa.<verse eid="PSA 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7"/>Orhalonzagya nterekêro orhanalonzagya ntûlo, ci kwône wanfukûla amarhwîri. Orhahûnaga nterekwa orhanahûnaga nterekêro oku byâha:<verse eid="PSA 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8"/>Go mango nadesire, nti niono nyishire. Nie bayandikire omu citabu cibunge.<verse eid="PSA 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9"/>«Mpu njire obulonza bwâwe, Nyamuzinda wâni, n’irhegeko lyâwe oku murhima limba.»<verse eid="PSA 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10"/>Obushinganyanya bwâwe nabumanyîsa aha balume akanwa kâni ntakashubakwo nâwe wêne orhahabiri Muciza.<verse eid="PSA 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11"/>Obushinganyanya bwâwe ntabufulikaga emurhima gwâni, oburhabêsha bwâwe n’oburhabâle bwâwe nabuganîrira abandi, nacîtakirira n’oburhabêsha bwâwe omu ngabo y’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12"/>We mbwîzire, Yâgirwa, omanye wantaza oku lukogo lwâwe, oburhonyi n’oburhabêsha bwâwe bukaz’iyôrha bunnanga.<verse eid="PSA 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13"/>Bulyâla ngosirwe n’ebibî: kuganja kutuka; obubî bwâni bwanzonzire: ciru ntacibona. obwo bubî bwo bunji kulusha emviri zindi okw’irhwe, n’omurhima gurhaciri gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14"/>Yâgirwa, orhahakanaga, ondîkûze; Yâgirwa, okanye ontabâle! <verse eid="PSA 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15"/>Lêro enshonyi zibagwarhe babulabule balya boshi banninga mpu bankûlemw’omûka. Bayêgûke enshonyi zibabumbe, balya bacîshingira okuhanyagala kwâni.<verse eid="PSA 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16"/>Zibabumbe basômerwe balya bakaz’iderha mpu tumirha tumirha!<verse eid="PSA 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17"/>Bôhe balya bakulonza, bacîshinge banasîme muli we; na balya bakulingakwo oburhabâle, bakaz’iyôrha baderha mpu Nyakasane aganze!<verse eid="PSA 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 40:18"/>Niehe ndi mukenyi nnandi muhanya! Câba Nyakasane arhahimwa kunshîbirira. Nyamuzinda wâni, obiduhe mâshi!<verse eid="PSA 40:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" altnumber="40" sid="PSA 41"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’omulwâla olekêrîrwe</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2"/>Ali muny’iragi omuntu oshîbirira omukenyi n’orhagwêrhi hyâge; Nyakasane amuciza olusiku lubî.<verse eid="PSA 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3"/>Nyakasane àmulanga, àmulekeramw’omûka, amuhè n’iragi hanw’igulu, arhàmuyôhe omu lîno ly’ababisha.<verse eid="PSA 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4"/>Nyakasane àyisha al’imurhabâla oku ncingo alwâlira, amurhenzemwo endwâla yoshi.<verse eid="PSA 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5"/>Niehe kwo ndesire, nti: «Yâgirwa mâshi ombabalire, oncize bulya nakubîhîre!»<verse eid="PSA 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6"/>Abashombanyi bâni banakaz’inderhera kubî, mpu: «Mangaci afà, mpu mangaci izîno lyâge lyaherêrekera?»<verse eid="PSA 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7"/>Hakajira owayîsh’intangula naye busha anaderha: omurhima gwâge gunagende guhagirine bubî, erhi ahika embuga agwîre aderhaderha.<verse eid="PSA 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8"/>Balya banshomba boshi erhi bahika baguma bagwîre bampurana, bagerêrezagye ebibî kuli nie obwo, mpu:<verse eid="PSA 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9"/>«Kafinjo kadârhi bamulozire», mpu: «Y’oyo ogwîshîre, arhakacifà azûsire aho».<verse eid="PSA 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10"/>Ciru n’omwîra nali ncîkubagîre, oyu rhwakazâg’ishangîra mugati muguma, naye ampîre ebinioko.<verse eid="PSA 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11"/>Wêhe Yâgirwa mâshi, onfè lukogo, onzûse ahâla ntang’ibayêreka nâni.<verse eid="PSA 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12"/>Nâmanya oku bwenêne ontonya, bano mbona omushombanyi arhâcicîshinga.<verse eid="PSA 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13"/>Nâni onjire nyôrhe ndi mutaraga, onampire omu masù gâwe mbêremwo ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 41:14"/>Ayâgirwe Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, ayâgirwe emyâka n’emyâka. Amen! Amen!<verse eid="PSA 41:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" altnumber="41" sid="PSA 42"/>
  <para style="s1">Iralà ly’okubona Nyamuzinda omu ka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwimbo lwa Nyigîrizo. Lwa bene Korè.<verse eid="PSA 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2"/>Kulyâla akashafu kacîfinja ecikunguzo c’olwîshi, kwo omurhima gwâni gudwîrhe gwakwifinja, Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3"/>Omurhima gwâni gugwerhwe n’enyôrha ya Nyamuzinda, ya Nyamuzinda ozîne, mangaci nabona enjira ndole oku busù bwa Nyamuzinda?<verse eid="PSA 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4"/>Emirenge lwo lukola lwîko lw’omûshi n’obudufu. Erhi bacimbwîra bwacà bwayira, mpu: «Ngahi Nyamuzinda wâwe aligi?»<verse eid="PSA 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5"/>Nankengêre nyumve omurhima gundwîrîr’omu nda, nankengêre oku nabonaga nakananda omu bandi, oku nabonaga nabarhang’aha ka-Nyamuzinda, omu cihôgêro c’omwîshingo n’obukuze, omu kafurhè k’olusiku lukulu.<verse eid="PSA 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6"/>Murhima gwâni carhuma warhoga, carhuma wandwîrira omu nda? Cîkubagire Nnâmahanga bulya nkala nashub’imukuza, ye kucira kw’obusù bwâni ye na Nyamuzinda wâni!<verse eid="PSA 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7"/>Omurhima gwandwîrîre omu nda, bwo buno nkukengêrîre eno munda e Yordani n’e Hermoni, oku hirhando hya Misarhi.<verse eid="PSA 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8"/>Emunda izibyo liyakûza eryâbo omu karhî k’enshalalo zâwe, amîshi gâwe, ag’enshalalo n’ag’omulaba, gangezire aha ntonda y’irhwe.<verse eid="PSA 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9"/>Nyakasane arhankarhang’injira oyu ashobôza oku burhonyi bwâge, buno bw’omûshi, lêro nanalâla namuyimbira, nkuze Nnâmahanga wampâga akalamo kâni.<verse eid="PSA 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10"/>Mbwîzirage Nnâmahanga, nti: «Kabuye kâni ci wanyibagira mâshi?» nti: «Cirhumirage nieki nagenda ndi burhè?» nti: «Cirhumirage nieki ababisha bambuza buhunga?»<verse eid="PSA 42:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11"/>Ndwîrhe nayumva narhoga enjingo ababisha erhi banacinjacira, erhi banacinkangula, mpu: «Ngahigi Nyamuzinda wâwe aligi?»<verse eid="PSA 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 42:12"/>Murhima gwâni carhuma warhoga, carhuma wandwîririra omu nda? Cîkubagire Nnâmahanga, bulya nkola nashub’imukuza, ye kucira kw’obusù bwâni, ye na Nyamuzinda wâni.<verse eid="PSA 42:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" altnumber="42" sid="PSA 43"/>
  <para style="s1">lralà ly’okuj’omu ka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1"/>Ontwîre olubanja, Nnâmahanga, ondêrhere nyâze eyo mihera, onandîkûzekwo erya ndyâlya y’ecishungu.<verse eid="PSA 43:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2"/>Bulya Nnâmahanga, we buzibu bwâni; cirhumire wanyôza? Cirhumire nciyumva ogu mutula gw’akushimbwa n’omubisha?<verse eid="PSA 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3"/>Orhume obumoleke bwâwe n’oburhabêsha bwâwe, byo byandusa bìnyêrek’enjira, byo byampisa oku ntondo yâwe ntagatîfu n’omu birâlo byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4"/>Njâge aha ìbuye lya Nyamuzinda obwo aha burhambi bwa Nyamuzinda orhuma nasîma nanshagaluke. Nkuzagye Nyamuzinda obwo, mmanule olulanga nkuzemwo Nyamuzinda wâni.<verse eid="PSA 43:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5"/>Murhima gwâni, carhuma warhoga? Carhuma wandwîrira omu nda? Cîkubagire Nnâmahanga: niono nkola nashub’imukuza, ye bucire bw’obusù bwâni, ye na Nyamuzinda wâni.<verse eid="PSA 43:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" altnumber="43" sid="PSA 44"/>
  <para style="s1">Omulenge gw’olubaga lwîshogwa.</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwimbo lwa Nyigîrizo. Lwa bene Korè.<verse eid="PSA 44:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2"/>Nnâmahanga, rhwacîyumvîrhîre n’amarhwîri gîrhu, ba larha bàrhubwîzire ebi wakozire amango gâbo, omu nsiku zàli burhanzi.<verse eid="PSA 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3"/>Wêne erhi ôbà wamâhulusa amashanja n’okuboko kwâwe, wabayanka bôhe wàbagwika butûdu; walasa amashanja wabashagalusa bôhe.<verse eid="PSA 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4"/>N’eci cihugo arhali muherho gwâbo gwabahîreco, arhanalî kuboko kwâbo kwabacizize, ci kuboko kwâwe, kulyo kwâwe n’okuca kw’obusù bwâwe, bulyâla orhàhimagwa kubarhonya.<verse eid="PSA 44:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5"/>We Mwâmi nshiga, we Nyamuzinda wâni, we wahimiraga Yakôbo.<verse eid="PSA 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6"/>Buhashe bwâwe rhwakwamagamwo abashombanyi bîrhu, buzibu bwâwe rhwahinagagamwo abàli barhurhêzire.<verse eid="PSA 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7"/>Arhali muherho gwâni nàli ncîkubagîre arhanali ngôrho yâni yangalukire.<verse eid="PSA 44:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8"/>Ci wêne warhulîkûzize oku babisha, wanabulabuza balya bâli barhushombire.<verse eid="PSA 44:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9"/>Nnâmahanga rhwakazâg’icîtakîrira mûshi na budufu, n’izîno lyâwe rhurhàhwaga rhurhàlikuza.<verse eid="PSA 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10"/>Alà lêro buno! warhulekêrîre wanarhubonesa nshonyi, ciru orhaciderha mpu warhabâla mwen’emirhwe y’abalwî bîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11"/>We warhumire rhwayâka ababisha, kwarhuma abashombanyi barhushokôla barhama.<verse eid="PSA 44:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12"/>Kwo warhuhânyire nka bibuzi byaj’ibâgwa, wanarhushandâza omu karhî k’amashanja.<verse eid="PSA 44:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13"/>Kuguza waguzize olubaga lwâwe, waluguza obusha, ciru ntà bunguke wakûzire mw’obwo burhunzi.<verse eid="PSA 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14"/>We warhumire rhwajâcirwa n’abâlûngwe bîrhu, abayûbaka haguma nîrhu barhushekera nk’aha bwacêraga.<verse eid="PSA 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15"/>Warhujizire lwimbo omu karhî k’amashanja, ebindi bihugo byarhugayire byàrhalusa.<verse eid="PSA 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16"/>Obubî bwâni burhacidwîrhi bwantenga emalanga, n’obusù bwâni enshonyi zabubumbire.<verse eid="PSA 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17"/>Ezo nshonyi zidwirhwe n’olya wakaz’injâcira n’okungayîsa, ye dwîrhe okwo omushombanyi, omubisha.<verse eid="PSA 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18"/>Ebyôla byoshi birhurhogîrekwo n’obwo rhurhakuyibagiraga, rhurhavunaga eciragâne câwe.<verse eid="PSA 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19"/>N’obwo omurhima gwîrhu gurhashubiraga enyuma n’amagulu gîrhu garhalekaga enjira yâwe.<verse eid="PSA 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20"/>Wanabul’irhutuntumira omu bulumba ba banyambwe, n’okurhubululirakwo omwizimya.<verse eid="PSA 44:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21"/>Rhuciyibagiraga izîno lyâwe Nyamuzinda wîrhu, rhukanayinamulira amaboko emunda nyamuzinda w’abandi ali;<verse eid="PSA 44:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22"/>ka kuhaba Nyamuzinda ankahabire ye yishi ebifulike omu murhima?<verse eid="PSA 44:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23"/>Ci rhwono badwîrhage banigûza erhi we rhuma, rhwono badwîrhe bagereka nka ezaj’ibàgwa.<verse eid="PSA 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24"/>Zûka, Nyakasane, cirhumire wahunga? Ozûke, omanye wankanarhukabulira ensiku n’amango!<verse eid="PSA 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25"/>Cankarhuma wafulika obusù bwâwe, onayibagira obulagîrire n’amalibuko gîrhu?<verse eid="PSA 44:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26"/>Omurhima gwîrhu bagugombize baguhira okw’idaho, enda yîrhu nayo okw’idaho eri.<verse eid="PSA 44:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 44:27"/>Oyimuke orhurhabâle, n’olukogo lwâwe lurhume warhulîkûza.<verse eid="PSA 44:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" altnumber="44" sid="PSA 45"/>
  <para style="s1">Lwimbo lwa kuyimbira Mwâmi-Mushîgwa ye Masiha</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa kuzihirwa oku «Liliya». Lwa bene Korè. Lwimbo lwa buzigire.<verse eid="PSA 45:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2"/>Omurhima gwâni gukola gwarhengamwo ebinwa bilengehe, nkola nayimbira mwâmi ehimbo hyâni; olulimi lumba ekanwa mugera gwa muntu oyîsh’iyandika duba.<verse eid="PSA 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3"/>Omu baburhwa n’abantu w’oyo olushire abandi busole: obwinjà bàbuyansire babubulagira oku kanwa kâwe: okwo kwarhuma Nyamuzinda akugisha oku myâka n’emyâka.<verse eid="PSA 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4"/>Yanka engôrho yâwe oyihire oku lurhungu, Ciri-misî, yanka obukulu n’obwinjà bwâwe obicûkane.<verse eid="PSA 45:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5"/>Ofôle onagende otamîre oku ndogomi, okanye oj’ilwîra oburhabêsha n’obushinganyanya: okulyo kwâwe bwinjà kufôla.<verse eid="PSA 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6"/>Emyampi yâwe erhahimwa bwôji; wabona oku amashanja gàyisha gal’ikushiga, n’abashomba mwâmi barhibe omurhima.<verse eid="PSA 45:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7"/>Entebe yâwe Nnâmahanga, ho ebà ensiku n’amango, akarhi kâwe k’obwâmi kabà ka bushinganyanya.<verse eid="PSA 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8"/>Orhahimwa kurhonya obushinganyanya, orhanakwîrirwa bulyâlya, Nyamuzinda wâwe akushîga amavurha g’enshagali wêne omu binyu.<verse eid="PSA 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9"/>Emyambalo yâwe edwîrhe yabaya bwinjinjà nka nshangi, obukù na nka bubâni n’omu burhwâli bwâwe buyûbake n’ihembe, ennanga zidumûsire zinakushagalusize.<verse eid="PSA 45:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10"/>Abaluzi-nyere bashûbûzinye mpu bayish’ikuyankirira, makambà aha kulyo kwâwe ayîmanzire, arhwinjire n’amasholo g’e Hofiri.<verse eid="PSA 45:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11"/>Mwâli wâni yumva nkubwîre, alole bwinjà onarhege okurhwiri; orhacikengêraga ab’emwinyu, orhacikengêraga n’enyumpa ya sho.<verse eid="PSA 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12"/>Wâbona oku mwâmi àyâgalwa n’iranga lyâwe: ye kola nnawinyu; omushige bwinjà.<verse eid="PSA 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13"/>Wâbona oku abantu b’e Tiri bâyisha n’entûlo; n’abagale b’omu cihugo bâyîsh’ilonza okurhona emund’oli.<verse eid="PSA 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14"/>Mucîlange, mwâli wa mwâmi oyôla oyishire: mwinjà mwinjà! Emishangi ayambîrhe ya masholo.<verse eid="PSA 45:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15"/>Bàmuhêkera mwâmi n’emishangi yâge y’obutonè-butonè, abâbo banyere bamukunjûsirekwo, bakudwîrhîrebo nabo.<verse eid="PSA 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16"/>Bayisha bayimba banacishinga, bâbo bamâshesherera omu bwâmi. <verse eid="PSA 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17"/>Bagala bâwe bo bâyîsh’iyîma omu bya bashakulûza bâwe; wêne we wânabayîmika babè barhegesi b’igulu lyoshi.<verse eid="PSA 45:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 45:18"/>Izîno lyâwe nâlibwîra amâburhwa n’amâburhwa, kurhume amashanja gakukuza omu myâka n’emyâka.<verse eid="PSA 45:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" altnumber="45" sid="PSA 46"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda ali haguma nîrhu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa bene Korè. Oku izù ly’abanyere­ bashugi. Lwimbo.<verse eid="PSA 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2"/>Nnâmahanga ye lwâkiro na buzibu bwîrhu, àyerekanire omu ntambala oku yêne Mugaruka.<verse eid="PSA 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3"/>Co cirhuma rhurhanajuguma ciru igulu lyankajamwo ehivango, entondo zicirhimba omu karhî k’enyanja.<verse eid="PSA 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4"/>Amîshi g’omu nyanja ganabira gashube bwâlike, entondo zanajegera erhi muhuku gwa mîshi gurhuma. (Nyakasane w’emirhwe ali haguma nîrhu, ye mulanzi orhulanga, Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo).<verse eid="PSA 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5"/>Enyîshi-nyîshi zo ziyinjihya olugo lwa Nyamuzinda, zo zishagalusa ecirâlo citagatîfu c’Ow’Enyanya bwenêne.<verse eid="PSA 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6"/>Nnâmahanga ali omu karhî k’olugo lwâge, lurhâhuligane, Nnâmahanga yêne aluhalira kurhenga sêzi lukula arhanda.<verse eid="PSA 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7"/>Amashanja gajà aho gàcihuma omw’isù, amâmi gàgeramwo omusisi, Lêro izù lyâge lyàkungula, igulu lyàhwera aha nshi.<verse eid="PSA 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8"/>Nyakasane w’emirhwe ali haguma nîrhu, ye mulanzi orhulanga, Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo.<verse eid="PSA 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9"/>Mukanye mubone ebi Nyamuzinda àkozire, muyishe mubone eby’okurhangâza ajijire kuno igulu. <verse eid="PSA 46:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10"/>Ajire aho afunga amalwa oku igulu lyoshi, avuna emiherho, avuna amatumu, n’empenzi azidûlika muliro.<verse eid="PSA 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11"/>Lekeragi aho: mumanye oku niene nie Nyamuzinda, nie nkulire amashanja nie nkulire n’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 46:12"/>Nyakasane w’emirhwe ali haguma nîrhu, ye mulanzi orhulanga, Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo<verse eid="PSA 46:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" altnumber="46" sid="PSA 47"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda Mwâmi w’Israheli n’ow’igulu lyoshi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa bene Korè. Lulanga.<verse eid="PSA 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2"/>Mwe mashanja mweshi, mukome akagasha mucîtakîre Nyamuzinda n’enshagadu.<verse eid="PSA 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3"/>Bulya Nyakasane w’enyanya arhajîbwa omw’irhwe, ye Mwâmi Nn’amahanga goshi.<verse eid="PSA 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4"/>Ayansire amashanja agahira idako lîrhu, agayandaza burhaba aha magulu gîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5"/>Yêne acîshoga ishwa rhwayimamwo, ishwa omurhonyi wâge Yakôbo akazâg’icîtakîrira.<verse eid="PSA 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6"/>Nnâmahanga oyo warherema omu karhî k’orhuhababo, Nyakasane oyo wasôka emishekera yashekeza.<verse eid="PSA 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7"/>Muzihire Nnâmahanga, muzihe, muzihe; muzihire Nnawîrhu, muzihe, muzihe!<verse eid="PSA 47:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8"/>Bulyâla Nyamuzinda, ye Mwâmi w’igulu lyoshi lyoshi, mumuzihire olulanga.<verse eid="PSA 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9"/>Nyamuzinda ye wârhegeka amashanja goshi, Nyamuzinda oyôla otamîre oku ntebe yâge ntagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 47:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 47:10"/>Abaluzi ba ngasi ishanja batamîre aha ngombe, batamîre boshi n’ishanja lya Abrahamu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 47:10">Abaluzi ba ngasi ishanja boshi banali bagula ba Nyamuzinda, ali w’enyanya bwenêne.<verse eid="PSA 47:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" altnumber="47" sid="PSA 48"/>
  <para style="s1">Siyoni, ntondo ya Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1"/>Lwimbo. Lulanga. Lwa bene Korè.<verse eid="PSA 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2"/>Nyakasane mushâna ali mukulu, akwânîne bamukuze bwenêne omu lugo lwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3"/>Entondo yâge ntagatîfu hibà hirhondo hilushire ezindi, abà mushagalusa w’igulu lyoshi. Entondo ya Siyoni yo ntebe ya Nyamuzinda, lwo lugo lw’omwâmi mukulu.<verse eid="PSA 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4"/>Nyamuzinda àyerakanîre omu lugo lwâge oku anali lwâkiro lw’okunali.<verse eid="PSA 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5"/>Lâba oku abâmi bâli bamâhuluzanya banarhabâlira caligumiza.<verse eid="PSA 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6"/>Oku bànabona ntya bafuduka, bashandabana bakûla idârhi.<verse eid="PSA 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7"/>Entemu yabashamula, balwâla ebihamba ak’owalwâla emikero<verse eid="PSA 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8"/>Gashuba manywanywa nka kula empûsi yàhubuka ebushoshôkero bw’izûba eshangula amârho g’e Tarsi.<verse eid="PSA 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9"/>Oku rhwabwîragwa kwo rhwayishirig’ibona, omu lugo lwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu, omu lugo lwa Nyakasane Nn’emirhwe Nyakasane àluzibuhize mpu lusêre ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10"/>Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, rhunakaz’ikengêra olukogo lwâwe omu ngombe yâwe.<verse eid="PSA 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11"/>Irenge lyâwe Nyamwagirwa, lihumîre ah’irhwêrhwè ly’igulu ak’Izîno lyâwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">Okulyo kwâwe kuyunjwîre bushinganyanya:<verse eid="PSA 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12"/>entondo ya Siyoni ecîzigirize, n’abanyere b’omu Yûda bacîtakîre obushinganyanya bwâwe omu kutwa emmanja.<verse eid="PSA 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13"/>Muj’izunguluka Siyoni mubone, mumugere omu marhambi munaganje enkingi zâge,<verse eid="PSA 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14"/>mulolêreze enkûta zâge, musingirize na ngasi nkingi eyâkirwamwo, lyo muhash’ibwîra abâna bâburhwa, erhi:<verse eid="PSA 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 48:15"/>«Nyamuzinda oyo mutyo», erhi: «Nyamuzinda wîrhu ho abâ ensiku n’amango, yêne ye mungere orhuyâbula kuhika olw’okufà».<verse eid="PSA 48:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" altnumber="48" sid="PSA 49"/>
  <para style="s1">Obufà-nshuzo bw’ebirugu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa bene Korè. Lulanga.<verse eid="PSA 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2"/>Muyumve guno mwe mashanja mweshi, murhege okurhwiri mwe mubà okw’igulu mweshi.<verse eid="PSA 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3"/>Barhwâli mweshi ninyu bantu kwône, mwe bagale ninyu bakenyi.<verse eid="PSA 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4"/>Akanwa kâni binwa bya bugula kaderha, n’omurhima gwâni bya burhimanya gwakengêra.<verse eid="PSA 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5"/>Nkola nayanka okurhwiri kwâni nkurhege omugani, nyanke omusi gw’olulanga nyimbirekwo omugani gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6"/>Cici cankarhuma najuguma amango ensiku ziri mbî? Cici cankarhuma nadirhimana nka ngosirwe n’empingira-mungo.<verse eid="PSA 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7"/>Zira zicîkubagira obuhirhi bwâzo, zinacîkunge obunji b’ebi zijira?<verse eid="PSA 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8"/>N’obwo omuntu arhacîcungula yêne, emwa Nyamuzinda omuntu arhacîhânakwo ncungulà:<verse eid="PSA 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9"/>Okufungira omûka gw’omuntu kurhali hôfi, na ntâkwo gwafungirwe lwoshi,<verse eid="PSA 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10"/>omuntu alarne arhaluse ensiku, alame burhafà.<verse eid="PSA 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11"/>Bulyâla omuntu anabone abagula bagabe ebirugu, abone abahwinja n’amadâga nago gafè, abone boshi, ebirugu byâbo babisigîre bandi bandi;<verse eid="PSA 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12"/>Enshinda zishubâge zo nyumpa babêramwo ensiku n’amango, n’obwo bihugo binji bal’ihîre amazîno gâbo!<verse eid="PSA 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13"/>Nanga ntà muntu walamire omu buhirhi: omuntu anashushîne n’ebintu byo birhengamw’omûka.<verse eid="PSA 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14"/>Yo njira y’abacîbikakwo omurhima eyo, kwo banafà ntyo abalimbira omugisho bàburhanagwa.<verse eid="PSA 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15"/>Kwo bahêkwa ekuzimu ak’ezaj’ibâgwa, lufù lubayâbula na bashinganyanya babarhegeka.<verse eid="PSA 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16"/>Niehe Nyamuzinda ekuzimu âyîsh’inkûla, bulyâla kurhôla âyish’intôla.<verse eid="PSA 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17"/>Irhondo okabona omuntu ahirhire orhayôbohaga, irhondo okabona eby’omu mwâge byaluga orhayôbohaga;<verse eid="PSA 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18"/>bulya olusiku afà arhacîyîkire kantu ciru n’akaguma, n’obuhirhi bwâge burhâmuluse omu kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19"/>Ciru akabà amango àli acizîne àcîbwîzire ebinwa binjà, mpu: «abandi bakusîma obûla ocîkômbire wêne»,<verse eid="PSA 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20"/>kurhârhume arhaja omu balinda-mboho, balya barhakacifà bàbwîne akamole. <verse eid="PSA 49:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 49:21"/>Omuntu ohirhîre buzira kurhimanya, anashushîne n’ebintu by’okubâgwa.<verse eid="PSA 49:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" altnumber="49" sid="PSA 50"/>
  <para style="s1">Oburherekêre busîmîsa Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Azafi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:1">Nyakasane Nnâmahanga adesire akanwa analâlika igulu lyoshi, kurhenga ebushoshôkero bw’izûba kuhika ebuzikiro bwalyo.<verse eid="PSA 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2"/>Nyamuzinda abalagazize kurhenga e Siyoni, ntondo yâge nyinjinjà.<verse eid="PSA 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3"/>Nyamuzinda wîrhu oyôla oyishire: arhâbule buderha akanwa. Ntakanjirwa w’omuliro amushokolîre, ayisha ayôkera, n’empûsi emugosire yayisha yakola akal’ibala.<verse eid="PSA 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4"/>Amâlâlika amalunga amâlâlika n’idaho, bulyâla akola atwîr’olubaga lwâge olubanja.<verse eid="PSA 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5"/>Mpu: «mpamagaliri abemêzi bâni, mpamagaliri balya bànywânaga nâni bulya barherekêra.»<verse eid="PSA 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6"/>Amalunga gamanyîsa oku olubanja bwinjà lutûbirwe: bulyâla Nyamuzinda yêne olutwire.<verse eid="PSA 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7"/>Mpu: «lubaga lwâni yumva nkubwîre, mpu: Israheli nkola nakushobeka: niene nie Nyamubâho, nie Nyamuzinda wâwe.<verse eid="PSA 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8"/>Arhali nterekêro zâwe zo otumwîrekwo, bulyâla embâgwa zâwe zirhantenga omu masù.<verse eid="PSA 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9"/>Ntâzigè akanina k’omu mwâwe, ntâyêmêre n’enganda-buzi z’omu busô bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10"/>Ensimba z’omu muzirhu zoshi zâni, n’ebintu biyâbukira omu malambo gâni birhankaganjwa.<verse eid="PSA 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11"/>Ntà kanyunyi kabalala mpabire, na ngasi hitondegera omu ishwa hyoshi mpimanyire.<verse eid="PSA 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12"/>Nka kwàli kushalika ntankakubwîzire bulyâla amahanga goshi gâni na ngasi bimuli byoshi byâni.<verse eid="PSA 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13"/>Ka nkulîra binyama bya mpanzi, nîsi erhi kwo bàkubwizire mpu nywa mwamba gwa bihebe?<verse eid="PSA 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14"/>Okaz’ibâgira Nnâmahanga enterekêro y’okumukuza, onakaz’ijuha Nnâmahanga endagâno omulaganya.<verse eid="PSA 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15"/>N’olusiku wânabe ogwêrhwe n’omutula onanyâkûze, wâbona oku nakulîkûza onankenge.»<verse eid="PSA 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16"/>Enkola-maligo nayo kwo Nyamuzinda ayibwîzire, erhi: «cirhuma obwîra abandi amarhegeko gâni, cirhuma ebinwa by’endagâno yâni birhakurhenga ekanwa,<verse eid="PSA 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17"/>we muntu wakengulaga ihano lyâni, wanajugucira ebinwa byâni kulî nâwe?<verse eid="PSA 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18"/>Erhi wabonaga ecishambo onakanye ociluse, erhi wabonaga abantu b’ebishungu erhi wamâbona abinyu.<verse eid="PSA 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19"/>Akanwa kâwe wakaz’ikalîkira oku bibî, n’olulimi lwâwe lurhàhimagwa kulyâlyanya.<verse eid="PSA 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20"/>Erhi wajàga oku rukiko erhi na mwene winyu ohêrhekwo, erhi na mwâna nyoko aburha oli bonêsa nshonyi.<verse eid="PSA 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21"/>K’obè wajijire ntyo nnampulike? Ka kwo omanyire mpu ndi akâwe? Nakuyagiriza njalabulire byoshi omu masù gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22"/>Rhangi muyumve kuno, mwe mukaz’iyibagira Nyamuzinda, rhangi muyumve kuno bakanajira abà nâgwârha babule câgalukira.<verse eid="PSA 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23"/>Ye nsîmîsa omuntu obâga enterekêro y’okunkuza, n’omuntu oshimba enjira nnungêdu ye nayêreka oku Nyamuzinda kuciza aciza.»<verse eid="PSA 50:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" altnumber="50" sid="PSA 51"/>
  <para style="s1">Ombêre obwonjo, Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 51:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2"/>Amango omulêbi Natani àjaga emunda Daudi ali kulya kubà anacîhemwîre kuli Betiseba.<verse eid="PSA 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda ombabalire, obwonjo bwâwe burhumire.<verse eid="PSA 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4"/>Omu lukogo lwâwe lunji, ozâze ecâha câni.<verse eid="PSA 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5"/>Bulyâla ntababiri obubî bwâni, ngasi mango ecâha câni cindi omu masù.<verse eid="PSA 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6"/>Wêne nagomire, Nyamwagirwa, ebiri bibî omu masù gâwe nabijizire. Ntyo oli murhondekezi omu bucîranuzi bwâwe, oli mutwî w’emmanja mwimâna.<verse eid="PSA 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7"/>Okengêre oku naburhagwa omu bubî, omu câha nayâlalagwa omu nda ya nyâmà.<verse eid="PSA 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8"/>Omurhima gw’omuntu w’okuli gwo gukusîmîsa, omu ndubi y’omurhima gwâni mw’onyigîriziza obumanye.<verse eid="PSA 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9"/>Ewe Nyakasane onkangûle lyo ncà, onshuke mbè mwêru nka lubula.<verse eid="PSA 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10"/>Nyumve obusîme n’omwîshingo, amavuha gàli gavungunyusire garhambe.<verse eid="PSA 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11"/>Orhalolaga obubî bwâni, ebyâha byâni byoshi obizâze.<verse eid="PSA 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12"/>Mâshi Nyamuzinda, omurhima gwâni oguleme buhyâhya ompiremwo iroho lihyâhya onalizibuhye.<verse eid="PSA 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13"/>Orhantenzagy’emalanga gâwe, orhanyagaga omûka gwâwe Mutagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14"/>Ongalulire obushaguluke bw’obuyôkozi bwâwe, ompè omurhima gw’entwâli.<verse eid="PSA 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15"/>Nyêreke abagoma enjira zâwe, n’abanya-byâha bagaluk'emund’oli.<verse eid="PSA 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16"/>Ondîkûze oku buhane bw’omukò, Nyakasane Muyôkozi wâni, olulimi lwâni lukayimba oburhondekezi bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17"/>Onshwêkûle akanwa Nyakasane, olulimi lwâni lukâderha irenge lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18"/>Bulya enterekêro erhakusîmîsa, n’erhi nankakubâgira orhankayêmera.<verse eid="PSA 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19"/>Enterekêro yâni, Yâgirwa, guli murhima gwadwa mukò, omurhima gwarhanya gunavungunyusire, orhankagukabulira, Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 51:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 51:20"/>Omu bwinjà bwâwe, okengêre Siyoni, Muhanyi, oshub’iyûbaka olugo lwa Yeruzalemu.<verse eid="PSA 51:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 51:21"/>Lyoki wankayankirira enterekêro zirhegesirwe, entûlo n’embâgwa ya nsirîra, lyoki bankarherekêra ebimasha oku luhêro lwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 51:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" altnumber="51" sid="PSA 52"/>
  <para style="s1">Okutwa olubanja lw’omulenzi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1"/>Gwarhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Nyigîrizo. Za Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 52:1"/></para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2"/>Amango Dwege w’e Edomu àyishig’ibwîra Saulu, erhi: «Daudi ajìre omu mwa Abimeleki».<verse eid="PSA 52:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3"/>Kurhi okwo walimbira obubî, wâni cikala-nshonyi?<verse eid="PSA 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4"/>Ngasi mango erhi na bubî warhânya, obulijira olulimi lwôji nka lugembe, nyankola-maligo.<verse eid="PSA 52:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5"/>Amabi g’orhonya oku minjà, obunywesi bw’oyumva orhonyize oku iderha linja!<verse eid="PSA 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6"/>Ebinwa bibi orhabikubwakwo, kanywesi!<verse eid="PSA 52:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7"/>Okwôla kwârhuma Nyamuzinda akushâba buyumpa, akushugule budundu, kwârhuma akubarhûla omu cihugo, akumânyule oku igulu ly’abazîne.<verse eid="PSA 52:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8"/>Abashinganyanya bamubona bageremw’omusisi, oku bundi bamukwame, mpu:<verse eid="PSA 52:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9"/>«Y’oyo omwîra winyu wàbulaga bwajira Nyamuzinda lwakiro lwâge: akaz’icîkubagira obunji bw’ebirugu byâge, akaz’ilimbira ebyâha byâge!»<verse eid="PSA 52:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 52:10"/>Niehe kwo ndi nka muzêti gujininira omu ka-Nyamuzinda; olukogo lwa Nnâmahanga lwo ncîkubagira ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 52:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 52:11"/>Nakaz’ikukuza ensiku zoshi bulya wakozire, nakaz’ikuza izîno lyâwe omu masù g’abarhonyi bâwe, bulya liri linja.<verse eid="PSA 52:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52"/>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" altnumber="52" sid="PSA 53"/>
  <para style="s1">Obuhwinja bw’omuntu olahira Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Oku ndwâla. Lwimbo. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 53:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2"/>Omuhwinja anaderhe, erhi: «Nyamuzinda arhahabà!» Bàhabusire, bàjizire eby’okugayîsa, ntâye ojira aminjà.<verse eid="PSA 53:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3"/>Kurheng’enyanya Nyamuzinda asinzize ababurhwa n’abantu alole erhi abonamwo omuntu w’obwenge amulongereza.<verse eid="PSA 53:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4"/>Boshi bàherîre haguma, boshi bàsherîre; ntâye ojira aminjà ciru n’omuguma!<verse eid="PSA 53:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5"/>Ewe! k’abajira amabî barhayengeha, bala bashanshanyula omulala gwâni nka kula balya omugati? Ka barhashenga Nyamubâho?<verse eid="PSA 53:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6"/>Banîre omushunzi, n’obwo ntâbyo bibayôbohize, bulya Nyamuzinda ashandâza ebivuha bya balya balikugosire; enshonyi zâbabumbire, bulya Nyamuzinda anabakabulîre boshi.<verse eid="PSA 53:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 53:7"/>Lêro ndi walêrhera Israheli obucire bwarhenga e Siyoni? Hano Nyamuzinda agalula empira z’omulala gwâge Yakôbo âshagaluka, Israheli asîme.<verse eid="PSA 53:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53"/>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" altnumber="53" sid="PSA 54"/>
  <para style="s1">Izù lyayâkûza Nyamuzinda Mucîranuzi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Oku nzihwa z’emisî. Nyigîrizo. Za Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 54:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2"/>Amango abantu b’e Zif bàlibwîra Saulu, mpu: «Ka Daudi arhali e mwîrhu acîfulisire obu?»<verse eid="PSA 54:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3"/>Mâshi Nyamuzinda oncize n’izîno lyâwe mâshi, ontwîre nâni luno lubanja oku buhashe bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 54:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda mâshi, yumvîrhiza omusengero gwâni, rhega okurhwiri oyumve ebinwa byâni. <verse eid="PSA 54:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5"/>Kulya kubà balya bacîgenza banyandûsirekwo, balya b’ecikalarhu nabo banshimbire mpu bantenzemw’omûka.<verse eid="PSA 54:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6"/>Awa, Nnâmahanga oyûla oli ntabâla, Nyakasane ye Nyamwegemerwa w’omûka gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 54:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7"/>Abashombanyi bâni orhangibayêrekeza obuhanya n’oku bwinjà bwâwe, Nyamuzinda obashâbe buyumpa.<verse eid="PSA 54:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 54:8"/>Nnonzize nkurhûle enterekêro, nnangashânize izîno lyâwe, Nyakasane, bulya liri linjà.<verse eid="PSA 54:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 54:9"/>Kulya kubà lyândikûzize oku ngasi mbaka, nanabwîne oku abashombanyi bâni bacôcoboka n’enshonyi.<verse eid="PSA 54:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54"/>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" altnumber="54" sid="PSA 55"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’odwîrhe alibuzibwa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1"/>Oku mukulu w’abimbiza. Oku nzihwa y’emirya. Nyigîrizo. Za Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 55:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2"/>Nyamuzinda mâshi, rhega okurhwiri oyumve omusengero gwâni, orhanagayaga izù ly’okuyinginga kwâni,<verse eid="PSA 55:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3"/>ci onyumve onayumvîrhize. Omutula gwanjegezize, nanayumvîrhe bangurumana:<verse eid="PSA 55:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4"/>izù ly’omubisha lirhumire, lwôho lw’omuntu mubî lurhumire. Kulya kubà badwîrhe bambarhuza amabî, banadwîrhe bansongera n’omutula gwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 55:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5"/>Omurhima gundi omu nda bagulyagusize, n’ebihamba by’olufù byamponirekwo.<verse eid="PSA 55:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6"/>Obwôba n’omusisi byantanzir’ekà, najugumire narhalusa.<verse eid="PSA 55:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7"/>Ndigi, nti: «Owampà amashala nka ngûkù, nanabalala nj’icirhamûkira ».<verse eid="PSA 55:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8"/>Nanayâkira kulî, nj’ibêra omu mpinga.<verse eid="PSA 55:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9"/>Nanayirukira nalonza aha nacibundika, aha nayâkira empûsi n’omulaba.<verse eid="PSA 55:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10"/>Orhang’ibashandabanya mâshi Nyamwagirwa, orhang’iberûla endimi zâbo: mbwîne obu oku entambala n’ennongwè byarhurhanzir’ekà.<verse eid="PSA 55:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11"/>Mûshi na budufu erhi kukeya byakeya oku lugo, obuhanya nabwo haguma n’amalibuko, byagwîsiremwo ecirâlo omu karhî k’olugo;<verse eid="PSA 55:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12"/>nayo emirhego yagwisirwe omu karhî kâlwo, murhâkala buhagwe murhâkala na bulyâlya.<verse eid="PSA 55:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13"/>Acibâga mwanzi wanjâciraga, nankanahulisire kwône, Acibâga muntu onshomba wanyishagakwo, nankanayâsire nj’icîfulikaye.<verse eid="PSA 55:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14"/>Ci wêhe wâni: Kàli rhwembi rhwàkulaga, rhwayinjibana rhwanakômerana wâni!<verse eid="PSA 55:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15"/>Omuntu nabonaga rhwanunirwa n’ecinyabuguma, rhwacûka kuguma omu ka-Nyamuzinda omu kafurhè k’olukulu wâni!<verse eid="PSA 55:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16"/>Baborhogerwa na wa-lufù wâni, babocôcôber’ekuzimu banazîne, obûla bahandisize obulyâlya omu mwa bâbwè, babutamaza omu karhî kâbo!<verse eid="PSA 55:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17"/>Niehe Nnâmahanga ye nayâkûza, Nyakasane ye wandîkûza<verse eid="PSA 55:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18"/>Sêzi, ebijingo n’omûshi, nkaz’ilaka nnandakûle, ayumve omulenge gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 55:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19"/>Omûka gwâni ye waguyôkola aguhebe omu murhûla, agulîkûze oku babisha bulya abanshombire bali banji.<verse eid="PSA 55:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20"/>Nnâmahanga ayumva kurhenga ensiku n’amango. kàli bôhe obu barhagokôla. <verse eid="PSA 55:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21"/>Bôhe banakaz’irìkira oyu babà boshi okuboko, ngasi muguma muli bo kushube kuciyandûlira ecihango.<verse eid="PSA 55:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22"/>Obusù bwâge bunabè bulushire amakafè kuyengûla, erhi n’omurhima gwâge bya ntambala gulimwo. Ebimwa byâge binabè bilushire amavurha bulembu, erhi zinali ngôrho bugôrho.<verse eid="PSA 55:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23"/>Emmanja zâwe ozihengulire Nyakasane, wâbona oku akurhamûla: ntà mango akaleka omushinganyanya alwâla enzungulira.<verse eid="PSA 55:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 55:24"/>Nnâmahanga obabulindike omu nyenga y’olufù; ebishumûsi n’endyâlya birhahikè ciru omu karhî k’ensiku zâbyo, ci niehe we ncîkubagîre.<verse eid="PSA 55:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55"/>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" altnumber="55" sid="PSA 56"/>
  <para style="s1">Ntà mango omwemêzi ahuligane</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. «Ak’engûkù y’omu mirhi y’ihanga». Lwa Daudi. N’izù linyinyi. Amango Daudi àbaga amâgwârhirwa e Gati n’Abafilistini.<verse eid="PSA 56:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2"/>Ombè lukogo mâshi Nnâmahanga, niono bahizire okw’idaho, badwîrhe bamvulindika burhahusa, nieshi bajirire manywanywa.<verse eid="PSA 56:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3"/>Babisha abo badwîrhe bandabarha ntyo burhahusa, banali banji banji abadwîrhe bandwîsa.<verse eid="PSA 56:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4"/>Yâgirwa, we bà enyanya, wêne ncîkubagîre, olusiku entemu yânshamula. <verse eid="PSA 56:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5"/>Ndagâno ya Nyamuzinda eno nâcîtakîrira muli ye, Nyamuzinda oyu ncîkubagîre: ntà bwôba bungwêrhe: kurhi zanjira engonyi?<verse eid="PSA 56:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6"/>Badwîrhe balegerera bampurana, enkengêro zâbo nie zishimbire, zirhânnongeza oburhali buhanya.<verse eid="PSA 56:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7"/>Erhi bayish’ibugânana, bagwîke emirhego, igenda lyâni balij’ebulâbi, balonze oku bakankûlamw’omûka.<verse eid="PSA 56:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8"/>Nyamuzinda mâshi, obalengere oku bubî bwâbo bunakwânîne, orhang’iluba oher’embaga.<verse eid="PSA 56:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9"/>Emihanda bàngezagyamwo erhi bandibirhakwo orhayihabiri; n’emirenge nalasire bulya omu hirembe hyâwe eri migunje: k’arhali mulya hitabu hyâwe eri miyandike?<verse eid="PSA 56:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10"/>Amango nkakuyâkûza, ago mango lyo abanshomba bâshukira; mmanyire bwinjà oku Nyamuzinda nie âlwîra.<verse eid="PSA 56:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11"/>Ndagâno ya Nyamuzinda eno nâcîtakîrira muli ye.<verse eid="PSA 56:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12"/>Nyamuzinda oyu ncîkubagîre: ntà bwôba bungwêrhe: kurhi zânjira engonyi?<verse eid="PSA 56:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13"/>Cirya ciragâne nakulaganyagya Nnâmahanga, co cino cingwêrhe, nkolaga nalîka enterekêro z’okukukuza:<verse eid="PSA 56:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 56:14"/>Nabwîne walîkûza omûka gwâni oku lufù, n’amagulu gâni, oku gali gakola mpu garhereze, wagagalukira, mpu lyo nkaz’ikananda omu ka-Nyamuzinda, omu bumoleke bw’abazîne.<verse eid="PSA 56:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56"/>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" altnumber="56" sid="PSA 57"/>
  <para style="s1">Okucîkubagira Nyakasane omu karhî k’ababisha</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. N’izù lisungunu. Ya Daudi. Kwo eyimbwa aka «Shukira orhashâbe». Ayizihaga amango àyâkiraga Saulu omu lwâla.<verse eid="PSA 57:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2"/>Ombè lukogo, mâshi Nyamuzinda, ombè nâni lukogo, bulya w’ono omurhima gwâni guyâkîreho. omu cihôho c’ebyûbi byâwe munôla nyâkîre, nti obu buhanya burhang’ihuba.<verse eid="PSA 57:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3"/>Ye nyâkûzize Nnâmahanga ôbà enyanya bwenêne, Ye nyâkûzize Nyamuzinda oyôrha onkûla omu kubî,<verse eid="PSA 57:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4"/>nti arhumize kurheng’empingu, andîkûze, n’aba banshimbulwîre arhag’ibabonêsa nshonyi. Nyamuzinda arhume enshôkano zâge n’oburhabêsha bwâge mâshi!<verse eid="PSA 57:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5"/>Omu karhî k’entale muno ntamîre omu karhî ka zirya zishanshanyula abahanya, Amîno gâzo nderhage obwoji bw’itumu n’obw’empiru! olulimi lwâzo ngôrho nnûbule.<verse eid="PSA 57:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6"/>Nyamuzinda mâshi, orhang’ibà nka wacîyerekanira oku nyanya z’amalunga irenge lyâwe balibone omw’igulu lyoshi.<verse eid="PSA 57:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7"/>Bayansire bàntega omulabarha: omûka gwâni baguhorhaza; bampumbira enyenga balya bakayigwamwo.<verse eid="PSA 57:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8"/>Càba omurhima gwâni guli muzibu, Nyamwagirwa, omurhima gwâni gurhahombagana; nkola nakuyimbira nnankuzihire.<verse eid="PSA 57:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9"/>Tulûka murhima gwâni; tulûka lulanga lwâni, tulûka nzenze yâni, nkola natula obuce buzûke.<verse eid="PSA 57:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10"/>Nakukuza omu karhî k’amashanja, Nyamwagirwa, nakuzihira olulanga omu karhî k’ab’ekulî.<verse eid="PSA 57:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11"/>Bulyâla olukogo lwâwe lunji lunji luhisire emalunga oburhabêsha bwâwe nabo buhisire oku nkuba.<verse eid="PSA 57:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 57:12"/>Nyamuzinda mâshi, orhang’ibà nka wacîyerekanira oku nyanya z’amalunga irenge lyâwe balibone omu igulu lyoshi.<verse eid="PSA 57:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57"/>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" altnumber="57" sid="PSA 58"/>
  <para style="s1">Omucîranuzi w’abacîranuzi b’en’igulu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Luzihwa aka «omanye washâba». N’izù linyinyi. Ya Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 58:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2"/>Ka mmanja munatwa obu mwe bagale? Ka murhalyâlyanya nka mwazitwa obu, mwe bashamuka?<verse eid="PSA 58:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3"/>Câba obulyâlya mwêhe emurhima mubujirira, n’enfune zinyu zirhamîra oburhali bulyâlya omw’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 58:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4"/>Emihera eburhwa enali mihera, kuburhanwa eburhanwa okuhabuka kwâyo, erhaderha n’oburhali bunywesi.<verse eid="PSA 58:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5"/>Olulimi luyibâ ekanwa kwo lulangabuka nka lwa njoka, amanjokà-njokà emihera emeshera kwo gayôrha aka ag’empiri y’ebihuli, yo ekaz’ifuka amarhwîri,<verse eid="PSA 58:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6"/>mpu yankanayumva izù ly’abàshâsirwe enjoka, balya bazihira enjoka zidogêre.<verse eid="PSA 58:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7"/>Nnâmahanga mâshi, ohungumule eyo mihera amîno gayiri ekanwa, oshangule ebijigo by’ezo mpangaza, mâshi Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 58:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8"/>Bashandâle nka mîshi gahona oku ntuli, bakaderha mpu balîka omwampi gubè nka kuno bagutûmba.<verse eid="PSA 58:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9"/>Bagende ak’ecishomgambeba, co cija cajonga bunjirà-njirà. Bagere nka cimomano ca muntu, co cigera cirhanabonaga izûba.<verse eid="PSA 58:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10"/>Enyungu zinyu mâshi, oku zirhaciyumva idûrhu ly’olurhadu, zimanyulwe n’idûrhu ly’empûsi.<verse eid="PSA 58:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11"/>Omushinganyanya acishinge abona encuku zahanwa, ahulire n’igâ omu mukò gw’endyâlya.<verse eid="PSA 58:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 58:12"/>N’abantu baderhe, mpu: «Nêci oluhembo lw’abashinganyanya ho lubà», mpu: «Nêci ho Nyamuzinda otw’emmanja z’igulu abâ».<verse eid="PSA 58:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58"/>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" altnumber="58" sid="PSA 59"/>
  <para style="s1">Ondîkûze oku bashombanyi bakali</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Luyimbwa aka «Shukira orhashâbe». Lwa Daudi. N’izù linyinyi. Amango Saulu arhumaga abantu mpu baj’ilanga enyumpa ya Daudi, mpu bamunige.<verse eid="PSA 59:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2"/>Nkûla muno nfune z’abashombanyi bâni, ncinga kuli aba banshimbire, mâshi Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 59:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3"/>Ondîkûze kw’ezi nkola-maligo onandîkûze kw’ezi nkunda-mukò.<verse eid="PSA 59:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4"/>Niono barhezire busimba, niono nshimbirwe n’abadârhi.<verse eid="PSA 59:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5"/>Ndi ntyo Yâgirwa, ntà câha, na ntà kubî kundimwo ntadesiri nti najira kulebe kurhumire banshimbire ntya.<verse eid="PSA 59:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6"/>Tulûka okanye ocîbonere, Muciza w’emirhwe, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, otulûke ohane ezo nkulira-lubala, ezo ncuku lêro orhazibêraga bwonjo.<verse eid="PSA 59:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7"/>Erhi byayîsh’ibà bijingo, banayisha bâmoka nka bibwa, bajè bahulahula omu lugo.<verse eid="PSA 59:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8"/>Kandi bâbo barhengamwo, bijâci byône bibali ekanwa, mpu: «Ndi wayumva?»<verse eid="PSA 59:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9"/>Wêhe Nyakasane kusheka odwîrhe washeka, kushekera oyôrha oshekera enkulira-lubala.<verse eid="PSA 59:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10"/>We buzibu bwâni, we nalolakwo, bulya Nnâmahanga, wêne we lwâkiro lwâni.<verse eid="PSA 59:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11"/>We Nyamuzinda wâni we na lukogo ncîkubagira, Nnâmahanga oyîshe ontabâle, okolere abashombanyi bâni buligo, nsîme.<verse eid="PSA 59:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12"/>Obanigûze mâshi Nnâmahanga, bankanashubîrira babè bo bakoler’olubaga lwâwe buligo, obashandâze n’emisî yâwe obahire okw’idaho, Nyamwagirwa we mpenzi yîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 59:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13"/>Ecâha câbo, binali bîra binwa bibarhenga ekanwa, bahanirwe ivuzi lyâbo n’okulogorha kwâbo.<verse eid="PSA 59:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14"/>Otulumukirwe bahere, baherêrekere barhacihabâga abantu boshi bamanye oku Nyamuzinda ye rhegeka omu ca Yakôbo, n’omu igulu lyoshi aha litanga n’aha liramuka.<verse eid="PSA 59:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15"/>Erhi byayîsh’ibà bijingo banajè bamoka nka bibwa, bajè bahulahula omu lugo.<verse eid="PSA 59:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16"/>Bajè bahulahula balonza ehi bâlya, bakabà barhayigusiri bajâge omu mulenge obwo!<verse eid="PSA 59:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17"/>Niehe kuyimba nayimba obuzibu bwâwe, buca sêzi ncîtakîre olukogo lwâwe, bulya washubire lwâkiro lwâni, washuba lubungo mbungiramwo olusiku ndi mutula.<verse eid="PSA 59:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 59:18"/>We buzibu bwâni we nânalolakwo, bulya Nnâmahanga, we lwâkiro lwâni, we na Muciza wâni.<verse eid="PSA 59:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59"/>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" altnumber="59" sid="PSA 60"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero enyuma ly’okuhimana omu kabanda ka Nyamunyu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Luzihwa aka «Bwâso bw’irhegeko». N’izù linyinyi. Ya Daudi. Oku kuyigîriza.<verse eid="PSA 60:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2"/>Amango Daudi arhêra Aramu Naharayimu bona Aramu w’e Soba, n’erhi Yowabu àrhabâluka amâyûs’ihimira Edomu omu kabanda ka Nyamunyu, bantu bihumbi ikumi na bibirhi<verse eid="PSA 60:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3"/>Nyamuzinda kulikirira oku warhulikirîre wanarhuvunira amatumu, kuluba oku warhulubîre, orhugalukirage mâshi mâshi.<verse eid="PSA 60:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4"/>Igulu walishakanyize lyahahanyuka, ofumagye obubere bwalyo bulya kudunga lidwîrhe lyadunga.<verse eid="PSA 60:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5"/>Olubaga lwâwe walukolîre ebizibu mushâna idivayi lya kudungadunga walunywesize.<verse eid="PSA 60:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6"/>Abakurhînya kukema wabakemire, mpu bayâke omwampi.<verse eid="PSA 60:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7"/>Orhurhabâlage wêne n’okuboko kwâwe, lyo abarhonyi bâwe balobôka, onarhuyumve.<verse eid="PSA 60:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8"/>Nyamuzinda erhi ali omu ngombe yâge, erhi: «Nkola nayimuka nj’igaba Siyoni, n’olubanda lwa Sukoti ndugabire bandi».<verse eid="PSA 60:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9"/>Erhi: «Ishwa lya Galadi libà lyâni n’erya Menashè kwo na kwo, Efrayimu yêhe yo mpenzi y’irhwe lyâni na Yûda bwo bwâmi bwâni.<verse eid="PSA 60:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10"/>Mowabu lwo lwôgero ncîkalabiramwo, Edomu yêhe namugera oku lwêru lw’enda, na Filistiya nâmuhima kano kânya.»<verse eid="PSA 60:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11"/>Lêro ndi wakampisa omu lugo luzibu? Ndi wakampisa cingana e Edomu wâni.<verse eid="PSA 60:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12"/>Nnâmahanga, kàli we warhucinagizagya wâni? Kàli orhadwîrhi wahuluka okarhabâla mwe n’abalwî bîrhu!<verse eid="PSA 60:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 60:13"/>Mâshi mâshi orhurhabâle kw’oyu mubisha, bulyâla okurhabâlwa n’abantu kuli kwa busha.<verse eid="PSA 60:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 60:14"/>Rhwakola emyônè oku burhabâle bwa Nnâmahanga yêne ye wajonjaga abashombanyi bîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 60:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60"/>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" altnumber="60" sid="PSA 61"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’olulizîbwe</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Oku nzihwa z’emisî. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 61:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2"/>Oyumve guno mulenge gwâni mâshi Nnâmahanga, orhege guno musengero gwâni amarhwîri.<verse eid="PSA 61:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3"/>Ndwîrhe nakubirikira na ndi ekulî, bulyâla amagala gandîre. Ondengereze okw’ibuye onampè obuluhûkiro.<verse eid="PSA 61:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4"/>Wêne we lwâkiro lwâni we n’ibuye ncîfulikaho nka nshimbirwe n’omubisha.<verse eid="PSA 61:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5"/>Kurhi nankabona nabêra omu mwâwe ensiku zoshi, mbone nyâkîre omu lukangà lw’ebyûbi byâwe wâni!<verse eid="PSA 61:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6"/>Nnâmahanga, nêci wayumvirhize omusengero gwâni, wanshobôzize akashambala abakenga izîno lyâwe bashobôla.<verse eid="PSA 61:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7"/>Ensiku za mwâmi ozihirekwo ezindi, emyâka yâge eyumânane n’ey’owamayâlusa kanji kanjî.<verse eid="PSA 61:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8"/>Ayôrhe arhegeka omu masù ga Nyamuzinda, omurhumîre oburhonyi n’obudahemuka bikaz’imulanga.<verse eid="PSA 61:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 61:9"/>Nyimbirage izîno lyâwe obwo nnanyûkirize emihigo yâni bwaca bwayira.<verse eid="PSA 61:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61"/>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" altnumber="61" sid="PSA 62"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda yêne bulangâlire</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Luyimbwa aka Yedutuni. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 62:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2"/>Okurhûla kw’omurhima gwâni anali muli Nnâmahanga mwône okucira kwâni erhi ye.<verse eid="PSA 62:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3"/>Yêne ye Kabuye kâni, ye bucire bwâni, ye na lwâkiro lwâni: nâni nkola nie ntagagajwa.<verse eid="PSA 62:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4"/>Mangaci mwaleka okukâhamira oku muntu, n’okumushimba mweshi mpu mumukube, nka kula bakuba olugurhu lugombire, nîsi erhi côgo cikoyire?<verse eid="PSA 62:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5"/>Emugamba nshonîre yo badwîrhe balonza bammanule, obunywesi go masheka basheka, Owayumva mpu bwinjà badwîrhe baderha, n’okuziga kutulagula badwîrhe batulagula emurhima.<verse eid="PSA 62:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6"/>Murhima gwâni, muli Nnâmahanga mwône waluhûkira, bulyâla ebi olangâlîre yêne wâkuhisakwobyo.<verse eid="PSA 62:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7"/>Yêne ye Kabuye kâni, ye na kucira kwâni, ye na lwâkiro lwâni: nâni nkola nie ntagagajwa.<verse eid="PSA 62:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8"/>Aha burhambi bwa Nyamuzinda ho nacirira ho nânajire irenge, Ye Kabuye-Buzibu bwâni, yêne ye lwâkiro lwâni.<verse eid="PSA 62:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9"/>Mwe balume, kaz’imucikubagire Nnâmahanga ngasi mango, kaz’imumuhirekwo omurhima: Nyamuzinda lwo lwâkiro lwîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 62:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10"/>Bene-Adamu gunabà mufula bufula, babà banywesi ababurhwa n’abantu. Erhi bankashonera oku munzâni, boshi haguma banayanguha kulusha omufula. <verse eid="PSA 62:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11"/>Murhahiraga mukalimbira emisî, murhahiraga mukacîkubagira eby’obuhagwe, ebirugu, ciru byankaluga, murhahiraga mukabihirakw’omurhima.<verse eid="PSA 62:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12"/>Nnâmahanga adesire akanwa nakayumvamwo bibirhi: «Nnâmahanga ye Nn’obuhashe,<verse eid="PSA 62:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 62:13"/>n’oku we Nn’oburhonyi Nyamwagirwa, bulya we gabira ngasi muntu nk’oku ebijiro byâge binakwânîne!»<verse eid="PSA 62:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62"/>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" altnumber="62" sid="PSA 63"/>
  <para style="s1">Omwîfinjo gw’okubona Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi. Amango àli omu irungu lya Yûda.<verse eid="PSA 63:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2"/>Nnâmahanga we Nyamuzinda wâni, w’ono ndwîrhe nalongereza. Nyôrha yâwe omurhima gwâni gwalwâla, ndwîrhe nakwifinja nieshi nieshi nka kul’idaho lyûmu licîfinja amîshi bwenêne.<verse eid="PSA 63:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3"/>Nkulolekwo omu bwâmi bwâwe, mbone bulya buhashe bwâwe n’irenge lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 63:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4"/>Okurhona emund’oli kulushire obuzîne, akanwa kâni kakukuze là.<verse eid="PSA 63:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5"/>Oku nciyîs’omûka erhi kugashâniza nnankugashâniza, nalengereza amaboko emund’oli okukuza izîno lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 63:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6"/>Omurhima gwâni gudendêze obwo ak’owalyag’ey’amashushi, n’akanwa kâni kayunjule mwishîngo kanakukuze.<verse eid="PSA 63:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7"/>Erhi nacikukengera nangwishîre, obudufu bunakule erhi wêne nakengêra.<verse eid="PSA 63:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8"/>Bulya nêci washubire mufungizi wâni, n’omu byûbi byâwe nuno ndwîrhe nacîshingira.<verse eid="PSA 63:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9"/>Omurhima gwâni gukwishwekìrekwo; n’okulyo kwâwe kwo nyegemîre<verse eid="PSA 63:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10"/>Balya badwîrhe balonza okumpeza, bajè omuw’idaho kuli kulî.<verse eid="PSA 63:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11"/>Engôrho ebamîme, ebibwa bibashêge,<verse eid="PSA 63:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 63:12"/>Mwâmi yêhe Nnâmahanga acîtakîra; ngasi muntu ocîtakìra Nyamuzinda kukuzibwa anakuzibwa, bulya akanwa kaderha ebibî kuhumbârhala kanahumbârhala.<verse eid="PSA 63:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63"/>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" altnumber="63" sid="PSA 64"/>
  <para style="s1">Enkola-maligo zimanye aha zafumira Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1"/>Oku mukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 64:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2"/>Yumva omulenge gwâni, mâshi Nnâmahanga, kulaka kuno ndimwo. orhenze ebihamba bindi emirhima.<verse eid="PSA 64:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3"/>Oncinge okw’ihano ly’ababî, n’oku kavulindi ka zira nkola-maligo.<verse eid="PSA 64:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4"/>Kwo zirhyaza olulimi nka ngôrho, kwo zimeshera ebinwa bibî nka kula zirîka mwampi.<verse eid="PSA 64:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5"/>Zo zira nkola-maligo zikaz’icîfulika mpu ziyâgaze omuhanya, mpu zimuyûbûke zimuyâgaze, zirhânababale bici.<verse eid="PSA 64:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6"/>Obubî lusima zibujîra, bwifulikwè zilâlira okurhega emirhego, mpu: «Ka hali owârhubone?»<verse eid="PSA 64:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7"/>Enkola-maligo bibî zigerereza, kufulika zikaz’ifulika enkengêro zikengire. Nêci wâni, omurhima gwa bene nyenga!<verse eid="PSA 64:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8"/>Ohumbe kwône, Nyamuzinda azirikiramwo emyampi, zifuduke zamâyagalika. <verse eid="PSA 64:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9"/>Lulimi lwâbo lwâbaheze, ngasi yêshi wâbalolekwo, okw’idaho ânameshere.<verse eid="PSA 64:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10"/>Ikola lya Nyamuzinda boshi balirhînya banalikuze, ebijiro byâge byoshi byâhizâna.<verse eid="PSA 64:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 64:11"/>Omushinganyanya kucîshinga acîshinga anashamambire Nyakasane; n’ab’omurhima nkana boshi, irenge bâja.<verse eid="PSA 64:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64"/>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" altnumber="64" sid="PSA 65"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo lw’okuvuga omunkwa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa Daudi. Lwimbo.<verse eid="PSA 65:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2"/>Nyamwagirwa, nêci kukwânîne bakuyimbire omu Siyoni, banayûkirize omulagi bàkulaganyagya.<verse eid="PSA 65:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3"/>Bulyâla abakusengera, kuyumvîrhiza obayumvirhiza. N’emund’oli yo ngasi muntu ayêrekîre, erhi byâha byâge birhuma.<verse eid="PSA 65:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4"/>Ebyâha bîrhu byàrhuhizire okw’idaho, câba wâbirhenza.<verse eid="PSA 65:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5"/>Omuntu ocîshoga okanamuhêka, erhi muny’iragi, omu côgo câwe aj’ibêra. Rhwalya rhuyigurhe ebinja by’omu mwâwe, rhuyigurhe obwimâna bw’engombe yâwe.<verse eid="PSA 65:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6"/>Warhuyumvirhîze omu bushinganyanya bwâwe, wanarhuyêrekakwo n’ebimanyîso bisômerîne, Nyamuzinda, Mufungizi wîrhu, Mwîkubagirwa w’enyanja z’ekulî, n’ow’amahanga goshi.<verse eid="PSA 65:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7"/>We gwîka entondo n’okuboko kwâwe, we komekera n’obuhashe bwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 65:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8"/>We Cirhûza-nyanja, Cirhûza-mulaba, Cirhûza-kadugundu-ka-bantu.<verse eid="PSA 65:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9"/>Ab’emahanga omu bihamba bali, erhi bisômerîne byâwe birhuma; ab’ebushoshôkero n’ab’ebuzikiro bw’izûba, boshi omu mwishingo bali.<verse eid="PSA 65:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10"/>Igulu walirhandwîre, walidômera lyagala; olwîshi lwa Nyamuzinda luyunjwîre, wabayêgîze emyâka yâbo.<verse eid="PSA 65:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11"/>Wadômera endike wakoma amalongo, walibombêza n’enkuba wanagisha emyâka yamuli.<verse eid="PSA 65:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12"/>Omwâka waguhîre aminjà gâwe: aha wagera erhi na mugisho.<verse eid="PSA 65:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13"/>Amalambo g’omu irungu kuhulula gahulula migezi, n’entondo omwîshingo gwazizonzire.<verse eid="PSA 65:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 65:14"/>Amalambo gayunjwîre masô, emmanda zirhâbonè bwikizo n’engano! ecihôgero n’enyimbo, mpu: «Rhw’oyo, murhuyumve!»<verse eid="PSA 65:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65"/>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" altnumber="65" sid="PSA 66"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuvuga omunkwa kw’olubaga lwoshi.</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwimbo. Lulanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:1">Mukuze Nyamuzinda mwe bihugo mweshi.<verse eid="PSA 66:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2"/>Muyimbe irenge lyâge, mumukuze oku bâyige.<verse eid="PSA 66:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3"/>Mubwîre Nnâmahanga, mpu: «Emikolo yâwe eri ya kurhangâza!» mpu: «Okuluga kw’obuhashe bwâwe, kunarhume abashombanyi bâwe bayish’ikushiga.»<verse eid="PSA 66:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4"/>lgulu lyoshi likugashânize linakuyimbire, izîno lyâwe liyimbwe omw’igulu lyoshi.<verse eid="PSA 66:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5"/>Mukanye mubone ebi Nyamuzinda àkozire, biri bya kurhangâza ebi àjizire omu karhî k’àbàbusirwe!<verse eid="PSA 66:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6"/>Enyanja ayihindula yashub’idaho lyûmu, bayikir’olwîshi n’amagulu burhajoma: rhucîtakîre ye là.<verse eid="PSA 66:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7"/>Buhashe bwâge arhegekamwo ensiku n’amango; isù lyâge lirharhenga oku bantu b’ihanga: mpu abagoma bankanatulumukirwa.<verse eid="PSA 66:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8"/>Mukuze Nyamuzinda wîrhu mwe mub’ihanga,<verse eid="PSA 66:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9"/>Ye warhuhiraga obuzîne omu mûka, arhanazigaga okugulu kwîrhu kwahabuka. <verse eid="PSA 66:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10"/>Nêci Nnâmahanga kurhangula warhurhangulaga, cîko warhurhanguliremwo nka kula barhangula amarhale.<verse eid="PSA 66:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11"/>Warhukulukuliza omu murhego, wanarhushwêkera omuzigo muzirho omu cibunu. <verse eid="PSA 66:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12"/>Waleka barhugera oku marhwe, rhwagera omu muliro rhwagera n’omu mîshi, ci wêhe washub’irhuhà obuluhûkiro.<verse eid="PSA 66:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13"/>Nkolaga nahika omu mwâwe n’enterekêro, ntang’ikurhûla emihigo yâni.<verse eid="PSA 66:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14"/>Eryâla akanwa kâni kànalîkaga, eryâla kàkulaganyagya amango nali mpanyagîre.<verse eid="PSA 66:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15"/>Nterekêro za bibuzi bitwedu nakurhûla, haguma n’omusingu gwa luganda-buzè: mpanzi nakubàgira haguma n’empene z’ebihebe.<verse eid="PSA 66:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16"/>Mwe mukenga Nyamuzinda mweshi mukanye muyumve, mukanye mmurhondêreze ebi àjirîre iroho lyâni!<verse eid="PSA 66:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17"/>naj’aho namuyâkûza n’aka kanwa kâni, namusengera n’olululimi lundi ekanwa.<verse eid="PSA 66:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18"/>Omurhima gwâni nka gwàli gwa ndyâlya, Nyakasane arhàkanyumvîrhîze.<verse eid="PSA 66:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19"/>Ci kwo biri: Nyakasane anyumvîrhize: izù ly’omusengero gwâni alirhega okurhiwiri.<verse eid="PSA 66:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20"/>Nyamuzinda ayâgirwe mâshi, erhi mbona arhakengwîri omusengero gwâni, erhi mbona arhahengulîri olukogo lwage kulî kulî nâni.<verse eid="PSA 66:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66"/>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" altnumber="66" sid="PSA 67"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’olubaga nka lwamâyus’isârûla emyâka</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Oku nzihwa z’emisî. Lulanga. Lwimbo.<verse eid="PSA 67:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2"/>Nyakasane Nyamuzinda arhubabalire anarhugishe, arhumolekere n’obusù burhulwîre.<verse eid="PSA 67:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3"/>Abantu boshi bamanye enjira zâwe, n’amashanja goshi gamanye obucunguzi bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 67:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4"/>Igulu lyoshi likukuze linakuvuge omunkwa, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga; igulu lyoshi likukuze linakuvuge omunkwa.<verse eid="PSA 67:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5"/>Amashanja goshi gasime ganacîshinge, bulya oyishi cîranulir’abantu n’oburhondekezi; bulya we Mwâmi w’amashanja g’en’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 67:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6"/>lgulu lyoshi likukuze linakuvuge omunkwa, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga; igulu lyoshi likukuze linakuvuge omunkwa.<verse eid="PSA 67:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7"/>Obudaka bwayezire emburho; Nnâmahanga Nyamuzinda wîrhu ye rhuhà omugisho.<verse eid="PSA 67:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 67:8"/>Nyamuzinda arhugishe, n’amahanga goshi gamurhinye en’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 67:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67"/>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" altnumber="67" sid="PSA 68"/>
  <para style="s1">Olugendo lunene kurhenga e Mîsiri kuhika e Siyoni</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwimbo. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 68:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2"/>Nnâmahanga amâyîmuka, abashombanyi bâge bamâgenda emihanda erhabugânana, abamushomba bamâyâka obusù bwâge.<verse eid="PSA 68:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3"/>Kwo bashandîre kulyâla omugî gushandâla, kulyâla omuhomo gujonga, kwo abanya-byâha bahwêrîre omu masù ga Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="PSA 68:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4"/>Abashinganyanya bôhe omu masheka bali, kushagaluka bashagalukire omu masù ga Nnâmahanga, kucîshinga badwîrhe bacîshinga bwenêne.<verse eid="PSA 68:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5"/>Muyimbire Nnâmahanga, muzihire izîno lyâge olulanga, mukwâbire owarhenga omw’irungu enjira, izîno lyâge ye Nyakasane: musâmire omu masù gâge.<verse eid="PSA 68:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6"/>Yêne ye îshe w’enfûzi, ye mufungizi w’abakana, Nyamuzinda mwo abêra omw’idubiro lyâge.<verse eid="PSA 68:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7"/>Nyamuzinda ye yûbakira akahumba, ye hisa empira omu ciyêzire: bagoma bône ayûbasa okw’idaho lyûmu.<verse eid="PSA 68:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8"/>Nnâmahanga, bulya agenda oshokolîre olubaga lwâwe, bulya olugerana omu mpinga,<verse eid="PSA 68:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9"/>idaho lyàgeramwo omusisi n’amalunga gàdubulira enkuba embere za Nnâmahanga. Sînayi ageramwo ogwa nyegenye omu kubona Nyamuzinda, Nnâmahanga w’Israheli.<verse eid="PSA 68:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10"/>Ishanja lyâwe Nnâmahanga, walirhumira enkuba y’akalume, n’amango lyàli buholoka walihà emisî.<verse eid="PSA 68:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11"/>N’obusò bwâwe bwayâbukira muli eco cihugo wali obîkîre omukenyi, obûla oyinjiha Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 68:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12"/>Nnâmahanga abîre nk’aderha akanwa, n’engabo ya baganda mbala-mwanzi erhali nyi.<verse eid="PSA 68:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13"/>Abâmi n’abalwî bâbo bàkûla idârhi, bàyâka. Embuguma zàsigala ekâ zagabâna ebi abalwî bàshokôlaga.<verse eid="PSA 68:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14"/>Oku mudwîrhe mwahûmûkira omu lugo lw’ebintu, ebyûbi by’engûkù byakaz’ilabuka nka cûma, n’amashala gâyo gakaz’ilabuka nka masholo.<verse eid="PSA 68:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15"/>Oku Ogala-byoshi adwîrhe ashandâza abâmi, enkuba y’olubula yàmanukira oku ntondo ya Salomoni.<verse eid="PSA 68:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16"/>Eyôrha ebà y’Ow’Enyanya entondo ya Bashani, ziyôrha zibà za ntuli entondo za Bashani.<verse eid="PSA 68:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17"/>Mwe birhondo by’entuli, cici cirhumire mwayâgalwa n’entondo Nyamuzinda àcîshozire mpu ayûbakekwo? Eyi àcîshozire mpu abêrekwo ensiku zoshi?<verse eid="PSA 68:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18"/>Engâlè za Nyamuzinda bihumbi n’ebihumbi, Nyakasane amâbunguluka oku Siyoni, amâj’omw’idubiro lyâge.<verse eid="PSA 68:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19"/>Nyakasane okola warheremera oku nyanya, wahêkakwo empira, wàyêmêra okurhûlwa abantu, nkaba ciru wàyêmêra bakurhûla na balya barhasîma bayûbake hôfi na Nyamwagirwa Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 68:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20"/>Nyakasane akaz’iyôrha ashîgwa: Nyamuzinda anakaz’irhurhamûla omu kubarhula emizigo yîrhu: yêne ye kucira kwîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 68:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21"/>Nnâmahanga wîrhu ye Nyamuzinda ociza, Nnawîrhu Nnâmahanga ye manyîsa abantu obulenga bw’okufuma olufù.<verse eid="PSA 68:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22"/>Ye shangula amarhwe g’ababisha Ye shangula empanga z’enkola-maligo.<verse eid="PSA 68:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23"/>Nyamuzinda anadesire, erhi: «Nâkukûla e Bashani», erhi: «Nâkurhenza emuhengere».<verse eid="PSA 68:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24"/>«Olabarhe omu mukò, endimi z’ebibwa byâwe zirhang’imîma oku bashombanyi bâwe.» <verse eid="PSA 68:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25"/>Bamâbona wacûka, Nnâmahanga, bamâbona wajà omw’idubiro lyâwe, Nnawîrhu Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 68:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26"/>Abimbiza bo bashokwîre, abazihi b’ennanga bazinda nyuma: n’aha karhî kâbo, abâna-nyere bayisha babûha empanda, mpu:<verse eid="PSA 68:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27"/>«Mucîgwâse haguma mukuze Nyamuzinda, mukuze Nnâmahanga mweshi, mwe muburhwa n’Israheli.<verse eid="PSA 68:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28"/>Benyamini gwo muziba, ye bashokolîre abagula ba kuli Yûda bo bakulikîre haguma n’engabo zâbo, abagula ba kuli Zabuloni n’abà kuli Neftali ho bali.»<verse eid="PSA 68:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29"/>Rhegeka Nnâmahanga, rhegeka obuzibu bwâwe, rhegeka erya misî warhulwîragamwo, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 68:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30"/>Engombe yâwe eri aha Yeruzalemu yàrhuma abâmi bayisha bal’ikushiga.<verse eid="PSA 68:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31"/>Okalihire eciryanyi c’amasheke, okalihire obusò bw’empanzi n’amanina g’ab’ekulî. Bayishe bashige, balêrhe amasholo: amashanja gasîma entambala orhang’igashandâza.<verse eid="PSA 68:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32"/>Abajà-bugo barheng’e Mîsiri, Etiyopiya alengereze amaboko emunda Nnâmahanga ali.<verse eid="PSA 68:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33"/>Mwe mâmi g’igulu muyimbire Nnâmahanga, muzihire Nyamwagirwa olulanga. Ye Nyamwagirwa oyishire oku malunga, oku malunga g’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 68:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34"/>Muyumve y’oyo wamâlîka izù: muyumve y’oyo wamâlîka izù ly’enkwîra, mpu:<verse eid="PSA 68:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35"/>«Mucîlange oku buhashe bwa Nyamuzinda!» Obwâmi bwâge omu Israheli bumolekîre, n’obuhashe bwâge omu bitù.<verse eid="PSA 68:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 68:36"/>Nnâmahanga bamurhînye nk’ali ahatagatîfu hâge, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli ye hâna emisî, ye nashobôza olubaga lwâge obuhashe. Ayâgirwe Nnâmahanga!<verse eid="PSA 68:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68"/>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" altnumber="68" sid="PSA 69"/>
  <para style="s1">Endûlù y’ohanyagîre bwenêne</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Luzihwa aka «Liliya». Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 69:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2"/>Nnâmahanga nciza mâshi, niono amîshi gahika omw’igosi.<verse eid="PSA 69:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3"/>Nashâyire omu cijondo c’emuhengere lêrhaga aha nankadêkereza okugulu. Yo muhêngere eno mushâna! Amîshi gangezire aha ntondo y’irhwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4"/>Nayamire narhama, omumiro gwoshi gwahehîre.<verse eid="PSA 69:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5"/>Abanshombera busha, bo banji aha mvîri zindi okw’irhwe Abanshimbire obumâma, bo bazibu aha kavuha kandi omu kuboko: mpu ngalulage, ka ngalulage ebi ntazimbaga?<verse eid="PSA 69:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6"/>Obuhwinja bwâni obuyishi, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, n’obubî bwâni orhabuhabiri.<verse eid="PSA 69:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7"/>Mâshi Nyakasane, murhambo w’engabo, abakulangâlira orhazigaga enshonyi zababumba erhi nie ntuma. Abakulonza, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, orhazigaga nababonêsa nshonyi.<verse eid="PSA 69:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8"/>Ebijâci nabirembera we rhuma, enshonyi zànyûbika là!<verse eid="PSA 69:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9"/>Nahugalala omu mwîrhu, nashuba w’ekulî omu bâna nyâmà aburha.<verse eid="PSA 69:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10"/>Nayumva obushiru bw’enyumpa yâwe bwandyagâsà, n’ebijâci bakujacira byanduma.<verse eid="PSA 69:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11"/>Nti nâshalisa omurhima gwâni, nafuduka kukola kushekerwa nashekerwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12"/>Nacîbwîka sunzu nti gubè gwo mwambalo kwashuba kukwâmwa nâkwamwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13"/>Ogwâni gwayimbwa aha ngombe, ogwâni gwaderhwa aha ganyôbwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14"/>Niehe we nsengîre Nyakasane oku ncirhona erhi kusengera nnansengera. Oyumve guno musengero gwâni, we Mwinjà-orhajîbwa omw’irhwe, ontabâle nâni we jir’oburhabâle bw’enkwîra.<verse eid="PSA 69:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15"/>Onshâyûle nankazika, ondîkûze kuli abâla banshombire, onanzikûle mw’ogu muhengere.<verse eid="PSA 69:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16"/>Nankanahêkwa n’olwîshi, erhi nyûbire burhayûlubuka, nîsi erhi nzike omu nyanja.<verse eid="PSA 69:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17"/>Yumva guno mulenge gwâni Yâgirwa, bulyâla oyu orhonyize, lukogo omubêra. Ndolakwo we Nn’olukogo lwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 69:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18"/>Orhanafulikaga mwambali wâwe obusù bwâwe, bulyâla Waliha mâshi, amagala gandire: obiduhe oyumvîrhize.<verse eid="PSA 69:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19"/>Ondirâne oncize, onandîkûze oku babisha.<verse eid="PSA 69:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20"/>Orhahabiri ebijâci banjâcira, orhahabiri n’omutula n’enshonyi zingwêrhe, bulyâla abadwîrhe banjâcira boshi omu masù gâwe bali.<verse eid="PSA 69:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21"/>Ebijâci n’akagayo kâbo byanvunzize omurhima, enjingo zirhaciri zâni; nalinzirage ôwakambà lukogo namubula, nalola nti nabona owakantûliriza, namubula.<verse eid="PSA 69:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22"/>Ebiryo byâni babiyansire babulagiramwo endulwè, nti nahûna amîshi bampà enkalishi.<verse eid="PSA 69:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23"/>Amêza balîrakwo gahinduke murhego mâshi? Gubagwâse gugwâse n’abîra bâbo?<verse eid="PSA 69:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24"/>Badundaguze mâshi, barhacifaga babwîne n’agâbo masù, balwâle akambadwe, bakaz’igenda bakûnagira.<verse eid="PSA 69:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25"/>Obarhulirekwo omutula, batwîke birhûbano erhi bwôba bwa kulahirwa nâwe burhuma.<verse eid="PSA 69:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26"/>Aha mwabâbwè hanyagwe, n’enyumpa zâbo zije ecigôhwa aha lusò.<verse eid="PSA 69:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27"/>Obwôla bashimbulwîre omuntu wêne wahanaga banarheneka omuntu wêne wabandaga.<verse eid="PSA 69:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28"/>Obubî bwâbo bujekw’obundi mâshi! n’irhondo barhafàga bâyagîze aha ngombe yâwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29"/>Bashandûlwe omu citabu c’abazîne, n’irhondo barhafàga bâyandikîrwe omu bashinganyanya.<verse eid="PSA 69:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30"/>Niehe omu buhanya muno ncîbêrîre n’omu mulenge, oburhabâle bwâwe buncinge, Yâgirwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31"/>Hano nkola nâcîtakîra izîno lyâwe Nnâmahanga, kuyimba nayimba: nnanderhe ebivugo by’okuvuga omunkwa.<verse eid="PSA 69:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32"/>Kwo kusîmîsa Nnâmahanga okwo, kulusha empanzi etwîre bwinjà erya y’obukoro n’eyâkunda.<verse eid="PSA 69:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33"/>Mwe banyinyi mukanye mubone, mwasîma munayumve oku omurhima gwinyu gwashagaluka, mwe mulonza Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 69:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34"/>Bulya Nnâmahanga arhahimwa kuyumva abakenyi n’abashwêke bâge arhababôla.<verse eid="PSA 69:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35"/>Amalunga n’igulu bicîzigirize, enyanja nazo, haguma n’eby’omu nyanja, bicîshinge.<verse eid="PSA 69:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36"/>Bulya Nnâmahanga yêne ye Mufungizi omu Siyoni, ye wânayûbakira bene Yûda, bajè omu nyûbake banaziyôrhane.<verse eid="PSA 69:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 69:37"/>Obûko bwa bambali bâge bwo bywâyime mw’ebyo, n’abazigira izîno lyâge bo babiyôrhana<verse eid="PSA 69:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69"/>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" altnumber="69" sid="PSA 70"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuhûna oburhabâle bwa Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lwa Daudi. Aha kushwinja.<verse eid="PSA 70:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2"/>Yâgirwa, oyêmêre ondîkûze nâni; Yâgirwa, okanye ontabâle.<verse eid="PSA 70:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3"/>Lêro enshonyi zibagwarhe babulabule, balya boshi banninga mpu bankûlamwo omûka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:3">Bayêgûke enshonyi zibabumbe, balya bacîshingira okuhanyagala kwâni.<verse eid="PSA 70:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4"/>Zibabumbe basômerwe, balya bakaz’iderha mpu yihè-yihè.<verse eid="PSA 70:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5"/>Bôhe balya bakulonza, bacîshinge banasîme muli we; na balya bakulingakwo oburhabâle, bakaz’iyôrha baderha mpu Nyakasane aganze!<verse eid="PSA 70:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 70:6"/>Niehe ndi mukenyi nnandi muhanya? Nyamuzinda mâshi mâshi, ndwirâkwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:6">We Mufungizi we na Muciza wâni: Biduha, mâshi Nyakasane!<verse eid="PSA 70:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70"/>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" altnumber="70" sid="PSA 71"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’okola mushosi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1"/>W’ono nyâkîreko Nyamwagirwa, Orhazigaga enshonyi zambumba ciru n’olusiku luguma<verse eid="PSA 71:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2"/>Omu bushinganyanya bwâwe ondîkûze onancize, oyuname ontege okurhwiri onandîkûze.<verse eid="PSA 71:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3"/>Ombêre ibuye nyâkiraho, onshubire côgo cizibu lyo ndobôka.<verse eid="PSA 71:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4"/>Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, nkûla omu maboko g’eyi nkola-maligo, ntenza omu nfune z’oyu mumînya w’ecishungu.<verse eid="PSA 71:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5"/>We nâlolakwo, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, we nyôrha ncîkubagira kurhenga oburhò bwâni.<verse eid="PSA 71:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6"/>We nyegemera kurhenga okuburhwa kwâni, we mufungizi wâni kurhenga omu nda ya nyâmà, we nancîkubagira ensiku zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 71:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7"/>Omu masù ga banji kwo nabîre nka cisômerîne, bulyâla wakaz’intabâla buzibu.<verse eid="PSA 71:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8"/>Akanwa kâni karhadwîrhi kahusa kuyimba irenge lyâwe, budwîrhe bwaca bunayîre erhi irenge lyâwe kayimba.<verse eid="PSA 71:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9"/>Orhanjahikaga amango nkola ndi mushosi, orhandekêreraga amango ntacigwêrhi magala.<verse eid="PSA 71:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10"/>Bulyâla abashombanyi bâni nie badwîrhe baderha, abadwîrhe bambona mahwe badwîrhe bahekana, mpu:<verse eid="PSA 71:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11"/>«Nyamuzinda amulekêrîre», mpu: «Mukanye mumugwârhe bulya arhagwêrhi cafungira.»<verse eid="PSA 71:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12"/>Mâshi Nnâmahanga orhanjâga kuli mâshi, okanye ontabâle, Waliha Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 71:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13"/>Ngasi bashimbire omûka gwâni, enshonyi zibagwarhe babulabule; balya barhammirira marhî boshi, enshonyi zibayûbikire, zibabumbe.<verse eid="PSA 71:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14"/>Niehe we nyôrha ncîkubagira, n’irenge lyâwe lyo nakaz’ilwîra.<verse eid="PSA 71:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15"/>Akanwa kâni kacîtakîre obushinganyanya bwâwe, kalegerere kayigâna oku burhabâle bwâwe: ntânaderhe nti lwo lugero nalekerakw’olu.<verse eid="PSA 71:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16"/>Naderha ebijiro by’obuhashe bwâwe, Nnâmahanga, nnanyimbe obushinganyanya bwâwe Nyamwagirwa.<verse eid="PSA 71:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17"/>Wanyigîrizagya nciri murhò, Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, na kuhika buno ebisômerîne byâwe kuderha mbiderha.<verse eid="PSA 71:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18"/>Bukolaga bushosi obu, zikola mvi zino, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga orhandekêreraga; nkaziganîrira abâna ba buno emisî y’okuboko kwâwe, n’abâna bâburhwa boshi mbabwîre obuhashe bwâwe?<verse eid="PSA 71:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19"/>Mbabwîre obushinganyanya bwâwe buhumire oku nkuba Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, bulya wajiragamwo ebingan’aha; Nyamuzinda mushâna orhajîbwa omu irhwe!<verse eid="PSA 71:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20"/>We wanyêrekaga amalibuko ntya, we wananshubizamwo omûka, we wanashubindengeza onkûle omûla kuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 71:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21"/>Obukulu bwâni buhirekwo obundi, onashubintûliriza.<verse eid="PSA 71:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22"/>Nâni nkolaga nayimba oburhabêsha bwâwe oku mulya gw’olulanga, nkukuze n’enzenze, we Mwimâma w’Israheli.<verse eid="PSA 71:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23"/>Kucîshinga akanwa kâni kâcîshinga hano nkola nakuyimbira, omurhima gwâni wâcungula gwohe kusîmîriza gwâsimiriza.<verse eid="PSA 71:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24"/>Olulimi lundi ekanwa nalwo lurhahuse lwaganîra obushinganyanya bwâwe, obûla balya barhannongezagya kalamo wababonesize nshonyi.<verse eid="PSA 71:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71"/>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" altnumber="71" sid="PSA 72"/>
  <para style="s1">Omwâmi walaganyibagwa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1"/>Lwa Salomoni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:1">Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, ohè mwâmi okurhimanya, otulire mwene mwâmi obushinganyanya bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 72:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2"/>Arhegeka ishanja lyâwe n’obwîrhonzi, n’abîrhôhye bâwe âbahabûla okunali.<verse eid="PSA 72:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3"/>Entondo zâhêreza olubaga omurhûla, n’ehirhondo hilêrhe obushinganyanya.<verse eid="PSA 72:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4"/>Ye wâshîbirira abanyi omu lubaga, Ye wâciza iburha ly’abakenyi. Ye wâtulikanya ababalibuza.<verse eid="PSA 72:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5"/>Alama nk’izûba, nka mwêzi kurhenga okw’iburha kuj’oku lindi. <verse eid="PSA 72:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6"/>Ahonera nka nkuba oku kahasi, nka nkuba yadômer’idaho.<verse eid="PSA 72:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7"/>Obushinganyanya bwâyêra omu nsiku zâge, n’omurhûla guluge, kuhika omwêzi guzike.<verse eid="PSA 72:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8"/>Arhegeka kurhenga oku nyanja kuhika oku nyanja kurhenga oku lwîshi kuhika ah’igulu lihekera.<verse eid="PSA 72:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9"/>Abashombanyi bâge barhibukira embere zâge, n’abamulwîsa bamîme akatulo.<verse eid="PSA 72:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10"/>Abâmi b’omu Tarsisi n’ab’omu birhwa bâmurhûla entûlo, abâmi b’e Saba n’ab’e Seba bamusholôlera.<verse eid="PSA 72:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11"/>N’abâmi b’igulu lyoshi bamuharâmya, amashanja goshi gâmukolere.<verse eid="PSA 72:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12"/>Co cirhumire âciza omukenyi omuyâkûzize, n’omugalugalu orhagwêrhi warhabâla. <verse eid="PSA 72:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13"/>Ababalira omushalye n’omukenyi, n’obuzîne bw’omunyi abucize.<verse eid="PSA 72:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14"/>Abakûla omu kunyagwa n’omu kulibuzibwa, n’omukò gwâbo âgulola bwinjà. <verse eid="PSA 72:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15"/>Kulama âlama, bakaz’imurhûla amarhale g’e Buharâbu, bakaz’imusengera burhahusa, bamugishe ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 72:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16"/>Idaho lyâyêra engano; emburho yâge yasogorokera oku busongerwe bw’entondo aka Libano, n’abantu bâyôloloka omu cihugo nka kahasi ebulambo.<verse eid="PSA 72:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17"/>Izîno lyâge lyâgishwa ensiku n’amango, oku izûba licibasha, erhi ho n’izîno lyâge libà. Emilala yoshi y’igulu yâgishirwa muli ye, amahanga goshi gâmuderha muny’iragi.<verse eid="PSA 72:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18"/>Agishwe Nyakasane Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, Bulya yêne wajizire ebirhangâzo. <verse eid="PSA 72:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19"/>Ligishwe n’izîno lyâge ly’irenge ensiku zoshi, n’obukuze bwâge bulumîre en’igulu. Amen! Amen!<verse eid="PSA 72:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20"/>Okushwinjwa kw’emisengero ya Daudi, mugala wa Yese.<verse eid="PSA 72:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72"/>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" altnumber="72" sid="PSA 73"/>
  <para style="s1">Ihwe n’amashumi g’okubona abantu babî banabêrwe n’eby’en’igulu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Azafi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 73:1">Nyamuzinda mushâna abâ mwinjà kuli Bene-Israheli, abâ mwinjà oku bantu b’omurhima nkana.<verse eid="PSA 73:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2"/>Amagulu gâni okwisi gagend’ebinzongonzongo, hindi hitya amagulu gâni garhereze.<verse eid="PSA 73:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3"/>Kulya kubà nàyâgîrwe, erhi mbona okubêrwa enkola-maligo zibêrwa.<verse eid="PSA 73:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4"/>Bôhe barhajira maganya maci, barhalaka ndwâla barhalaka na buhorho buci.<verse eid="PSA 73:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5"/>Ezi mmanja zibà oku bantu bôhe zirhababakwo, bôhe barhahanirwa haguma n’abandi bantu.<verse eid="PSA 73:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6"/>Ko kala kagayano bayambala omw’igosi, ko kala kadali bayambaliza nka cirondo.<verse eid="PSA 73:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7"/>Obubî bwâbo kupamuka bupamuka omu murhima guzinzire, enkengêro zâbo kucîlasha zicîlasha.<verse eid="PSA 73:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8"/>Iderha lyâbo n’amasheka gâbo, bulyâlya bwône, n’okulimbira emisî kwâbo, kagayano kakulêrha.<verse eid="PSA 73:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9"/>Akanwa kâbo, oku kàlwîsa amalunga, olulimi lwâbo lwazinga-zinga igulu.<verse eid="PSA 73:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10"/>Okwo kwarhuma olubaga lwâni lwayêrekera emunda bali, n’amîshi bàganywa bàrhama, mpu:<verse eid="PSA 73:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11"/>«Kurhi Nyamuzinda ankamanya?» mpu: «K’Ow’Enyanya ankamanya?»<verse eid="PSA 73:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12"/>Kwo bayôrha ntyo abanya-byâha, okudêkerera bo bene-kwo n’okubêrwa n’ebirugu, bo bene-kwo.<verse eid="PSA 73:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13"/>Kumanya busha narhamiraga erhi nnanga omurhima gwâni nti gurhazingaga, erhi nkalabira enfune omu bwêru-kwêru?<verse eid="PSA 73:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14"/>Bulyâla mpimbo ndwîrhe nalya ngasi mango, na ngasi lusiku erhi na buhane nahâbwa.<verse eid="PSA 73:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15"/>Ncigerêrezagye nti: «Ka nderhe akâbo», nali nacîkûla omu karhî ka bagala bâwe.<verse eid="PSA 73:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16"/>Nacîja emurhima obwo, nti: «Ka nyumve okwo»; nabona oku kuli kurhama bwenêne.<verse eid="PSA 73:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17"/>Nalinda mpika oku mahwe ga Nyamuzinda, lyo nkabonaga okuhera kw’abanya-byâha.<verse eid="PSA 73:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18"/>Ewa, oku ntuli kuno obayâbulira, obul’inabahirikira omu buhanya!<verse eid="PSA 73:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19"/>Kuziga barhimang’irhibuka wâni! Kuhirigirha bahirigirha bahêkwe n’ebihamba.<verse eid="PSA 73:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20"/>Nyamwagirwa, kwo obalola kula omuntu alola ecilôrho erhi azûka, erhi ôbà wamâtulûka orhashîbirira mpu olole kurhi bâli bashushire.<verse eid="PSA 73:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21"/>Amango omungo gwàli gungwêrhe, nayumva nka kuno bamandira emurhima.<verse eid="PSA 73:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22"/>Kuhwinjagala nali mpwinjagîre, ntàli mmanyire bici, omu masù gâwe kwo nali nyôsire nka nkâfu.<verse eid="PSA 73:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23"/>Niehe nâyôrha mbà haguma nâwe, wanyansire wangwârhira oku kuboko.<verse eid="PSA 73:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24"/>Wêne walonzize okumpabûla, wêne wâyishir’inyakirira omw’irenge.<verse eid="PSA 73:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25"/>Wundi ndi njira omu mpingu aha nyuma zâwe? N’amango rhuli rhwembi, igulu ntà bununu mbwîne lirikwo.<verse eid="PSA 73:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26"/>Amagala ciru gankarhemuka, n’omurhima ciru gukarhemuka, Wêne we Kabuye k’omurhima gwâni, We wanayôrha ôbà mwanya gwâni ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 73:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27"/>Bulyâla abakutwîka kuhera baj’ihera, abakuleka baj’ishiga bandi balume kuzigulula onabazigulula.<verse eid="PSA 73:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28"/>Niehe okubêraho Nyamuzinda kwo kwinjà kwâni, n’okujira Nyakasane Nyamuzinda lwâkiro lwâni. Emikolo yâwe yoshi, nâyiyimba aha lumvi lwa mwâli-Siyoni<verse eid="PSA 73:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73"/>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" altnumber="73" sid="PSA 74"/>
  <para style="s1">Okulakira engombe ya Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kuyigîriza. Lwa Azafi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:1">Mâshi Nnâmahanga, ci warhulekêrîre mâshi? Carhumire walubira ebibuzi by’omu busô bwâwe?<verse eid="PSA 74:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2"/>Kengêra lulya lubaga wacîshogaga kurhenga mîra, gulya mulala wacungulaga mpu gubè gwâwe, kengêra na kulya wacîshogaga entondo ya Siyoni onagwîkakwo entebe yâwe.<verse eid="PSA 74:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3"/>Orhang’ibà nka wahira okugulu mwo bîra bikola byayôrha bibà bigûkà, ngasi kantu kali omu ngombe omushombanyi akashandâzize koshi.<verse eid="PSA 74:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4"/>Ababisha bàjîre aha ngombe yâwe babandiraho akakû, bagwîka amatumu gâbo bacîtakîra.<verse eid="PSA 74:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5"/>Kwo bâli ak’abâkonda omuzirhu n’embasha.<verse eid="PSA 74:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6"/>Enyumvi z’olurhambâ lwâwe, bàziyûsize bazivunanga n’embasha n’enyundo.<verse eid="PSA 74:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7"/>Oluhêro lwâwe bàludûlisire muliro, n’ecirâlo c’izîno lyâwe hanw’igulu bacîhemwîre. <verse eid="PSA 74:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8"/>Kwo bàdesire emurhima, mpu: «Rhushâbire byoshi kuguma», mpu: «Ngasi mahêro Nyamuzinda ajira hanw’igulu goshi mugayôce.»<verse eid="PSA 74:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9"/>Ebisômerîne bîrhu arhali rhwe rhwâcibilolekwo, na ntà mulêbi ocihali, rhurhanalimwo omuntu omanyire mangaci ebi byâhwa.<verse eid="PSA 74:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10"/>Nnâmahanga, mangaci oyo mubisha âleka okurhukwâma, kàli anakolaga ashekera izîno lyâwe burhahusa obwo?<verse eid="PSA 74:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11"/>Cici cirhumire washukira cici cirhumire wabeza okulyo kwâwe oku cifuba? <verse eid="PSA 74:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12"/>Nyamuzinda ye Mwâmi nshiga kurhenga mîra, ye Mufungizi onfungira mw’er’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 74:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13"/>W’olya waberag’enyanja n’obuhashe bwâwe, washangula amarhwe g’enjoka omu mîshi.<verse eid="PSA 74:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14"/>W’olya watuntumaga amarhwe ga Leviyatani, wamuhà eby’omu nyanja byamushêga.<verse eid="PSA 74:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15"/>W’olya wamezagya enshôko wazûsa n’emigezi, enyîshi nênênè waziganya.<verse eid="PSA 74:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16"/>We Nn’omûshi we na Nn’obudufu, We wamanikaga omwêzi n’izûba.<verse eid="PSA 74:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17"/>We watwîraga idaho aha lyagalukira, ecanda n’empondo we wabijiraga.<verse eid="PSA 74:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18"/>Okengêre n’oku: oyo mubisha kushonza okwo akushonzize, Nyakasane, n’eryôla ishanja ly’abasirhe lyajacîre izîno lyâwe lyarhama.<verse eid="PSA 74:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19"/>Engûkù yâwe omanyâge wankayihâ lubakâ, n’omûka gwa bambali bâwe orhaguyibagiraga bujayo!<verse eid="PSA 74:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20"/>Lolakwo erya ndagâno yâwe: mwo cirya cihugo, enyâkiro n’amashwa, ntaho barhâlwa.<verse eid="PSA 74:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21"/>Omunyi arhakurhengagaho n’enshonyi, omukenyi n’omunyi bacîtakîre izîno lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 74:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22"/>Nnâmahanga, yimuka wêne olwîse olwo lubanja, okengêre n’ebijâci abo basirhe bàdesire balegerera bakujacira.<verse eid="PSA 74:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23"/>Orhahushaga izù ly’abashombanyi bâwe, akavù katuzirwe n’abakurhêzire kacidwîrhe kazûka.<verse eid="PSA 74:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74"/>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" altnumber="74" sid="PSA 75"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda Mucîranuzi w’okuli</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. «Shukira orhashâbe». Lulanga. Lwa Azafi. Lwimbo.<verse eid="PSA 75:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2"/>Kukuza kuno rhudwîrhe rhwakukuza, Nyakasane, kukuza kuno rhudwîrhe rhwakukuza. Rhudwîrhe rhwakuza izîno lyâwe, rhunadwîrhe rhwayimba ebisômerîne byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 75:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3"/>Amango nâtwa olusiku go na mango nâtwa olubanja niene; nk’oku binahashikîne.<verse eid="PSA 75:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4"/>Ciru igulu lyankadundagana, n’abaliyûbakakwo boshi badûndagana, amakondo gâlyo buzibu nagagwisire.<verse eid="PSA 75:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5"/>Nabwîzire abalimbirira, nti: «Murhalimbirire», n’enkola-maligo, nti: «Murharhege amahembe».<verse eid="PSA 75:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6"/>Nti: «Murharhege Ow’Enyanya amahembe, murhahiraga mukashinyagulira Nyamuzinda!»<verse eid="PSA 75:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7"/>Arhali yo âyîsh’ebushoshôkero bw’izûba, nîsi erhi ebuzikiro bwalyo; arhali yo âyîsh’ebwa ntondo,<verse eid="PSA 75:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8"/>Nyamuzinda ye mutwî w’emmanja: anayandagaze muguma, alengeze n’owundi.<verse eid="PSA 75:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9"/>Bulya Nyakasane akola afumbasire akabêhe, kayunjwîre irivayi lyabira, linali lya cigushè. Amâbahungulira kuli ko: enkola-maligo zibà okw’igulu, ene zanywa zishongôze.<verse eid="PSA 75:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10"/>Niehe nâyôrha nsîmire ensiku n’amango, nanzihire Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo olulanga.<verse eid="PSA 75:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 75:11"/>Kutuntuma nâtuntuma amahembe g’enkola-maligo, amahembe g’abashinganyanya gohe kugôya nâgagôya.<verse eid="PSA 75:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75"/>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" altnumber="75" sid="PSA 76"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda ye hima byoshi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Oku nzihwa z’emisî. Lulanga. Lwa Azafi. Lwimbo.<verse eid="PSA 76:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2"/>Nyamuzinda amanyîkîne omu ca Yûda, n’omu Israheli, izîno lyâge lyàjîre irenge.<verse eid="PSA 76:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3"/>Ecirâlo câge mwo ciri cigwîke omu Salemu; n’oku Siyoni kw’obwâmi bwâge bubà.<verse eid="PSA 76:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4"/>Avunirekwo emilazô y’emiherho, n’empenzi, n’engôrho n’amatumu.<verse eid="PSA 76:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5"/>Wayisha n’emisî, wamoleka nka cimole, wamanuka oku ntondo z’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 76:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6"/>Entwâli mpu zinyagâge zànyagwa, mpu zihungâge zij’îrò, zàyumva amaboko gàrhoga.<verse eid="PSA 76:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7"/>Wakankama obwo, Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo, babomboro n’ebihêsi byàgama.<verse eid="PSA 76:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8"/>Bakurhînye, orhajîbwa omw’irwe, erhi budârhi bw’oburhè bwâwe burhuma.<verse eid="PSA 76:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9"/>Kurheng’emalunga akanwa kâwe kàyumvikana: igulu lyàgeramw’omusisi lyanamerha.<verse eid="PSA 76:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10"/>Nyamuzinda ayimuka obwo mpu aj’itwa emmanja, anagalukire abanyinyi babà okw’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 76:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11"/>Edomu àkukuza omu burhè bwâge, n’abanyi bàsigîre omu Emati, bakujirira olusiku lukulu.<verse eid="PSA 76:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12"/>Mujire ebiragâne mubirhûle Nyakasane Nnâmahanga, abâli eburhambi bwâge barhûle Nyamuzinda entûlo.<verse eid="PSA 76:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 76:13"/>Ye kûla abaluzi mw’omûka. Ye nageza abâmi b’igulu mw’omusisi.<verse eid="PSA 76:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76"/>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" altnumber="76" sid="PSA 77"/>
  <para style="s1">Okugerêreza ebijiro bya Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Yedutuni. Lwa Azafi. Lulanga.<verse eid="PSA 77:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2"/>Nnâmahanga nayâkûza obu nakûbiriza ntya, ye ndwîrhe nayâkûza nti anyumve nâni.<verse eid="PSA 77:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3"/>Olusiku ngwêrhwe n’omutula Nyakasane ye nnongereza mbone, okuboko kwâni kunalâle kwamuyimbira obudufu bwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 77:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4"/>Erhi nayîsh’ikengêra Nnâmahanga, nnanyumve ecifufu, erhi nayîsh’irhanya, nyumve omurhima gurhaciri gwâni gurhoge.<verse eid="PSA 77:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5"/>Engohe zâni wazibuzize buhunga, omurhima gwâni gwabuzire budêkerera, lêrha ciru okuderha akanwa ntakuhashiri.<verse eid="PSA 77:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6"/>Ndwîrhage nagerêreza ensiku zàgezire, nkengêre emyâka yali burhanzi, ntanye-ntanye!<verse eid="PSA 77:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7"/>Erhi bwayîsh’ibà budufu nangerêrezagye emurhima, nkengêre ndôse emirhima.<verse eid="PSA 77:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8"/>Nti: «Nyamuzinda kàli warhulekêrîrage obwo? Orhakanacirhubabalira bundi?<verse eid="PSA 77:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9"/>Kàli rhwanatûhirage lwoshi omu masù gâge, n’omulagi àrhulaganyagya ntà mwâna wîrhu wâciguhikekwo.<verse eid="PSA 77:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10"/>Ka Nyamuzinda kuyibagira ayibagire olukogo lwâge, nîsi erhi burhè bwarhuma anywa embuli aleka olukogo lwâge?»<verse eid="PSA 77:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11"/>Naderha obwo, nti: «Gwo mutula gungwêrhe ogwo, gunali gw’ogu, kulya kubà okuboko kw’Ow’Enyanya bwenêne kwahindusire kundi kundi.»<verse eid="PSA 77:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12"/>Kukengêra nkengêra emikolo ya Nyakasane, nêci nankengêre ebisômerîne byâwe bya mîra.<verse eid="PSA 77:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13"/>Nkolaga nagerêreza nkengêre emikolo wakozire, ngere n’omu bijiro warhujirîre.<verse eid="PSA 77:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14"/>Nnâmahanga, enjira yâwe erhagerwamwo, ka hali wundi Nyamuzinda oli aka Nyamuzinda wâni?<verse eid="PSA 77:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15"/>Mushâna we Nyamuzinda, we jira ebirhangâzo, wayêresire amashanja gabona obuhashe ojira.<verse eid="PSA 77:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16"/>wayanka walîkûza olubaga lwâwe n’okuboko kwâwe kulyo, walîkûza bene-Yakôbo na bene-Yozefu.<verse eid="PSA 77:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17"/>Amîshi gàkubona, Nnâmahanga, gàkubona gàgeramw’omusisi: <verse eid="PSA 77:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18"/>Ebitù byàdubula amîshi, ecitù càkungula n’emyampi yâwe yàbalala.<verse eid="PSA 77:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19"/>Enkuba yâwe yalaza, orhukengulo rhwamoleka igulu, igulu lyàrhemuka, lyàgeramw’omusisi.<verse eid="PSA 77:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20"/>Wàyanka watwa enjira omu nyanja, wakoma enjira omu nyanja y’amîshi, lêrhaga ciru amashando gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 77:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 77:21"/>Wàjà watunda olubaga lwâwe nka busô, walutunda n’okuboko kwa Mûsa na Aroni.<verse eid="PSA 77:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77"/>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" altnumber="77" sid="PSA 78"/>
  <para style="s1">Okubula okuvuga omunkwa kwa Bene-Israheli</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1"/>Nyigîrizo. Lwa Azafi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:1">Lubaga lwâni yumva nkubwîre, rhegi okurhwiri muyumve oku nâderha.<verse eid="PSA 78:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2"/>Nkola nabumbûla akanwa, nkola nâtwa emigani, nkola nâbasa agàli mahwe kurhenga mîra.<verse eid="PSA 78:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3"/>Birya rhwayumvagya rhwanabimanya, birya rhwabwîragwa na balarha,<verse eid="PSA 78:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4"/>Rhurhankabifulika abinjikulu bâbo, rhurhankabula bwabimanyîsa abâna bâburhwa. Rhwababwîra oku Nyakasane alumeha kwoshi, obuhashe bwâge n’ebinja àjizire by’okurhangâza.<verse eid="PSA 78:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5"/>Ayansire aderha akanwa omu ca Yakôbo, agwîka irhegeko omu ca Israheli. Akomêreza ababusi bîrhu mpu irhegeko bahîrwe balimanyîse abâna bâbo.<verse eid="PSA 78:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6"/>Iburha lyâyisha, bo bâna baburhwa abo, mpu nabo bamanye banamanyîse abâna bâbo.<verse eid="PSA 78:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7"/>Nabo bakaz’icîkubagira Nyamuzinda, barhag’iyibagira emikolo ya Nnâmahanga, ci bakaz’ishimb’amarhegeko gâge.<verse eid="PSA 78:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8"/>Barhanabâga ishanja lya bagoma, ba cabira-bahana, aka bashakulûza wâbo. Lyo lyàli iburha lya murhima guli nka gwa ngoko, omurhima gwâbo gurhàli gusêzire kuli Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 78:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9"/>Aka bene-Efremi bàbâga bafôzire banahinika, babul’iyâka erhi olusiku lw’okulwa luhika.<verse eid="PSA 78:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10"/>Ecihango ca Nyamuzinda bàrhacifumaga, bulya bamâlahira bwa kulikira irhegeko lyâge.<verse eid="PSA 78:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11"/>Bayibagira ebinja àli àbajirire, n’ebijiro by’okurhangâza àli àbayeresire.<verse eid="PSA 78:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12"/>Ali àjirîre ebisômerîne by’enkwîra omu masù ga b’îshe, amango bâli omu cihugo c’e Mîsiri n’oku irango lya Sowani.<verse eid="PSA 78:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13"/>Enyanja ayiberamwo kabirhi abayîkiza, anayîmanika amîshi nka côgo ca kuhalira. <verse eid="PSA 78:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14"/>Akaz’ibalusa n’ecitù mûshi, akaz’ibamolekera n’omuliro budufu.<verse eid="PSA 78:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15"/>Abêra amabuye omu mpinga àbanywesa bàguka aka owanywer’aha nshalalo,<verse eid="PSA 78:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16"/>Apamula amîshi omw’ibuye, akûlamwo amîshi gahulula nka nyîshi nênênè.<verse eid="PSA 78:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17"/>Kurhahangaga barhashub’igwîra babîhira Ow’Enyanya, n’okumugayikiza omu mpinga.<verse eid="PSA 78:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18"/>Omu mirhima yâbo balonza okurhangula Nnâmahanga, bahûnira ebiryo obuhubu.<verse eid="PSA 78:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19"/>Bashinyagulira Nnâmahanga, mpu: «Ka Nyamuzinda akarhubonera eci rhwalya omu mpinga?»<verse eid="PSA 78:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20"/>Mpu: «Dala oku abîre nk’akoma okw’ibuye amîshi gafukûkamwo, ashûrh’okw’ibuye enyîshi zapamukamwo. Mpu: Omugati gwo? K’akarhuboneragwo, nîsi erhi aderhe mpu alîsa olubaga lwâge oku hy’amîru?»<verse eid="PSA 78:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21"/>Lêro erhi Nyakasane àyumva ntyo oburhè bwamugwârha, embasha yajà ecîko erhi Yakôbo orhuma, àlubira Yakôbo nk’aha bwacêraga.<verse eid="PSA 78:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22"/>Bulyâla barhayêmêraga akanwa ka Nnâmahanga, barhacikubagiraga oburhabâle bwâge.<verse eid="PSA 78:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23"/>Kurhanahangaga arhanarhegeka ebitù by’enyanya, anahamûl’enyumvi z’emalunga.<verse eid="PSA 78:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24"/>Enkuba y’amâna g’okulya yacîbânda okw’idaho, mpu: «Nki omugati gw’emalunga». <verse eid="PSA 78:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25"/>Omuntu naye aluma oku biryo by’abazibu, biryo ebyôl’abantu bàrhumiragwa mpu balye basîme.<verse eid="PSA 78:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26"/>Ashub’ijà aho: atul’empûsi emalunga, n’oku buhashe bwâge azûsa kalemêra.<verse eid="PSA 78:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27"/>Enyama zàbâgwakwo nka katulo, n’ebinyunyi, birya by’amashala, byagwa nka mushenyi omu nyanja.<verse eid="PSA 78:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28"/>Byacîkananika omu birâlo byâbo, byakaz’igwa aha burhambi bwa ngasi cihando câbo.<verse eid="PSA 78:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29"/>Balya, bayigurha, babundêza, amîru gàli gabagwêrhe gatwîka.<verse eid="PSA 78:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30"/>Oku ebiryo bicibali ekanwa, oburhè bwâbo bwagwârha Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 78:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31"/>Anigûza abagula bàbalimwo, n’emisole y’Israheli ayihir’okw’idaho.<verse eid="PSA 78:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32"/>Kurhahangaga barhabîha okurhalusire, banabula buyêmêra ebisômerîne byâge.<verse eid="PSA 78:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33"/>Lêro ensiku zâbo àzisingônola kano kanya, n’emyâka yâbo ayigeza buhena.<verse eid="PSA 78:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34"/>Oku adwîrhe abanigûza bamulongereza, banakaz’igaluka bal’ilonza Nyamuzinda,<verse eid="PSA 78:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35"/>Banakaz’ikengêra oku Nyamuzinda ye Kabuye kâbo, oku Ow’Enyanya ye Muciza wâbo.<verse eid="PSA 78:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36"/>Babulikaz’imurheba obwo n’akanwa kâbo, babulikaz’imuhêkakwo akalimi kanywesi.<verse eid="PSA 78:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37"/>N’omurhima gwâbo gurhali gushingânîne mpu guyêrekere emund’ali, n’akanwa bàfundikiraga haguma naye barhakasêzagya.<verse eid="PSA 78:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38"/>Ci kwône yêhe akaz’ibafa lukogo omu kukaz’izâza obubî bwâbo n’omu kubula bwabaherêrhera; akaz’icika omutula gwâge àhâli h’okubarhulira kuli gwo.<verse eid="PSA 78:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39"/>Yêhe akaz’ikengêra oku zinali ngonyi, oku gunali mûka kwône, gwo gugenda burhagaluka.<verse eid="PSA 78:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40"/>Oku bakaz’imushongeza omw’irungu banamugayikiza omu mpinga wâni!<verse eid="PSA 78:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41"/>Bakaz’ishubirira barhangula Nnâmahanga n’okujira Omutagatîfu w’Israheli burhè.<verse eid="PSA 78:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42"/>Barhanaderhaga mpu bakengêre kulya kuboko kwâge, nîsi erhi lulya lusiku abashugulaga omu nfune z’omubisha.<verse eid="PSA 78:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43"/>Barhakengêraga oku akolaga eby’okurhangâza omu Mîsiri, n’ebisômerîne omu irango lya Sowani.<verse eid="PSA 78:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44"/>Oku àhindulaga enyîshi zâbo zashuba mukò gwône gwône, n’emibunda yâbo kwo na kwo mpu bankananywa.<verse eid="PSA 78:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45"/>Oku àbarhumiraga ebibugu mpu bibalume, n’ebikere mpu bibalibuze.<verse eid="PSA 78:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46"/>Oku àlikiraga amahanzi omu myâka yâbo, n’emburho yâbo ayirhega enzige.<verse eid="PSA 78:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47"/>Barhacitwaga ihuzihuzi ly’oku àlikiraga olubula omu mizâbîbu yâbo, n’ehiboho hy’obunya lwikungu omu mirhi yâbo.<verse eid="PSA 78:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48"/>Oku àhenguliraga olubula omu bihêsi byâbo, n’enkuba omu masô gâbo.<verse eid="PSA 78:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49"/>Oku abalikiragamwo idûrhu ly’oburhè bwâge, abalikiramwo n’omutula n’omungo n’amalibuko: erya ngabo y’abaganda bahisa obuhanya!<verse eid="PSA 78:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50"/>Oku àyiguliraga omutula gwâge àbula bubacinga oku lufù, analeka ebintu byâbo byajamwo ecihûsi.<verse eid="PSA 78:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51"/>Barhakengêraga oku àlambikaga ngasi nfula y’omu Mîsiri okw’idaho, alambikakwo na ngasi lubere lw’abàli omu bihando bya bene-Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 78:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52"/>Oku àyishaga atunda olubaga lwâge nka bibuzi, abageza omu mpinga nka busô bwa bibuzi.<verse eid="PSA 78:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53"/>Oku àbayikizagya bwinjà bwinjà buzira bwôba, n’enyanja yamirangusa abashombanyi bâbo.<verse eid="PSA 78:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54"/>Oku abahisagya omu cihugo câge citagatîfu abahisa aha ntondo àcihâga n’okuboko kwâge.<verse eid="PSA 78:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55"/>Amashanja g’eco cihugo agalibirhakwo banasinza agagaba myanya-myanya gashuba birugu bàyimamwo, n’ebihando by’ago mashanja emilala y’Israheli yabishobôla.<verse eid="PSA 78:55"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56"/>Ci bôhe bakaz’irhangula Nnâmahanga, bakaz’ishonza Ow’Enyanya bwenêne, banabula bushimba amarhegeko gâge.<verse eid="PSA 78:56"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57"/>Bahabuka banahemuka aka bashakulu wâbo, bagolonjoka nka ndyâlya ya muherho.<verse eid="PSA 78:57"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58"/>Bamujira burhè n’empêro zâbo z’oku ntondo, n’ebishanga byâbo byamuzûkiza obwonganwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:58"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59"/>Lêro Nnâmahanga ayumva omutula gwamugwârha, kwo kukaga Israheli.<verse eid="PSA 78:59"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60"/>Aleka ecirâlo c’omu Silo obwo, co cirâlo àli agwîsire omu karhî k’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 78:60"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61"/>Okubundi aleka emisî yâge bayihêka mpira, n’irenge lyâge alirikira omu nfune z’omubisha.<verse eid="PSA 78:61"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62"/>Olubaga lwâge nalwo alurhega engôrho, akunirira omwîmo gwâge.<verse eid="PSA 78:62"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63"/>Abâna bâbo b’emisole omuliro gwabashamula, abâna-nyere bâbo babula ciyansire.<verse eid="PSA 78:63"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64"/>Abadâhwa bâbo engôrho zabashenyula, n’abakana bâbo ciru barhalakaga.<verse eid="PSA 78:64"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65"/>Lêro Nyakasane anacitulîka nk’owarhenga îrò, atulumukirwa nka murhabâzi wali ogazirwe n’amamvu.<verse eid="PSA 78:65"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66"/>Abashombanyi bâge abagezamwo ecôji, ababonesa eza mêmè, zirya z’enkwîra.<verse eid="PSA 78:66"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67"/>Akengula ecirâlo ca Yozefu, anabula bwacîshoga obûko bwa Efrayimu.<verse eid="PSA 78:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68"/>Ci yêhe abà obûko bwa Yûda bwo acîshoga. Abà entondo ya Siyoni yo arhonya.<verse eid="PSA 78:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69"/>Engombe yâge ayiyûbaka ndîrî ak’amalunga, ayigwika ya nsiku n’amango ak’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 78:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70"/>Kwo kucîshoga omwambali Daudi obwo, amukûla ebulambo erhi ayâbwîre ebibuzi.<verse eid="PSA 78:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71"/>Amuhamagala erhi ayisha atunda ba-lubuzè, amuhamagala mpu ayâbule Yakôbo, lwo lubaga lwago, na Israheli, gwo mwîmo gwâge.<verse eid="PSA 78:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72"/>Akaz’ibayâbula n’omurhima mukombêdu, akaz’ibatunda n’enfune z’obwîrhonzi.<verse eid="PSA 78:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78"/>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" altnumber="78" sid="PSA 79"/>
  <para style="s1">Omulenge gw’olubaga lwoshi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Azafi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:1">Nnâmahanga mâshi kàli abapagani bàkuhisire ekà, bàhemwîre engombe yâwe ntagatîfu, Yeruzalemu yêshi bàmuhindwîre bigûkà.<verse eid="PSA 79:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2"/>Emibiri ya bambali bâwe, bayisîgire ebihungu mpu birye biyigurhe, n’emirhumba y’abatagatîfu bâwe bayikwêba empunga.<verse eid="PSA 79:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3"/>Omukò gwâbo gwabulagîrwe nka mîshi oku burhambi bwa Yeruzalemu, lêrhaga ciru omuntu wankababisha.<verse eid="PSA 79:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4"/>Rhwabîre lwimbo emw’abalungu bîrhu, rhwakwâmirwe rhwanashekerwa n’abarhuli eburhambi rhwarhama.<verse eid="PSA 79:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5"/>Waliha kuhika mangaci? Kàli weki omungo gwâwe gurhakarhûla? Ka mpu omutula gwâwe guyigurhe nka muliro?<verse eid="PSA 79:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6"/>Obè by’ohêkakw’oburhè birya bihugo birhalonza okukumanya, galya mashanja garhagashâniza izîno lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 79:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7"/>Bulyâla bàshanshanywîre Yakôbo, banashâba aha mwâge hoshi!<verse eid="PSA 79:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8"/>Orharhulyûzagya obubî bwa bashakulûza, obwonjo bwâwe buyêrekere emunda rhuli, bulya rhuhanyagîre kurhali kunyi obu.<verse eid="PSA 79:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9"/>Orhulwîrekwo mâshi Nyamuzinda, Muciza w’abantu; irenge ly’izîno lyâwe lirhume warhurhabâla, onarhukûlir’ebyâha.<verse eid="PSA 79:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10"/>Ewani, cici cankarhuma abapagani baderha, mpu: «Ngahi Nnâmahanga wâbo aligi?» Boshi bamanye, nîrhu rhucîbonere oku nêci wacîhôlire gulya mukò gwa bambali bâwe gwabulagagwa.<verse eid="PSA 79:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11"/>Mâshi ogu mulenge gw’empira zâwe gukuhikekwo mâshi, n’oku buhashe bw’okuboko kwâwe ogalukire eno minyama y’olufù mâshi!<verse eid="PSA 79:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12"/>Ojire mâshi Nyamwagirwa, abâlungwe bîrhu ecijâci bakujacira cibagalukekwo kali nda omu murhima<verse eid="PSA 79:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13"/>Rhwêhe rhwe rhuli lubaga lwâwe rhwe rhunali bibuzi by’omu busô bwâwe rhukwîtakîre emyâka n’emyâka, rhunakaz’ishambâlira abandi irenge lyâwe omu maburhwa n’amâburhwa.<verse eid="PSA 79:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79"/>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" altnumber="79" sid="PSA 80"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’okushub’ishakûlula Israheli</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Luyimbwa aka «Amarhegeko ga Nyakasane». Lwa Azafi. Lulanga.<verse eid="PSA 80:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2"/>We mungere oyâbula Israheli, orhuyumve nîrhu, we kombêra Yozefu nka busô, we tamala enyanya za ba-Kerubi.<verse eid="PSA 80:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3"/>Omolekere Efrayimu na Benyamini na Menashè. otule obuhashe bwâwe butulûke, onayishe lyo rhulobôka.<verse eid="PSA 80:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4"/>Nnâmahanga mâshi orhudâhye, onarhuyêrekeze obusù burhulwîre lyo rhucira.<verse eid="PSA 80:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5"/>Nnâmahanga w’emirhwe mangaci waleka okubêyûla, n’olubaga lwâwe ludwîrhe lwakushenga?<verse eid="PSA 80:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6"/>Waluyikuzizagye omugati gw’emirenge, wanalunywesa endubudubu y’emirenge mushâna!<verse eid="PSA 80:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7"/>Warhumirage rhwabà igwârhiro lya kadali oku balungu bîrhu, n’abashombanyi bîrhu barhushekîre barhama.<verse eid="PSA 80:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8"/>Nnâmahanga w’emirhwe, mâshi orhugalule, onarhuyêrekeze obusù burhulwîre lyo rhucira.<verse eid="PSA 80:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9"/>Omuzâbîbu erhi guli e Mîsiri wagumânyula, amashanja wagalibirhakwo wagubarha.<verse eid="PSA 80:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10"/>Wagukombêra gwône gwône, gwamina gwagandâza gwabumba igulu.<verse eid="PSA 80:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11"/>Entondo zayumva empehema yagwo, n’enduluma za Nyamuzinda zayumva gwazilandirirakwo.<verse eid="PSA 80:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12"/>Gwagandâza gwahuma oku nyanja, gwahika n’oku lwîshi.<verse eid="PSA 80:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13"/>Lêro cici carhumirage wagushâbira ecôgo, mpu lyo ngasi wagera omu njira aguhagulakwo?<verse eid="PSA 80:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14"/>Mpu lyo enshenge y’erubala eguyôna, n’ensimba z’emuzirhu ziguyâbukekwo?<verse eid="PSA 80:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15"/>Hindamuka Nnâmahanga w’emirhwe, hindamuka olîke amasù kurheng’emalunga obone, onayishe orhandûle ogu muzâbîbu.<verse eid="PSA 80:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16"/>Ogulange we Nnagwo, kuboko kwâwe kwagugwikaga, hyàli hirhi, wêne wahihà obuzibu.<verse eid="PSA 80:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17"/>Mâshi balya bàdûlikaga ogu muzâbîbu muliro banaguhira okw’idaho, bahungumuke n’obukali bw’obusù bwâwe mâshi!<verse eid="PSA 80:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18"/>Okuboko kwâwe kubêre kuli olya mulume w’aha kulyo kwâwe, olya mwene omuntu wazibuhagya wêne.<verse eid="PSA 80:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19"/>Lêro rhurhakacikurhengakwo bundi, orhulange bagumagumà, rhuyîsh’icîtakîra izîno lyâwe,<verse eid="PSA 80:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 80:20"/>Nyamwagirwa Nnâmahanga w’emirhwe mâshi orhudâhye orhuyêrekeze obusù burhulwîre lyo rhucira.<verse eid="PSA 80:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80"/>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" altnumber="80" sid="PSA 81"/>
  <para style="s1">Omulâli gw’olusiku lukulu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Luyimbwa aka Gati. Lwa Azafi.<verse eid="PSA 81:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2"/>Mukanye muhindire Nyakasane, Mufungizi orhufungira, mukanye mukuze Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo.<verse eid="PSA 81:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3"/>Mukomere ennanga murhimbe n’engoma, muvuze enzenze na hirya hirhêra hilongîre.<verse eid="PSA 81:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4"/>Mudumûle omushekera buno omwêzi gwacibaluka, muguhiremwo amarhama hano omwêzi gucêrwa, nêci muvuze omushekera mwa luno lusiku lwîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 81:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5"/>Bulyâla kuli Israheli liri irhegeko eryo, irhegeko lya Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo.<verse eid="PSA 81:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6"/>Eryôla irhegeko yêne walihâga Yozefu, amango àrhengaga omu cihugo c’e Mîsiri. Iderha ntâl’ishubig’iyumva naliyumva obwo:<verse eid="PSA 81:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7"/>Mpu: «Nie nalîkûzagya ecirhugo câwe oku mucîmba, n’okuboko kwâwe nakurhenza oku birhimbiri».<verse eid="PSA 81:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8"/>Amango wali omu malibuko wanyâkûza nakulîkûza, amango wali omu citù cakungula nakushuza, nanakurhangulira aha mîshi ga Meriba.<verse eid="PSA 81:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9"/>Lubaga lwâni yumva nkuhanûle, mâshi Israheli nyumva mâshi!<verse eid="PSA 81:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10"/>Irhondo orhahîraga okahandîsa wundi wundi nyamuzinda omu mwâwe, orhahîraga okagashâniza nyamuzinda w’embuga.<verse eid="PSA 81:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11"/>Niene nie Nnâmahanga, nie Nyamuzinda wâwe, niene nie nakurhenzagya omu cihugo c’e Mîsiri: bumbûla akanwa kâwe nkuvangulire.<verse eid="PSA 81:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12"/>Ci kwône olubaga lwâni lwôhe lurhayumvagya izù lyâni, Israheli naye àrhanyumvagya.<verse eid="PSA 81:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13"/>Okwo, kwarhuma nabahanira obudârhi bw’omurhima gwâbo, nti bashenye ezi bâgala.<verse eid="PSA 81:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14"/>Olubaga lwâni lucinyumvagya wâni! Israheli acishimbaga enjira zâni wâni!<verse eid="PSA 81:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15"/>Kano kanya nali nakabya abashombanyi bâge, nali nabakubûlira okuboko kwâni niene.<verse eid="PSA 81:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81"/>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" altnumber="81" sid="PSA 82"/>
  <para style="s1">Oku bacîranuzi b’endyâlya</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Azafi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 82:1">Nnâmahanga oyo wamâyimanga omu karhî k’ihano lya banyamuzinda, y’oyo wamâhumanula olubanja omu karhî kâbo.<verse eid="PSA 82:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2"/>Mpu: «Mangaci mwâleka okutwîra olubanya obulyâlya n’okuhà abayâzire olubanja?»<verse eid="PSA 82:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3"/>Kaz’imufungire omuhanya n’ecirhaba, kaz’imushubize omunyi n’omukenyi ehyâge.<verse eid="PSA 82:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4"/>Kaz’imulîkûze omuhanya n’omushalye, kaz’imumukûle omu nfune z’endyâlya.<verse eid="PSA 82:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5"/>Oku barhishi bici kwo barhanayumva, omu mwizimya bagenda, emitungo y’igulu yoshi kwo kuciha okw’idaho okwo mushâna!<verse eid="PSA 82:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6"/>Niehe kwo nali ndesire nti muli banyamuzinda mweshi, nti muli bagala b’Ow’Enyanya bwenêne.<verse eid="PSA 82:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7"/>N’okusiga ninyu kufà mwanafè ak’abantu, n’ekugulu kwinyu mukoba gwayizinde ak’abandi bagale.<verse eid="PSA 82:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8"/>Nnâmahanga, yimuka otwîre igulu olubanja, bulyâla amashanja goshi we Nnago.<verse eid="PSA 82:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82"/>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" altnumber="82" sid="PSA 83"/>
  <para style="s1">Oku bashombanyi b’Israheli</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1"/>Lwimbo. Lulunga. Lwa Azafi.<verse eid="PSA 83:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2"/>Yâgirwa mâshi orhahulike, Nnâmahanga mâshi orhahulikaga orhanadekêreraga!<verse eid="PSA 83:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3"/>Bulyâla abashombanyi bâwe batuzire akavù, n’abakushomba bafôzire banahinika.<verse eid="PSA 83:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4"/>Olubaga lwâwe balujirire mahwe, obusò bwâwe babujìrire omu ihano<verse eid="PSA 83:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5"/>Mpu: «Mukanye rhubashandâze bakanahinduka lubaga, n’izîno ly’Israheli lyakanashub’ikazikengwa.»<verse eid="PSA 83:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6"/>Nêci haguma baderhîre, kunywâna banywânîne mpu bakuj’ebulambo.<verse eid="PSA 83:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7"/>Amahêma gayêremîre: ab’Edomu, bene-Ismaeli, ab’e Mowabu na bene Hagara,<verse eid="PSA 83:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8"/>Gebal, Amoni na Amaleki, Abafilistini n’ab’e Tiri.<verse eid="PSA 83:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9"/>Ciru n’ab’e Asîriya bacîhebirekwo bo, mpu baj’irhabâla bene Loti.<verse eid="PSA 83:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10"/>Obajire kulya wajiraga Madiyani, Sizara na Yabini aha lwîshi lwa Gizoni.<verse eid="PSA 83:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11"/>Bàhungumukira aha Endori, bànazaho amashwa.<verse eid="PSA 83:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12"/>Abarhambo bâbo obajire aka Orebu na Zebu, kulya wajiraga Zebahi na Salamana kwo obajirage nabo.<verse eid="PSA 83:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13"/>Bàyisha, mpu: «Rhuyanke amashwa ga Nyamuzinda goshi!»<verse eid="PSA 83:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14"/>Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, obajire nka kula kalemêra ahêka ebyâsi, nka kula ehyâsi hihêkwa n’empûsi.<verse eid="PSA 83:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15"/>Babè kulîra omuliro guyokêra omuzirhu, nka kulîra engulumira emîma entondo.<verse eid="PSA 83:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16"/>Orhang’ibanikakwo omulaba gwâwe ntyo, n’empûsi yâwe erhang’ibakanga.<verse eid="PSA 83:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17"/>Orhang’ibabonêsa nshonyi, balongereze izîno lyâwe, Yâgirwa Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 83:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18"/>Enshonyi zibabumbe bajemwo ecikango cirhafuma, enshonyi zibagwarhe zinabahêke.<verse eid="PSA 83:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 83:19"/>Bamanye oku w’oyo izîno lyâwe we Nyakasane bamanye oku wêne ôbà enyanyanyanya z’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 83:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83"/>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" altnumber="85" sid="PSA 84"/>
  <para style="s1">Omwîfinjo gw’okuhika omu ka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Luyimbwa aka Gati. Lwa bene Korè. Lulanga.<verse eid="PSA 84:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2"/>Alà nk’enyumpa yâwe yayinjiha Yâgirwa Nyakasane k’Emirhwe.<verse eid="PSA 84:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3"/>Omurhima gwâni gwafîre n’omwîfinjo gw’okuhika omu kônga ka Nyakasane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:3">Omurhima gwâni n’amagala gâni bidwîrhe byalwîra okuhika aha burhambi bwa Nyamuzinda ozîne.<verse eid="PSA 84:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4"/>Ciru n’ehifunzi hijira aha mwahyo, n’ehirembe-rembe hijira olwôgo hidêkerezamwo ebyâna byahyo. Câhisibwa aha luhêro lwâwe Nyakasane k’emirhwe. Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga!<verse eid="PSA 84:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5"/>Câbajirwa ababà omu nyumpa yâwe Nyamwagirwa bolino barhahwa barhâkukuza.<verse eid="PSA 84:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6"/>Iragi lyâge omuntu orhabâlwa nâwe, amango agwêrhe omulâli gw’olugendo lutagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 84:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7"/>Hano bayikira akabanda kûmu, bâkahindula nshôko, n’enkuba mpangûka ekabumbe mugisho.<verse eid="PSA 84:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8"/>Bâja bazibuha bunjirà-njirà bulya bâyîsh’ibona Nnâmahanga omu Siyoni.<verse eid="PSA 84:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9"/>Nyakasane k’emirhwe oyumve guno musengero gwâni, Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo ontege nâni okurhwiri.<verse eid="PSA 84:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10"/>Nnâmahanga, we mpenzi yîrhu, rhulolekwo nîrhu, lolà oku busù bw’omushîge wâwe.<verse eid="PSA 84:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11"/>Kwo binali: omulegerege omuntu agezize omu mwâwe gwo mukulu oku yindi cihumbi, okubêra aha lusò lwa Nnâmahanga, kwo kukulu aha kubêra omu nyumpa y’abanya-byâha.<verse eid="PSA 84:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12"/>Nyakasane Nnâmahanga ye Kazûba-zûba ye na Mpenzi, oburhonyi n’irenge zo ngalo zâge. arhazijinikira, oku bantu bakerekera omu ntagoma.<verse eid="PSA 84:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 84:13"/>Nyakasane k’emirhwe, iragi lyâge omuntu ôkwîkubagira.<verse eid="PSA 84:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84"/>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" altnumber="84" sid="PSA 85"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’okuhûna omurhûla</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa bene Korè.<verse eid="PSA 85:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2"/>Yâgirwa nêci wagashânîre ecihugo câwe, Yakôbo lêro naye akola ayôsire bwinjà.<verse eid="PSA 85:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3"/>Olubaga lwâwe walubabalîre obubî bwâlwo, ebyâha byâlwo wabibwikira birhag’iboneka.<verse eid="PSA 85:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4"/>Omungo gwâwe wagurhanga, n’oburhè wali wabuleka.<verse eid="PSA 85:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5"/>Orhushubize ekà, Nnâmahanga Muciza wîrhu, n’omutula rhukujirire oguyibagirage<verse eid="PSA 85:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6"/>K’okola wayôrha orhulubîre ensiku zoshi, nîsi erhi olubîre amâburhwa g’abantu goshi?<verse eid="PSA 85:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7"/>Kàli we warhushubizamw’omûka, olubaga lwâwe lucîkwitakîre? <verse eid="PSA 85:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8"/>Yâgirwa mâshi, orhuyêrekeze olukogo lwâwe onarhucize<verse eid="PSA 85:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9"/>Ka nyumve ebi Nyakasane Nnâmahanga aderha: binwa bya murhûla bino adwîrhe abwîra olubaga lwâge n’abacêse bâge, byo anabwîra ngasi bayêrekeza omurhima emund’ali.<verse eid="PSA 85:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10"/>Nêci akola ali hôfi h’okuciza abamurhînya, n’irenge lyâge lyaling’iyîsh’ibêra kunôla igulu lîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 85:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11"/>Olukogo n’oburhabêsha bikola byabugânana, n’obushinganyanya bulamuse omurhûla.<verse eid="PSA 85:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12"/>Obudahemuka bukolaga bwajalamuka okw’igulu n’obushinganyanya bw’emalunga bulîkire isù okw’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 85:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13"/>Nyakasane akolaga ahâna ebinja, n’amashwa gayêre garhengwemwo.<verse eid="PSA 85:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 85:14"/>Obushinganyanya bwayisha bumushokolîre, enjir’ayishamwo yo n’obucire bwayishamwo.<verse eid="PSA 85:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85"/>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" altnumber="85" sid="PSA 86"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’omwîra wa Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1"/>Musengero. Gwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:1">Yâgirwa, orhege okurhwiri kwâwe onyumve nâni, bulyâla mpanyagîre nnandi mukenyi.<verse eid="PSA 86:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2"/>Omanyire omurhima gwâni, bulya ndi wâwe, ocize mwambali wâwe, bulya we acîkubagîre.<verse eid="PSA 86:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3"/>We Nyamuzinda wâni; onfè lukogo mâshi Yâgirwa, obûla ndwîrhe nakukûbiriza burhahusa.<verse eid="PSA 86:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4"/>Oshagaluse omurhima gwa mwambali wâwe, bulyâla emund’oli, Nyakasane yo ndengerize omurhima gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 86:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5"/>Na bulya Yâgirwa we mwinjà, we n’olukogo lushundwakwo; onaluzize obwonjo oku ngasi boshi bakusengera.<verse eid="PSA 86:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6"/>Nyamwagirwa, omusengero gwâni oguyumvîrhize, n’izù ly’omusengero gwâni olirhege okurhwiri.<verse eid="PSA 86:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7"/>Nkuyâkûzize olusiku ndi burhè, bulyâla mmanyire oku wanyumvîrhiza. <verse eid="PSA 86:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8"/>Abazimu barhalimwo okuhisirekwo, Nyakasane, na ntà mulenga ohisire okw’ikola lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9"/>Amashanja walemaga goshi, gayisha gakuharâmye, Nyamwagirwa, ganamanyise izîno lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10"/>Bulya we munênênè we nakola ebirhangaza: wêne we Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="PSA 86:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11"/>Muhanyi, onnangûle enjira yâwe nkaz’igera omu kunali kwâwe, ohabûle omurhima gwâni, gukaz’irhînya izîno lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, nacîkwitakîra n’omurhima gwâni gwoshi, nnamanyîse izîno lyâwe emyâka n’emyâka.<verse eid="PSA 86:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13"/>Bulyâla olukogo lwâwe lwayishir’ibà lunji kuli nie, washâywîre omûka gwâni omu muhengere gw’ekuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 86:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14"/>Nyamuzinda, mâshi, balya bagayana bantezire, n’engabo ya balya b’ecikalarhu egungêzize omûka gwâni, barhanakushibiriri ciru w’oyo.<verse eid="PSA 86:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15"/>Cabâ wêhe, Nyamwagirwa, we Nyamuzinda w’obwonjo n’olukogo, we Nn’obwinjà bwoshi, orhalubiraho orhanarhebana.<verse eid="PSA 86:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16"/>Ndolakwo obwonjo bukugwârhe; oshobôze mwambali wâwe obuzibu bwâwe, onacize mugala wa mwambali-kazi wâwe.<verse eid="PSA 86:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17"/>Ompè ecimanyîso c’oburhonyi bwâwe, balya banshomba babone, n’enshonyi zibabumbe, babone oku wantabîre, Nyamwagirwa, wanantûliriza.<verse eid="PSA 86:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86"/>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" altnumber="86" sid="PSA 87"/>
  <para style="s1">Siyoni, nnina w’amashanja goshi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa bene Korè. Lwigânwa n’emyambalo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 87:1">Nyakasane ahizire Siyoni oku nyanya z’entondo ntagatîfu<verse eid="PSA 87:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2"/>Enyumvi z’e Siyoni zo arhonya kulusha ez’emwa Yakôbo zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 87:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3"/>Wàjir’irenge, lugo lwa Nyamuzinda!<verse eid="PSA 87:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4"/>Rahabu na Babeli bâganjirwa omu bihugo bingashâniza, lolà oku Filistiya, Tiri n’abantu b’e Etiyopiya bâbwirwa, mpu: «Abà yo baburhwa e Siyoni».<verse eid="PSA 87:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5"/>Na hano bakola baderha Siyoni, mpu: «Boshi na boshi yo baburhwa», mpu: «Ow’Enyanya yêne wayûbakaga Siyoni.»<verse eid="PSA 87:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6"/>N’omu citabu c’amashanja Nyakasane àyandika, mpu: «Lebè na lebè yo baburhwa e Siyoni.»<verse eid="PSA 87:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7"/>Hano bakola bahinda bayirnbe, mpu: «Siyoni wêne we nabâmwo enshôko zâni zoshi.»<verse eid="PSA 87:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87"/>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" altnumber="87" sid="PSA 88"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’omuntu ohanyagîre</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1"/>Lwimbo. Lulanga. Lwa bene Korè. Oku mukulu w’abimbiza. Luyimbwa aka «Mahalat.» Lwigânwa. Lwa Hemani w’Ezra.<verse eid="PSA 88:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2"/>Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, gubire mûshi erhi nakuyâkûza, bubîre budufu erhi nalakira omu masù gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 88:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3"/>Omusengero gwâni gukuhikekwo mâshi, orhege. okurhwiri oyumve oku ndwîrhe nabirikira.<verse eid="PSA 88:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4"/>Bulyâla omurhima gwâni gwayihisirwe n’obubî, n’obuzîne bwâni yo bukola buyêrekîre ekuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 88:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5"/>Kwo nkola ndi aka balya bayandagalira omu mwîna, nkola nyôsire nka ngonyi.<verse eid="PSA 88:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6"/>Encingo yâni yabambirwe ekarhî k’àbafire, eshushire ey’abànigagwa banakola batulamire omu nshinda. Balyâla orhacikengêra, bala wahambwîrekwo abà okombêra.<verse eid="PSA 88:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7"/>Omu mwîna muli-muli wampebire, omu mwizimya, omu nyenga.<verse eid="PSA 88:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8"/>Omutula gukugwêrhe gunzidohire nka muzigo, n’omuhûsi gw’enyîshi zâwe gwanshangwîre.<verse eid="PSA 88:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9"/>Abanyishi wabampambwîrekwo, wanjizire nyamakobwa emunda bali mpamikirwe: ntabona bwahuluka.<verse eid="PSA 88:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10"/>Arnasu gantunzire erhi buhanya burhuma, ndwîrhage nakuyâkûza bwaca bwayira.<verse eid="PSA 88:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11"/>K’abafîre bo wajirira ebisômerîne? K’emifù yo ekolaga yatulûka ekukuze?<verse eid="PSA 88:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12"/>K’ebinja byâwe binayimbwe omu nshinda? K’oburhabêsha bwâwe bunayimbirwe ekuzimu?<verse eid="PSA 88:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13"/>K’ebisômerîne byâwe binabonekere omu mwizimya? K’obwinjà bwâwe bunabonekere emwa Kayibagira?<verse eid="PSA 88:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14"/>Yâgirwa niehe we ndwîrhe nayâkûza, nti omusengero gwâni gukuhikekwo sêzi-sêzi.<verse eid="PSA 88:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15"/>Mâshi Yâgirwa cici cirhumire wanyôza mâshi?<verse eid="PSA 88:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16"/>K’orhabwîni oku mpanyagîre obu? Kurhenga eburhò bwâni erhi ndi wa kufà, erhi n’ebihamba by’olufù bindi okw’irhwe; lêro nieshi najonzire.<verse eid="PSA 88:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17"/>Omutula nie wagurhûzirekwo, na birya bihamba lêro byampezize.<verse eid="PSA 88:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18"/>Byangosire nka kulya amîshi galegerera gagosire omuntu, lêro byantezire byoshi caligumiza.<verse eid="PSA 88:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 88:19"/>Owîrhu n’omwîra nali ngwêrhe wamunkûzirekwo, ogu mwizimya ye kola wîrhu ye na mwîra.<verse eid="PSA 88:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88"/>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" altnumber="88" sid="PSA 89"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo n’omusengero kuli Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1"/>Obulyo bw’okuherha bwa Etani w’e Ezra.<verse eid="PSA 89:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2"/>Olukogo lwa Nyakasane, nâluyimba ensiku n’amango, oburhabêsha bwâge, niene n’akanwa kâni, nabumanyîsa abinjikulu n’abinjikulûza.<verse eid="PSA 89:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3"/>Wadesire bulya, erhi: «Olukogo lwâni luli luyimânike ensiku n’amango», nêci wayimânisire oburhabêsha bwâwe emalunga.<verse eid="PSA 89:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4"/>Waderha, erhi: Nanywânîne n’omwîshogwa wâni, nalahirîre mwambali wâni Daudi, nti:<verse eid="PSA 89:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5"/>«Nadêkereza iburha lyâwe lihabe ensiku n’amango, nti: Nâgwîka entebe yâwe ehabè omu maburhwa n’amâburhwa.»<verse eid="PSA 89:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6"/>Amalunga gadwîrhe gayimba ebisômerîne byâwe, n’oburhabêsha bwâwe budwîrhe bwayimbwa omu ndêko y’abatagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 89:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7"/>K’omu bitù muli owakagererwakwo Nyakasane? Ndi oli aka Nyakasane omu karhî ka Bene-Nyamuzinda?<verse eid="PSA 89:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8"/>Omu ndêko y’abatagatîfu, Nyamuzinda arhajìbwa omw’irhwe,<verse eid="PSA 89:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9"/>Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga w’emirhwe, ndi oli akâwe? Oli muzibu Yâgirwa n’oburhabêsha bwâwe bukuzungulusire.<verse eid="PSA 89:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10"/>We hima obukali bw’enyanja, omulaba gukazûka we gurhûza.<verse eid="PSA 89:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11"/>We watumirhaga Rahabu wamugerakwo, wêne n’okuboko kwâwe washandâza abashombanyi bâwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12"/>Amalunga gabà gâwe, n’igulu kwo na kwo, wêne walemaga igulu n’ebiribâmwo.<verse eid="PSA 89:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13"/>We walemaga eby’ekulembe walema n’eby’ekulyo, entondo ya Tabora n’eya Hermoni kucîtakîra zacîtakîrira izîno lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14"/>Okuboko kwâwe ye mugala-byoshi, enfune zâwe ye ciri-misî, n’okuboko kwâwe kulyo ye Kalengera.<verse eid="PSA 89:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15"/>Okushinganyanya n’okurhalyalyanya, co ciriba entebe yâwe edêkerîrekwo. oburhonyi n’oburhabêsha bo baganda bakushokolîre.<verse eid="PSA 89:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16"/>Luli lw’iragi olubaga luyishicîtakira, Yâgirwa nêci, obusù bwâwe bwône bubamolekera oku bashûrh’enjira.<verse eid="PSA 89:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17"/>Barhahwa barhacîtakira izîno lyâwe, n’okukuza obukulu bwâwe. <verse eid="PSA 89:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18"/>Bulyâla okulangaza kw’obuhashe bwâbo, wêne obalwîre, n’okunegena kw’ihembe lîrhu, erhi rhurhonyire emund’oli.<verse eid="PSA 89:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19"/>Bulyâla empenzi ya Nyakasane yo rhwalamamwo, n’Omutagatîfu w’Israheli arhuhîre omwâmi wîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 89:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20"/>Mîra-mîra wêne wabonekera abarhonyi bâwe wanababwîra erhi: «Ntwâli nayambisize ishungwè», erhi: «Omwîshogwa wâni omu lubaga namushomôrhwire»,<verse eid="PSA 89:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21"/>Erhi: «Nabwîne mwambali wâni Daudi, nanamushîzire amavurha gâni matagatîfu, <verse eid="PSA 89:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22"/>nti okuboko kwâni kuyôrhe kumuyimangîre kunamuhè omurhima.»<verse eid="PSA 89:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23"/>Erhi ntà mushombanyi wamurhebe, na ntà mubisha wamurhabirekwo.<verse eid="PSA 89:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24"/>Abashombanyi bâge nabatuntuma anabona n’abanzi bâge boshi kushemba nabashemba.<verse eid="PSA 89:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25"/>Oburhabêsha n’oburhonyi bwâni bwamuyimangira, n’okw’izîno lyâni ihembe lyâge linegene.<verse eid="PSA 89:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26"/>Okuboko kwâge nakulambûlira oku nyanja, n’okulyo kwâge kwayìkira enyîshi.<verse eid="PSA 89:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27"/>Hano akola anyâkûza, erhi: «We Larha, we Nyamuzinda wâni, we kabuye kanciza.»<verse eid="PSA 89:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28"/>Nâni namujira nfula yâni, abâmi b’igulu boshi abalenga bulî,<verse eid="PSA 89:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29"/>Nâmujira abè murhonyi wâni ensiku n’amango, n’eciragâne câni câyôrha cisêzire.<verse eid="PSA 89:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30"/>iburha lyâge nâliyôlolosa lihabe ensiku n’amango, n’entebe yâge eyôrhe ehabà ak’ensiku z’oku nkuba.<verse eid="PSA 89:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31"/>Ciru abagala bakarhiba irhegeko lyâni, ciru bakabula bwashimba ebinwa byâni,<verse eid="PSA 89:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32"/>Amarhegeko gâni ciru bakâgavuna, bakânabula bwagalanga,<verse eid="PSA 89:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33"/>nêci nanahuma akarhi mpane obubî bwâbo, kunyulika nâkabanyulika,<verse eid="PSA 89:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34"/>ci oburhonyi bwâni ntâmunyagebwo, n’endagâno yâni ntayitwemwo.<verse eid="PSA 89:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35"/>Eciragâne câni ntacivunè, n’akanwa nadesire ntâkatwemwo.<verse eid="PSA 89:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36"/>Obwimâna bwâni bwo ndahîre, ntârhebè Daudi,<verse eid="PSA 89:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37"/>iburha lyâge lyâyôrha lihabà ensiku n’amango, n’entebe yâge yayôrha eri omu masù gâni ak’izûba,<verse eid="PSA 89:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38"/>ak’omwêzi gwo guyôrha guhabà, gwo guyôrha gubà «Muhamîrizi mutabesha w’emalunga.»<verse eid="PSA 89:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39"/>Lêro kwayishirigibà kujandâga ojandâga! olya washîgaga wêne wamulubîrage!<verse eid="PSA 89:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40"/>wagayire eciragâne ca mwambali wâwe, n’ishungwè lyâge walihemula n’ebidaka <verse eid="PSA 89:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41"/>Ecôgo coshi wacihira okw’idaho, obûbake bwâge bwoshi wabulambika okw’idaho.<verse eid="PSA 89:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42"/>Abâgara bahagwîre barhama, àshubirage masheka g’abalungu!<verse eid="PSA 89:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43"/>Okuboko kw’abashombanyi bâge kwo walengezizagye, ababisha wabayunjuza mwishingo!<verse eid="PSA 89:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44"/>Engôrho yâge wayitumbirage, orhanacimuyimangire omu ntambala.<verse eid="PSA 89:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45"/>Obumoleke bwâge wabuzimizagye n’entebe yâge wayikweba okw’idaho!<verse eid="PSA 89:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46"/>Ensiku z’obusole bwâge wazinyihizagye, wamubonesa eza mêmè.<verse eid="PSA 89:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47"/>Yâgirwa mâshi, kuhika mangaci? Kumanya onakolaga wayôrha ocîfulisire? K’oburhè bwâwe bunakolaga bwayâka nka muliro?<verse eid="PSA 89:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48"/>Kengêra oku ensiku z’obuzîne bwâni ziri nyofi, kengêra oku abantu boshi wabalemire ba nsiku nyofi.<verse eid="PSA 89:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49"/>Ndi yeki olimwo omûka orhakafà, ndi yeki wacirhenze omu nfune za Nnakuzimu?<verse eid="PSA 89:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50"/>Yâgirwa mâshi, bulya burhonyi bwâwe bwa mîra ngahi bwajirage? Bulya burhonyi walaganyagya Daudi omu burhabesha bwâwe?<verse eid="PSA 89:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51"/>Kengêra Yâgirwa ebijâci badwîrhe bajacira bambali bâwe; obushombanyi bw’amashanja bwanjizire mungo!<verse eid="PSA 89:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52"/>Abashombanyi bâwe Yâgirwa, bijâci balimwo, banônogwire olya washîgaga wêne bàrhama!<verse eid="PSA 89:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 89:53"/>Ayâgirwe Nyakasane Nnâmahanga, emyâka n’emyâka. Amen! Amen!<verse eid="PSA 89:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89"/>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" altnumber="89" sid="PSA 90"/>
  <para style="s1">Omuntu kahuka</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1"/>Musengero. Gwa Mûsa. Mwambali wa Nnâmahanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 90:1">Nyamwagirwa oyôrha ôbà lwâkiro lwîrhu kurhenga abantu baburhwa.<verse eid="PSA 90:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2"/>Embere entondo zifûnuke n’embere igulu liburhwe, kurhenga ensiku n’amango erhi ho wêhe onabà ensiku n’amango Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 90:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3"/>We rhegeka abantu mpu bashubire omu budaka, mpu: «Galuki mwe muburhwa n’abantu mwe.»<verse eid="PSA 90:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4"/>Omu masù gâwe myâka cihumbi kw’eri ak’omulegerege gw’injo gwo gwagezire, kwo enali nka cihimbi ca budufu.<verse eid="PSA 90:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5"/>Kushamula obashamula nk’îrò lya sêzi, nka byâsi by’oku civù,<verse eid="PSA 90:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6"/>sêzi omuntu anashange bijinîrîre binayâsize, kubà bijingo oshange byatûbirwe byanayûmire.<verse eid="PSA 90:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7"/>Omutula gwâwe gwamârhuyûsa wâni! oburhè bwâwe bwarhugezizemw’omusisi.<verse eid="PSA 90:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8"/>Ebyâha bîrhu wabiyansire wabihira omu masù gâwe, ebibî rhwâjiraga bwifulikwè wabihebire omu bumoleke bw’obusù bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 90:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9"/>Ensiku zîrhu zoshi zâhwêrîre omu burhè bwâwe, emyâka kwo rhwayimazire nka kula omuntu amira amarhî.<verse eid="PSA 90:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10"/>Emyâka yîrhu yoshi haguma, gali makumi gali nda, na nk’omuntu alamirage bwenêne, gali makumi galimunani, ciru minji muli yo ganali malibuko n’obulagîrire, bulya kano kanya erhi yamâgera, kano kanya erhi kamâkala.<verse eid="PSA 90:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11"/>Ndi wakagera obuhashe bw’omutula gwâwe, nîsi erhi agere obwôba bukwânîne oburhè bwâwe?<verse eid="PSA 90:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12"/>Orhuyigîrize rhukaziyôrha rhuganjire ensiku zîrhu, lyo rhukazirhimanya.<verse eid="PSA 90:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13"/>Rhulolekwo mâshi Nyakasane, kuhika mangaci? Onababalire bambali bâwe.<verse eid="PSA 90:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14"/>Mâshi orhushobôze duba rhuyigurhe olukogo lwâwe, rhusîme rhunacîshinge ensiku zoshi z’obuzîne bwîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 90:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15"/>Orhuhè enshagadu y’ensiku rhwalibwîre, n’ey’emyâka rhwarhindibwîre.<verse eid="PSA 90:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16"/>Bambali bâwe nabo babone oku kukola okola, na bagala bâbo babone irenge lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 90:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17"/>Obwinjà bwa Nyakasane Nnâmahanga bubêre nîrhu, n’emikolo yîrhu ayizibubye rhwenayo, nêci ayizibubye ekomere.<verse eid="PSA 90:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90"/>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" altnumber="90" sid="PSA 91"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda ye Mulanzi w’Abemêzi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1"/>We yimangirwe n’ow’enyanya, we bêra omu cizunguzungu c’Ogala-byoshi<verse eid="PSA 91:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2"/>Obwîre Nyamwagirwa, erhi: «We lwâkiro lwâni, we n’ibuye ncîfulikaho, we Nyamuzinda wâni, we ncîkubagira.»<verse eid="PSA 91:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3"/>Bulyâla yêne ye wâkulîkûza oku murhego gw’abahivi, oku cihûsi cidârhi.<verse eid="PSA 91:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4"/>Akucinga n’amashala gâge, n’omu byûbi byâge mwo wâyâkira. Oburhabêsha bwâge yo mpenzi yâkucinga.<verse eid="PSA 91:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5"/>Orharhînye ecôbà c’obudufu, orhanarhînye omwampi guhenesire mûshi.<verse eid="PSA 91:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6"/>Orharhînye ecihûsi cahulahula omu mwizimya, nîsi erhi ecahira cakola emyônè mûshi.<verse eid="PSA 91:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7"/>Bahirime cihumbi aha burhambi bwâwe, na bihumbi ikumi aha kulyo kwâwe, ci wêhe ababisha barhâkuhikeho.<verse eid="PSA 91:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8"/>Câba nâwe wêne wâcibonera; wâbona oku ababî bahembwa.<verse eid="PSA 91:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9"/>Bulyâla Nyakasane ye lwâkiro lwâwe, Ow’enyanya ye wajizire mpenzi yâwe.<verse eid="PSA 91:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10"/>Okubî kurhakuhikeho, n’obuhanya burhayêrekere ah’oli.<verse eid="PSA 91:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11"/>Kulya kubà àkuhizirekwo abaganda bâge, mpu bakulange omu njira zâwe zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 91:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12"/>Bakuhek’aha nfune zâbo, mpu wakanasarhala okw’ibuye.<verse eid="PSA 91:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13"/>Wâger’oku ntale n’oku mpiri, wâlabarh’empangaza olabarhe n’enkuba-joka.<verse eid="PSA 91:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14"/>Nâmulîkûza kulya kubà acinyishwêkîrekwo, namucinga kulya kubà amanyire izîno lyâni.<verse eid="PSA 91:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15"/>Ampamagala mmuyumve, akajakw’embaka erhi rhwe naye rhunali, namukulakwozo nnamuhè irenge.<verse eid="PSA 91:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16"/>Nâmuyigusa n’omwandu gw’ensiku, nâmuyêreka n’oku nciza abandi.<verse eid="PSA 91:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91"/>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" altnumber="91" sid="PSA 92"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwiganyo lw’omushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1"/>Lulanga. Lwimbo. Lwa kuyimbwa olusiku lwa Sabato.<verse eid="PSA 92:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2"/>Mushâna kuyinjiha okukuza Nyakasane, n’okuzihira izîno lyâwe we ôbà Enyanya.<verse eid="PSA 92:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3"/>Kuyinjiha okuzûkiriza omuntu olukogo lwâwe, n’okulâla omuntu ayîgâna obudahemuka bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 92:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4"/>Lêro lulanga lwa misî ikumi naziba haguma n’erikembe, mpirekwo n’olwimbo lw’oku nzenze.<verse eid="PSA 92:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5"/>Kulya kubà Yâgirwa nêci wansîmîsize n’ebijiro byâwe, mikolo ya maboko gâwe eyi nacîtakîra.<verse eid="PSA 92:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6"/>Emikolo yâwe, alà mpu yaneneha Nyakasane! Enkengêro zâwe, alà mpu zalîha?<verse eid="PSA 92:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7"/>Omuhwinja arhishi ntyo, idâga lirhumva okwo.<verse eid="PSA 92:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8"/>Ababî banajinirira nka byâsi, ba nyankola-maligo banaminîrira, erhi na kurhemwa bayishirhemwa, liguma lya lwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 92:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9"/>Wêhe Nyamwagirwa, oyôrha ôbà w’Enyanya.<verse eid="PSA 92:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10"/>Bulya nêci abakushomba Yâgirwa, abakushomba kuhera bâhere; ba nyankola-maligo boshi kushandâla bâshandâle.<verse eid="PSA 92:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11"/>Niehe wangonyire, walirhega nka lya mbogo; wandodobeka amavurha mahyâhya.<verse eid="PSA 92:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12"/>Balya bakaziginshomba, isù lyâni lyabalolêreza na balya bakazâg’intêra, okurhwiri kwâni kwabayumvîrhiza!<verse eid="PSA 92:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13"/>Omuntu orhalyâlyanya yêne! kwo ayâna nka murhanda. Kwo amina nka nduluma ye Sedre y’e Libano.<verse eid="PSA 92:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14"/>Abà agwîsirwe omu nyumpa ya Nyakasane, omu côgo ca Nnawîrhu Nnâmahanga bayâkiza.<verse eid="PSA 92:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15"/>Bâbà bakola bali nsiku banarhengekwo amalehe, galya malehe minjà gâtwa enyôrha.<verse eid="PSA 92:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 92:16"/>Kuderha okwo mpu, ntà buhemu muli Ye Ye kabuye kâni, ntà buhemu muli Ye.<verse eid="PSA 92:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92"/>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" altnumber="92" sid="PSA 93"/>
  <para style="s1">Oku ngoma ya Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1"/>Nyakasane ayîmire, acîhundikîre obwâmi, Nyakasane acîhundikîre obuhashe, akenyîre bwinjinjà n’igulu àligwîsire buzibu, lirhankadundagana.<verse eid="PSA 93:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2"/>Kurhenga ensiku n’amango erhi entebe yâwe ebà ngwîke. Kurhenge ensiku n’amango erhi ho ôbà.<verse eid="PSA 93:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3"/>Enyîshi zidwîrhe zakabanda, Yâgirwa, enyîshi zidwîrhe zakabanda erhi na kahababo enyîshi zidwîrhe zàshekêreza, zalujira erhi na lubî.<verse eid="PSA 93:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4"/>Ci kwône obuhashe Nyakasane agwêrhe emalunga, bulushire izù ly’amîshi manji manji, bulushire akafurhè k’amayanjayanja.<verse eid="PSA 93:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5"/>Akanwa kâwe kanali ka kuyêmêrwa, enyumpa yâwe Yâgirwa enali ya kukengwa ensiku zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 93:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93"/>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" altnumber="93" sid="PSA 94"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda w’obushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda we cîhôla, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga we cîhôla kanya.<verse eid="PSA 94:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2"/>Oyimuke we twa emmanja z’igulu, abagayana obahè ebi banakwânîne.<verse eid="PSA 94:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3"/>Yâgirwa mangaci, Waliha mangaci ababî bâleka okulîmbirira kwâbo?<verse eid="PSA 94:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4"/>Mangaci bâleka okulogorha n’okuderhera akagayo? Mangaci ba nyankola-maligo bâleka okucîtakîra?<verse eid="PSA 94:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5"/>Yâgirwa kàli olubaga lwâwe baluhinazire, n’omwîmo gwâwe bagulibuzize.<verse eid="PSA 94:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6"/>Badwîrhe baderha, mpu: «Nyakasane arhabona», mpu: «Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo arhadwîrhi atwa ciru ihuzihuzi».<verse eid="PSA 94:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7"/>Kàli badwîrhe baniga omukana, banige ecigolo banige n’ecirhaba.<verse eid="PSA 94:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8"/>Lêro mweki mwe bahwinja omu lubaga, rhangi muyumve; Lêro bino bingolongolo mangaci byarhimanya?<verse eid="PSA 94:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9"/>K’owashoshaga okurhwiri omu irhwe ye wabula bwayumva? Nîsi k’owagwîkaga isù ye kolaga wabula bubona?<verse eid="PSA 94:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10"/>K’ohanûla amashanja ye kolaga wabula buhana? K’erhi ye nayigîriza abantu obumanye obwo?<verse eid="PSA 94:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11"/>Kàli Nyakasane arhahabiri enkengêro z’abantu: <verse eid="PSA 94:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12"/>Yêhe ali muny’iragi Yâgirwa, omuntu oyemera wamubwiriza; oyemera wamuyigîriza irhegeko lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 94:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13"/>Mpu lyo arhengamwo entemu y’ensiku mbî, oku enshinda ya nyankola-maligo yahumbwa.<verse eid="PSA 94:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14"/>Nanga, Nyamwagirwa arhâyôze olubaga lwâge, arhâjandâge ebyâge by’omwîmo. <verse eid="PSA 94:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15"/>Okutwa emmanja kwoki kwashubira omu njira y’obushinganyanya, n’emirhima eshingânîne yoshi mwo ekola yashubira.<verse eid="PSA 94:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16"/>Ndi wajagindwîkiza ba nyankola-maligo? Lêro ndi wakabanjira omw’irhwe?<verse eid="PSA 94:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17"/>Nyamwagirwa andwîrakwo, ci oku isî iroho lyâni lirhaja omu balinda-mboho.<verse eid="PSA 94:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18"/>Erhi naciderha, nti: «Okugulu kwâni kurhasêra», nyumve Yâgirwa bwenêne nsêzire omu burhonyi bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 94:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19"/>Erhi naciyumva ebihamba binduga emurhima, nyumve oburhûlirize bwâwe bushagaluse omurhima omu nda.<verse eid="PSA 94:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20"/>Yâgirwa lushangi luci mweshi n’engombe y’endyâlya? Engombe ezûsa entambala mpu ly’irhegeko erhi irhegeko!<verse eid="PSA 94:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21"/>Bôhe mpu omûka gw’omushinganyanya bagushimbulule bagubone; n’omukò gw’orhajiraga kubî kuci bagulagirize.<verse eid="PSA 94:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22"/>Nyakasane arhâbule bwambêra lwâkiro, na Nnâmahanga ambêre ibuye nacîfulikaho.<verse eid="PSA 94:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23"/>Ababî bôhe abahengulira obubî bwâbo, n’obubî bwâbo bwo anabahezamwo, nêci, kuheza abaheza, Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 94:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94"/>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" altnumber="94" sid="PSA 95"/>
  <para style="s1">Rhuyimbire Nyakasane n’omwîshingo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1"/>Muyishe rhuhindire Nyakasane, rhuyakuze ibuye lyàrhucizagya.<verse eid="PSA 95:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2"/>Rhujè omu masù gâge rhucîtakîriremwo, rhuyimbe rhunasâmiremwo.<verse eid="PSA 95:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3"/>Bulya nêci Nyamwagirwa ali Nyamuzinda mukulu, anali Mwâmi okulîre banyamuzinda boshi.<verse eid="PSA 95:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4"/>Enyenga z’en’igulu aha nfune yâge zibà, n’amasongêrwe g’entondo goshi gâge. <verse eid="PSA 95:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5"/>N’enyanja eri yâge: bulya yêne wayijiraga, n’idaho lyûmu nalyo lyâge: nfune zâge zàlibumbaga.<verse eid="PSA 95:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6"/>Muyishe rhuharâmye Nyakasane rhufukame embere zâge bulya ye warhulemaga. <verse eid="PSA 95:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7"/>Bulyâla ali Nnâmahanga wîrhu, nîrhu rhuli lubaga lw’irango lyâge, rhuli bibuzi bitundwa n’okuboko kwâge.<verse eid="PSA 95:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8"/>Murhakarhangiyumva izù lyâge ene: mukaliyumva murhazigaga emirhima yinyu yâgârha, nka kulya yàgârhaga e Meriba, nka kulya yàgârhaga e Masa omw’irungu olusiku lw’amashumi.<verse eid="PSA 95:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9"/>Lulya lusiku basho bangeramwo, bulyâla bantangulaga bànabwîne ebi nkola.<verse eid="PSA 95:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10"/>Myâka makumi anni yoshi erhi oburhè bw’eryôla iburha bungwêrhe, naderha obwo nti: «Omurhima gw’olu lubaga kuhabuka gunahabusire», nti: «Ciru barhishi enjira zâni oku zigenda.»<verse eid="PSA 95:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11"/>Nacigasha muli obwo burhè, nti: «Barhâlabarhe omu iluhûkiro lyâni.»<verse eid="PSA 95:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95"/>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" altnumber="95" sid="PSA 96"/>
  <para style="s1">Mukuze Nyakasane, igulu lyoshi liri lyâge</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1"/>Yimbiri Nyakasane olwimbo luhyâhya, igulu lyoshi liyimbire Nyakasane<verse eid="PSA 96:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2"/>Yimbiri Nyakasane, mukuze izîno lyâge mukazimanyîsa bwaca bwayira oku kuciza aciza.<verse eid="PSA 96:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3"/>Irenge lyâge muliganîre omu karhî k’ab’emahanga, n’ebi ajizire by’okurhangâza mubimanyîse omu mashanja goshi.<verse eid="PSA 96:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4"/>Bulya Nyakasane arhali ntindi, anakwânîne aj’irenge, akwânîne ayôbohwe kulusha abandi ba nyamuzinda boshi.<verse eid="PSA 96:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5"/>Bulyâla banyamuzinda b’abapagani linali ibumba, Nyakasane yêhe ye wajiraga amalunga.<verse eid="PSA 96:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6"/>Obwâmi n’obumuleke bumushokolîre, n’entebe yâge buhashe n’obulangashane buyirikwo.<verse eid="PSA 96:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7"/>Mwe milala y’amashanja mweshi, hêrezi Nyakasane, hêrezi Nyakasane irenge n’obuhashe.<verse eid="PSA 96:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8"/>Hêrezi Nyakasane irenge ly’izîno lyâge. Mumurhûle enterekêro munahike omu côgo câge:<verse eid="PSA 96:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9"/>Muharâmye Nyakasane n’iyâmbala ly’ebujinji, mujugume embere zâge, mwe bihugo mweshi.<verse eid="PSA 96:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10"/>Muderhe omu karhî k’amashanja; mpu: «Nyakasane oyîmire!» Agwîsire igulu buzibu mpu lirhagihuligana; arhegeka n’amashanja burhalyâlyanya.<verse eid="PSA 96:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11"/>Amalunga gacîshinge, n’igulu lishembuke, enyanja ekunguze haguma n’ebimuli byoshi.<verse eid="PSA 96:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12"/>Amashwa gashagaluke haguma n’ebimuli byoshi, emirhi y’emuzirhu nayo esîme.<verse eid="PSA 96:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13"/>Omu masù ga Nyakasane, bulyâla ayishire, bulya ayîshitwîr’igulu olubanja; âtwira igulu olubanja n’obushinganyanya, ârhegeka n’amashaja burharhebana.<verse eid="PSA 96:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96"/>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" altnumber="96" sid="PSA 97"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyakasane Mwâmi wîrhu ayish’itwîra igulu olubanja</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1"/>Nyakasane ayîmire: igulu lishagaluke birhwa binji bicîshinge.<verse eid="PSA 97:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2"/>Omwizimya n’ebitù byacîbulwîre, byamugorha, obushinganyanya n’okurhalyalyanya, co ciriba entebe yâge edêkerîrekwo.<verse eid="PSA 97:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3"/>Ntakanjirwa omushokolîre; n’ababisha bamugosire ntakanjirwa arhabagezekwo lîno. <verse eid="PSA 97:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4"/>Emilazô yâge yo yamoleka igulu, idaho lyabwîne lyanajuguma.<verse eid="PSA 97:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5"/>Entondo zôhe kwo zidwîrhe zajongera omu masù ga Nyakasane nka muhomo, omu masù g’orhegeka igulu lyoshi.<verse eid="PSA 97:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6"/>Amalunga gadwîrhe gaganîra obushinganyanya bwâge, n’amashanja goshi gabwîne irenge lyâge.<verse eid="PSA 97:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7"/>Abagashâniza emirhi mibinje enshonyi zababumbire, na balya bacîkubagira enshanga kwo na kwo; banyamuzinda omu masù gâge bafukamire.<verse eid="PSA 97:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8"/>Yâgirwa, Siyoni ayumvîrhe anarhwamwo omunyu, n’ebishagala bya Yûda byoshi bishagalusire, erhi kutwa emmanja kwâwe kwinjà kurhuma.<verse eid="PSA 97:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9"/>Bulya oli enyanya ly’igulu lyoshi Yâgirwa, n’omu banyamuzinda boshi ntâye okuhisirekwo oku bulî.<verse eid="PSA 97:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10"/>Nyakasane azigira abashomba okubî, arhanahimwa kushîbirira obuzîne bw’abacêse bâge, yêne onabarhenza omu nfune z’abalenzi.<verse eid="PSA 97:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11"/>Obumoleke buyishîre omushinganyanya, n’ab’omurhima gushingânîne bàyishîrwe n’omwîshingo.<verse eid="PSA 97:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12"/>Sâmi muli Nyakasane mwe bashinganyanya, mukuze n’izîno lyâge litagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 97:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97"/>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" altnumber="97" sid="PSA 98"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyakasane ayîmire, ahimîne, ali Mucîranuzi mwinjà</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1"/>Lulanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:1">Yimbiri Nyakasane olwimbo luhyâhya, bulyâla ajizire ebirhangâzo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:1">Kwamuhimire okuboko kwâge kulyo, okuboko kwâge kutagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 98:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2"/>Nyakasane amanyîsize oku kuciza aciza, omu masù g’ab’emahanga, afulûla obushinganyanya bwâge.<verse eid="PSA 98:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3"/>Akengêra obwinjà bwâge n’obudahemuka bwâge, kuli bene-Israheli. Igulu lyoshi aha litanga n’aha liramuka, lyabona okuciza kwa Nnâmahanga wîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 98:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4"/>Igulu lyoshi lihindire Nyakasane, musîme, munashagaluke, munazihe.<verse eid="PSA 98:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5"/>Muzihire Nyakasane enzenze, mudumûle enzenze mudumûle n’olulanga.<verse eid="PSA 98:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6"/>Oku orhurhêra rhwalongêra, oku empembe zabûhwa, muhinde, muhindire omu masù ga Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 98:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7"/>Enyanja ekunguze haguma n’ebiyirimwo, igulu lidumize haguma n’abalirimwo. <verse eid="PSA 98:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8"/>Enyîshi zikome akagasha, oku entondo zahinda.<verse eid="PSA 98:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9"/>Zihindire omu masù ga Nyakasane, bulyâla ayiruka, bulyâla ayishire alirhegeka igulu; ârhegeka igulu n’obushinganyanya, ârhegeka n’amashanja burhalyâlyanya.<verse eid="PSA 98:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98"/>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" altnumber="98" sid="PSA 99"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda, Mwâmi mushinganyanya na Mutagatîfu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1"/>Nyakasane ayîmire, amashanja gadwîrhe gageramwo ogwa nyegenye. Atamîre oku nyanya lya bakerubi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">99, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kerubi: nsalamu za byûbi birîbirî z’omu ka-Nyamuzinda.</char></note>: igulu lidwîrhe lyajuguma.<verse eid="PSA 99:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2"/>Nyakasane arhabâ ntindi omu Siyoni, ye nakulîre amashanja goshi. <verse eid="PSA 99:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3"/>Izîno lyâge ligashâne, lirhali nshâhu balirhînye: liri litagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 99:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4"/>Ye yîmire omuzibu osîma obushinganyanya, wafundisire ebinwa bishingânîne, muli Yakôbo obushinganyanya buli bwâwe, n’emmanja we zitwa.<verse eid="PSA 99:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5"/>Mulengeze Nyakasane Nnâmahanga wîrhu, mufukamirize aha cisinde ahirakwo amagulu: ciri citagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 99:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6"/>Mûsa na Aroni bali omu badâhwa bâge, Samweli naye àli muli balya bàkazâgiyâkûza izîno lyâge. balya bàkazâgiyâkûza izîno lyâge naye anabayumvirhize.<verse eid="PSA 99:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7"/>Akazibashambâza anali omu nkingi y’ecitù: bakaziyumva amarhegeko gâge, bakaziyumva oku abarhegesire.<verse eid="PSA 99:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8"/>Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga wîrhu, mushâna wabayumvîrhîze, Nyamuzinda, mushâna wali obabêrîre obwonjo, ci bubî bwâbo bwarhumaga wacîhôla.<verse eid="PSA 99:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9"/>Mulengeze Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wîrhu, mufukamirize aha ntondo yâge ntagatîfu. Bulyâla Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wîrhu ali Mwimâna.<verse eid="PSA 99:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99"/>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" altnumber="99" sid="PSA 100"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo lw’engabo yasôkera omu ka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa kuvuga omunkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 100:1">Amahanga goshi gasâmire Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 100:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2"/>Mukolere Nyakasane n’enshagadu; mujè omu masù gâge n’omwîshingo.<verse eid="PSA 100:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3"/>Mumanye oku Nyakasane ye Nyamuzinda, Yêne warhulemaga nîrhu rhuli bâge, rhuli ishanja lyâge, rhunali bibuzi by’okw’irango lyâge.<verse eid="PSA 100:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4"/>Mushesherere omu mihango yâge erhi mwanakoma akagasha. muyongoberere omu côgo câge n’enyimbo; mumuhè irenge, mukuze izîno lyâge.<verse eid="PSA 100:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5"/>Bulya Nnâmahanga ali mwinjà, obwonjo bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango, arhanarheba ndi kurhenga abantu baburhwa.<verse eid="PSA 100:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100"/>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" altnumber="100" sid="PSA 101"/>
  <para style="s1">Omuhigo gw’omwimangizi w’olubaga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:1">Nkola nayimba obushinganyanya n’oburhonyi; we nazihira, Nyamwagirwa.<verse eid="PSA 101:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2"/>Mwo nayisha omu njira y’entagoma: mangaci wampikaho? Nyishire n’omurhima gw’obudahemuka, omu mwâni mwo na nene.<verse eid="PSA 101:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3"/>Akantu kabî ntâzigè kangera omu masù: enkola-maligo ntazibonakwo: nanga ntazibonakwo.<verse eid="PSA 101:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4"/>Omurhima mubî gurhagera aha ndi, ehiri hibî ntahikwîrirwa.<verse eid="PSA 101:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5"/>Omuntu wâshobeke owâbo bwifulikwè, nnamuheze, omuntu ocîbona, n’ogayana ntabakwîrirwa.<verse eid="PSA 101:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6"/>Abemêzi b’eci cihugo bo amasù gâni galikwo, nti bayûbake haguma nâni. Omuntu okerekera omu ntagoma, ye wâbà mwambali wâni.<verse eid="PSA 101:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7"/>Enkola-maligo erhâlabarhe omu mwâni, n’endyâla erhâyimange omu masù gâni.<verse eid="PSA 101:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8"/>Enkola-maligo ziri omu cihugo, nakaziregerera nazihungumula eziri omu lugo lwa Nyakasane, nâziheza zihwemwo.<verse eid="PSA 101:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101"/>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" altnumber="101" sid="PSA 102"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’omuntu ohanyagîre</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1"/>Musengero gw’omuntu ohanyagîre. Mw’obwo buhanya bwâge, Nyakasane ye arhuzirekwo emirenge yâge.<verse eid="PSA 102:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2"/>Yâgirwa oyumve guno musengero gwâni, onaleke izù lyâni likuhikekwo.<verse eid="PSA 102:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3"/>Omanye wakanfulika obusù bwâwe olusiku omutula gunwerhe. Ontege okurhwiri, hano nkuyâkûza oyirukire wayumva.<verse eid="PSA 102:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4"/>Yâgirwa ensiku zâni kwo zahirigisire nka mugî, n’orhuvuha rhwâni kwo rhudûrhubîre nka buhya bwa muliro.<verse eid="PSA 102:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5"/>Omurhima gundi omu nda bagudûrhwîre, kwo gwayûmirage nka hyasi, ebiryo ntaciyumvîrhi bindi oku murhima.<verse eid="PSA 102:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6"/>Nalasirage naganûkirwa, omubiri gwalinda gunyumira oku rhuvuha.<verse eid="PSA 102:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7"/>Kwo nkola nyôsire nka munyunyi w’omu mpinga, nka mutulama gw’ebigûkà.<verse eid="PSA 102:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8"/>Nacibêrire nie Karhahunga, nie Nyamulakà, kula akanyunyi kasigala kône-kône oku nyumpa.<verse eid="PSA 102:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9"/>Abashombanyi bâni badwîrhe balegerera banjâcira, nie basirahiragekwo n’izîno lyâni lyo badwîrhe bashârhamwo<verse eid="PSA 102:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10"/>Oluvù byo biryo ndwîrhe nashêga nnanyikule, na ngasi eci nanywa erhi cinali cigushemwo emirenge.<verse eid="PSA 102:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11"/>Burhè bwâwe n’omutula gwâwe byandwîrhîre okwo, bulyâla wannengezize wantimba okw’idaho.<verse eid="PSA 102:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12"/>Ensiku zâni kwo zishushire nka cihôho cirî-cirî, nâni niehe najìre nayûma nka hyasi.<verse eid="PSA 102:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13"/>Wêhe Nyakasane ho oyôrha ôbà, n’izîno lyâwe kuderhwa liderhwa omu maburhwa goshi.<verse eid="PSA 102:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14"/>Oyimuke obabalire Siyoni, bwacîre bw’okumubêra lukogo,<verse eid="PSA 102:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15"/>Bulyâla bambali bâwe barhahimwa kusîma amabuye gâge, barhakabula bwayumva omutula omu kubona Siyoni ashâbûka.<verse eid="PSA 102:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16"/>Wàbona oku amashanja gakuza izîno lyâwe obwo Nyakasane, n’abâmi b’igulu boshi bakenge irenge lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 102:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17"/>Hano ôbà wamâshubiyûbaka Siyoni, Siyoni yeshi aboneka omu irenge lyâge,<verse eid="PSA 102:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18"/>Nyakasane oyêrekere omusengero gw’abakenyi, buzira kulekêrera omulenge gwâbo.<verse eid="PSA 102:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19"/>Ebîrà biyandikirwe abâna baciburhwa, n’olubaga lwayishilemwa lukuze izîno lya Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 102:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20"/>Bulya Nyakasane abîre ali omu ndâro yâge, abîre ali emalunga àlîkira amasù okw’idaho,<verse eid="PSA 102:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21"/>Mpu ayumve omulenge gw’abashwêke bujà, analîkûze abatwirirwe okufà.<verse eid="PSA 102:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22"/>Na ntyo izîno lya Nyakasane lije irenge omu Siyoni, n’irenge lyâge liderhwe omu Yeruzalemu,<verse eid="PSA 102:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23"/>Olusiku amâmi n’amashanja gàja haguma mpu gakolere Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 102:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24"/>Emisî yampwêrîre njira, n’ensiku zâni bazitwîremwo.<verse eid="PSA 102:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25"/>Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga omanye wampêka nnanciri omu karhî k’ensiku zâni. Emyâka yâwe wêhe ho eyôrha ebà omu maburhwa n’amâburhwa.<verse eid="PSA 102:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26"/>Emurhondêro wajà aho wabandaho igulu, amalunga nago mukolo gw’amaboko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 102:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27"/>Byombi kuhêka byâheka, ci wêhe we Nyamubâho, byoshi kwo byâkoye nka bwikûnjè, kwo obihindula nka mwambalo binahinduke.<verse eid="PSA 102:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28"/>Wêhe orhahinduka, n’emyâka yâwe erhajira aha ehekîre.<verse eid="PSA 102:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 102:29"/>Abâna ba bambali bâwe bâyûbaka n’omurhûla, n’abâna bâbo bayôrhe bali omu masù gâwe ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 102:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102"/>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" altnumber="102" sid="PSA 103"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda abà buzigire</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1"/>Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:1">Murhima gwâni, kuza Nyamuzinda, n’ebindi oku ndubi y’omurhima bikuze izîno lyâge.<verse eid="PSA 103:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2"/>Murhima gwâni, kuza Nyamuzinda, ntà nshobôlo yâge oyibagirage.<verse eid="PSA 103:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3"/>Ye babalira ebyâha byâwe byoshi, Ye fumya obuzamba bwâwe bwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 103:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4"/>Ye yôkola obuzîne bwâwe omu nyenga, Ye kuyunjuza inêma n’obwonjo.<verse eid="PSA 103:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5"/>Obuzîne bwâwe ye buyunjuza minjà, obusole bwâwe ye bujira buhyâhya nka bwa nyunda.<verse eid="PSA 103:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6"/>Nyamuzinda ojira oburhondekezi, acîranulira abarhindubizîbwe.<verse eid="PSA 103:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7"/>Ye wabwîraga Mûsa amahwe gâge, n’abâna b’Israheli àbayêreka ebirhangâzo byâge.<verse eid="PSA 103:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8"/>Nyamuzinda ye ntahimwa lukogo na bwonjo, arhakunira duba, anali buzigire.<verse eid="PSA 103:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9"/>Arhakaliha kuhika okurhalusa, arhanarhulyûza kungana obubî bwîrhu,<verse eid="PSA 103:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10"/>Arharhujirira kungana ebyâha bîrhu, arhanarhulyûza kungana obubî bwîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 103:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11"/>Nka kulya amalunga gali enyanya ly’igulu kwo n’obuzigire bwâge bugwêrhe obuhashe oku bamurhînya.<verse eid="PSA 103:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12"/>Nka kulya ebushoshôkero eri kuli n’ebuzikiro, kwo Nnâmahanga ahirika kuli ebyâha bîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 103:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13"/>Nka kulya îshe w’abâna abà mwonjo oku bâna bâge, kwo na Nyamuzinda ali mwonjo oku bamurhînya.<verse eid="PSA 103:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14"/>Ayishi bwinjà eci rhwabumbagwamwo, arhahabiri oku rhuli luvù.<verse eid="PSA 103:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15"/>Omuntu ensiku zâge ziri nka hyasi, kwo amera nka bwâso bw’omu ishwa.<verse eid="PSA 103:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16"/>Empûsi ekamugerakwo erhi arhacihali, orhankacimanywa aha àbâga burhanzi.<verse eid="PSA 103:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17"/>Obuzigire bwa Nyamuzinda oku bamuyôboha bôhe buli bw’ensiku n’amango, n’oburhondekezi bwâge oku bâna b’abâna bâbo.<verse eid="PSA 103:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18"/>Oku babîkirira amalaganyo gâge, abakengêra amarhegeko gâge n’okujira ebi alonza.<verse eid="PSA 103:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19"/>Nnâmahanga àjêberize entebe yâge omu mpingu, omu bwâmi bwâge burhegeka byoshi.<verse eid="PSA 103:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20"/>Mukuze Nyakasane mwe bamalahika bâge mweshi, mwe ntwâli zâge, mwe mujir’akanwa kâge, mwe muyumva izù lyâge mumukuze.<verse eid="PSA 103:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21"/>Mukuze Nyakasane, mwe ngabo zâge mweshi, mwe bambali bâge, mwe mujira ngasi oku alonza, mumukuze.<verse eid="PSA 103:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22"/>Mukuze Nyakasane, mwe biremwa byâge mweshi, omu bwâmi bwâge mweshi mumukuze. Murhima gwâni kuza Nyakasane!<verse eid="PSA 103:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103"/>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" altnumber="103" sid="PSA 104"/>
  <para style="s1">Mushâna abumba Owalemaga igulu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1"/>Murhima gwâni kuza Nyakasane! Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda, mushâna oli mukulu kulusha!<verse eid="PSA 104:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2"/>Ocîbwîsire obukulu n’obwinjà, ocîhundikîre obulangashane nka cirondo.<verse eid="PSA 104:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3"/>Amalunga we wagakanûlaga nka lukangà, wayûbakira empamikwa zâwe oku nyanya z’amîshi. Ebitù wabijira ngâlè yâwe, byûbi bya bitù oyishakwo.<verse eid="PSA 104:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4"/>Empûsi wazijira ntumwa zâwe n’engulumira bashuba baganda bâwe.<verse eid="PSA 104:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5"/>Wayanka igulu walidêkereza oku bikondo byâlyo: lirhankafà lyâhuliganyire.<verse eid="PSA 104:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6"/>Waliyambika enyanja kulya bayambika omuntu omushangi, amîshi gamanana oku nyanya z’entondo.<verse eid="PSA 104:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7"/>Wabà nka wakankama gakûla idârhi, wakungula gageramw’omusisi.<verse eid="PSA 104:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8"/>Galya entondo n’amîno, gabungulukira omu rhubanda, gajidêka aha wagatwîrîre gâhekera.<verse eid="PSA 104:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9"/>Olubibi wagatwîrîre, garhakalutwa mpu gashubizisa igulu.<verse eid="PSA 104:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10"/>Enshôko wazirhegesire okurhengamwo enyîshi, ezi nyîshi ziyisha aha karhî k’entondo.<verse eid="PSA 104:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11"/>Ezi nyîshi zinywêsa ngasi c’erubala, ezîra ensimba zihêkakwo enyôrha.<verse eid="PSA 104:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12"/>Ezi nyîshi ebinyunyi biyâlikirakwo, ebi binyunyi biryogôlera omu mashaka.<verse eid="PSA 104:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13"/>We dômera entondo n’amîshi g’omu mpamikwa zâwe, we shalûla idaho n’eby’omu maboko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 104:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14"/>We mêza ebyâsi ebihêsi bikera n’olurhendebuka lushalûla omuntu.<verse eid="PSA 104:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15"/>We rhuma idaho lyarhengamwo omugati lirhengemwo n’irivayi lyahiramwo omuntu orukara, lirhengemwo orhuvurha omuntu acêsamw’obusù, lirhengemwo n’ehigati omuntu agalulamwo amarhî.<verse eid="PSA 104:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16"/>Emirhi ya Nyakasane, enduluma z’e Libano agwîkaga yêne, kulya zirya ziyigurhe.<verse eid="PSA 104:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17"/>Mwo ebinyunyi biyûbakira enyôgo; emihangâli omu nduluma eyûbakira.<verse eid="PSA 104:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18"/>Entondo ndi zo zihà empene z’erubala olwâbuko, n’amabuye go gahà ebishegeshe olwâkiro.<verse eid="PSA 104:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19"/>Wàjizire omwêzi mpu gukazigera amango n’izûba limanyire amango n’emunda lizikira.<verse eid="PSA 104:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20"/>Okabulula omwizimya lyo obudufu burumbâna, go mango eby’erubala byoshi bija byahulahula.<verse eid="PSA 104:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21"/>Go mango omwâna w’entale alakira omuhanya, go mango omwâna w’entale ahûna Nyamuzinda eci alya.<verse eid="PSA 104:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22"/>Erhi lukula arhanda lyo bifuluka, go mango bihêka îrò oku ncingo zâbyo.<verse eid="PSA 104:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23"/>Go mango omuntu arhabâlira omukolo, agulegererekwo birinde bijinga.<verse eid="PSA 104:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24"/>Mushâna Nyamwagirwa emikolo yâwe guli mwandu! Burhimanya wayijiragamwo yoshi: igulu lyoshi liyunjwîre biremwa byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 104:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25"/>Olole oku enyanja eluga n’oku egaliha: ebiyôga muli yo birhankaganjwa, ebinyinyî n’ebinênênè mwo bishundwa.<verse eid="PSA 104:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26"/>Amârho mwo gagera, n’envubu, biremwa byâwe nabyo, mwo bishârhira.<verse eid="PSA 104:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27"/>Byoshi byoshi wêne bilokakwo, mpu obiyikuze amango gâbyo gahika.<verse eid="PSA 104:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28"/>Nk’obihire binayunamirize birhôlogole, okabumbula enfune zâwe lyo bilugirwa.<verse eid="PSA 104:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29"/>Okafulika obusù bwâwe binakomakomye, okabinyaga omûka binafè bicîshubirire omw’idaho.<verse eid="PSA 104:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30"/>Okarhuma omûka gwâwe ebindi binalemwe; n’obusù bw’igulu onabuhindule buhyâhya.<verse eid="PSA 104:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31"/>Irenge lya Nyakasane liyimbwe ensiku n’amango: nêci Nyakasane acîtakir’emikolo yâge.<verse eid="PSA 104:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32"/>Kàli akalola okw’igulu linageremw’omusisi wâni! akahuma oku ntondo enatumbûke cigî!<verse eid="PSA 104:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33"/>Oku nciyisa omûka erhi kuyimba nanyimbira Nyakasane, oku ncihabà erhi kuziha nanzihira Nyamuzinda wîrhu olulanga.<verse eid="PSA 104:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34"/>Ebinwa byâni bimununire mâshi: nânacîzigiriza muli Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 104:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35"/>Abanya-byâha barheng’en’igulu, banyankola-maligo nabo barhacihabâga. Murhima gwâni kuza Nnâmahanga!<verse eid="PSA 104:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104"/>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" altnumber="104" sid="PSA 105"/>
  <para style="s1">Amaganîro g’okurhangâza g’Israheli</para>
  <para style="q1">Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1"/>Mukuze Nyakasane, muyakûze izîno lyâge, mumanyîse emikolo yâge omu karhî k’amashanja.<verse eid="PSA 105:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2"/>Mumuyimbire, mumuzihire ennanga, muyigâne ebinja àjizire by’okurhangâza.<verse eid="PSA 105:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3"/>Mucîtakîre izîno lyâge limâna, omurhima gwa ngasi balonza Nyakasane gurhimûkwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4"/>Musinze Nyakasane, musingirize obuhashe bwâge, mukaz’iyôrha mulongereza obusù bwâge.<verse eid="PSA 105:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5"/>Mukengêre emikolo y’okurhangâza àkozire, mukengêre ebisômerîne byâge n’ebinwa byâge.<verse eid="PSA 105:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6"/>Mw’oyo bene mwambali wâge Abrahamu mw’oyo bene enshâgi yâge Yakôbo.<verse eid="PSA 105:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7"/>Yêne ye Nyakasane Nnâmahanga, akanwa kâge igulu lyoshi karhegeka.<verse eid="PSA 105:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8"/>Arhayibagira endagâno yâge ensiku n’amango, arhayibagira akanwa àfundikiraga maburhwa cihumbi.<verse eid="PSA 105:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9"/>Kalya kanwa àfundikaga bo na Abrahamu, n’erya ndahiro àlahiriraga Izaki.<verse eid="PSA 105:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10"/>Kalya agwîkaga kashuba irhegeko kuli Yakôbo; kanaba ndagâno y’ensiku n’amango kuli Israheli.<verse eid="PSA 105:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11"/>Bulyâla aderha, erhi: «Nâkugabira ishwa lya Kanâni, bishube byo binyu birugu by’omwîmo».<verse eid="PSA 105:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12"/>Amango bàciri banyi, amango barhàli baciluga banabà bigolo eyo mwa bene;<verse eid="PSA 105:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13"/>amango bakazâgijà babunga, batwîka mwâmi bashige wundi.<verse eid="PSA 105:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14"/>Ago mango ntâye azigîre abarhindibuza, ciru banarhuma hajira abâmi ahana.<verse eid="PSA 105:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15"/>Mpu: «Murhahîraga mukahuma oku nshâgi zâni», mpu: «Murhahîraga mukashonza abageremwa bâni.»<verse eid="PSA 105:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16"/>Lêro anacirikira ecizombo omw’igulu, abanyaga ciru n’omugati bàkazagicîkubagira.<verse eid="PSA 105:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17"/>Erhi ànarhanzirigirhuma omuntu wabashokolera obwo; n’omuntu erhi ye Yozefu bàguzagya bujà.<verse eid="PSA 105:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18"/>Amagulu gâge erhi gali mazirike migozi, n’igosi lyâge erhi bamâlizonza budagulè.<verse eid="PSA 105:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19"/>Ayôrha ntyo kuhika akanwa àderhaga kâbà, n’akanwa ka Nnâmahanga kàmubêra.<verse eid="PSA 105:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20"/>Mwâmi arhumiza obwo mpu bamulîke, omurhambo w’amashanja amulîkûza.<verse eid="PSA 105:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21"/>Amujira mukulu w’enyumpa yâge, ànamubîsa ngasi hyâge hyoshi.<verse eid="PSA 105:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22"/>Mpu lyo akaziyigîriza abagula bâge nk’oku anabwîne yêne, anakazibwiriza abashamuka bâge oburhimanya.<verse eid="PSA 105:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23"/>Ago mango Israheli ahika omu Mîsiri, Yakôbo abalamira omu ishwa lya Kamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24"/>Olubaga lwâge lwanaciluga bwenêne, lwaluga lwarhaluka abashombanyi bâge.<verse eid="PSA 105:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25"/>Atulongola omurhima gw’abo bashombanyi mpu bamînyize olubaga lwâge banalenganye abambali.<verse eid="PSA 105:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26"/>Oku bundi arhuma omwambali Mûsa, arhuma n’omwîshogwa wâge Aroni.<verse eid="PSA 105:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27"/>Bakolera ebisômerîne byâge omu karhî kâbo. bakola ebirhangâzo omw’ishwa lya Kamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28"/>Arhuma omwizimya, endundulya yacîbêra, bàyumva ebinwa byâge.<verse eid="PSA 105:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29"/>Amîshi gâbo agahindula mukò, n’enfî zâbo azinigûza.<verse eid="PSA 105:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30"/>Ecihugo câbo cayunjula bikere, byahika ciru n’omu rhwonga rhw’oku bwâmi. <verse eid="PSA 105:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31"/>Aderha akanwa kwayisha irumbu ly’enzi, ecihugo coshi cayunjula mihusha.<verse eid="PSA 105:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32"/>Abashobôza olubula mpu nkuba, ecihugo câbo coshi acîrhulirakwo omuliro gw’engulumira.<verse eid="PSA 105:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33"/>Emizâbîbu yâbo n’emirhi yâbo y’amalehe ayihira oku’idaho, ashangula na ngasi murhi gwàli gumezire omu cihugo câbo.<verse eid="PSA 105:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34"/>Alîka akanwa, enzige zàgwa, amahanzi gôhe garhânkaganjirwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35"/>Zakera ngasi hyasi hyànali omu cihugo, zayôna ngasi mburho yanali omu mashwa gâbo.<verse eid="PSA 105:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36"/>Enfula z’omu cihugo câbo azilambika okw’idaho, ngasi lubere lwa magala gâbo lwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 105:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37"/>Abahulusa bacîyikîre amagerha n’amasholo, harhànali omuzamba ciru n’omuguma omu mashanja gâbo.<verse eid="PSA 105:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38"/>Ab’e Mîsiri erhi bàbona bàgenda basîma, bulyâla ebihamba byàli byamâbagwârha.<verse eid="PSA 105:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39"/>Alambûla ecitù cabacinga, atwâna omuliro gwabamolekera budufu.<verse eid="PSA 105:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40"/>Basengera, abarhumira enkwâle, anabashalûla n’omugati gw’empingu.<verse eid="PSA 105:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41"/>Abasa ibuye amîshi gàpamukamwo, gàhulula omu irungu nka lwîshi erubanda.<verse eid="PSA 105:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42"/>Ajira ntyo bulyâla àli akengîre akanwa kâge kimâma, kalya kanwa abwîraga omwambali Abrahamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43"/>Anahulusa olubaga lwâge omu nshagadu, n’abîshogwa bâge abalika n’omwîshingo.<verse eid="PSA 105:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44"/>Abashobôza ecihugo c’amashanja, banayîma omu by’abanyamahanga.<verse eid="PSA 105:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45"/>Ajira ntyo mpu lyo baseza akanwa kâge, banalange amarhegeko gâge!<verse eid="PSA 105:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105"/>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" altnumber="105" sid="PSA 106"/>
  <para style="s1">Obucîyunjuze bw’olubaga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1"/>Aleluya</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:1">Kuzagyi Nyakasane, bulya ali mwinjà, na bulyâla olukogo lwâge lubà lw’ensiku n’amango<verse eid="PSA 106:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2"/>Emikolo y’obuhashe bwa Nyakasane ndi wankayiderha wâni? Emyanzi y’obukuze bwâge ndi wankayiganîra wâni?<verse eid="PSA 106:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3"/>Bali bany’iragi abashimba amarhegeko, abajira okushingânîne ngasi mango.<verse eid="PSA 106:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4"/>Muhânyi onkengêre nâni omu burhonyi orhonyamw’olubaga lwâwe, okanye ontandûle onantabâle.<verse eid="PSA 106:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5"/>Lyo nyumva nâni omwîshingo gw’enshâgi zâwe, nshagaluke n’enshagadu y’olubaga lwâwe, nnancîtakîre haguma n’omwîmo gwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6"/>Kwo rhwabîhire aka balarha, rhwajizire ecâha, rhwashuba nkola-maligo.<verse eid="PSA 106:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7"/>Balarha nabo amango bâli e Mîsiri, barhashîbiriraga balola emikolo yâwe y’okurhangâza. Barhakengêraga obunji bw’olukogo lwâwe, ci erhi bahika aha Nyanja Ndukula, bagomera Ow’Enyanya bwenêne.<verse eid="PSA 106:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8"/>Kwônene yêhe abaciza oku bukulu bw’izîno lyâge, mpu babone obuhashe bwâge.<verse eid="PSA 106:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9"/>Akankamira Enyanja y’akaduku yakala, abageza omu mîshi nka kulya bayisha omu irungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10"/>Abakûla omu nfune z’omushombanyi, abalîkûza oku mubisha.<verse eid="PSA 106:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11"/>N’amîshi gamanukira oku bânzi, barharhengagamwo ciru omuguma walobôka.<verse eid="PSA 106:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12"/>Bajà bayêmêra ebinwa byâge obwo, banaciyîmba irenge lyâge.<verse eid="PSA 106:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13"/>Ci barharhamagiyibagira ebi àkozire, barhanalindaga mpu babone ebi ashubijira.<verse eid="PSA 106:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14"/>N’erhi bahika omw’irungu amîru gabagwârha banakuyumva, mpu: «Rhurhangigera Nyamuzinda muno mpinga».<verse eid="PSA 106:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15"/>Naye ayumva omusengero gwâbo, abarhumira ebyabalwâza engagira.<verse eid="PSA 106:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16"/>Kandi omu bihando bajà aho babà mitula ya Mûsa bo na Aroni Mutagatîfu wa Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 106:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17"/>Lêro igulu lyàyashama lyamirangusa Datani, lyamira n’engabo y’Abiramu.<verse eid="PSA 106:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18"/>Omuliro gwanacipamuka muli eyo ngabo, gwasingônola abagoma boshi.<verse eid="PSA 106:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19"/>Erhi bahika e Horebu batula akanina, banaharâmya oyo nyamuzinda bàtulaga n’amasholo.<verse eid="PSA 106:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20"/>Irenge lya Nyamuzinda baligerera oku mpanzi, eyi mpanzi enashêga ebyâsi.<verse eid="PSA 106:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21"/>Bayibagira Nnâmahanga wabacizagya, Nnâmahanga owabajiriraga ebisômerîne e Mîsiri!<verse eid="PSA 106:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22"/>Owakolaga ebingana halya omu cihugo ca Kamu, anajirira eby’okurhangâza aha Nyanja Ndukula,<verse eid="PSA 106:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23"/>Ali akola mpu abahungumule, ci omurhonyi wâge Mûsa amusengera, mpu ashukire arhabahungumulaga.<verse eid="PSA 106:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24"/>Kandi aho bagayaguza ecihugo nkana barhayêmêraga ebinwa byâge,<verse eid="PSA 106:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25"/>Bacîduduma omu birâlo byâbo, barhenguha Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 106:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26"/>Lêro alengeza okuboko acîgasha, mpu arhabalambisiri omu mpinga,<verse eid="PSA 106:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27"/>mpu akabà arhabashandâzizi omu banya-mahanga, akanaba arhabahabulîri omu bihugo bya bene!<verse eid="PSA 106:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28"/>Kandi bayanka bacîshwêkera kuli Bali-Peori, balyà n’oku nterekêro za banyamuzinda b’emifù.<verse eid="PSA 106:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29"/>Bamushonza obwo n’amabî gâbo, lêro obuhanya bwabajakwo.<verse eid="PSA 106:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30"/>Finehesi anaciyimuka obwo, akazitwa emmanja, bulya buhanya bwahwa. <verse eid="PSA 106:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31"/>Bamurhonyeza okwo obwo, omu maburhwa goshi n’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 106:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32"/>Kandi bamushomboza aha mîshi g’e Meriba, ciru Mûsa alinda atumula erhi bo bàrhuma.<verse eid="PSA 106:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33"/>Erhi bamujira burhè bwenêne bwenêne, aderha ebinwa bigalugalu.<verse eid="PSA 106:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34"/>Barhacihungumulaga amashanja Nyakasane àli ababwizire mpu bahungumule.<verse eid="PSA 106:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35"/>Bashandâla omu banya-mashanja, banayiga okukola ebihenyehenye byâbo. <verse eid="PSA 106:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36"/>Bakazigashâniza banyamuzinda b’ago mashanja, kwashuba kugwârhwa omu murhego kwâbo.<verse eid="PSA 106:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37"/>Bakazirherekêra abâna bâbo abashetani, abânarhabana n’abâna-nyere.<verse eid="PSA 106:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38"/>Babulaga omukò gw’abêru-kwêru, omukò gwa bagala bâbo n’ogwa bâli bâbo. Bàkagihanwa nterekêro emwa banyamuzinda b’e Kanâni, igulu lyahemuka n’omukò gwâbo.<verse eid="PSA 106:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39"/>Nabo bône bahemuka n’ebi bakazâg’ikola, bacîshûbula n’ebijiro byâbo.<verse eid="PSA 106:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40"/>Lêro Nyakasane anacigwârhwa n’omutula gw’olubaga lwâge, omwîmo gwâge gwamurhenga oku murhima.<verse eid="PSA 106:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41"/>Abalikira omu nfune z’amashanja, barhegekwa n’abashombanyi bâbo.<verse eid="PSA 106:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42"/>Balibuzibwa n’abo bashombanyi, banarhindibuzibwa nabo.<verse eid="PSA 106:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43"/>Abalikûzize kanji-kanji, ci bôhe bakazimujira burhè n’omurhima gwâbo mubî.<verse eid="PSA 106:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44"/>Ci kwône, erhi àyumva omulenge gwâbo, alolêreza amalibuko gâbo.<verse eid="PSA 106:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45"/>Akengêra omulagi àbalaganyagya, ayumva omutula bulyâla olukogo lwâge lubà lunji.<verse eid="PSA 106:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46"/>Abashobôza omurhima gw’olukogo, omu karhî k’abâli babagwâsire mpira,<verse eid="PSA 106:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47"/>Orhulîkûzagye Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu, onarhushûbûze rhurhenge ihanga lya bene. Rhujikuza izîno lyâwe limâna, rhunacîtakîre irenge lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48"/>Ayâgirwe omu myâka n’emyâka Nyakasane Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, n’olubaga lwoshi lushuze, mpu: «Amen!»<verse eid="PSA 106:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106"/>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" altnumber="106" sid="PSA 107"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda ye yôkola omuntu omu ngasi marhabi</para>
  <para style="q1">Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1"/>Mukuze Nyakasane bulya ali mwinjà, bulyâla olukogo lwâge luli lw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 107:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2"/>Bakuderhe abà Nyakasane àcungwîre boshi, balya boshi àkûzire omu nfune z’omubisha.<verse eid="PSA 107:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3"/>Balyâla àhamagaliraga ndêko nguma kurhenga omu mahugo, kurhenga emahanga g’ebushoshôkero bw’izûba kuhika emunda lizikira, kurhenga emahanga g’e mwênè kuhik'emukôndwe.<verse eid="PSA 107:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4"/>Bâli omw’irungu, omu mpinga, lêro bahabuka, balonza enjira y’ekà bayibula.<verse eid="PSA 107:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5"/>Bashalika banagwârhwa n’enyôrha, bayumva kukola kufà.<verse eid="PSA 107:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6"/>Bayâkûza Nyakasane muli obwo bulagîrire bwâbo, abalikûza muli ago malibuko.<verse eid="PSA 107:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7"/>Abalangûla enjira nnungêdu, erya yabahisa ahâli enyumpa.<verse eid="PSA 107:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8"/>Bavuga Nyakasane omunkwa oku lukogo lwâge, bamuvuga omunkwa oku binjà àjirîre ababurhwa n’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 107:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9"/>Bamuvuga omunkwa bulya àshalwîre omushalye, anagaza owali bufà n’enyôrha.<verse eid="PSA 107:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10"/>Bâli batamîre omu mpehema, omu ndundulya y’omwizimya, bànali bashwêke n’emigozi y’obuhanya n’ey’obudagulè,<verse eid="PSA 107:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11"/>kulya kubà bâli barhanzirirhenguha akanwa ka Nyamuzinda, bànali barhanzirigayaguza irhegeko ly’Ow’Enyanya bwenêne.<verse eid="PSA 107:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12"/>Lêro emirhima yâbo ayibarhuza omutula, gwabadandabaganya banabula cirhabîre.<verse eid="PSA 107:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13"/>Bayâkûza Nyakasane muli obwo bulagîrire bwâbo, abalîkûza kuli ago malibuko.<verse eid="PSA 107:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14"/>Abakûla omu mpehema, omu ndundulya y’omwizimya, emigozi yàlibashwêsire ayitwa.<verse eid="PSA 107:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15"/>Bavugage Nyakasane omunkwa oku lukogo lwâge, bamuvuge omunkwa oku binjà ajirîre ababurhwa n’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 107:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16"/>Kulya kubà àvungunywîre enyumvi z’amarhale, ashangula orhuhamikizo rhw’ecûma.<verse eid="PSA 107:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17"/>Balwâla erhi byâha byâbo birhuma, balibuka barhindibuka erhi bubî bwâbo burhuma.<verse eid="PSA 107:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18"/>Baderha mpu balye akalyo bayumve karhabali oku murhima; babona ekola ekuzimu bayêrekîre.<verse eid="PSA 107:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19"/>Bayâkûza Nyakasane muli obwo bulagîrire bwâbo, abalîkûza kuli ago malibuko.<verse eid="PSA 107:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20"/>Arhuma oluderho lwâge mpu lubafumye, lunabalikûze oku lufù.<verse eid="PSA 107:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21"/>Bavugage Nyakasane omunkwa oku lukogo lwâge, bamuvuge omunkwa oku binjà ajirîre ababurhwa n’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 107:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22"/>Banarherekêre enterekêro z’okumukuza, n’ebijiro byâge babiyimbe n’enshagadu.<verse eid="PSA 107:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23"/>Abàli omu bwârho mpu bayikire enyanja, mpu bayikire enyanja bajè burhunzi,<verse eid="PSA 107:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24"/>Babona ebi Nyakasane abamwo, Babonera ebisômerîne byâge omu karhî k’enyanja.<verse eid="PSA 107:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25"/>Abà nk’aderha n’akanwa: empûsi y’omulaba yazûka, amîshi gakazilwîra omu nyanya.<verse eid="PSA 107:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26"/>Garhalihamira emalunga, garhaliyandagalira ekuzimu, omurhima gwâbo gwashalama.<verse eid="PSA 107:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27"/>Batabataba banadandabagana nka balalwe, obulenga bàkazagicîkubagira bwahirigirha.<verse eid="PSA 107:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28"/>Lêro bayâkûza Nyakasane muli obwo bulagîrire bwâbo abalikûza kuli ago malibuko.<verse eid="PSA 107:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29"/>Erya mpûsi ndârhi ayigombya hyashuba hiboho hyashungurha, obukali bw’erya nyanja bwalemba.<verse eid="PSA 107:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30"/>Basîma erhi babona akahwenyenye kabà, abahêka abahisa ah’izîko balonzagya okuhika.<verse eid="PSA 107:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31"/>Bavugage Nyakasane omunkwa oku lukogo lwâge, bamuvuge omunkwa oku binjà àjirîre ababurhwa n’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 107:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32"/>Bamukuze omu ndêko y’abantu, banamuyimbire irenge lyâge aha karhî k’abagula.<verse eid="PSA 107:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33"/>Ezàli nyîshi azihindula mpinga, n’ezàli nshôko azihindula idaho lya canda.<verse eid="PSA 107:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34"/>Ecihugo câkazâgiyêra acîhindula mushenyi gwa munyu, erhi bubî bwa bantu bamwo burhuma.<verse eid="PSA 107:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35"/>Eryàli irungu alihindula cidêka ca mîshi, n’idaho lyàli lya canda alihindula nshôko zàburha enyîshi.<verse eid="PSA 107:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36"/>Ayûbasamwo abantu bâli bufà n’obuligo, n’akalengwe, bayûbakamwo olugo lwanakaderhwa.<verse eid="PSA 107:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37"/>Bahinga amashwa, bagwîka emizâbîbu, barhenzamwo birhali binyi.<verse eid="PSA 107:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38"/>Abagisha baluga bwenêne, abahà na bintu birhali binyi.<verse eid="PSA 107:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39"/>Ci kwône bajà banyiha, gashuba mâhungà erhi kuhanyagala n’okulagîrira kwâbo kurhuma.<verse eid="PSA 107:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40"/>Agaya abaluzi bwenêne, àbahabuliraga omw’irungu, omu nyâmà wandya,<verse eid="PSA 107:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41"/>akula omukenyi mwo bulya buhanya, analuza emilala yashuba minji nka masô.<verse eid="PSA 107:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42"/>Omushinganyanya abwîne anasîmire, ci ababî boshi aha irhama bôhe banacigwêrhe.<verse eid="PSA 107:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43"/>Oli murhimanya, ashimbe ebi byoshi, arhimanye anakengêre bwinjà emikolo ya Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 107:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107"/>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" altnumber="107" sid="PSA 108"/>
  <para style="s1">Lwimbo lwa sêzi na musengero gw’olubaga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1"/>Lwimbo. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 108:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2"/>Omurhima gwâni guli muzibu Nyamwagirwa, omurhima gwâni gurhahombagana; nkola nakuzihira nnankuyigânire.<verse eid="PSA 108:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3"/>Tulûka murhima gwâni; tulûka lulanga lwâni, tulûka nzenze yâni, nkola natula obucè buzûke.<verse eid="PSA 108:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4"/>Nâkukuza omu karhî k’amashanja, Nyamwagirwa, nâkuzihira olulanga omu karhî k’ab’ekulî;<verse eid="PSA 108:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5"/>bulyâla olukogo lwâwe luli lunji: luhisire emalunga, oburhabêsha bwâwe nabwo, buhisire oku nkuba.<verse eid="PSA 108:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6"/>Nyamuzinda mâshi orhangibà nka wacîyerekanira oku nyanya z’amalunga, irenge lyâwe libonekane omw’igulu lyoshi.<verse eid="PSA 108:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7"/>Orhurhabâle n’okuboko kwâwe onarhuyumve, lyo abarhonyi bâwe balobôka.<verse eid="PSA 108:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8"/>Nyamuzinda erhi ali omu ngombe yâge, ayisha erhi nkola nayimuka njigaba Siyoni, n’olubanda lwa Sukoti ndugabire bandi.<verse eid="PSA 108:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9"/>Erhi ishwa lya Galadi libà lyâni n’erya Manasè kwo na kwo, Efrayimu yêhe yo mpenzi y’irhwe lyâni na Yûda ye kayundwè wâni.<verse eid="PSA 108:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10"/>Mowabu lwo lwôgero ncîkalabiramwo, Edomu yêhe namugera oku lwêru lw’enda, na Filistiya namuhima kano kanya.<verse eid="PSA 108:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11"/>Lêro ndi wakampisa omu lugo luzibu? Ndi wakampisa cingana e Edomu wâni?<verse eid="PSA 108:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12"/>Nnâmahanga kali we wanarhucinagizagya wâni! Kali orhacidwîrhi wayisha okarhabâla mwe n’abalwî bîrhu!<verse eid="PSA 108:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13"/>Mâshi mâshi orhurhabâle kw’oyu mubisha, bulyâla okurhabâlwa n’abantu kuli busha.<verse eid="PSA 108:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 108:14"/>Rhwakola emyônè oku burhabâle bwa Nnâmahanga, yêne ya wâjonjaga abashombanyi bîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 108:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108"/>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" altnumber="108" sid="PSA 109"/>
  <para style="s1">Endûlù y’omurhumisi wa Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:1">Nnâmahanga, we ncîtakîra, orhahulike, orhahulike,<verse eid="PSA 109:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2"/>bulyâla bankâyîrekwo ebinwa by’obulyâlya.<verse eid="PSA 109:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3"/>bambwîzire akanwa k’obunywesi, banzihula ebinwa by’obushombanyi, bananshimbulula buzira igwârhiro.<verse eid="PSA 109:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4"/>Oku niehe ndi wa buzigire, bôhe babà kushobeka banshobeka, omu kubona ntyo nagwira nasalira.<verse eid="PSA 109:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5"/>Oku minjà mbajirira bôhe bangalulira amabî, n’oku buzigire bwâni kuli bo, bôhe bangalulira enshombo.<verse eid="PSA 109:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6"/>Orhangimunîkakwo omusirhe, n’omubisha arhangimuyimanga aha burhambi.<verse eid="PSA 109:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7"/>Irhondo âkaja lubanja, lurhahambûlaga, n’okusamba kwâge kushube kuyâga.<verse eid="PSA 109:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8"/>Ensiku zâge bazitwemwo, owundi ayîme omu byâge.<verse eid="PSA 109:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9"/>Abagala bashube nfûzi, na mukâge ashube mukana.<verse eid="PSA 109:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10"/>Abagala ntâye obayûbakiraga, bahabuke bajè bahulahula, bahulusibwe ciru n’omu bigûkà by’enyumpa zâbo.<verse eid="PSA 109:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11"/>Oyu àlire omwenda amucêse buroha, n’owagera amunyâge ehi àli acîbîkîre.<verse eid="PSA 109:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12"/>Arhabonaga cafira bwonjo, n’enfûzi zâge zirhafàga zâbuganyire omuzîre w’olukogo.<verse eid="PSA 109:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13"/>Iburha lyâge lihwêre okw’itumu, n’izîno lyâge lihirigirhe oku mwîmo murhanzi. <verse eid="PSA 109:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14"/>Nyakasane âkengêre obubî bwa bashakulu wâge, n’ecâha ca nnina cirhazâzibagwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15"/>Biyôrhe bikengêrwa na Nyakasane, anamuzazc hano igulu, irhondo ntâye ocimukengêraga.<verse eid="PSA 109:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16"/>Yêhe arhadesiri mpu abè lukogo, ci agwîra ayâbula omukenyi muhanya, olyâla oli bufà n’omutula mpu amuholêreze.<verse eid="PSA 109:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17"/>Obwôla asîmire okuhehêrerwa, ahehêrerwe, n’obwôla arhalonza mugisho, gumurhengekwo.<verse eid="PSA 109:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18"/>Obuhanya bumubwîke nka mushangi, bumuje omu nda nka mîshi, bumuje omu njingo nka mavurha.<verse eid="PSA 109:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19"/>Bumuzonge nka gwo mushangi acîbwîka, nka gwo mukaba ayôrha ayambala.<verse eid="PSA 109:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20"/>Abagendikanshobeka n’abanderhcra ebirhali byo, Nyakasane abahè olwo luhembo.<verse eid="PSA 109:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21"/>Wêhe, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, ondwîrekwo erhi izîno lyâwe lirhuma, onandîkûze bulyâla olukogo lwâwe buzigire.<verse eid="PSA 109:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22"/>Obwîne oku ndi mukenyi nnampanyagîre, n’omurhima gwanfundîre omu nda.<verse eid="PSA 109:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23"/>Nahwîre nka cihôho ca mafuluko, nazûzûrhîre nka luzige empûsi ehunisire.<verse eid="PSA 109:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24"/>Nkola ndwîrhe nakomanya amadwî erhi kucîshalisa kurhuma, n’omubiri gwâni gwahosire erhi kubula mavurha kurhuma.<verse eid="PSA 109:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25"/>Nakwâmirwe nanashekerwa narhama, abadwîrhe bambona irhwe badwîrhe badunda.<verse eid="PSA 109:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26"/>Ontabâle, Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, ondîkûze wêne oku lukogo lwâwe,<verse eid="PSA 109:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27"/>babone oku lukogo lwâwe lukozire ebyo, oku wêne we oncizize, Yâgirwa Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 109:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28"/>Bampehêrere ci wêhe ongishe, àbanshimbire baturutumbe, mwambali wâwe yêhe acishinge.<verse eid="PSA 109:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29"/>Abakaz’indega enshonyî zibabumbe; okurumbaguza kwâbo kubabwîke nka cirondo.<verse eid="PSA 109:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30"/>Niehe nayimbira Nyakasane n’akanwa kâni, namukuza omu karhî k’engabo y’abantu:<verse eid="PSA 109:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31"/>Bulyâla anayîmangire omukenyi, mpu lyo amulîkûza omu bazûzi.<verse eid="PSA 109:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109"/>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" altnumber="109" sid="PSA 110"/>
  <para style="s1">Obwâmi, Obukulu n’Obudâhwa bwa Masiha</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:1">Nyakasane àjire aho abwîra Nnawîrhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">110, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyakasane abwîra Nnawîrhu: Nyamuzinda yênene odesire ntyôla: <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7-9">Lul 2, 7-9</ref></char>. - Bwârhala ekulyo kwâni: ahantu h’olukengwa. Masiha âbà n’ecikono c’obwâmi, âbà Mudâhwa w’ensiku n’amango: <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 22:44">Mat 22, 44</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:34-35">Ebj 2, 34-35</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:13">Hbr 1, 13</ref></char>.</char></note> akanwa, erhi: «Bwârhala ekulyo kwâni, ntangiyandaza abashombanyi bâwe aha magulu gâwe».<verse eid="PSA 110:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2"/>Nyakasane ayanka itumu ly’obwamî bwâwe alirhogeza oku Siyoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">110, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kurhenga e Siyoni: Masiha âbà côkola w’abantu boshi. <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2">Lul 2</ref></char> na <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 71">Lul 71</ref></char>.</char></note>, mpu: «Nj’oyîme omu karhî k’abashombanyi bâwe.»<verse eid="PSA 110:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3"/>Mpu: «Kurhenga okuburhwa kwâwe oli n’obukulu omu bulangashane bw’obutagatìfu: niene nakuburhaga embere z’omucêracêra nka lumè.»<verse eid="PSA 110:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4"/>Nyakasane acîgashire arhanatwe omu kanwa kâge: «Oli mudâhwa w’ensiku n’amango kulya kwa Melkisedeki.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">110, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kurhenga e Siyoni: Masiha âbà côkola w’abantu boshi. <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2">Lul 2</ref></char> na <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 71">Lul 71</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="PSA 110:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5"/>Nyakasane aha kulyo kwâwe ali: olusiku atulumukirwa lyo amâmi-mâmi gaherêrherwa.<verse eid="PSA 110:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6"/>Go mango olw’amashanja lwâmanywa, emirhumba elundumane; amarhwe gahinagwe omw’igulu lyoshi.<verse eid="PSA 110:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7"/>Omu njira mîshi ga muhona ânywa, kurhume alengeza irhwe.<verse eid="PSA 110:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110"/>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" altnumber="110" sid="PSA 111"/>
  <para style="s1">Irenge ly’emikolo ya Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1"/>Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 111:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:1">Nkola nakuza Nyakasane n’omurhima gwâni gwoshi, omu ndêko y’abemêzi n’ey’abashinganyanya.<verse eid="PSA 111:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2"/>Emikolo ya Nyakasane erhankagerwa ekwânîne emanywe n’abayisîma boshi.<verse eid="PSA 111:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3"/>Omukolo gwâge bubà bwâmi bunabà bulangashane; n’obushinganyanya bwâge buyôrha buhabà ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 111:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4"/>Ajijire ebirhangâzo analonza bikazikengêrwa, Nyakasane abâ wa bwonjo anabà wa lukogo.<verse eid="PSA 111:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5"/>Abamukenga àbahire ebiryo, ayôrha akengêra endagâno yâge ensiku zoshi. <verse eid="PSA 111:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6"/>Amanyîsize olubaga lwâge obuhashe bw’emikolo yâge, erhi àlushobôza eby’amashanja.<verse eid="PSA 111:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7"/>Emikolo y’amaboko gâge erhabâ ya bunywesi enabà mimâna; amarhegeko gâge goshi gali magwîke buzibu.<verse eid="PSA 111:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8"/>Gali magwîke akantashugulwa, oku nsiku n’amango, garhajiragwa n’oluhinzo erhi n’obulyâlya.<verse eid="PSA 111:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9"/>Arhumira olubaga lwâge owalucungula, àjizire endagâno yâge ebè ya nsiku n’amango, izîno lyâge liri limâna liri na lya kukengwa.<verse eid="PSA 111:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10"/>Okurhînya Nyakasane gwo murhondêro gw’obushinganyanya, ngasi bamukenga boshi, bo barhondekezi b’okunali; irenge lyâge liyôrhe lihabà ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 111:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111"/>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" altnumber="111" sid="PSA 112"/>
  <para style="s1">Iragi ly’omuntu mushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1"/>Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 112:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:1">Iragi lyâge omuntu orhînya Nyakasane, omuntu oyumva anunîrwe n’amarhegeko gâge.<verse eid="PSA 112:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2"/>iburha lyâge lyâyishilushana hano igulu, n’obûko bw’abashinganyanya bwâbona omugisho.<verse eid="PSA 112:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3"/>Omu mwâge mwâyunjula buhirhi n’ebirugu, n’obushinganyanya bwâge buli bwa kuyôrha ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 112:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4"/>Omu mwizimya ali kamole k’ab’emirhima nkana, obwonjo, olukogo, oburhimanya, ye nnabyo.<verse eid="PSA 112:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5"/>Omuntu mwinjà abâ wa lukogo, ebyâge arharhînya bwabihoza abandi, ebyâge byoshi burhondekezi bubirhegeka.<verse eid="PSA 112:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6"/>Omuntu mushinganyanya ntà mango ahuligane, na ntà mango ânayibagirwe.<verse eid="PSA 112:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7"/>Arhayôboha mwanzi mubî, omurhima gwâge guyôrha gudekerire, bulya Nnâmahanga acîkubagira.<verse eid="PSA 112:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8"/>Omurhima gwâge kusêra gusêra, arhishi entemu byo bici. abashombanyi bâge enshonyi zababumba erhi anasinza.<verse eid="PSA 112:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9"/>Arhahimwa kuhâna n’okushîbirira abakenyi, obushinganyanya bwâge burhakahwa kuderhwa, irenge lyâge kugandâza lyanagandâza.<verse eid="PSA 112:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10"/>Enkola-maligo ekamubona enazizimire emurhima, ekenyeze amîno eje yagangabala, enyifinjo z’abalenzi kufanânda zinafanânda.<verse eid="PSA 112:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112"/>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" altnumber="112" sid="PSA 113"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuli Nyamuzinda w’irenge n’ow’olukogo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1"/>Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:1">Mwe bambali ba Nyakasane, mukuze, mukuze izîno lya Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 113:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2"/>Lij’irenge izîno lya Nyakasane, bunôla n’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 113:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3"/>Kurhenga ebushoshôkero bw’izûba na kuhika emunda lizikira, likuzibwe izîno lya Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 113:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4"/>Nyakasane Nnâmahanga w’abantu boshi, irenge lyâge liyunjwîre empingu yoshi.<verse eid="PSA 113:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5"/>Ndi oli aka Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wîrhu, ôbà enyanya bwenêne,<verse eid="PSA 113:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6"/>ôyûnama kurheng’enyanya alola idako, abone ebiri empingu n’en’igulu?<verse eid="PSA 113:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7"/>Ye rhenza omuzamba omu katulo Ye nayimanza omukenyi, amukûle oku cavu.<verse eid="PSA 113:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8"/>Amutamaze oku ntebe haguma n’abaluzi, haguma n’abaluzi b’omulala gwâge.<verse eid="PSA 113:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9"/>Ye tamaza owali ngumba omu nyumpa; amuhè obusîme bw’okubà nnina w’abâna.<verse eid="PSA 113:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113"/>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" altnumber="113A" sid="PSA 114"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo lwa Basâka</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1"/>Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 114:1">Olusiku Israheli arhenga e Mîsiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 114:1">olusiku enyumpa ya Yakôbo erhenga omu lubaga lw’abahalanjisi,<verse eid="PSA 114:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2"/>Yûda lwashuba luhêro lwâge, Israheli bwashuba bwâmi bwâge.<verse eid="PSA 114:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3"/>Enyanja yabona okwo yakûla omulindi, Yordani ashubira nyuma.<verse eid="PSA 114:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4"/>Entondo zahama nka nganda-buzi. Orhurhondo rhwacanacana nka bâna-buzi.<verse eid="PSA 114:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5"/>Wanyanja kurhi wamâbà obu wayâka? Yordani kurhi oku washubira nyuma?<verse eid="PSA 114:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6"/>Kurhi mwe birhondo obu mwahama nka ngandabuzi? Kurhi ninyu mwe rhurhondo obu mwacanacana nka bâna-buzi?<verse eid="PSA 114:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7"/>Igulu, nêci dirhimana omu masù ga Nyakasane, omu masù ga Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo.<verse eid="PSA 114:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8"/>Owahindulaga ibuye cidêka ca mîshi, n’olwâla aluhindula nshôko.<verse eid="PSA 114:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114"/>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" altnumber="113B" sid="PSA 115"/>
  <para style="s1">Obukulu n’obwinjà bwa Nyamuzinda w’okuli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1"/>Irenge arhali rhwe Yâgirwa, ci izîno lyâwe Waliha, bulya oli mwinjà orhanarhebana.<verse eid="PSA 115:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2"/>Cici càkazirhuma ab’emahugo barhukangula, mpu: «Ngahi Nyamuzinda wâbo aligi?»<verse eid="PSA 115:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3"/>Nyamuzinda wîrhu omu mpingu abâ, ebi alonzize byoshi byo anajira.<verse eid="PSA 115:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4"/>Ebi bagashâniza abo biri bya cûma, biri bya masholo, bunali bushanja burhenga omu nfune z’abantu.<verse eid="PSA 115:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5"/>Bigwêrhe akanwa birhanaderha, bigwêrhe amasù birhanabona.<verse eid="PSA 115:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6"/>Bijira amarhwîri birhanayumva, bijira amazûlu birhanabayirwa na cici.<verse eid="PSA 115:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7"/>Bijira amaboko birhanahuma kantu, bijira amagulu birhanarhenga aha biri; ciru ntà izù lirhenga ekanwa kâbyo.<verse eid="PSA 115:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8"/>Ababitula babishushe, ngasi boshi babihirakw’omurhima babishushe.<verse eid="PSA 115:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9"/>Enyumpa y’Israheli yôhe Nyakasane ecîkubagira, Ye Mufungizi wâbo ye na mpenzi yâbo.<verse eid="PSA 115:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10"/>Enyumpa ya Aroni yôhe Nyakasane ecîkubagira, Ye Mufungizi wâbo ye na mpenzi yâbo.<verse eid="PSA 115:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11"/>Abarhînya Nyakasane yêne bahirakwo omurhima ye mufungizi wâbo ye na mpenzi yâbo.<verse eid="PSA 115:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12"/>Nyakasane arharhuyibagira, kugisha arhugisha, kugisha agisha enyumpa y’Israheli, kugisha agisha enyumpa ya Aroni.<verse eid="PSA 115:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13"/>Agisha ngasi boshi barhînya Nyakasane, abarho n’abakulu.<verse eid="PSA 115:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14"/>Nyakasane âmmuluza, mw’oyo n’abâna binyu,<verse eid="PSA 115:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15"/>Mw’oyo mukola mugwêrhe omugisho gwa Nyakasane, Ye wajiraga empingu n’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 115:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16"/>Empingu ebà ya Nyakasane, igulu lyôhe abantu bàlishobwîre.<verse eid="PSA 115:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17"/>Arhali abalinda-mboho bo bakuza Nyakasane, arhali abàjîre ekuzimu bo bamukuza.<verse eid="PSA 115:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18"/>Ci rhwe rhuzîne rhwe rhwakuza Nyakasane, buno n’omu myâka n’emyâka.<verse eid="PSA 115:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115"/>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" altnumber="115" sid="PSA 116"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuvuga omunkwa</para>
  <para style="q1">Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1"/>Ndwîrhe nacîshinga: bulya Nyakasane ayumvîrhîze izù ly’omusengero gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 116:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2"/>Antege okurhwiri, olusiku mmusengîre.<verse eid="PSA 116:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3"/>Emibanga y’olufù enziririnzire n’entanya z’olufù zantubire, oburhè n’amaganya bingwêrhe.<verse eid="PSA 116:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4"/>Nyâkûzize izîno lya Nyakasane mâshi Yâgirwa, ocize obuzîne bwâni.<verse eid="PSA 116:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5"/>Nyakasane abâ mwonjo na murhondekezi, Nyamuzinda wîrhu arhahimwa lukogo.<verse eid="PSA 116:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6"/>Abanyi bo Nyakasane alwîra, nali mubî ananciza.<verse eid="PSA 116:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7"/>Oshubiluhûka murhima gwâni, bulya Nyakasane akuyumvirhize<verse eid="PSA 116:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8"/>Omûka gwâni alilikûzize oku lufù, amasù gâni àgahôrhola emirenge, n’amagulu gâni arhuma garhahirima.<verse eid="PSA 116:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9"/>Nâbera haguma na Nyakasane, omu cihugo c’abazîne.<verse eid="PSA 116:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116"/>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" altnumber="116" sid="PSA 117"/>
  <para style="s1">Mwe mashanja mweshi, mukuze Nyakasane</para>
  <para style="q1">Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1"/>Mukuze Nyakasane, mwe mashanja mweshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 117:1">muyimbe irenge lyâge, mwe bihugo mweshi.<verse eid="PSA 117:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2"/>Bulya obuzigire bwâge kuli rhwe busêzire buzibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 117:2">n’oburhabêsha bwa Nyakasane buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 117:2"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117"/>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" altnumber="117" sid="PSA 118"/>
  <para style="s1">Obugashânize bw’olusiku lukulu lw’Ebihando</para>
  <para style="q1">Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1"/>Muvuge Nyakasane omunkwa bulya ali mwinjà, bulya obwonjo bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 118:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2"/>Ab’omu Israheli bakuderhe, mpu: «Obwonjo bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.»<verse eid="PSA 118:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3"/>Ab’omu mwa Aroni bakuderhe, mpu: «Obwonjo bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.»<verse eid="PSA 118:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4"/>Abarhînya Nyakasane bakuderhe, mpu: «Obwonjo bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.»<verse eid="PSA 118:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5"/>Erhi omutula gungwêrhe nayâkûza Nyakasane, arhega izù lyâni okurhwiri anandîkûza.<verse eid="PSA 118:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6"/>Nêci Nyakasane ali haguma nâni: ntà bwôba bungwêrhe; kurhi abantu banjira?<verse eid="PSA 118:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7"/>Nyakasane ali haguma nâni: ye burhabâle bwâni, abanshomba nâbona oku enshonyi zâbabumba.<verse eid="PSA 118:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8"/>Aha wankacîkubagira abantu wakayâkira hali Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 118:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9"/>Aha wakacîkubagira abagale, wakayâkira hali Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 118:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10"/>Amashanja goshi nabona gangorha, oku izîno lya Nyakasane nagagezamwo engôrho.<verse eid="PSA 118:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11"/>Gànyisha ekulyo n’ekulembe, oku izîno lya Nyakasane nagahinaga.<verse eid="PSA 118:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12"/>Ganyishakwo nka njuci, gayâkiriza nka ngulumira omu mishûgi: oku izîno lya Nyakasane nagalabarhanya.<verse eid="PSA 118:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13"/>Gàntunika, gàntunika nalonzihirima, ci Nyakasane àngalukira.<verse eid="PSA 118:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14"/>Nyakasane ye busêre na buzibu bwâni, ye wambêrîre Mugaruka.<verse eid="PSA 118:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15"/>Izù ly’okucîshingira okulobôka, liyumvîkane omu bihando by’abashinganyanya, mpu: «Okulyo kwa Nyakasane kwakozire akirumè.»<verse eid="PSA 118:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16"/>Kulyo kwa Nyakasane kwanzûsize, mpu: «Okulyo kwa Nyakasane kirumè kwakozire.»<verse eid="PSA 118:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17"/>Ntâcife, kulama nkola nalama, nkaziyimba emikolo ya Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 118:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18"/>Buhane Nyakasane àbâga nk’ampà, ci kurhàli kundîkira walufù.<verse eid="PSA 118:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19"/>Mumpamûlire olumvi lw’obushinganyanya, mpikemwo mvuge Nyakasane omunkwa.<verse eid="PSA 118:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20"/>Muhango gwa Nyakasane ogu, bashinganyanya bagugeramwo.<verse eid="PSA 118:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21"/>Nakuvuga omunkwa kulya kubà wanyumvîrhîze, wanambêrîre Mugaruka.<verse eid="PSA 118:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22"/>Ibuye abûbasi bagayaguzagya, lyàyishiriba kaboko ka nyumpa.<verse eid="PSA 118:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23"/>Okwôla Nyakasane wakujiraga, kurhangâzize amasù gîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 118:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24"/>Lulya lusiku Nyakasane àjirag’olu, rhucîshinge rhunasîme muli lwo.<verse eid="PSA 118:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25"/>Yâgirwa mâshi, orhucize, Yâgirwa mâshi orhulwîrekwo.<verse eid="PSA 118:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26"/>Ayâgirwe Oyishire okw’izîno lya Nyakasane, rhukugishîre omu nyumpa ya Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 118:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27"/>Mushâna Nyamwagirwa yêne Nyakasane, rhwabwîne arhumolekera. Mucîgwâse haguma, munafumbarhe amashami gagazire oku byâsi; mujè mwahinda muhike ah’irhwêrhwê ly’oluhêro.<verse eid="PSA 118:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28"/>Ôbà Nyamuzinda wâni, nkuvuzire omunkwa, Nyamuzinda wâni nkukuzize.<verse eid="PSA 118:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29"/>Muvuge Nyakasane omunkwa bulyâla ali mwinjà, bulyâla obwonjo bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 118:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118"/>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" altnumber="118" sid="PSA 119"/>
  <para style="s1">Irhegeko lya Nyamuzinda kabà kamole kabwîriza ecidâga obugula</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1"/>Bajira iragi ababâ omu njira nnungêdu, abashimbûlira irhegeko lya Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 119:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2"/>Bajira iragi abashimba akanwa kâge, bamulonze n’omurhima gwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 119:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3"/>Balya babula bwakola amabî, basêre omu njira zâge,<verse eid="PSA 119:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4"/>Wêne wahâna amarhegeko gâwe, mpu abantu bagashimbe bwinjà-bwinjà.<verse eid="PSA 119:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5"/>Mâshi nâni enjira zâni zikomere, omu kulanga akanwa kâwe mâshi.<verse eid="PSA 119:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6"/>Lyoki nakabula bugwârhwa n’enshonyi, amango ndikire amasù oku marhegeko gâwe goshi.<verse eid="PSA 119:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7"/>Nâkuvuga omunkwa n’omurhima mwimâna, hano mbà namâyîga ebinwa byâwe by’obushinganyanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8"/>Nâbêra oku marhegeko gâwe, nâwe omanyâge wakandekêrera.<verse eid="PSA 119:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9"/>Kurhi omusole gusêra omu njira gulimwo? Omu kubîkirira ebinwa byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10"/>W’ono ndwîrhe nalongereza n’omurhima gwoshi, orhazigaga nahabuka ntiba akanwa kâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11"/>Nsegîze akanwa kâwe oku murhima, nti ndeki hemuka.<verse eid="PSA 119:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12"/>Nyakasane mâshi we kasinga, onyigîrize amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13"/>Ebinwa by’akanwa kâwe, ndwîrhe nahigeramwo n’akâni kanwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14"/>Omu njira y’amarhegeko gâwe kwo nyumva nshagalusire, kula omuntu ashagaluka omu bundi buhirhi.<verse eid="PSA 119:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15"/>Nârhimanya nkengêre amarhegeko gâwe, n’enjira zâwe nzije ebulâbi<verse eid="PSA 119:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16"/>Nnunîrwe n’amarhegeko gâwe, ntanaciyibagiraga ebinwa byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17"/>Ndi mwambali wâwe: ompè akalamo, onampè nshibirire ebinwa byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18"/>Ozibûle amasù gâni, mbonemwo obwinjà bw’irhegeko lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19"/>Ndi cigolo hano igulu, omanye wakanfulika amarhegeko gâwe,<verse eid="PSA 119:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20"/>Omurhima gwâni gwayumîrîre n’iralà, ly’okulonza mmanye ngasi mango ebi orhegesire.<verse eid="PSA 119:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21"/>Abacibona wabakalihire, abarhiba amarhegeko gâwe bahehêrîrwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22"/>Onkûle nshonyi barhacingayaga, babone nkola nshimbire amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23"/>Ciru abakulu bakadahala bampurana, kurhankahanza mwambali wâwe bwarhimanya n’okukengêra akanwa kâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24"/>Bulyâla ebinwa byâwe kununa bikazinnunira, amarhegeko gâwe bo bahanûzi njira.<verse eid="PSA 119:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25"/>Bampizire okw’idaho: ompembûlage nka kulya waderhaga.<verse eid="PSA 119:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26"/>Enjira ngeramwo nakubwîzirezo wanaziyumva: ombwîrage nâwe emihigo yâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27"/>Ommanyîse oku amarhegeko gâwe gagenda, ntimanye nkengêre ebinja byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28"/>Omurhima gwâni gwaganûkîrwe n’emirenge erhi mutula gurhuma, onyimusagye wêne kulya waderhaga.<verse eid="PSA 119:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29"/>Orhazigaga nayêrekera omu njira yampabula, onanshobôze irhegeko lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30"/>Enjira y’okunali yo nacîshozire, ebinwa byâwe byo ntonyize.<verse eid="PSA 119:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31"/>Amarhegeko gâwe go ncîshwêkîrekwo, Yâgirwa, omanyâge wambonêsa nshonyi.<verse eid="PSA 119:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32"/>Nkola nakombêra enjira y’amarhegeko gâwe, obûla washagalusize omurhima gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 119:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33"/>Nyamwagirwa, nyêreka oku amarhegeko gâwe gagenzire, ngashimbe kula omuntu ashimba enjira.<verse eid="PSA 119:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34"/>Onyigîrize nshimbe irhegeko lyâwe, ndilange n’omurhima gwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 119:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35"/>Ongeze omu njira y’amarhegeko gâwe, bulya ntahimwa kununirwa nago.<verse eid="PSA 119:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36"/>Omurhima gwâni ahâli h’okuhenekera ebirugu, guyêrekere emunda amarhegeko gâwe gali erhi yo.<verse eid="PSA 119:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37"/>Amasù gâni ogahabûle garhagihenekera ebya busha, enjira yâwe empise oku kalamo mâshi.<verse eid="PSA 119:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38"/>Mwambali wâwe erya ndagâno yâwe emugwe oku murhima, erya ndagâno walagaga abakurhînya.<verse eid="PSA 119:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39"/>Oncingekwo zirya nshonyi nyôboha, bulyâla amarhegeko gâwe kushagalusa gashagalusa.<verse eid="PSA 119:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40"/>Kucîfinja okwo ncîfinjire irhegeko lyâwe obwo: orhalyâlyanya: ompè nâni akalamo.<verse eid="PSA 119:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41"/>Nyamwagirwa mâshi olukogo lwâwe lumpikekwo nâni, kulya walaganyagya abantu, oburhabâle bwâwe bundwîrekwo nâni!<verse eid="PSA 119:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42"/>Nâni mmanye akanwa nâshuza balya bakazinshekera; bulyâla binwa byâwe ncîkubagira.<verse eid="PSA 119:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43"/>Orhazigaga nabula akanwa kashingânîne, bulyâla amarhegeko gâwe g’omurhima gwâni gucîkubagira.<verse eid="PSA 119:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44"/>Irhegeko lyâwe kulanga nakazililanga, ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 119:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45"/>Nkazigera omu njira ngali, bulyâla amarhegeko gâwe kulongereza ngalongereza.<verse eid="PSA 119:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46"/>Amarhegeko gâwe nkazicîtakîrago omu masù g’abâmi, ntanakubêre nshonyi.<verse eid="PSA 119:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47"/>Nnunirwe n’amarhegeko gâwe, nie ngazigira nka bici.<verse eid="PSA 119:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48"/>Ndengereze amaboko emunda ebinwa byâwe biri, mbigerereze nnambilôrhe.<verse eid="PSA 119:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49"/>Okengêre kalya kanwa wabwîraga mwambali wâwe, kalyâla wampâgamwo omulagi.<verse eid="PSA 119:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50"/>Ko kantûliriza omu burhè, bulyâla akanwa kâwe buzîne kahâna.<verse eid="PSA 119:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51"/>Abacîbonyi nka banjâcira barhagera, ci kurhakarhuma nârhiba irhegeko lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52"/>Nanga Yâgirwa, ntâyibagire ebinwa waderhaga mîra, byo bintiûliriza.<verse eid="PSA 119:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53"/>Ci omungo gungwêrhe erhi nkola-maligo zirhuma, zirya zikazirhiba irhegeko lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54"/>Amarhegeko gâwe lwambêrirage lwimbo, muli cino cirâlo câni c’olubungo.<verse eid="PSA 119:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55"/>Ndwîrhe nalâla nakengêra izîno lyâwe, ntâbulè bulanga irhegeko lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:55"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56"/>Kwo bibîre ntyo, bulya kulanga ndanga amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:56"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57"/>Kwo ndesire Yâgirwa, nti okulanga ebinwa byâwe gwo gwâni mwanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:57"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58"/>Nsengîre obusù bwâwe Yâgirwa, n’omurhima gwâni gwoshi, ombabalire kulya walaganyagya abantu.<verse eid="PSA 119:58"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59"/>Nalolerîze enjira zâni, nashubiza amagulu omu njira y’amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:59"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60"/>Nakanyize nabiduha, nti nkazilanga amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:60"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61"/>Emigozi y’enkola-maligo yanzônzire, ci ntâyibagire irhegeko lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:61"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62"/>Aha karhî k’obudufu nzûka nti nkuvuge omunkwa, oku bushinganyanya bw’amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:62"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63"/>Ngasi bakurhînya boshi, na ngasi balanga amarhegeko gâwe bo nyinjibana.<verse eid="PSA 119:63"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64"/>Nyamwagirwa, igulu liyunjwîre burhonyi bwâwe, onyigîrize nâni ebinwa byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65"/>Mwambali wâwe bwinjà wamujirîre, Yâgirwa kwo wamujirîre kulya wanaderhaga wêne.<verse eid="PSA 119:65"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66"/>Onyigîriz’emmanya ompè n’obukengêre bulya go ncîkubagira amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:66"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67"/>Embere mbabale erhi ndi muhabâ, lêro akanwa kâwe namâkasêza nti nkalange.<verse eid="PSA 119:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68"/>Oyinjiha orhajîbwa omw’irhwe, onyigîrize nâni amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69"/>Abagayana bantezire eby’obunywesi nkolaga nâcîshwêkera oku marhegeko gâwe ngashimbe.<verse eid="PSA 119:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70"/>Omurhima gwâbo kwo gujagalîre nka muhuli gwa ngano, niehe nnunirwe n’irhegeko lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71"/>Akwizize nnambabale, nkolaga nayîga amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72"/>Kuli nie, irhegeko lyâwe lyo likulu bwenêne, oku bihumbi by'amasholo n’amarhale.<verse eid="PSA 119:72"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73"/>Maboko gâwe gàmbumbaga ganambinja, onyigîrizagye, mmanye amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74"/>Abakurhînya, hano mbabona basîma, bulya kanwa kâwe nali ncîkubagîre.<verse eid="PSA 119:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75"/>Mmanyire Yâgirwa, oku amarhegeko gâwe gayôrha, gashingânîne, nanali wa kubabazibwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76"/>Olukogo lwâwe luhabè mâshi, luntulirize, kulya walaganyagya mwambali wâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77"/>Nshobôle obwonjo bwâwe, nkûlemwo akalamo, bulyâla irhegeko lyâwe ncîtakîra.<verse eid="PSA 119:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78"/>Abagayana enshonyi zirhangibabûmba, bulyâla bàntindibulîze obusha: nkolaga nagerêreza ngeregere omu marhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79"/>Abakurhînya bayêrekere emunda ndi, n’abashîbirira amarhegeko gâwe kwo na kwo.<verse eid="PSA 119:79"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80"/>Omurhima gwâni gubè mwimâna omu kushimba amarhegeko gâwe, lyo ndekibumbwa n’enshonyi.<verse eid="PSA 119:80"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81"/>Omurhima gwâni guyûmîrîre gwalinga oburhabâle bwâwe, akanwa kâwe ko ncîkubagîre.<verse eid="PSA 119:81"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82"/>Amasù gâni gayumire galinga oku waderha akanwa: mangaci okolaga wantûliriza obwo?<verse eid="PSA 119:82"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83"/>Bulya, kwo nabîre nka ndaha mmanike omu mugî, amarhegeko gâwe ntagayibagîri.<verse eid="PSA 119:83"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84"/>Ensiku za mwambali wâwe ziri inga? Abanshimbulwîre, mangaci galya olwâbo wâlutwa?<verse eid="PSA 119:84"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85"/>Balya bagayana, bajîre aho; bampumbira emîna, bôhe barhayisha omu njira y’amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:85"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86"/>Amarhegeko gâwe goshi garhalimwo elirhebana, abo basirhe busha banshimbîre: obantabâlekwo.<verse eid="PSA 119:86"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87"/>Okwisi bantenze en’igulu, ci kwône niehe ntârhibè amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:87"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88"/>Oku lukogo lwâwe ondange mugumagumà, nâni ndange ebinwa byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:88"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89"/>Akanwa kâwe, Yâgirwa, ka nsiku n’amango, karhahuligana, kwo kali ak’amalunga.<verse eid="PSA 119:89"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90"/>Oburhabêsha bwâwe bwa kurhenga amâburhwa, walemire igulu, ho linacibà kuhika buno.<verse eid="PSA 119:90"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91"/>Oku orhegesire kwo binayôrha ngasi mango, bulyâla byoshi we biyôrha bishiga.<verse eid="PSA 119:91"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92"/>Ncibâga ntanunirwa n’irhegeko lyâwe, singa mîra nafâga n’ogu mutula gungwêrhe<verse eid="PSA 119:92"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93"/>Ntakafà nayibagîre amarhegeko gâwe, bulya go wampâgamwo akalamo.<verse eid="PSA 119:93"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94"/>Oncize, ndi mwambali wâwe, bulyâla amarhegeko gâwe kulonza ngalonza.<verse eid="PSA 119:94"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95"/>Enkola-maligo ziri mpu zimpeze, niehe marhegeko gâwe nâshwîra.<verse eid="PSA 119:95"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96"/>Nabwîne oku ngasi kantu kajira aha kahekîre, irhegeko lyâwe lyôhe ye nyamugali.<verse eid="PSA 119:96"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97"/>Ntahimwa kurhonya irhegeko lyâwe, Yâgirwa, omulegerege gwoshi erhi nalikengêra.<verse eid="PSA 119:97"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98"/>Lyo lyarhumire nalenga abashombanyi bâni bugula, bulyâla lirhantenga emurhima.<verse eid="PSA 119:98"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99"/>Abanyigîriza boshi, mbalushire bwîrhonzi, bulyâla amarhegeko gâwe kukengêra ngakengêra.<verse eid="PSA 119:99"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100"/>N’abashosi mbalushire bwenge, bulyâla marhegeko gâwe nshimba.<verse eid="PSA 119:100"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101"/>Amagulu gâni ntâzigè gagera omu njira mbî, nti lyo ndanga ebinwa byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:101"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102"/>Ntananûka oku marhegeko gâwe, bulya wêne wanyigîrizagya.<verse eid="PSA 119:102"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103"/>Ebinwa byâwe, oku binnunira! Ekanwa kâni, byo binunu oku bûci.<verse eid="PSA 119:103"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104"/>Namâjâga nayumva amarhegeko gâwe, namâjâga nashomba enjira z’obulyâlya.<verse eid="PSA 119:104"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105"/>Akanwa kâwe, ko kamole ngendamwo ko kamole k’enjira ngeramwo.<verse eid="PSA 119:105"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106"/>Ncîgashire nnampizire, okulanga amarhegeko gâwe gashingânîne.<verse eid="PSA 119:106"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107"/>Yâgirwa, omutula gungwêrhe lêro gwanyîrha, akanwa kâwe kamanye ntafâga.<verse eid="PSA 119:107"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108"/>Yâgirwa, yanka zino ntûlo z’akanwa kâni, onanyigîrize amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:108"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109"/>Omurhima gwâni ntamango gudêkerera, ci ntà mango nyibagire irhegeko lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:109"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110"/>Enkola-maligo zintezire akasà, ci ntà mango ntenge oku marhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:110"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111"/>Ebinwa byâwe gwo mwîmo gwâni omu nsiku n’amango, bulyâla bibà busîme bw’omurhima gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 119:111"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112"/>Nagombize omurhima gwâni nti ebi orhegesire omu marhegeko gâwe, gubikole bwinjinjà ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 119:112"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113"/>Bala b’emirhima ibirhi ntababâkwo, n’irhegeko lyâwe, ntahimwa kulirhonya.<verse eid="PSA 119:113"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114"/>We Mufungizi wâni, we na mpenzi yâni, kanwa kâwe ncîkubagîre.<verse eid="PSA 119:114"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115"/>Ntengiho, ezi nkola-maligo, ntengiho, nshimbe amarhegeko ga Nnawîrhu Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 119:115"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116"/>Oleke nkuyegemere lyo ndama, wêne warhulaganyagyakwo.<verse eid="PSA 119:116"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117"/>Ondîkûze lyo ncira, nshimbûlire bwinjà amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:117"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118"/>Abarhenguha akanwa waderhaga, orhababâkwo, bulya kurhebwa barhebwa n’obwenge.<verse eid="PSA 119:118"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119"/>Enkola-maligo z’igulu, kwo ozilola nka bishwêka, co nsîmira amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:119"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120"/>Ndwîrhe nageramwo omusisi erhi kurhimanya kurhuma, ngwêrhwe n’obwôba bw’akanwa waderhaga.<verse eid="PSA 119:120"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121"/>Ntahimwa kurhonya ebishingânîne n’ebiringânîne, orhankwêbaga omu nfune z’ababisha.<verse eid="PSA 119:121"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122"/>Olwîre mwambali wâwe bwinjà, balya bangayire, bakanampîma.<verse eid="PSA 119:122"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123"/>Amasù ganyumîre embuga, galinga oburhabêsha n’obushinganyanya bw’akanwa kâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:123"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124"/>Mwambali wâwe omulwîrekwo n’obwinjà bwâwe, onanyigîrize amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:124"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125"/>Mbà mushizi, emunda oli, onyigîrize mmanye amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:125"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126"/>Amango ga Nyakasane g’okukola gahisire, irhegeko lyâwe balivunyire.<verse eid="PSA 119:126"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127"/>Co cirhuma nsîma amarhegeko gâwe kulusha amarhale n’amasholo.<verse eid="PSA 119:127"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128"/>Co cinarhuma ncîshoga enjira y’amarhegeko gâwe, nnanshomba ngasi njira y’obulyâlya.<verse eid="PSA 119:128"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129"/>Amarhegeko gâwe kusômerana gasômerana, co cirhuma ngashîmbûlira.<verse eid="PSA 119:129"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130"/>Ebinwa byâwe kumoleka bimoleka, kuyigîriza biyigîriza abahwinja.<verse eid="PSA 119:130"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131"/>Namâyashama namânayîsa munyi kurhonya amarhegeko gâwe okwo.<verse eid="PSA 119:131"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132"/>Ndolakwo obwonjo bukugwârhe, kw’oyôrha ojirira abasîma izîno lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:132"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133"/>Amagulu gâni ogayêrekeze omu njira y’ebinwa byâwe, harhanajiraga obubî bwampasha.<verse eid="PSA 119:133"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134"/>Ondîkûze oku bumînya bw’abantu, wâbona oku nâlanga amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:134"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135"/>Yereka mwambali wâwe obusù bw’enshagadu, onanyigîrize amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:135"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136"/>Lêro nyîshi za mirenge nvugumwire, omu kubona abarhashîmba amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:136"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137"/>Ôbà mushinganyanya, Yâgirwa, n’okutwa olubanja kwâwe kuyôrha kushingânîne.<verse eid="PSA 119:137"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138"/>Amarhegeko gâwe wagahânyire n’obushinganyanya, haguma n’obuzibu bunji.<verse eid="PSA 119:138"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139"/>Obushiru bwanvunikiremwo, erhi kubona abashombanyi bayibagira amarhegeko gâwe kurhuma.<verse eid="PSA 119:139"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140"/>Akanwa kâwe kabà kakomokomo, co cirhuma mwambali wâwe akarhonya.<verse eid="PSA 119:140"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141"/>Ndi munyi nnandi mushombe, ci amarhegeko gâwe ntagayibagira.<verse eid="PSA 119:141"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142"/>Obushinganyanya bwâwe bubà bw’ensiku n’amango, n’irhegeko lyâwe libà lizibuzibu, lirhahuligana.<verse eid="PSA 119:142"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143"/>Omutula n’amalibuko byanjirekwo, byashanga amarhegeko gâwe, gwo mwishingo gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 119:143"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144"/>Obushinganyanya bw’amarhegeko gâwe bubà bw’ensiku n’amango, onyigîrize mbone akalamo.<verse eid="PSA 119:144"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145"/>Nyâkûzize n’omurhima gwoshi: oyumvîrhize Yâgirwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:145"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146"/>We mpêrhekwo emirenge: nciza mâshi, nâni nkazilanga amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:146"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147"/>Kulamukira ndamukîre nti nsengere oburhabâle, binwa byâwe ncîkubagira.<verse eid="PSA 119:147"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148"/>Kuyîza amasù gâni gayîza, nti nkengêre akanwa kâwe<verse eid="PSA 119:148"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149"/>Olukogo lwâwe, Yâgirwa, lurhume wayumva izù lyâni, n’irhegeko lyâwe lirhume wanshobôza akalamo.<verse eid="PSA 119:149"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150"/>Abanshimbira obusha bamâshegera, ngasi hoshi bali barhabà n’amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:150"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151"/>Nyakasane wêhe hôfi oli, n’amarhegeko gâwe gacibêra «mutabesha».<verse eid="PSA 119:151"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152"/>Oku myandiko yâwe namanyiraga ago marhegeko. wêne wagasinganga kurhenga emyâka n’emyâka.<verse eid="PSA 119:152"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153"/>Olole omutula gungwêrhe onandîkûze, bulyâla irhegeko lyâwe ntaliyibagira.<verse eid="PSA 119:153"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154"/>Onsambire onancize, onanshobôze akalamo waderhaga.<verse eid="PSA 119:154"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155"/>Abanya-byâha barhabà hôfi n’obucire, bulya barhashîbirira amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:155"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156"/>Nyamwagirwa, olukogo lwâwe lubà lunji, onshobôze akalamo amarhegeko gâwe gadesire.<verse eid="PSA 119:156"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157"/>Abadwîrhe banshimbulula n’okundibuza bali banji, ci ntayahuka nti ntenge omu njira y’amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:157"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158"/>Nabwîne enkola-maligo omutula gwangwârha, bulya zirhalanga ebinwa byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:158"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159"/>Lolà Nyakasane, oku niehe kurhonya ntonya amarhegeko gâwe, oku lukogo lwâwe onnange mugumagumà.<verse eid="PSA 119:159"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160"/>Okuli lyo ifûndo ly’ebinwa byâwe n’obucîranuzi bwâwe bw’obushinganyanya buyôrha buli bw’ensiku n’amango<verse eid="PSA 119:160"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161"/>Abaluzi banshimbîre obusha, ci omurhima gwâni kukenga gwanakenga ebinwa byâwe<verse eid="PSA 119:161"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162"/>Kwo ebinwa byâwe binsîmîsa, nka muhivi ogwâsize nsimba nyinji<verse eid="PSA 119:162"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163"/>Obulyâlya, ntahimwa kubushomba, irhegeko lyâwe lyôhe kurhonya ndirhonya.<verse eid="PSA 119:163"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164"/>Kali nda nkukuza omu lusiku, erhi bushinganyanya bwâwe omu kutwa emmanja burhuma.<verse eid="PSA 119:164"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165"/>Abarhonya irhegeko lyâwe murhûla munji bayumva, barhanajira kantu bankasârhalakwo.<verse eid="PSA 119:165"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166"/>Burhabâle bwâwe ncîkubagîre, Yâgirwa, n’amarhegeko gâwe kushimba ngashimba.<verse eid="PSA 119:166"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167"/>Omurhima gwâni kulanga gulanga amarhegeko gâwe, gunagarhonya bwenêne.<verse eid="PSA 119:167"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168"/>Kulanga nalanzire amarhegeko gâwe, bulyâla enjira ngeramwo, zoshi omu masù gâwe ziri.<verse eid="PSA 119:168"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169"/>Omulenge gwâni gukuhikekwo mâshi Nyamwagirwa, mâshi, onyigîrize n’oluderho lwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:169"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170"/>Mâshi omusengero gwâni guhike ah’oli mâshi mbone ondîkûze nka kulyâla warhulaganyagya.<verse eid="PSA 119:170"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171"/>Akanwa kâni karhenge mw’ebîtakîro, kakuyimbire mbona wamanyigîriza amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:171"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172"/>Olulimi lwâni luderhe lunayimbe akanwa kâwe bulya amarhegeko gâwe goshi gabà gashingânîne.<verse eid="PSA 119:172"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173"/>Okuboko kwâwe kuyôrhe kuhabà kukazintabâla, bulyâla marhegeko gâwe nacîshozire.<verse eid="PSA 119:173"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174"/>Obucire wêne ndwîrhe nabulolakwo Yâgirwa, n’okushagaluka kwâni erhi irhegeko lyâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:174"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175"/>Omurhima gwâni gulame gukaz’ikukuza, n’amarhegeko gâwe gakaz’intabâla.<verse eid="PSA 119:175"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176"/>Kwo nahezire kula ecibuzi cihabuka, okanye ojè walonza mwambali wâwe bulyâla ntayibagiraga amarhegeko gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 119:176"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119"/>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" altnumber="119" sid="PSA 120"/>
  <para style="s1">Abashombanyi b’omurhûla</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1"/>Lwimbo. Lwa kusoka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 120:1">Nkayumva omutula, Nyakasane, Nyakasane ye nyâkûza ananshuze.<verse eid="PSA 120:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2"/>Yâgirwa, ofungire omûka gwâni oku rhunwa rhubî, n’oku ndimi zibêsha.<verse eid="PSA 120:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3"/>Lêro olulimi lw’endyâlya cici ludesire lwankakuha erhi lukuyûshûlire?<verse eid="PSA 120:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4"/>Kàli bisonga byoji omu nfune z’entwâli, makala g’omurhi gwa Yenista.<verse eid="PSA 120:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5"/>Namâhera nie mbà muli Mesheki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">120, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mesheki: cihugo ciri hôfi n’Enyanja Nyîru. Kedari: omu irungu ly’e Sîriya.</char></note>, nie mpanzire e Kedari.<verse eid="PSA 120:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6"/>Mwo nyûbasire omu karhî kâbo, balya barhakwirirwa murhûla.<verse eid="PSA 120:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7"/>Oku ndi nti omurhûla, bôhe mpu entambala là.<verse eid="PSA 120:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120"/>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" altnumber="120" sid="PSA 121"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyakasane ye mulanzi w’Israheli</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1"/>Lwimbo. Lwa kusoka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 121:1">Ngalamulîre amasù ebwa ntondo, Lêro owantabâla ngahi ayisha?<verse eid="PSA 121:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2"/>Nyakasane ye wantabâla, ye wajiraga empingu n’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 121:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3"/>Arhâzigè okugulu kwâni kwalabuka, arhahunira omulanzi okulanga.<verse eid="PSA 121:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4"/>Nêci, arhahunga arhânahunge, omulanzi olanga Israheli.<verse eid="PSA 121:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5"/>Nyakasane ye kulanga Nyakasane ye mulanzi okuli aha burhambi.<verse eid="PSA 121:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6"/>Gubire mûshi, izûba lirhâkukomè, bubîre budufu, omwêzi gurhâkujire kurhi.<verse eid="PSA 121:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7"/>Nyakasane akucinga oku ngasi kubî, âfungira omûka gwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 121:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8"/>Akulanga omu kubalama n’omu kushubûka buno n’ensiku zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 121:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121"/>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" altnumber="121" sid="PSA 122"/>
  <para style="s1">Obucire e Yeruzalemu burhenga</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1"/>Lwimbo kwa kusôka. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 122:1">Nayumvîrhe nanasîma ene bambwîra, mpu: mwo rhwajà omu nyumpa ya Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 122:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2"/>Amagulu gîrhu gano gakola gali, omu bululi bwâwe Yeruzalemu.<verse eid="PSA 122:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3"/>Yeruzalemu kwo ali muyûbake nka cishagala, nka cishagala cisêzire buzibu.<verse eid="PSA 122:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4"/>Yo amashanja gayinamukira, amashanja ga Nyakasane. Mpu gakuze izîno lya Nyakasane nk’oku Israheli anarhegesire.<verse eid="PSA 122:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5"/>Yo entebe z’okutwîra emmanja zibà, entebe z’omu nyumpa ya Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 122:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6"/>Yâkûlizagyi Yeruzalemu omurhûla abakurhonya babè n’omurhûla,<verse eid="PSA 122:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7"/>Akalembe kabè omu bululi bwâwe, n’omurhûla omu minene yâwe.<verse eid="PSA 122:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8"/>Bene wîrhu haguma n’abirhu bo barhumire nakuderha nti: «Obêmwo omurhûla.»<verse eid="PSA 122:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9"/>Nêci nakusengerera ebinja, erhi eyi nyumpa ya Nyakasane Nnâmahanga wîrhu yo erhuma.<verse eid="PSA 122:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122"/>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" altnumber="122" sid="PSA 123"/>
  <para style="s1">Rhulîkûze oku kagayo k’abacîbona</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:1">Ngalamulîre amasù emund’oli, We bà omu mpingu.<verse eid="PSA 123:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2"/>Kulyâla amasù g’abashizi, ganayêrekera enfune za ba nnawâbo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:2">kulyâla amasù g’omujà-kazi gahenekera enfune za nn’omumwâbo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:2">kwo amasù gîrhu gadwîrhe galolakwo Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wîrhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:2">kuhika olukogo lwîrhu lumugwârhe.<verse eid="PSA 123:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3"/>Rhubêre nîrhu olukogo, Yâgirwa, rhubêre nîrhu olukogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:3">barhulibuzize n’akagayo.<verse eid="PSA 123:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4"/>Omurhima gwîrhu gwayihisirwe n’amasheka g’abacîbwîne bagale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:4">n’aka gâyo k’abacîbona.<verse eid="PSA 123:4"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123"/>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" altnumber="123" sid="PSA 124"/>
  <para style="s1">Omucunguzi w’Israheli</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 124:1">Nyakasane acibulaga bwarhulwîrakwo -Israheli nêci kuderhe-<verse eid="PSA 124:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2"/>Nyakasane acibulaga bwarhulwîrakwo, bulyâla bayisha barhuharhîrekwo,<verse eid="PSA 124:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3"/>singa bàrhumizire bagumagumà. Bulyâla bayisha barhudwîrhekwo omutula,<verse eid="PSA 124:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4"/>sînga rhwazisire omu mîshi, singa emigezi yàrhuhulwîrekwo.<verse eid="PSA 124:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5"/>Singa amîshi g’enshalalo gàrhubirundukirekwo.<verse eid="PSA 124:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6"/>Nyakasane ayâgirwe obu àrharhulîkiriraga, mpu rhubè minyama bazikamwo amîno.<verse eid="PSA 124:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7"/>Omûka gwîrhu kwo gwafulumusire nka kanyunyi, gwatwa oku isî ly’abarhezi, olusi lwatwîka, nîrhu rhwacîfulumukira.<verse eid="PSA 124:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8"/>Oburhabâle bwîrhu kwo burhenga okw’izîno lya Nyakasane Ye walemaga empingu n’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 124:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124"/>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" altnumber="124" sid="PSA 125"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda ye langa abâge</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:1">Abacîkubagira Nyakasane kwo bali ak’entondo ya Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:1">yo erhahuligana enahabà ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 125:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2"/>Kula Yeruzalemu entondo zimugosire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:2">kwo na Nyamuzinda agosire olubaga lwâge buno n’ensiku zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 125:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3"/>Nanga ntà mango akarhi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">125, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akarhi k’endyâlya: kwo kuderha obwâmi bw’enkola-maligo.</char></note> k’endyâlya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:3">kwânahume oku mwanya gw’abashinganyanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:3">Abashinganyanya bakanalambûla okuboko kwâbo mpu bajiremw’okubî.<verse eid="PSA 125:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4"/>Nyamwagirwa abinja obajirire ebinja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:4">n’ab’omurhima gushingânîne kwo n’okwo.<verse eid="PSA 125:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5"/>Abagera omu njira zikubire bôhe, Nyakasane abalibirhekwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:5">abageze omu njira nguma n’ababî.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:5">Omurhûla muli Israheli!<verse eid="PSA 125:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125"/>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" altnumber="125" sid="PSA 126"/>
  <para style="s1">Okugaluka kw’abàli balulize</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 126:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:1">Erhi Nyakasane àgalula empira z’e Siyoni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:1">kwo rhwàli nk’abalôrha.<verse eid="PSA 126:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2"/>Lêro akanwa kîrhu kanaciyunjula masheka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:2">n’endimi zîrhu zayunjula mwishingo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 126:2"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:2">Agandi mashanja gakaziderha, mpu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:2">Nyakasane abakolîre akirumè.<verse eid="PSA 126:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3"/>Nêci Nyakasane arhujirîre birhali binyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:3">rhw’oyu rhukola rhushagalusire.<verse eid="PSA 126:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4"/>Okûla rhuyôsire, Yâgirwa, okuhindule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:4">kula bahindula omugezi gw’ebumosho bw’izûba<verse eid="PSA 126:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5"/>Abarhwêra omu mulenge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:5">omu mwishingo basârûla.<verse eid="PSA 126:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6"/>Banagenda bajà balaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:6">banagenda babarhwîre emburho barhwêra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:6">Erhi bagaluka erhi bayisha bacîshinga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:6">n’emîha yâbo okw’irhwe.<verse eid="PSA 126:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126"/>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" altnumber="126" sid="PSA 127"/>
  <para style="s1">Okucîhira omu maboko ga Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka. Lwa Salomoni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:1">Nka Nyakasane arhayûbasiri enyumpa, abayiyûbaka erhi na busha bârhamira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:1">Nka Nyakasane arhalanziri olugo, omulâlîzi erhi na busha ârhamira.<verse eid="PSA 127:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2"/>Busha mwarhamira mpu mwazûka sêzisêzi burhacica,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:2">mpu murhajigwîshira duba, mpu murhalya ehi murharhamiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:2">kàli anashobôze abarhonyi bâge banali îrò!<verse eid="PSA 127:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3"/>Kàli abâna ngalo ya Nyakasane, akarhenga omu nda luhembo.<verse eid="PSA 127:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4"/>Ababurhirwa ebusole, kwo bali nka bisonga omu nfune z’entwâli.<verse eid="PSA 127:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5"/>Ali w’iragi omulume obumbire omurhana gwâge myampi ya bene eyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:5">enshonyi zirhâmubumbe amango ababisha bamujà aha lusò.<verse eid="PSA 127:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127"/>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" altnumber="127" sid="PSA 128"/>
  <para style="s1">Omugisho oku muntu okenga Lulema</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:1">Iragi lyâwe we rhînya Nyakasane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:1">we shimba enjira zâge.<verse eid="PSA 128:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2"/>By’omu maboko gâwe wâlye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:2">obone iragi onasîme.<verse eid="PSA 128:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3"/>Mukâwe kwo ali nka muzâbîbu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:3">guyâna bwenêne omu mwâwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:3">Abâna bâwe kwo bali nka mirhô ya muzêti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:3">bazungulusire ecîbo omu bululi bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 128:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4"/>Kwo agishwa ntyo, omuntu orhînya Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 128:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5"/>Nyakasane akugishe kurheng’e Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:5">ensiku zoshi z’obuzîne bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 128:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6"/>Obone oku Yeruzalemu agandâza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:6">obone abâna b’abâna bâwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:6">Omurhûla gubè omu Israheli!<verse eid="PSA 128:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128"/>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" altnumber="128" sid="PSA 129"/>
  <para style="s1">Oku bashombanyi ba Siyoni</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 129:1">Mushâna wâni, kurhenga ndi murhò erhi banshimbulula, -Israheli nêci kuderhe-<verse eid="PSA 129:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2"/>Kurhenga ndi murhò erhi banshimbulula, ci barhampashaga.<verse eid="PSA 129:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3"/>Abahinzi bàgwîra bampinga oku mugongo, bahumba bahumba;<verse eid="PSA 129:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4"/>Nyakasane yêhe bula arhalyalyanya, àtwîra ababisha emigozi.<verse eid="PSA 129:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5"/>Enshonyi zirhangibabumba, bashubire nyuma, balya boshi banashomba Israheli.<verse eid="PSA 129:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6"/>Bashube nka câsi cimerera oku nyumpa, co ciyûma barhanacicishugula.<verse eid="PSA 129:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7"/>Co cirhabumba nfune z’owasârûla! nîsi erhi ecîbo c’owashûbûza ebirundo.<verse eid="PSA 129:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8"/>N’abâgera barhâderhe, mpu: «Nyakasane amugishe»,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 129:8">mpu: «Rhumugishire okw’izîno lya Nyakasane.»<verse eid="PSA 129:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129"/>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" altnumber="129" sid="PSA 130"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda ye shundwakwo obwonjo</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 130:1">Oku ndi emuhengere, Yâgirwa, nakuyâkûza.<verse eid="PSA 130:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2"/>Waliha, yumva omulenge gwâni! amarhwîri gâwe garhegêre, gayumve izù ly’omusengero gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 130:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3"/>Erhi wakalola ebyâha, Yâgirwa, Yâgirwa ndi wakayêra?<verse eid="PSA 130:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4"/>Câba aha burhambi bwâwe h’obwonjo bw’ebyâha bushundwa, mpu lyo bakukolera banakukenzire.<verse eid="PSA 130:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5"/>Niehe Nyamwagirwa ye ncîkubagîre, n’omurhima gwâni luderho lwâge gucîkubagire.<verse eid="PSA 130:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6"/>Omurhima gwâni gudwîrhe gwagungêza Nyakasane, kulusha kula omulâlîzi agungêza obucè.<verse eid="PSA 130:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7"/>Kulusha omulâlîzi walinga oku lukula ârhanda, Israheli alinge Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 130:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8"/>Yêne ye walîkûza Israheli, oku byâha byâge byoshi.<verse eid="PSA 130:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130"/>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" altnumber="130" sid="PSA 131"/>
  <para style="s1">Omurhima gw’oburhò</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:1">Yâgirwa omurhima gwâni gurhalimwo bya kucîbona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:1">n’amasù gâni garhalimwo bya cisûli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:1">ntaharhîri bya bukulu ntanahambîri ebindenzire bulî.<verse eid="PSA 131:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2"/>Kàli ciru n’omurhima gwâni gurhûzize gwanadêkerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:2">kula omwâna obagalirwe na nnina ayôrha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:2">kula omwâna arhûlûla, kwo n’omurhima gukola gunyosiremwo.<verse eid="PSA 131:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3"/>Israheli, okazicîkubagira Nyakasane, buno n’ensiku zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 131:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131"/>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" altnumber="131" sid="PSA 132"/>
  <para style="s1">Okukengêra okuhêkwa kw’Omucîmba gw’Amalaganyo</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:1">Yâgirwa, okengêre Daudi n’obukombêdu bwâge bwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 132:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2"/>Okengêre oku alahiriraga Nyakasane, okengêre eciragâne àlaganyagya Mugala-byoshi wa Yakôbo, erhi:<verse eid="PSA 132:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3"/>«Ntasheshere omu cirâlo nti omu mwâni, ntasôkere oku ncingo nti ngwîshîre,<verse eid="PSA 132:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4"/>ntanayêmêre amasù gâni gajà îrò, ntâzigè engohe zâni zarhamûka<verse eid="PSA 132:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5"/>ntanacibonera Nyakasane ahantu, ntanacibonera Mugala-byoshi wa Yakôbo ecirâlo.»<verse eid="PSA 132:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6"/>Lolà oku badwîrhe baguderha omu Efrata, rhwagushanzire omu bihugo by’emuzirhu.<verse eid="PSA 132:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7"/>Rhuhike omu mwâge, rhuharâmize aha magulu gâge.<verse eid="PSA 132:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8"/>Yimuka, Nyamwagirwa, ojè aha warhamûkira, mwe n’omucîmba gw’obwâmi bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 132:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9"/>Abadâhwa bâwe bacîhundikîre n’obushinganyanya, n’abemêzi bâwe bahubulize n’omwîshingo.<verse eid="PSA 132:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10"/>Mâshi mâshi, mwambali wâwe Daudi orhumire, omanye wakayôza omushîge wâwe.<verse eid="PSA 132:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11"/>Nyakasane alahirîre Daudi, àmulaganya endagâno y’enkwîra, eryâla erhatûbwamwo, erhi: «Mwâna ôburha nâtamaza oku ntebe yâwe.»<verse eid="PSA 132:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12"/>Erhi: «Abâna bâwe bâkalanga eciragâne câni, bakanalanga amarhegeko nâbarhegekaga, abâna bâbo nabo, bâtamala oku ntebe yâwe ensiku zoshi.»<verse eid="PSA 132:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13"/>Bulya nêci Nyakasane acîshozire Siyoni, àcîmwîshozire mpu eshube ntebe yâge, erhi:<verse eid="PSA 132:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14"/>«Kuno kwo nkola nakaziluhûkira ensiku zoshi»; erhi: «Kuno kwo nkola nayûbaka bulya kuno kwo ncîshozire.»<verse eid="PSA 132:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15"/>Erhi: «Ebijiro byakwo nkolaga nabigisha, n’abakenyi bakwo mbayîguse mugati.<verse eid="PSA 132:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16"/>Abadâhwa bakwo nkolaga nababwîka obucire, n’abemêzi bakwo bashembuke n’omwîshingo.<verse eid="PSA 132:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17"/>Eyo munda yo nâmereza Daudi ihembe, nnankolêgeze omushîge wâni akamole.<verse eid="PSA 132:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18"/>Abamushomba boshi nâbabonêsa nshonyi, n’irhwe lyâge lilabukekwo akashambala kâni.»<verse eid="PSA 132:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132"/>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" altnumber="132" sid="PSA 133"/>
  <para style="s1">Akalamo k’ecinyabuguma</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:1">Alà nka kwayinjiha, alà nka kwanuna, okubêra haguma cinyabuguma kw’abalondana.<verse eid="PSA 133:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2"/>Kwo kuli nka kula banadêkereza ensholo y’amavurha okw’irhwe, gahonere omu bwânwa, omu bwânwa bwa Aroni, gayandagalire omw’igosi ly’omushangi gwâge.<verse eid="PSA 133:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3"/>Kwo kuli nka kula olumè lwa kuli Hermoni luyandagalira kuli Siyoni; kwo Nyakasane ahânira omugisho, n’akalamo kashinga emyâka n’emyâka.<verse eid="PSA 133:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133"/>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" altnumber="133" sid="PSA 134"/>
  <para style="s1">Oku lusiku lukulu lw’obudufu</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1"/>Lwimbo lwa kusôka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 134:1">Kanyi! mugashânize Nyakasane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 134:1">mwe munashiga Nnawîrhu mweshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 134:1">mwe muyimanzire omu idubiro lya Nyakasane</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 134:1">gano mango g’obudufu!<verse eid="PSA 134:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2"/>Mulengereze amaboko ginyu ebwa ngombe yâge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 134:2">mugashânize Nn’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 134:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3"/>Nyakasane akugishe kurhenga e Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 134:3">ye wajiraga empingu n’igulu.<verse eid="PSA 134:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134"/>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" altnumber="134" sid="PSA 135"/>
  <para style="s1">Okukuza Omulemi wa byoshi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1"/>Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:1">Mukuze izîno lya Nyakasane, kuzi ye mwe bambali ba Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 135:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2"/>Mwe muli omu ka-Nyamuzinda, omu bululi bw’enyumpa ya Nnawîrhu Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="PSA 135:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3"/>Mukuze Nyakasane bulya arhahimwa bwinjà Nyakasane, muzihire izîno lyâge bulya ali wa kusîmwa.<verse eid="PSA 135:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4"/>Na bulyâla Nyakasane àcîshozire Yakôbo, Israheli gwo gwâge mwanya acîshozire.<verse eid="PSA 135:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5"/>Niehe mmanyire oku Nyamubâho ali mukulu, Nnawîrhu Nnâmahanga alushire banyamuzinda boshi.<verse eid="PSA 135:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6"/>Ebi alonzize byoshi binabè, en’igulu n’emalunga, omu nyanja n’omu ngasi muhengere.<verse eid="PSA 135:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7"/>Ye rhenza ebitù kurhenga enyuma z’ebihugo, ahindule emilazô eshube nkuba, n’empûsi ayishâze aha yali ecifulisire.<verse eid="PSA 135:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8"/>Ajà aho, abanda enfula z’e Mîsiri, ez’abantu n’ez’ebintu.<verse eid="PSA 135:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9"/>Arhuma ebisômerîne n’ebimanyîso emund’oli bulya wa Mîsiri, abirhumira Faraoni mwâmi w’e Mîsiri n’abambali boshi.<verse eid="PSA 135:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10"/>Abanda amashanja garhali manyi, ahungumula abâmi b’entwâli:<verse eid="PSA 135:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11"/>Sihoni mwâmi w’Abamoriti, na Ogu mwâmi w’e Bashani, n’amâmi goshi g’e Kanâni.<verse eid="PSA 135:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12"/>Amashwa gâbo agagabira Israheli, olubaga lwâge Israheli lwagayimamwo.<verse eid="PSA 135:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13"/>Mushâna Nyakasane izîno lyâwe ho liyôrha libà ensiku n’amango, mushâna Nyakasane oyôrhe okengwa emyâka n’emyâka.<verse eid="PSA 135:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14"/>Bulyâla Nyakasane ye lungere w’olubaga lwâge, yêne ye nalufa lukogo.<verse eid="PSA 135:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15"/>Abapagani nabo mpu bajira ba nyamuzinda, bala b’amabuye n’ebyûma! bala babinjwa n’enfune z’abantu!<verse eid="PSA 135:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16"/>Irumbi mpu bagwêrhe akanwa barhanaderha, mpu bagwêrhe amasù barhanabona!<verse eid="PSA 135:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17"/>Mpu bagwêrhe amarhwîri barhanayumva, ciru lêrhaga ehyûka omu kanwa kâbo!<verse eid="PSA 135:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18"/>Ababatula bamôbashusha, abacîkubagira bo nabo.<verse eid="PSA 135:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19"/>Nyumpa y’Israheli, kuza Nyakasane, bûko bwa Aroni, kuza Nyamubâho,<verse eid="PSA 135:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20"/>Nyumpa ya Levi, nâwe kuza Nyakasane mwe muharâmya Nyamubâho mweshi, mukuze Nyakasane.<verse eid="PSA 135:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21"/>Nyakasane aj’irenge omu Siyoni, ye yûbaka omu Yeruzalemu!<verse eid="PSA 135:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135"/>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" altnumber="135" sid="PSA 136"/>
  <para style="s1">Litaniya linene ly’okuvuga omunkwa</para>
  <para style="q1">Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1"/>Kuzagi Nyakasane bulyâla ali mwinjà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:1">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2"/>Kuzagi Nyamuzinda okulîre banyamuzinda boshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:2">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3"/>Kuzagi Nyakasane Mwâmi w’abâmi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:3">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4"/>Yêne ye jira ebirhangâzo ntà wundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:4">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5"/>Ye walemaga empingu n’obushinganyanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:5">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6"/>Ye walambûliraga igulu oku nyanya ly’amîshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:6">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7"/>Ye wajiraga ebimole binênênè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:7">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8"/>Ajira izûba mpu likâmoleka mûshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:8">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9"/>Omwêzi n’enyenyêzi mpu bikâmoleka budufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:9">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10"/>Abâna ab’e Mîsiri erhi àhuma oku nfula zâbo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:10">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11"/>Agalikûla Israheli ekarhî kâbo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:11">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12"/>N’obuzibu bw’okuboko kwâge n’obuhashe bunji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:12">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13"/>Enyanja Ndukula àyiberamwo mpande ibirhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:13">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14"/>Ageza Israheli omu karhî kâyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:14">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15"/>Alohamwo Faraoni mwâmi w’e Mîsiri n’engabo yâge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:15">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16"/>Olubaga lwâge alutwîsa irungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:16">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17"/>Abâna abâmi banênênè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:17">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18"/>Abâmi badârhi abahira okw’itumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:18">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19"/>Sihoni mwâmi w’Abamoriti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:19">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20"/>Na Ogu mwâmi w’e Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:20">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21"/>Amashwa gâbo agashobôza abandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:21">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22"/>Agashobôza omwambali Israheli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:22">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23"/>Arhukengêra amango bamârhulungumarhiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:23">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango,<verse eid="PSA 136:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24"/>Arhurhenza omu nfune z’ababisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:24">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25"/>Ye hà ngasi ciremwa ebi cirya byoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:25">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26"/>Mukuze Nyamuzinda w’empingu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:26">bulya obuzigire bwâge buli bw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PSA 136:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136"/>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" altnumber="136" sid="PSA 137"/>
  <para style="s1">Owayibagira ah’omunyunyu gwâge gubà erhi arhamubà</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1"/>Erhi rhwabâga rhudahîre</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:1">oku bikunguzo by’enyîshi z’e Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:1">yône mirenge rhwakàgidubula</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:1">erhi kufà Siyoni mungo kurhuma.<verse eid="PSA 137:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2"/>Kwarhuma ciru n’ennanga zîrhu rhukazimanika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:2">oku mirhi ya mw’eryo ihanga.<verse eid="PSA 137:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3"/>Abarhuhekaga mw’eryo ihanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:3">erhi barhurhenza omu cihugo c’amasîma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:3">balinda bakala enshonyi z’okurhuhûna enyimbo, mpu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:3">«Rhuyimbiri enyimbo z’omwîshingo gw’e Siyoni.»<verse eid="PSA 137:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4"/>Kurhigi rhwakayimba enyimbo z’okukuza Nyakasane omw’ihanga lya bene? <verse eid="PSA 137:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5"/>Yeruzalemu wêhe aha nakakuyibagira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:5">nankashingâna okulyo kwâni kwahozire.<verse eid="PSA 137:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6"/>Nêci olulimi lwâni, waliha Yeruzalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:6">luyûmire ebiraka, aha nankakuyîbagira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:6">nîsi erhi aha nankabula kuderha oku we murhanzi omu bansimîsa.<verse eid="PSA 137:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7"/>Kengêra Nyamwagirwa, kurhi bene Edomu bàjizîre Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:7">mpu ehyajirwe kuhika okw’ibuye lizinda.<verse eid="PSA 137:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8"/>Kashâba we, mwâli wa Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:8">ali w’iragi linene owabona amabî warhujirîre.<verse eid="PSA 137:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9"/>Nêci ali w’iragi owagwârha ebirhaba byâwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:9">n’okubivunyungulira oku mabuye.<verse eid="PSA 137:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137"/>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" altnumber="137" sid="PSA 138"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo lw’okuvuga omunkwa</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1"/>Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:1">Nakugashâniza Nyamwagirwa, n’omurhima gwâni gwoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:1">bulya wayumvirhîze ebinwa byâni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:1">nkolaga nakuzihira embere za bamalahika bâwe,<verse eid="PSA 138:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2"/>nkola nakuyimbira enyimbo z’obukuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:2">erhi nnankumbire bûbi omu ka-Nyamuzinda kâwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:2">Nakuza izîno lyâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:2">erhi buzigire bwâwe n’okurhahemuka kwâwe kurhuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:2">bulya eciragâne câwe càbîre ca mwâmi w’izîno.<verse eid="PSA 138:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3"/>Olusiku nakufukamiraga wanyumvîrhiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:3">wanyûshûlira emisî y’omurhima.<verse eid="PSA 138:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4"/>Nyamwagirwa, abâmi b’omw’igulu boshi bakuvuga omunkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:4">bulya bàyumvîrhe ebirhangâzo by’ekanwa kâwe.<verse eid="PSA 138:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5"/>Nêci bayimba enjira za Nnâmahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:5">bulya irenge lya Nnâmahanga liri likulu lwoshi.<verse eid="PSA 138:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6"/>Omu bukulu bwâge kurharhuma arhashîbirira abanyinyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:6">n’okukengula abacîbona binjà.<verse eid="PSA 138:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7"/>Nkabâ omu maganya, onanzibuhye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:7">onalambûle okuboko kwâwe wagombyamwo abanshomba, onancize.<verse eid="PSA 138:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8"/>Nêci, obuzigire bwâwe buli bw’ensiku n’amango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:8">omanye wankacilîkirira emikolo y’okuboko kwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 138:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138"/>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" altnumber="138" sid="PSA 139"/>
  <para style="s1">Irenge kuli olya oyishi byoshi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:1">Nyakasane, wandolêrize wammanya:<verse eid="PSA 139:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2"/>Ntamîre, nyimanzire, orhahabiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:2">enkengêro zâni oku ziciri kulî, erhi okola ozimanyire;<verse eid="PSA 139:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3"/>ngwîshîre, ndambagîre, erhi wambona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:3">enjira zâni zoshi ntà nguma ohabire.<verse eid="PSA 139:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4"/>Akanwa kanabè kacindi emurhima karhacihika oku lulimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:4">erhi na mîra wakamanyaga koshi.<verse eid="PSA 139:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5"/>Ongwârhîre emalanga n’ebirhugo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:5">onandêkerîzekwo okuboko kwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 139:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6"/>Obumanye buli ntyo bunsômîre bwenêne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:6">buntalusire bwenêne, ntakabuyumva.<verse eid="PSA 139:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7"/>Ngahi nakaja nderhe nti nkola ndi kulî n’omûka gwâwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:7">Ngahi nakayâkira amasù gâwe?<verse eid="PSA 139:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8"/>Nsôkîre emalunga, yo ôbà!,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:8">ngwîshîre ekuzimu-bwînini, we Nnayo.<verse eid="PSA 139:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9"/>Erhi nakalamukira mucêracêra,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:9">nti njiyûbaka iduli ly’enyanja:<verse eid="PSA 139:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10"/>Ciru n’eyo munda nayo kuboko kwâwe kwayimpisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:10">kulyo kwâwe kwayisha kundwîrhe.<verse eid="PSA 139:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11"/>Erhi nakanderha, nti: «Ciru omwizimya gumbwîke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:11">n’obudufu bunzonge nka mûshi.»<verse eid="PSA 139:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12"/>Omwizimya wêhe gurhakubêra mwizimya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:12">n’obudufu kuli we kwo buli nka mûshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:12">endundulya y’omwizimya kuli we kw’eri nka mûshi.<verse eid="PSA 139:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13"/>We waburungusagya ensiko zâni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:13">We wambumbaga omu nda ya nyâmà.<verse eid="PSA 139:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14"/>Ncîkwitakîre bulya oku wanjirîre kusômerîne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:14">bulyâla emikolo yâwe eri ya kurhangâza.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 139:14"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:14">Omurhima gwâni ogumanyire bwinjà,<verse eid="PSA 139:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15"/>na ntà kavuha kandimwo ohabire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:15">Nabîre ndwîrhe nabumbwa bushâla-shâla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:15">nabîre ncidwîrhe nashwinjirwa omu kuzimu,<verse eid="PSA 139:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16"/>erhi n’amasù gâwe mîra gabonaga ebijiro byâni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:16">erhi byoshi binakola biri biyandike omu citabu câwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:16">ensiku zâni zayôrhaga ziri nganje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:16">erhi n’olurhanzi-rhanzi muli zo lurhacija oku nkuba.<verse eid="PSA 139:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17"/>Enkengêro zâwe Nnâmahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:17">mbwîne ziri ndârhi; gunali mwandu, zirhankaganjwa!<verse eid="PSA 139:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18"/>Erhi nderha nti nziganje zoshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:18">nashanga zo nyinji oku mushenyi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:18">erhi nankaderha nti namâyûsa lêro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:18">nnanashanga rhwembi rhuciri.<verse eid="PSA 139:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19"/>Nyamuzinda, mâshi oyîrhe enkolamaligo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:19">n’abîsi b’abantu barhengeho omuntu!<verse eid="PSA 139:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20"/>Bulyâla bàkugomîre okubozire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:20">abashombanyi bâwe bàrhwâmire kubî.<verse eid="PSA 139:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21"/>Abakushomba, Yâgirwa, kàli nâni kushomba mbashomba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:21">Ka mbonakwo abasharhirakwo Nyamuzinda!<verse eid="PSA 139:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22"/>Kushomba mbashomba, ntabakwîrirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:22">omu masù gâni bali bagoma.<verse eid="PSA 139:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23"/>Nnâmahanga, ondolêreze obone omurhima gwâni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:23">onjè emurhima obone enkengêro zâni.<verse eid="PSA 139:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24"/>Wâbona oku arhali njira mbî ngeramwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:24">ongeze omu njira y’abà mîra, Muhânyi.<verse eid="PSA 139:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139"/>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" altnumber="139" sid="PSA 140"/>
  <para style="s1">Endyâlya erhahike aha yamera emvi, mâshi!</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1"/>Gwârhi omukulu w’abimbiza. Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 140:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2"/>Yâgirwa mâshi, ondîkûze nâni oku muntu mubî, ncinga oku muntu w’ecikalarhu.<verse eid="PSA 140:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3"/>Oncinge kuli balya bagerêreza okubî omu murhima, abakazitula entambala bwaca bwayira.<verse eid="PSA 140:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4"/>Endimi zâbo banakaz’izirhyaza nka njoka, omu kanwa kâbo mîno ga mpiri gamuli.<verse eid="PSA 140:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5"/>Nciza mâshi, Yâgirwa, nkûla omu nfune z’omubisha, ncinga oku muntu w’ecikalarhu: abalâlire mpu bankube,<verse eid="PSA 140:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6"/>Abaminya bakazintega emirhego banayifulike, banakanûle emigozi nka kasirha.<verse eid="PSA 140:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7"/>We mbwîzire, Yâgirwa: we Nyamuzinda wâni, mâshi, Waliha, oyumvîrhize izù ly’omusengero gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 140:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8"/>Yâgirwa Nyamuzinda wâni, we burhabâle we na misî yâni, we cingikiza irhwe lyâni olusiku lw’entambala.<verse eid="PSA 140:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9"/>Yâgirwa mâshi, orhayêmêraga enyifinjo z’omubî, mâshi mâshi orhazigaga emihigo yâge yayunjula.<verse eid="PSA 140:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10"/>Abandi eburhambi balengezize irhwe, mâshi mâshi obubî bw’ebinwa byâbo burhankarhang’ibafundêza mâshi.<verse eid="PSA 140:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11"/>Enkuba y’ebisêsè ebarhogere, abo bakakûmba elushâyo babule cazûsa.<verse eid="PSA 140:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12"/>Omuntu w’olulimi lubî arhâshinge kasanzi hano igulu, omuntu w’ecikalarhu buhanya bwamushamula.<verse eid="PSA 140:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13"/>Mmanyire, Yâgirwa, oku orhalenganya oli bûmu-bûmu, naye omukenyi orhamuzimba lubanja.<verse eid="PSA 140:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 140:14"/>Nêci abashinganyanya bo bakaz’ikuza izîno lyâwe abarhalyâlyanya bo babêra omu masù gâwe.<verse eid="PSA 140:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140"/>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" altnumber="140" sid="PSA 141"/>
  <para style="s1">Oyimangîrwe na wa-Ngwi adôma gashongwîre</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:1">Yâgirwa w’ono ndwîrhe nayâkûza, ntabâla duba we kasinga, yumvîrhiz’omulenge gwâni w’ono ndwîrhe nayâkûza.<verse eid="PSA 141:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2"/>Omusengero gwâni gusôker’emund’oli nka mugî gwa nshangi, n’aga maboko nalengeza gayêrekereyo nka burherekêre bwa bijingo.<verse eid="PSA 141:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3"/>Yâgirwa ohire omulanzi aha kanwa kâni, n’omulâlîzi aha lusò lw’omunwa gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 141:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4"/>Mâshi mâshi omanye wakayêrekeza omurhima gwâni emund’okubî buli, mpu gujire ebibî birhakwânînî. Ntanajaga omu bantu bajir’okubî, mpu ndye oku biryo byâbo.<verse eid="PSA 141:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5"/>Omushinganyanya ankomekwo: kwo kukulu. Ankalihire erhi kwo: gali mavurha omw’irhwe. Irhwe lyâni lirhâgalahire, Nâkazicîsâlirira oku bali omu bubî bwâbo.<verse eid="PSA 141:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6"/>Abakulu bâbo omu kucihukula oku mabuye, lyo bajirage bayumva obununu bw’ebinwa byâni.<verse eid="PSA 141:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7"/>Kula owahinga ashandâza ebidaka na kula akoma irongo, kwo ebivuha byâbo byashandâlîre ekuzimu.<verse eid="PSA 141:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8"/>Nêci Yâgirwa Nyamubâho, amasù gâni yo gayêrekîre emund’oli, yo nyâkîre emund’oli, omanye wakaherêrekeza omûka gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 141:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9"/>Onnange oku murhego bantezire, n’oku rhusà rhw’abajira ebibî.<verse eid="PSA 141:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10"/>Abo babî mâshi bagwe caligumiza omu mirhego badwîrhe barhega, oku nâcîfulumukira.<verse eid="PSA 141:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141"/>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" altnumber="141" sid="PSA 142"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero gw’odwîrhe alibuzibwa anacîfulisire</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1"/>Lwigânwa. Lwa Daudi. Amango àli omu lukunda. Lulanga.<verse eid="PSA 142:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2"/>Izù linene nâyakûzamwo Nyakasane, Izù linene nâyingingamwo Nyamwagirwa. <verse eid="PSA 142:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3"/>Omu masù gâge narhûla omutula gungwêrhe, embere zâge nabulagira oburhè bungwêrhe.<verse eid="PSA 142:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4"/>Obu omûka gunfundîremwo; câba orhahabiri enjira yâni. Enjira nâyishamwo, bantegîremwo olubambo.<verse eid="PSA 142:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5"/>Ndozir’ekulyo nnambwîne, ci ntâye mbwîne wankanshîbirira. Ntaho mbwîne nakayâkira, na ntâye mbwîne wakafungira omûka gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 142:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6"/>We nyâkûzize, Yâgirwa; We nabwîra, wêne lwâkiro lwâni, Weri gwâni mwanya mw’er’igulu ly’abazîne.<verse eid="PSA 142:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7"/>Yumvîrhiza omulenge gwâni, bulyâla mbengîre kurhali kunyi. Ndîkûza kuli aba banshimbire, bulyâla bandushire misî.<verse eid="PSA 142:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 142:8"/>Nkûla mw’eyi mpamikwa, nvuge izîno lyâwe omunkwa. Abashinganyanya bakolaga bangorha, hano ôbà wamanjirira bwinjà.<verse eid="PSA 142:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142"/>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" altnumber="142" sid="PSA 143"/>
  <para style="s1">Amingingo g’obwîrhôhye</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1"/>Lulanga. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:1">Waliha yumva omusengero gwâni, oyumve amingingo gâni bulya we Mudahemuka, oyumvîrhize bulya we Mushinganyanya.<verse eid="PSA 143:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2"/>Omanye wankajisa mwambali wâwe lubanja, bulya ntà wabusirwe oli mushinganyanya embere zâwe.<verse eid="PSA 143:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3"/>Kulya kubà onshombire ashimbulwîre omûka gwâni; obuzîne bwâni abuhizire aha nshi; anandekerize omu mwizimya aka abakola bali nsiku bafîre.<verse eid="PSA 143:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4"/>Omûka gundimwo gukola ntagwo, n’omurhima gwâni gwarhemusire.<verse eid="PSA 143:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5"/>Namâkengêra ensiku zàli burhanzi, namâyibuka emikolo yâwe yoshi, namâsingiriza obushanja enfune zâwe zàkolaga.<verse eid="PSA 143:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6"/>Arhali bw’obu ndambûlîre amaboko emund’oli omurhima gwâni enyôrha yagukabize nk’idaho lya canda.<verse eid="PSA 143:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7"/>Nyumva duba mâshi, Yâgirwa, bulyâla omûka gundimwo gukola ntagwo. omanye wakananfulika obusù bwâwe, nankanaba nka abayandagalira emwîna.<verse eid="PSA 143:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8"/>Ndisa duba oku burhonyi bwâwe, bulyâla wêne ncîkubagira. Nyêreka njira ehi nashimba, bulyâla emund’oli yo ndengerize omûka gwâni.<verse eid="PSA 143:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9"/>Ndîkûza oku bantu banshomba, Yâgirwa, wêne ndangâlîre.<verse eid="PSA 143:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10"/>Nyigîriza nkazijira oku olonzize, bulya we Nyamubâho wâni. Mûka wâwe arhahimwa kuyinjiha ampise omu cibandâna.<verse eid="PSA 143:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11"/>Izîno lyâwe, Yâgirwa, lirhume wannanga mugumagumà, olukogo lwâwe lurhume warhenza omûka gwâni omu burhè.<verse eid="PSA 143:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12"/>N’obwinjà bwâwe burhume wahungumula abanshomba. N’abalibuza omûka gwâni boshi, obaherêrekeze, bulya ndi mwambali wâwe.<verse eid="PSA 143:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143"/>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" altnumber="143" sid="PSA 144"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo lw’amatabâro n’obuhimanyi</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1"/>Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:1">Nnâmahanga Nyamubâho agashâne, ye mutungo gwâni, Ye komeza amaboko gâni oku matabâro, anayigîrize eminwe yâni okulwa.<verse eid="PSA 144:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2"/>Ye buzigire bwâni, ye mpenzi yâni, Ye lwâkiro na Muciza wâni, yêne ye kereka emirhwe oku burhegesi bwâni.<verse eid="PSA 144:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3"/>Nyamwagirwa, omuntu co cici obu omukoyakoyakwo okungan’aha? Mwene-omuntu co cici obu omushîbirira ntya?<verse eid="PSA 144:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4"/>N’obwo omuntu kwo ali nka mpûsi, ensiku zâge kwo ziri nka cizunguzungu câgera.<verse eid="PSA 144:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5"/>Nyamuzinda Nyamubâho gombya amalunga oyandagale, ohume oku ntondo zitwike mabira.<verse eid="PSA 144:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6"/>Zûsa emilazô oshandabanyemwo ababisha, ofôle obageze mihanda erhashingânana.<verse eid="PSA 144:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7"/>Nyandagaliza okuboko, ondîkûze, onyûlubule emûbi, n’okuboko kwâwe ontenze omu nfune z’ab’emahanga.<verse eid="PSA 144:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8"/>Abà akanwa karhaderha oburhali busha, n’ab’okuboko kulenzi.<verse eid="PSA 144:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9"/>Nyamwagirwa, Nyamubâho, nakuyimbira olwimbo luhyâhya, nakuzihira olulanga lwa misî ikumi.<verse eid="PSA 144:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10"/>Yâgirwa, Nyamubâho, we rhuma abâmi bahima, we wakûlaga Daudi oku bwôji bw’itumu ly’ababisha.<verse eid="PSA 144:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11"/>Nyôkola, nkûla omu maboko g’ab’emahanga, ab’akanwa karhaderha oburhali bulenzi, n’ab’amaboko gakola amaligo.<verse eid="PSA 144:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12"/>Ecabona bagala bîrhu bayûshûsire nka mburho enazire omu busole bwâbo, na bâli bîrhu nka mitungo minjinjà na mibinje nka nkingi z’omu bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="PSA 144:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13"/>Nazo enguli zîrhu ziyunjule na ngasi lubero lwa myâka, omu malambo gîrhu ebibuzi bîrhu biyôloloke.<verse eid="PSA 144:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14"/>Enkafu zîrhu ziburhane, rhurhanazimbagwa erhi kunyagwa, ntyo harhabaga ndûlù omu mihanda yîrhu.<verse eid="PSA 144:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15"/>Bali bany’iragi abantu bagishirwe ntyo, bali bany’iragi abantu bajira Nyakasane nka Nyamuzinda wâbo.<verse eid="PSA 144:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144"/>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" altnumber="144" sid="PSA 145"/>
  <para style="s1">Irenge lya Mwâmi Nyamubâho</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1"/>Lwimbo. Lwa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 145:1">Nnâmahanga Mwâmi wâni, nalonza okukuza, nacîtakirira izîno lyâwe ensiku zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 145:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2"/>Nalonza ngasi lusiku nkukuze, na ngasi luj’oku nkuba nyimbire izîno lyâwe irenge.<verse eid="PSA 145:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3"/>Nnâmahanga ali w’izîno anali wa kukengwa bwenêne, obukulu bwâge burhankayumvûbwa.<verse eid="PSA 145:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4"/>Ngasi iburha lyabwiriza eryâbo ebirhangâzo byâwe, n’ebisômerîne byâwe byahêkwa irenge.<verse eid="PSA 145:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5"/>Nêci nyimba irenge ly’obukulu bwâwe, n’ebirhangâzo byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 145:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6"/>Abantu bakaz’iganîra obuhashe bwâwe bujugumya. nâni nkazibaganîrira obukulu bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 145:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7"/>Bakâhamagaza aminjà gâwe manene, n’okubandira obwîrhonzi bwâwe empûndu.<verse eid="PSA 145:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8"/>Nyamubâho abà mwinjà na wa lukogo, arhakunira duba abà na wa buzigire.<verse eid="PSA 145:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9"/>Nyamubâho abà mwinjà kuli boshi, nn’olukogo lwâge luyerekera emikolo yâge.<verse eid="PSA 145:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10"/>Aminjà gâwe wajizire kukuza gakukuza Muhanyi n’abarhonyi bâwe bakugashâniza.<verse eid="PSA 145:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11"/>Banaganire irenge ly’obwâmi bwâwe n’okulumîza irenge ly’ebisômerîne byâwe.<verse eid="PSA 145:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12"/>Lyo bamanyîs’abantu ebirhangâzo wabajirire. irenge ly’obwâmi bwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 145:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13"/>Obwâmi bwâwe buli bw’emyâka n’emyâka, oburhegesi bwâwe buyôrha buli oku ngasi iburha. Nyakasane ali w’okuli omu nderho zâge zoshi, ali na Mwimâna omu bijiro byâge byoshi.<verse eid="PSA 145:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14"/>Nyakasane ye kakoma ka ngasi bahirima, ye Cînamula wa ngasi bashâyire.<verse eid="PSA 145:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15"/>Boshi we bahirakw’omurhima n’amasù omu bulagîrire, n’amango gakwânîne nâwe obahè ebi bàlya<verse eid="PSA 145:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16"/>Onalambûle okuboko, oyiguse n’obugale bwâwe ngasi coshi cibâmwo omûka.<verse eid="PSA 145:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17"/>Nnâmahanga ali mwîrhonzi omu njira zâge zoshi, na wa lukogo omu mikolo yâge yoshi.<verse eid="PSA 145:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18"/>Nnâmahanga ali hôfi ha ngasi yêshi omusengera, ngasi yêshi omusengera n’omurhima gurhajira bulyâlya.<verse eid="PSA 145:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19"/>Abamurhînya anabajirire ngasi byoshi bacîfinja, anayumve emirenge yâbo anabacize.<verse eid="PSA 145:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20"/>Nnâmahanga analange abamuzigira boshi, anaherêrekeze endyâlya.<verse eid="PSA 145:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21"/>Ecabona akanwa kâni kayimba irenge lya Nnâmahanga, na ngasi bàhîrwe omubiri boshi bagashânize izîno lyâge litagatîfu.<verse eid="PSA 145:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145"/>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" altnumber="145" sid="PSA 146"/>
  <para style="s1">Iragi lyâge ocîkubagira Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1"/>Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:1">Murhima gwâni kuza Nyamuzinda<verse eid="PSA 146:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2"/>Oku ncibamw’omûka, nâkazikuza Nyamwagirwa, amango goshi ncizîne nakâyimbira Nyamuzinda irenge.<verse eid="PSA 146:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3"/>Mumanye mwakakâlangâlira abaluzi, nîsi erhi okucîkubagira iburha ly’omuntu elirhaciza,<verse eid="PSA 146:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4"/>erhi omûka gumurhengamwo anashubire omu budaka n’obwo emihigo yâge yoshi ehirigirhe.<verse eid="PSA 146:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5"/>Ali w’iragi oyu Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo abà murhabâzi wâge, olangâlira Nnâmahanga Nyamwagirwa wâge.<verse eid="PSA 146:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6"/>Nnâmahanga ye walemaga empingu n’igulu, enyanja n’ebiyibâmwo byoshi. Azibuhize endagâno zâge ensiku zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 146:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7"/>Abalenganyire anabagalulire obushinganyanya bwâbo, ye yigusa abashalye n’ebiryo.<verse eid="PSA 146:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8"/>Empira Nnâmahanga ye zirikûza, abahusire anabazibûle engohe.<verse eid="PSA 146:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9"/>Ye yimanza abagogomîrwe, Nnâmahanga azigira abîrhonzi.<verse eid="PSA 146:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10"/>Nyamuzinda analange abakenyi, Ye lamira enfûzi n’abakana. Ci enjira z’abanya-byâha anaziyêrekeze erushâyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:10">Nyamubâho ali Mwâmi, arhegeka emyâka erhaganjwa, wâni Siyoni, Nnâmahanga ali wâwe ensiku zoshi.<verse eid="PSA 146:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146"/>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" altnumber="146" sid="PSA 147"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo lw’okuyimbira Ogala-Byoshi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1"/>Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:1">Kuzagi Nyamuzinda buly’ali mwinjà, Yimbiri Nyamuzinda wîrhu bulya irenge alikwânîne.<verse eid="PSA 147:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2"/>Nyamwagirwa, mûbasi wa Yeruzalemu, ashûbûza olubaga lw’Israheli.<verse eid="PSA 147:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3"/>Anabuke abagogomîrwe omu murhima, anabuke ebibande byâbo.<verse eid="PSA 147:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4"/>Ayishi omuganjo gw’enyenyêzi, ntâyo ahabire izîno lyâyo.<verse eid="PSA 147:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5"/>Nyamuzinda wîrhu ali mukulu, obuhashe bwâge burhagerwa, obukengêre bwâge burhahimwa.<verse eid="PSA 147:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6"/>Nyamuzinda ye rhabâla abazamba, abanya-byâha anatuntumire okw’idaho.<verse eid="PSA 147:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7"/>Yimbiri Nyamuzinda olwimbo lw’okuvuga omunkwa, zihi omu lulanga obukuze bwa Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="PSA 147:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8"/>Amalunga anagabwîkire n’ebitù, arheganyize idaho enkuba, ameze obwâsi oku ntondo<verse eid="PSA 147:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9"/>Ye hà enkafu obwâsi zikera, n’ebyâna bya hungwe bimuyêrekezize omulomo.<verse eid="PSA 147:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10"/>Arhali misî ya citerusi emushagalusa, nîsi erhi magulu ga muntu.<verse eid="PSA 147:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11"/>Nnâmahanga ashagaluka erhi abamurhînya barhumire erhi abacìkuhagira obwinjà bwâge bàrhuma.<verse eid="PSA 147:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12"/>Yeruzalemu, gashâniza Nnâmahanga, Siyoni, kuza Nyamubâho.<verse eid="PSA 147:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13"/>Bulya ahamikirîze enyumvi zâwe, abâna bâwe abagishìre aha mwâwe.<verse eid="PSA 147:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14"/>Amaziko gâwe agalanzire, akugaza n’emburho y’emyâka yâwe.<verse eid="PSA 147:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15"/>Akanwa kâge kanazunguluk’igulu lyoshi akanwa kâge kwo kalibirha nka mpûsi.<verse eid="PSA 147:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16"/>Ananiese olubula lwêru nka bôya bwa cibuzi, alumîze ecimè c’emboho nka luvù.<verse eid="PSA 147:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17"/>Kwo aniesa enkuba nk’ahungumula mugati, emboho yâge enakayûze ciru n’amîshi ganage.<verse eid="PSA 147:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18"/>Akarhuma akanwa binajonge, akarhuma empûsi yâge amîshi ganashubihulula.<verse eid="PSA 147:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19"/>Yêne wamanyîsa Yakôbo akanwa kâge, n’Israheli amumanyîsa amarhegeko gâge.<verse eid="PSA 147:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20"/>Ntà lindi ishanja Nnâmahanga ajirîre okungan’aho, ntà lindi ishanja lyamanyire ecimubà emurhima.<verse eid="PSA 147:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147"/>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148"/>
  <para style="s1">Empingu n’igulu bikuze Nyakasane</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1"/>Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:1">Kuzagi Nyamuzinda kurhenga enyanya emalunga mumukuze oku nkuba.<verse eid="PSA 148:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2"/>Mweshi Bamalahika bâge mumukuze, ninyu mweshi mirhwe yâge mumukuze.<verse eid="PSA 148:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3"/>Mwe mwêzi n’izûba mumukuze mwe nyenyêzi zilangashana mumukuze.<verse eid="PSA 148:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4"/>Mumukuze mwe malunga g’oku nkuba, ninyu mwe mîshi mubà emalunga mumukuze.<verse eid="PSA 148:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5"/>Byoshi bikuze izîno lya Nyakasane bulya kanwa kaguma kône àdesire byanabà.<verse eid="PSA 148:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6"/>Abizibuhize emyâka erhaganjwa, àgwîsire irhegeko lirhakahindulwa.<verse eid="PSA 148:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7"/>Murhondêrere en’igulu mwamukuza, mwe biryanyi by’omu mîshi, ninyu mwe nyanja.<verse eid="PSA 148:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8"/>Omuliro, olubula n’olwikungu na ba-kalemêra, barhahumba irhegeko lya Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="PSA 148:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9"/>Mwe ntondo n’orhurhondo rhwoshi emirhi y’amalehe n’emirhi yoshi.<verse eid="PSA 148:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10"/>Ensimba z’emuzirhu n’ebishwêkwa bya ngasi lubero, ebinyâgâsi n’ebinyunyi bibalala.<verse eid="PSA 148:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11"/>Abâmi b’igulu n’amashanja goshi, abaluzi ninyu batwî b’emmanja b’igulu. <verse eid="PSA 148:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12"/>Emisole n’ensûli, abashosi n’abâna.<verse eid="PSA 148:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13"/>Bakuze izîno lya Nyamuzinda, bulya izîno lyâge lyône liri likulu, irenge lyâge liri enyanya ly’igulu n’amalunga.<verse eid="PSA 148:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14"/>Ajîsize olubaga lwâge irenge, ngwârhiro ya bukuze oku barhonyi bâge, bo bâna b’Israheli, ishanja limuyêgêra.<verse eid="PSA 148:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148"/>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwimbo lw’obuhimanyi</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1"/>Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:1">Yimbiri Nnâmahanga olwimbo luhyâhya, irenge lyâge liyumvîkane omu ndêko y’abarhonyi bâge.<verse eid="PSA 149:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2"/>Israheli ashagalukire Nnâmahanga Mulemi wâge, abâna b’e Siyoni bacîtakîrire omwâmi wâbo.<verse eid="PSA 149:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3"/>Bakuze banasâmire izîno lyâge, bamuzihire ennanga banamurhimbire engoma.<verse eid="PSA 149:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4"/>Bulya Nyamuzinda ashagaluka n’olubaga lwâge, Ye ciza abanyinyi anabakuze.<verse eid="PSA 149:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5"/>Abarhonyi bâge banagandâze omw’irenge, banashagaluke n’omw’îrò.<verse eid="PSA 149:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6"/>Obukuze bwa Nnâmahanga burhabarhenga omu kanwa, omu nfune zâbo murharhenga engôrho ya môji abirhi.<verse eid="PSA 149:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7"/>Y’okucîhôla amashanja, n’okuhana emirhwe<verse eid="PSA 149:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8"/>Okuhanika abâmi bâbo n’enkoba, n’abaluzi bâbo omu caburhinda.<verse eid="PSA 149:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9"/>Lyo olushika lwatûbagwa kuli bo luyunjula, lyo irenge lyàbikîrwe abarhonyi bâge boshi<verse eid="PSA 149:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149"/>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150"/>
  <para style="s1">Obukuze bw’okufundika</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1"/>Aleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:1">Kuzagi Nyakasane omu ka-Nyamuzinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:1">Kuzagi ye oku nkuba omu buhashe bwâge.<verse eid="PSA 150:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2"/>Kuzagi ye oku birhangâzo byâge, Kuzagi ye oku bukulu bwâge bunji<verse eid="PSA 150:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3"/>Kuzagi ye n’izù ly’empanda, Kuzagi ye n’ennanga n’enzenze.<verse eid="PSA 150:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4"/>Kuzagi ye n’amasâmo n’engoma, Kuzagi ye n’olunyege n’orhurhêra.<verse eid="PSA 150:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5"/>Kuzagi ye n’emijegereza y’izù linjà, Kuzagi ye n’ebyûma by’izù lilongîre.<verse eid="PSA 150:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6"/>Ngasi byoshi bibâmwo omûka, kuzagi Nyakasane Aleluya!<verse eid="PSA 150:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150"/>
</usx>
